window.RA_INDEX=[{"id":"e042","n":"100-Type Guanyin Bodhisattva","s":"A prayer completed faster than violence can begin: a colossal golden Guanyin answers with a hundred hands, and at the end the Zero Hand turns everything into light.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Prayer Palm: Focused","prayer-palm-focused","A golden palm strikes the foe you look at (120 blocks): 33 damage."],["Prayer Palm: Driving","prayer-palm-driving","20 damage, and the foe is hurled six blocks away."],["Prayer Palm: Grasping","prayer-palm-grasping","20 damage, and the foe is held 3 s (a strong foe less)."],["First Hand: Heaven's Descent","first-hand-heavens-descent","The palm falls from straight above, twice the size: 33 damage, driven into the ground (the soft earth craters) and held 3 s."],["Third Hand: Converging Mercy","third-hand-converging-mercy","Two palms close on one foe from either side: 33 damage in all, and it's held 3 s."],["Ninety-Ninth Hand","ninety-ninth-hand","6 CE: 12 palms spread among the foes in reach, 26 damage each."],["Prayer Palm: Merciful","prayer-palm-merciful","A gentle palm throws the ally you look at (120 blocks), or yourself with no ally in sight, 6 blocks along your look, and they land softly."],["Faster Than Sound","faster-than-sound","One more Focused palm, in the same breath."],["Maximum: Zero Hand","maximum-zero-hand","All your CE (at least 15): the foe you look at (120 blocks) takes 166 damage, plus 13 damage for every CE poured in, ignoring armor. Afterwards your CE is empty and you're exhausted for a minute."],["Palm Reach","palm-reach","120 blocks (24 at 6th, 60 at 11th, 120 at 20th); the palms hit harder at each step."],["Prayer Before Violence","prayer-before-violence","Once every 3 s, 2 CE: when a foe in reach strikes you, the statue answers with a Driving palm."],["Guarding Palm","guarding-palm","Once every 3 s, 1 CE: a heavy blow is lessened by 15% of your health. And once every 3 s, 1 CE, a heavy blow on an ally in your reach is lessened the same way, and they're moved 3 blocks clear."],["Prayer Outside Time","prayer-outside-time","Every 3 s in a fight, a free Focused palm strikes the nearest foe in reach (1 CE)."],["Temple of Ten Thousand Gratitudes","temple-of-ten-thousand-gratitudes","Hundredfold Benediction: every chosen foe takes 166 damage and is held 1.5 s. In the temple a free palm strikes every 3 s, as with Prayer Outside Time."],["Unbroken Mudra","unbroken-mudra","Once every 3 s, a palm that lands flows on to a second foe within 3 blocks: 20 damage."],["Hundred-and-First Hand: Lotus Prison","hundred-and-first-hand-lotus-prison","Technique Key 1 (4 CE): three palms close on the foe you look at like petals, 26 damage each, and it's held 10 s (a strong foe less)."],["The Hundredth Name","the-hundredth-name","Every palm also grasps, holding its foe 1.5 s."],["Great Compassion","great-compassion","For 1 CE more, the Merciful Palm also throws a second ally within 3 blocks of the first, and the Guarding Palm moves a second ally beside the struck one clear too."],["Opening Salutation","opening-salutation","Once a fight, a free Merciful Palm the moment it starts: your first blow struck or taken after 10 s of quiet."]]},{"id":"e159","n":"Adaptive Hatred","s":"Survive something once, record what hurt you, and spend limited Adaptation slots deciding which threats your body is allowed to stop caring about.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Hateful Maul","hateful-maul","The foe you look at (2.5 blocks): 26 damage, and 13 damage more for every Adaptation installed."],["Install Adaptation","install-adaptation","Spend 1 Data of the chosen Threat Tag: that harm lands at half, or that effect lasts half as long. With 2 Data it's installed Hardened: a plain harm (fire, a fall, a blade and the like) or an effect can't touch you at all, while a technique's, magic's or a Domain's stays at half, and once every 3 s one such blow is cut by 79 damage more. You have 4 slots; when they're full the oldest is replaced. With Variant it shapes your body instead (Reactive Morphology)."],["Maximum: Abhorrent Evolution","maximum-abhorrent-evolution","Consume all the Data of at least two Threat Tags: each is installed at once, in two extra slots, for a minute. You grow larger, 10% faster, and your bare hands deal 13 damage more. When it ends those slots and that Data are gone, you're slowed and sluggish for a minute, and you record nothing for 3 s."],["Exposure Record","exposure-record","Whatever hurts you is recorded by its exact Threat Tag (1 CE): +1 Data, once every 3 s a Tag, up to 3, kept until a long rest. Each kind of damage is a Tag, and so is each harmful effect (poison, slowness, weakness, blindness, being held). Technique Key 1 cycles the Tags you hold Data for."],["Regenerative Hate","regenerative-hate","Below half health, once every 3 s, a harm you're adapted to mends you 15 health."],["Reactive Morphology","reactive-morphology","Each Adaptation brings one shape, picked with Variant + Install, each shape once: Swift (+10% speed), Climbing, Swimming, Long Reach (+1), Plated (+2 armor), Crushing Hands (13 damage more bare-handed)."],["Termination Failure","termination-failure","Once a long rest, a blow that would kill you leaves you standing and mends you 44% of your health; what nearly killed you gets 3 Data and a free Hardened Adaptation until the fight ends."],["Hostile Evolution","hostile-evolution","Once every 3 s, a creature that hurts you with a harm you've adapted to takes 26 damage back."],["Keter Genome","keter-genome","Once every 3 s, a harm you hold Data for but haven't adapted to swaps out an Adaptation for it on the spot, spending no Data."],["Lent Loathing","lent-loathing","Once every 3 s, Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE) lends your newest Adaptation to the ally you look at (within 18 blocks) until 3 s has passed."],["Consume and Rebuild","consume-and-rebuild","Once a minute, eating mends you 79 and gives 1 Data to the Tag of the last harm that hurt you."]]},{"id":"e125","n":"Amazon Champion","s":"Divine arms and bracelets, the Lasso of Truth, Amazon leaps, flight, Godkiller training and the Godwave Counter.","c":"DC","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Divine Weapon","divine-weapon","A sweep of your divine sword: everything in a 3.5-block arc in front of you takes 18 damage. It counts as a weapon blow (Favor and the rest)."],["Lasso of Truth","lasso-of-truth","The golden lasso, 15 blocks: the foe you look at is roped and bound for 6 s (a strength check; bigger foes slip it more). Bound in truth, it fights at half its heart (weakened), and the rope stays tied to you."],["Bracelet Shockwave","bracelet-shockwave","3 Favor: clash your bracelets. A 15-block cone, 77 damage, everything in it thrown far."],["Champion of Themyscira","champion-of-themyscira","A minute: blows land far softer, you fly fast, your weapon deals 22 damage more, and your Favor can't fall below 1."],["Maximum: Godwave Counter","maximum-godwave-counter","Spend all your Favor: for 3 s, the next great blow against you is met with crossed bracelets. 98% + 20% of your health of it is stopped, and if that stops it entirely, a 30-block wave of the stopped force goes back the way it came (up to 159 damage)."],["Bracelets of Submission","bracelets-of-submission","Once every 3 s (1 CE and 1 Favor), a shot that reaches you is struck aside and flies back the way it came, as yours."],["Favor","favor","Your first weapon blow each 3 s earns 1 Favor (up to 10)."],["Amazon Leap","amazon-leap","You jump far higher and never take fall damage. After sprinting 20 blocks, your next weapon blow deals 18 damage more."],["Flight","flight","You fly, and once every 3 s your weapon deals 9 damage more."],["Divine Guard","divine-guard","Once every 3 s (1 CE), a blow on an ally within 3 blocks meets your shield: it lands on you instead, and you step to their side."],["Godkiller Training","godkiller-training","Against a boss, anything with twice your health or more, or a sorcerer above your level, one blow in ten strikes half again as hard, and your first blow each 3 s on one earns a second Favor."],["Amazon Grappler","amazon-grappler","A roped foe is hauled up to 7 blocks toward you (1 CE; not a boss)."]]},{"id":"e104","n":"Anti-Cursed Grimoire","s":"Zero cursed energy, and swords that unmake the premise curses are built on. Anti-Energy fuels the Demon-Slayer, Black Form, and the devil's union.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Demon-Dweller Slash","demon-dweller-slash","1 Anti-Energy: a 36-block anti-magic slash where you look, 26 damage to everything on it. It cuts down any block a technique conjured. With Variant and an ally within 3 blocks, it wears their technique's colour."],["Demon-Destroyer","demon-destroyer","2 Anti-Energy: cut every harmful effect off yourself, or off the ally you look at; and every effect off the foe within 4 blocks you look at (it's weakened for a 3 s too). A conjured creature in reach with under 50 health is unmade outright; a bigger one takes 106 damage instead. Free once every 3 s."],["Devil Union","devil-union","4 Anti-Energy, a minute (any number of times): you fly, you're fast, shots and every technique's damage land at half, and your blows leave a foe unable to counter, dodge or parry for 3 s. True Devil Union: once every 3 s, a blow on a sorcerer who fails to resist puts the art they last cast on cooldown for 3 s."],["Black Divider","black-divider","2 Anti-Energy: the sword lengthens into a 12-block arc in front of you, above and below too: your weapon's blow to each, and 40 damage more to anything that casts or was conjured. Conjured blocks in it are cut down."],["Demon-Slasher Katana","demon-slasher-katana","3 Anti-Energy: a selective 36-block line, 66 damage, and what it cuts is weakened."],["Black Form","black-form","2 Anti-Energy, a minute: faster, a far higher jump, and once every 3 s your blow on a sorcerer breaks their concentration (a Domain being cast, a chant, a held art)."],["Maximum: Infinite Slash Equinox","maximum-infinite-slash-equinox","Every Anti-Energy (at least 6), once a long rest: a 72-block line that walls don't stop, 106 damage to every foe on it, cutting down every conjured block in its way. A closed Domain's barrier it crosses takes its hardest blow, and every sorcerer it cuts loses their concentration."],["Zero CE","zero-ce","You have no cursed energy at all: none to spend, none to steal. Anti-Energy (52) runs everything. It returns on a long rest, or after two minutes out of a fight. A fight starts you with 6 or more."],["Demon-Slayer Sword","demon-slayer-sword","Your melee blows bite 13 damage deeper into anything that casts or was conjured. Once every 3 s (1 Anti-Energy), a shot or a technique's flying shot is blocked with the flat: it lands at half."],["Anti-Magic Swordsman","anti-magic-swordsman","Once every 3 s (1 Anti-Energy), a shot or a technique's flying shot about to hit an ally within 3 blocks is blocked with the flat: it lands at half."],["Bull Thrust","bull-thrust","In Black Form, a melee blow at a full sprint drives the sword home: 26 damage more, and it's thrown back (once every 3 s)."],["Sword Flight","sword-flight","You ride the sword: while Black Form lasts you can fly."],["Liebe's Partner","liebes-partner","When Devil Union ends, the departing devil discharges: every foe within 18 blocks loses every effect it carries, and fights weaker for 10 s."]]},{"id":"e253","n":"Antigravity System","s":"Gravity reversed around you: foes fall upward and come down hard, a shield that pushes blows away, flight, and a minute of zero gravity.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Antigravity","antigravity","Gravity reverses in a 6-block column around you (not you) for 3 s: foes in it fall upward, and slam back down when it ends (11 damage per 2 blocks fallen). One that strikes a ceiling on the way takes 22 damage there too. Loose items fall up with them. A lifted foe is weakened unless it resists, and can't answer blows. Hold to pour CE: a block wider and 3 s longer per CE."],["Maximum: Zero Gravity","maximum-zero-gravity","For a minute every foe within 12 blocks weighs nothing: they drift helplessly above the ground, and when it ends they all fall at once."],["Light Fall","light-fall","Falling fast, you drift down gently instead (1 CE, once every 3 s), and falls never hurt you. Allies falling fast within 72 blocks are caught the same way, for the same CE."],["Antigravity Shield","antigravity-shield","Once every 3 s (2 CE), a blow is pushed away from you: 34 less. It answers for an ally within 3 blocks too."],["Inverted Heaven","inverted-heaven","Every 3 s the chosen foes simply fall upward and are dropped from the height: 41 damage, and the fall."],["Levitation System","levitation-system","Antigravity also lifts the foe you look at (within 12 blocks) for 2 CE more."],["Antigravitational Flight","antigravitational-flight","You fly on reversed gravity: 1 CE for every 3 s you're aloft."],["Inverted Shield","inverted-shield","When your Shield catches a melee blow, it inverts for 3 CE: the attacker is pulled in and knocked down."],["Dense Antigravity Shield","dense-antigravity-shield","When your Shield catches a blow and you can spare 3 CE more, the blow is halved as well."]]},{"id":"e537","n":"Atlantean Kingship","s":"Atlantean blood, the trident, marine telepathy, the Seven Seas' tidal wave and whirlpool, the Trench and Leviathan's Wake.","c":"DC","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Water Shaping","water-shaping","A wave toward where you look, 3 blocks: 16 damage, shoving foes 3 blocks, and fire in its path goes out. With the trident in hand it thrusts instead (the same blow, one foe)."],["Marine Telepathy","marine-telepathy","Water within 8 blocks answers: 6 dolphins fight for you for a minute, 9 damage a bite."],["King of the Seven Seas","king-of-the-seven-seas","Once a minute, picked with Variant + Technique Key 1: a 18-block tidal wave (22 damage, swept 9 blocks and held 2 s), or a whirlpool 6 blocks across where you look for a minute (each 3 s, what's in it is held and drawn in)."],["The Trench Answers","the-trench-answers","A leviathan breaches where you look (36 blocks): everything within 18 blocks of it takes 89 damage, and the ground floods for a minute: foes wade through it."],["Trident of the King","trident-of-the-king","The trident in your hand, or back to the sea. Technique Key 1 throws a real trident, 16 damage, that the sea takes back."],["Maximum: Leviathan's Wake","maximum-leviathans-wake","The ocean stands up: a 36-block wave along your look, 89 damage, everything swept 18 blocks. The ground floods for a minute, and while you stand in it your arts cost 2 CE less."],["Atlantean Blood","atlantean-blood","You breathe water, swim and mine underwater as you would on land, and the cold of the deep can't touch you."],["Pressure King","pressure-king","Once every 3 s, your weapon blow on a foe in the water while you're in it adds 9 damage, and chills and slows it."],["Tidecaller's Step","tidecallers-step","Variant + Water Shaping (2 CE), standing in water: you come up in the water you look at, up to 18 blocks away."],["Stormcaller's Wake","stormcallers-wake","Variant + Trident of the King with the trident in hand (2 CE): lightning where you look (36 blocks), 22 damage to foes within 3 blocks of it."],["Abyssal Gaze","abyssal-gaze","Variant + Marine Telepathy (2 CE): the foe you look at within 9 blocks is frightened of you for 10 s."]]},{"id":"e001","n":"Auspicious Beast Summon","s":"Four beasts: a golden horn that follows your blows, dark water that carries you, Kirin's endurance, and Ryu, a dragon whose lightning you command.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Kaichi","kaichi","Summon Kaichi's golden drill horn, which stays until you dismiss it (your art's other form). Cast it at the foe you look at (30 blocks), or land a weapon blow, and the horn flies at that foe, through walls, and doesn't stop until it strikes or 5 s pass: 20 damage, once every 3 s."],["Reiki","reiki","Dark water carries you: twice as fast for 3 s. On its own, once every 3 s (2 CE), a blow about to land may be turned aside (half the time)."],["Kirin","kirin","Hold to pour 1 to 6 CE: Kirin's endurance shields you, 5% of your health per CE, but you stand rooted for 3 s."],["Ryu","ryu","Summon Ryu, the dragon, for an hour: it flies beside you and fights. Technique Key 1 commands its lightning breath (once every 3 s): 53 damage down a 12-block line. If it falls, it's gone until a long rest."],["Maximum: Kirin's Flames","maximum-kirins-flames","For a minute Kirin's endurance burns inside out: every blow that reaches you returns as fire on whoever struck it, three times as hard."],["Auspicious Beasts' Realm","auspicious-beasts-realm","A law, not an event: inside, every beast answers for 2 CE less, and Kaichi strikes with every blow."],["Double Up","double-up","Kaichi grows a second drill horn: every horn thrust strikes twice."],["Zero Friction","zero-friction","While Reiki carries you, Kaichi answers every weapon blow (not once every 3 s), and each thrust throws the foe back."]]},{"id":"e539","n":"Backwards Magic","s":"Spoken backwards: telekinesis, fire, shields, illusions, vanishing, healing, teleporting, freezing, countercharms and the Backwards Word.","c":"DC","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Speak the Verb","speak-the-verb","Speak the verb Technique Key 1 chose, backwards: EVOM EHT TCEJBO (1 CE) throws the foe you look at 9 blocks, or lifts the block you look at and hurls it. ERIF (1 CE) is fire, 22 damage, and lights where it lands. DLEIHS (1 CE) halves the next blow within 3 s. NOISULLI (2 CE): an illusion 6 blocks around where you look, for 10 minutes; foes in it lose the fight in it. ESAPAHC (1 CE): you vanish for 3 s. LAEH (2 CE) heals. TROPELET (2 CE) teleports you 18 blocks to where you look. EERF (2 CE) freezes the foe you look at for 3 s, and the water around it. LLEPS EHT OTUAH (3 CE): every hostile shot within 18 blocks unravels. It also breaks holds on you and your allies in reach. Every verb that harms deals 9 damage more, and once a long rest, Variant + this speaks the verb and the next together, both costs + 1 CE."],["Escape Artist","escape-artist","With the feat: it was a trick all along. Holds, slowing, frost and confusion fall away, and webs around you part."],["Maximum: The Backwards Word","maximum-the-backwards-word","One whole sentence, backwards, without a stumble: for a minute every lesser foe within 36 blocks forgets the fight, every great one fights at half its strength, and you're mended. Once in the minute, Variant + Technique Key 1 speaks the true name of the foe you look at backwards: it's banished till the minute ends, unseen and out of the fight with you (not a boss; a strong will may hold)."],["Escape Artist","escape-artist-2","The quick key slips any hold (1 CE)."],["Stage Fright","stage-fright","Each verb you speak unnerves the foe you look at: it hits 30% softer for 3 s (a strong will holds)."],["Rabbit Out of the Hat","rabbit-out-of-the-hat","TAH EHT FO TUO: Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE, outside the Backwards Word) pulls a small plain thing into your hand, torches, bread, ladders, snowballs or string by turn. It's gone from your inventory after an hour."],["The Prestige","the-prestige","Once a long rest, a blow that would kill you leaves you at 1 health, already 18 blocks away along your look."]]},{"id":"e060","n":"Battle Waltz","s":"Spinning tops with brutally simple orders. Their randomness is area denial, and the dancer becomes a top too.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Battle Waltz","battle-waltz","12 tops swarm a 4-block spot where you look for 30 s; foes in it stumble. At most 24 swarm tops at once; the oldest stop."],["Tornado Top","tornado-top","For a minute you spin your own body: 4 more armor, nothing knocks you back, and whatever strikes you takes 26 damage (once every 3 s). Spinning Guard (2 CE, once every 3 s) lessens a heavy blow by 59% of your health."],["Shotgun Blues","shotgun-blues","Your tops fire as one down a 12-block line along your look: 66 damage, and they land at its end. With Variant (11 CE), every top converges on the foe you look at instead: 86 damage in one blow."],["Dancing Top","dancing-top","Throw a top along your look; it spins, ricochets off every surface and strikes whatever's near for 13 damage. Up to 9 loose tops; the oldest stops. They spin 45 s."],["Maximum: Fifty-Top Funeral","maximum-fifty-top-funeral","Fifty spectral tops in five swarms where you look (24 blocks) for 30 s: 13 damage to whatever they touch. A new Funeral ends the last."],["Tops","tops","Each top strikes for 13 damage, harder at 6th, 11th and 18th. They fall, roll and bounce like real tops."],["Unpredictable Orbit","unpredictable-orbit","A hostile shot that flies into a Battle Waltz swarm is knocked out of the air 25% of the time."],["Top Riding","top-riding","Variant + Dancing Top: a top spins up under your feet and lifts you as much as 12 blocks over 2 s, then lets you drift down slowly."],["Low Waltz","low-waltz","Technique Key 1 (2 CE) sends a top within 6 blocks of the foe you look at spinning into its feet: 13 damage, and it trips (a nimble foe keeps its feet)."],["Blue Shot","blue-shot","Shotgun Blues shatters one of its tops for 26 damage more."],["Gyro Balance","gyro-balance","Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE): the ally you look at, or you, spins steady for 3 s: nothing knocks them back."],["Ringmaster","ringmaster","Your tops know the troupe: they never strike, stagger or trip your allies."]]},{"id":"e002","n":"Black Bird Manipulation","s":"A flock of bonded crows that fly with you and peck your foes, an omen that frightens, and a crow's lethal dive.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Bond a Crow","bond-a-crow","Another crow answers and is bound to you for good (up to 11)."],["Omen of Death","omen-of-death","The crows gather where death is coming: every foe within 6 blocks is frightened for a minute (a strong will may resist): it flees, and fights weakened."],["Bird Strike","bird-strike","One crow launches itself at the foe you look at (12 blocks), homing, and bursts on it: 111 damage, and a limb broken (weakened and slowed for a minute). A nimble foe halves it. The crow dies, hit or miss."],["Maximum: Kamikaze","maximum-kamikaze","A Bird Strike whose death cry is an Omen: everything within 6 blocks of the foe is frightened too."],["Cursed Crows","cursed-crows","Your bonded crows fly with you and peck at your foes. Three return each long rest if the flock is smaller."],["Raven's Eye","ravens-eye","Your crows see for you: foes within 16 blocks show through walls."],["Black Mahakala","black-mahakala","The murder descends: up to three chosen foes suffer a full Bird Strike at no cost (the crows still die)."],["All Seeing","all-seeing","The flock lends you its eyes: you see in the dark, and darkness and blindness never take your sight."],["Deathwatch","deathwatch","What you've frightened, the crows keep watching: your blows on Omen-struck foes land 10% harder."],["Murder's Due","murders-due","Strike an Omen-struck foe and the whole flock collects: every crow pecks it at once (once every 3 s, no crow is lost)."],["Scavenger","scavenger","Once every 3 s, a blow on an Omen-struck foe feeds you: you heal 10% of your health."]]},{"id":"e254","n":"Black Box","s":"Dark Cube, Black Box Reinforcement, Perfect Cube and Primordial Gap: the toughest containment barrier there is, worn as armor at its peak.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Dark Cube","dark-cube","An opaque cube closes on the foe you look at (18 blocks): real black walls for a minute, dark inside for anyone but you, and the foe is held 3 s as it shuts (it may slip out first). With Variant the cube rises around you instead, or opens every cube you have standing. Hold the cast to reinforce: up to 10 CE more, each 2 a block wider (2 at most, and it takes whoever else stands inside), each 3 10 s longer. Technique Key 1 makes the next one a Perfect Cube (5 CE more): walls of obsidian for 30 s, and no one slips it."],["Dark Press","dark-press","With Offensive Creations: a wall of cube hurled down your look (36 blocks, stopped by a wall), 53 damage to each foe in its way, thrown back."],["Midnight Fist","midnight-fist","Wearing Midnight Armor: a fist of the cube on the foe you look at (4.5 blocks), 33 damage."],["Maximum: Midnight Armor","maximum-midnight-armor","For a minute you wear the cube: mended for its strength, 15 armor more and 40% less from every blow, and Midnight Fist opens."],["Primordial Gap","primordial-gap","Three fresh Perfect Cubes rise around three chosen foes, holding them 1.5 s and walling them in until the next pulse. Every Dark Cube you raise inside it is Perfect, for nothing more."],["Offensive Creations","offensive-creations","Dark Press opens. A Dark Cube that traps a foe crushes it as it closes (4 CE more: 55 damage), and once every 3 s your weapon blows wrapped in cube add 28 damage (2 CE)."],["Instant Manifestation","instant-manifestation","Once every 10 s, a blow on you, or on an ally within 3 blocks, lands on a cube snapped shut around them instead (2 CE)."],["Sealing Cube","sealing-cube","A Perfect Cube seals output too: while its walls stand, the foe's shots and arts are shut off."]]},{"id":"e050","n":"Black Flame Apostasy","s":"The godskin hunt: the Apostle's reach or the Noble's mass, black flame that burns late, and a Sabbath swept across the field.","c":"Video Games","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Black Flame Orb","black-flame-orb","An orb of black flame along your look (18 blocks): 27 damage, and it Kindles what it hits."],["Ritual Circle","ritual-circle","For a minute, a 3-block ring of black flame where you stand: every foe that crosses its edge is Kindled. In the Noble's skin its pillars ward you: weapon blows from foes inside the ring land at half."],["Scouring Black Flame","scouring-black-flame","A 9-block cone of black flame: every foe in it is Kindled and blinded for 3 s. A nimble foe may slip it."],["Noble Roll","noble-roll","In the Noble's skin, roll 6 blocks along your look through your foes: each one you cross is knocked down for 1 s and dragged 3 blocks with you."],["Skinbound Partner","skinbound-partner","For a minute, your other skin stands beside you as a body of its own, with 160 health. Once every 3 s it strikes your foe (25 damage) and Kindles it for nothing. It can be struck down."],["Black Flame Tornado","black-flame-tornado","A whirl of black flame: every foe within 4.5 blocks is pulled 3 blocks toward you and Kindled."],["Godskin Stance","godskin-stance","For a minute, wear a skin and its armament. Apostle: a fifth faster, a longer reach and the Twinblade. Noble: your body swells, 6 more armor, nothing knocks you back, and the heavy Stitcher. Technique Key 1 swaps them for free."],["Maximum: Godskin Sabbath","maximum-godskin-sabbath","You and a phantom of your other skin sweep 12 blocks along your look: every foe crossed is knocked down and Twin-Kindled (the flame bursts in it twice). A nimble foe is only Kindled."],["Kindling","kindling","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow Kindles its foe (1 CE): 3 s later the black flame bursts inside it (53 damage). Until it bursts, the foe can't heal."],["Swaddling Recovery","swaddling-recovery","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow wraps you in a little life (6% of your health)."],["Twin Detonation","twin-detonation","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow on a foe Kindled by your other skin bursts its flame at once and knocks it down for 1 s (1 CE)."],["Apostle Extension","apostle-extension","In the Apostle's skin your reach grows by 1.5 blocks more, and once every 3 s a weapon blow lets you step 3 blocks back from your foe."],["Shared Health Rite","shared-health-rite","While your partner stands, once every 3 s it takes up to 30 of a blow on you."],["Resurrection Chant","resurrection-chant","A fallen partner reforms 6 s later, for 5 CE, unless you're struck while you chant."],["True Black Flame","true-black-flame","The black flame's burst grows by half."],["Gloam Hunt","gloam-hunt","When you and your partner strike one foe within 3 s, its Kindling bursts at once and it can't heal for 3 s."],["Apostle's Reach","apostles-reach","In the Apostle's skin, Kindling costs no CE."],["Shared Vestments","shared-vestments","While you wear a skin, the ally nearest you within 3 blocks shares its grace: tougher and faster."],["Swaddling Cloth","swaddling-cloth","Swaddling Recovery wraps the most hurt ally within 3 blocks instead of you, when they need it more."],["Choir of Two","choir-of-two","Foes within 9 blocks of your partner glow, as if you saw them through its eyes."]]},{"id":"e544","n":"Black Flash Chaining","s":"Not a technique but a rhythm: chain hit into hit until the distortion answers in red, again and again.","c":"Original","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Step Inside","step-inside","For a minute you fight inside the distortion: the Chain never breaks, and your first critical each 3 s is a sure Black Flash."],["See the Gap","see-the-gap","For a minute you see the distortions: every creature within 16 blocks shows to you, and each blow builds the Chain twice."],["Maximum: Crimson Distortion","maximum-crimson-distortion","For a minute you are the distortion: the Chain is full, every critical you land is a Black Flash, and more of your blows land critically."],["The Chain","the-chain","Every blow you land builds the Chain (up to 5); 3 s without one breaks it. Each link: blows 3% harder, 2% likelier to be critical, and a critical 6% likelier to be a Black Flash."],["The Spark Remembers","the-spark-remembers","The Chain never breaks, and your blows land critically more often."],["The Gap Wears You","the-gap-wears-you","Once every 3 s, a creature's blow slips 2.5 microseconds sideways (2 CE): it lands at half, and the attacker takes 18 damage."],["Spark-Sight","spark-sight","Once every 2 minutes, a blow that would land was seen coming in the distortion: it misses."]]},{"id":"e115","n":"Blacklight","s":"Consume the living for Biomass and their shape, reshape it into claws, blades and hammers, and finally release a viral bloom grown from something you ate.","c":"Video Games","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Consume","consume","A mauling blow on the foe in front of you (3 blocks): 18 damage. But under a third of its health, a foe 10 levels under you, or 5 to 9 under and already low (half its health at 5, more as the gap grows), player or creature but never a boss, is eaten whole: Biomass by its size (5, 10 or 20) and you heal as much, and you wear its shape for two minutes: the rest of its kind doesn't know you until you strike one."],["Viral Ascendancy","viral-ascendancy","For a minute you Consume from 18 blocks: tendrils of you reach out and drag the meal in."],["Armor","armor","10 Biomass: for a minute your hide becomes a fortress. Blows land far softer and nothing knocks you back, but you're slower."],["Take Form","take-form","Reshape your arms into the form Technique Key 1 chose (press again to return to human): Claws (9 damage more) · Musclemass (11 damage, blows throw foes, you leap higher) · Blade (6th: 13 damage, longer reach) · Hammerfist (6th: 11 damage; taking it slams the ground, knocking down everything within 3 blocks for 2 CE) · Whipfist (9th: 9 damage, reach four blocks farther, and a hit drags the foe to you for 1 CE)."],["Maximum: Viral Cataclysm","maximum-viral-cataclysm","Spend an eaten elite (a great foe, or anything of 100 health or more, that you consumed or felled): spikes of biomass burst from the ground for 15 blocks around you, and every foe in it is infected for a minute, rotting every 3 s (14 damage) and spreading it when it dies (a tough foe resists)."],["Biomass","biomass","You hold up to 200 Biomass. Below half health, it mends you a little every second."],["Shield","shield","With Variant held, once every 3 s a blow meets a shield of eaten flesh (1 CE and 5 Biomass): 22 damage plus your level softer."],["Critical Mass","critical-mass","With 75 Biomass or more your blows land 9 damage harder and you move faster; and once every 3 s a killing blow leaves you at 1 health instead (3 CE and 30 Biomass)."],["Blacklight Apex","blacklight-apex","Your Biomass holds twice as much."],["Parkour Predator","parkour-predator","Sprint into a wall and you run up it; you leap higher, falls don't hurt you, and sneaking in the air glides."],["Adaptive Biomass","adaptive-biomass","Once every 10 s, a creature's blow teaches you (1 CE and 5 Biomass): the next blow from its kind misses, and feeds you 5 Biomass and health."]]},{"id":"e255","n":"Blazing Courage","s":"Through your beliefs, you set both your weapon and heart alight with your blazing courage.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Ignition","ignition","Set your weapon alight for a minute. Hold the cast to pour up to 5 CE: each is 13 damage of fire on your weapon blows (at most once a second), and they set the foe burning. The blade is a torch: it lights the air around you as you walk."],["Mantle of Courage","mantle-of-courage","While the blade burns: a 6-block aura of tended flame for a minute. You can't be set burning or chilled and take 10% less, and every foe in it takes your Ignition damage once every 3 s (half if it holds against the heat). In the Mantle your bare fists throw the flame too."],["Maximum: Conflagration","maximum-conflagration","A 18-block cone of flame along your look: 132 damage, knocked down a second, and the ground in it catches fire. Some come out of it badly burned: every fire of yours finds them for 6 more until a long rest."],["Eternal Flames","eternal-flames","With 3 or more CE in the blade, every swing throws a lick of flame 6 blocks ahead for half your Ignition damage, and your weapon reaches 3 blocks farther: courage that misses still burns."],["Technique Release","technique-release","Technique Key 1: end Ignition early and spend the flame at once: everything within 6 blocks of the foe you last struck takes your Ignition damage."],["Fire of the Heart","fire-of-the-heart","Inside, your blade always burns at its fullest; every chosen foe takes your Mantle's flame."],["Ferocious Courage","ferocious-courage","Once a second, a burning blow lets the flame leap to another foe within 9.0 blocks for half your Ignition damage (1 CE)."],["Blazing Heart","blazing-heart","While your Mantle burns, the teammate nearest you within 18 blocks wears it too: no burning, no chill, and its flame burns the foes around them as it does around you."],["Soulfire","soulfire","Once every 3 s (3 CE), a burning blow cuts through armor and leaves severe burns."]]},{"id":"e154","n":"Blind Spot","s":"Tax enemy attention to keep you still, then explode through any lapse in line of sight with impossible movement and a punishing strike.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Peripheral Failure","peripheral-failure","Up to 6 foes within 18 blocks blink: blinded 3 s, and they can't Observe you for 3 s even once they see again (a strong foe may keep its eyes open)."],["Blind Spot Step","blind-spot-step","Only while no foe Observes you: you're simply somewhere else, up to 18 blocks along your look. Your next weapon blow within a second is a Snap Strike: no more harm, but the foe can't react (a player's shield is knocked down) for 6 s, and if it fails to resist it's also held there and blinded for 6 s."],["Observation","observation","A foe within 18 blocks whose eyes are turned on you, with nothing in the way, Observes you. While any do, you can't Step."],["Blink Advance","blink-advance","Once every 3 s, when a foe watching you strikes or shoots, your next Step within a second works even while you're watched (up to 4 blocks)."],["Blink Reflex","blink-reflex","The moment the last Observer looks away, your next Step costs nothing (it reaches half as far)."],["Containment Chamber: DON'T BLINK","containment-chamber-dont-blink","Biological Blink: every chosen foe's eyes close at once (1.5 s), and each one you close gives a Blink Window (up to 6): a Window pays a Step instead of CE, one every 3 s, until the next pulse."],["Blink Hunter","blink-hunter","A watcher that raises a shield or strikes stops watching you; once every 3 s that's a Blink Reflex."],["Concrete Idol","concrete-idol","Perfect stillness absorbs the blow: once every 3 s, a blow on you while you stand motionless lands 47 softer."],["No Peripheral Vision","no-peripheral-vision","Against a single Observer you can force a micro-blink: the Step costs 2 CE more, and the watcher has to resist or lose sight of you."],["Neck-Line Anatomy","neck-line-anatomy","Once every 5 minutes, a Snap Strike that a foe badly fails to resist stuns it for 3 s: held, and its blows come to nothing."]]},{"id":"e003","n":"Blood Manipulation","s":"Your own blood as a weapon: spinning rings, walls of congealed blood, binding nets, a flooded body, a supersonic line and waiting orbs.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Slicing Exorcism","slicing-exorcism","A spinning ring of blood flies 12 blocks along your look, cutting through everything in its path: 11 damage. Costs 1% of your health."],["Blood Constructs","blood-constructs","A wall of congealed blood rises where you look (3 wide, 3 high, 2 wider per Convergence step): real blocks that stop foes and shots, gone after five minutes. Costs 3% of your health."],["Crimson Binding","crimson-binding","A net of blood flies at the foe you look at (6 blocks): it's bound for 1.5 s (half a second more per Convergence step, up to 3 s; a strong foe may tear free). Costs 2% of your health."],["Flowing Red Scale","flowing-red-scale","For a minute your blood runs at full speed: twice as fast, 6 more armor, blows a quarter faster."],["Piercing Blood","piercing-blood","A 20-block line of supersonic blood along your look, through every foe on it: 89 damage. Costs 10% of your health."],["Maximum: Supernova","maximum-supernova","Up to 6 orbs of compressed blood hang around you (each beyond the first costs 10 CE and 10% of your health). When a foe comes within 2 blocks of one, or after a minute, they all burst: 89 damage each."],["Convergence","convergence","Hold an art's key to pour more in: each step is 1 CE and 1% of your health for more force, up to 5 steps."],["Bloodbath","bloodbath","Every chosen foe's own blood attacks it from the inside: 53 damage."],["Blood Transfusion","blood-transfusion","Once every 3 s, an ally within 5 blocks who falls below half health is given your blood (1 CE and 5% of your health): they heal."],["Crimson Clot","crimson-clot","Your blood arts clot in the wound: a foe they hit is held for a moment (once every 3 s per foe)."],["Blood Crystallization","blood-crystallization","Flowing Red Scale also crystallizes your blood into armor: a quarter less damage taken and 5 more armor, but every 3 s there's a 15% chance the brittle flesh gives (weakened for 30 s)."],["Red Current","red-current","While Flowing Red Scale runs, you run up walls and across water."],["Blood Edge","blood-edge","Your weapon blows are edged in blood: 11 damage more each (a sliver of your health per blow)."],["Flowing Red Scale: Stack","flowing-red-scale-stack","Use Flowing Red Scale again while it runs (3 CE) and the flood deepens: three times as fast, 10 more armor and blows half again faster."]]},{"id":"e250","n":"Blood Techniques","s":"Blood shaped into rings, nets, crystals, rain and beams, every art paid in CE and your own blood. Convergence compresses it to the limit.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Slicing Exorcism","slicing-exorcism","A spinning ring of blood flies 36 blocks where you look, slicing through everything on its way: 18 damage. Costs 1% of your health."],["Crimson Binding","crimson-binding","A red net flies 18 blocks; whatever it catches is bound where it stands for 3 s, or 4 s after charging 1 s and 5 s after charging 2 s. Costs 1% of your health."],["Blood Construct","blood-construct","Blood drawn out and held in shape: a wall three blocks wide and two high where you look (6 blocks), for a minute. Costs 1% of your health. With the Blood Crystallization feat, Variant (2 CE more) hardens a plank instead: six blocks straight out from your feet the way you look, for 20 minutes."],["Blood Meteorite","blood-meteorite","A hurled crystal of blood that arcs and hits hard: 25 damage, knocking the foe back. Costs 3% of your health."],["Crimson Rain","crimson-rain","Spikes of blood rain on a 3-block circle where you look (up to 36 blocks): 33 damage in all; converged, they pin foes down. Costs 2% of your health."],["Blood Geyser","blood-geyser","Saturate the ground where you look (up to 6 blocks): the first foe to step on it in the next 30 s is hit from below by a geyser of blood, 55 damage, and launched. Costs 3% of your health."],["Blood Burst","blood-burst","Toggle. While it's on, once every 3 s a melee blow explodes with blood (1 CE and 1% of your health): 27 damage to everything within 2 blocks."],["Piercing Blood","piercing-blood","A supersonic beam of compressed blood, 60 blocks where you look, through every foe on the line: 89 damage. Converged, it lingers 2 s and sweeps with your aim, striking each foe on it once more. Costs 5% of your health."],["Flowing Red Scale","flowing-red-scale","A minute with your blood running fast: much faster on foot, +3 armor, +25% attack speed, higher jumps, and nothing knocks you back."],["Wing King Imitation","wing-king-imitation","Maximum (the Wing King Imitation feat): a minute on veined wings of blood. You fly, and every 2 s a line of blood rains on the foe nearest below you, 18 damage. Piercing Blood sleeps while you fly."],["Convergence","convergence","Hold the cast key to compress the blood, rooted where you stand: each second adds a stage (two at most), and each stage hits much harder, reaches 6 blocks farther and costs a little more CE and blood."],["Bloodbath","bloodbath","Every 3 s, the blood of each foe it chose turns on them from within: 53 damage. While it stands, your blood costs are paid from them, not you."],["Blood Production","blood-production","Cursed energy spun into blood: when a blood cost would come out of your body, 1 CE pays for it instead (up to ten times as much blood as CE)."],["Blood Crystallization","blood-crystallization","Variant + Blood Construct: blood taught to be stone, a plank to cross a gap."],["Crimson Afterimage","crimson-afterimage","Under Flowing Red Scale you leave a red ghost behind: once every 10 s, a blow finds the afterimage instead of you (3 CE)."],["Supernova","supernova","Piercing Blood seeds three small suns of blood along its line: for a minute they wait, then burst like buckshot (27 damage) when a foe comes near."],["Wing King Imitation","wing-king-imitation-2","Gain the Maximum: a minute of flight on wings of blood, raining lines of ruin below."]]},{"id":"e136","n":"Bloodlord","s":"An old vampire's appetite: drink from every blow, store the blood, and spend it on spawn, sorcery and one exsanguinating feast.","c":"Magic: The Gathering","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Blood Lance","blood-lance","A piercing lance of blood (18 blocks): 18 damage; it drinks up to 6 Blood for 9 damage more each."],["Vampire Spawn","vampire-spawn","A blood-born spawn for a minute: 27 damage a bite, and each bite heals you a little. It spends 3 Blood if you have it (otherwise it lasts only 20 s)."],["Aristocrat's Command","aristocrats-command","1 Blood: the foe you look at (18 blocks) is dismissed for 3 s: a creature turns away from you, a player is shaken (a strong will may hold)."],["Maximum: Exsanguinate","maximum-exsanguinate","Every foe within 9 blocks: 89 damage, and 11 damage more for every 2 Blood spent (all of it); a tough foe halves it. You drink half of what it takes, up to your full health."],["Vampiric Thirst","vampiric-thirst","Once every 3 s a weapon blow drinks deep (1 CE and 1 Blood): 9 damage more, and you heal."],["Blood","blood","Once every 3 s your blows gather a Blood; each kill gives another."],["Markov Immortality","markov-immortality","Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE and 3 Blood): you heal 55 damage, half if fire touched you in the last 3 s."],["Lord of Innistrad","lord-of-innistrad","Two spawn at once."],["Ancient Vampire","ancient-vampire","Blood holds 15 and rises to 3 after half a minute out of a fight. At 10 Blood or more you fly, and blows land 25% softer on you. Once a long rest, a killing blow leaves you at 1 health for 1 CE and all your Blood (5 at least)."],["Castle Markov","castle-markov","The banquet hall opens: each pulse every chosen living foe loses 22 damage (a tough one half), and you and your spawn drink the total, 66 damage at most."],["Vampiric Link","vampiric-link","Your vampiric healing past your max becomes temporary health, up to your level and 5, for a minute."],["Blood Artist","blood-artist","Once every 3 s, any death within 9 blocks, your own spawn included, gives 1 Blood."],["Ancient Grudge","ancient-grudge","Once every 3 s, whoever hurts you has its health named to you."],["Sanguine Bond","sanguine-bond","Technique Key 1 (1 Blood) bonds the foe you look at for 12 s: each time Vampiric Thirst heals you on another foe, the bonded one bleeds too."]]},{"id":"e004","n":"Body Manipulation","s":"Move into the bodies you kill: you wear them, their size, strength and toughness become yours, each leaves a stolen trait, and a backup body waits if you die.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Graverobber","graverobber","Once a long rest: move into the freshest body you've killed (within 10 s and 6 blocks), a sorcerer's too. Your body becomes it: everyone sees you as it, at its size, and with more health, armor and strength the mightier it was. It stays until you take another."],["Maximum: Backup","maximum-backup","Set where you stand as your only backup: the next time you'd die, you wake there instead, at half your health."],["The New Body","the-new-body","A taken body keeps its might until you take another."],["Skill Theft","skill-theft","Every body you take leaves you one trait it had (wings, fireproof hide, gills, thick hide, speed, venom, a predator's strength). You keep 4; the oldest goes first."],["Immortality","immortality","Every body is a new age: weakness and slowness never touch you."]]},{"id":"e005","n":"Boogie Woogie","s":"Instant positional exchange with escalating range, hostile swaps, multi-swaps, and deceptive tempo.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Boogie","boogie","Clap: you trade places with the foe you look at (24 blocks; 18 from 6th, 24 from 11th). From 3rd, with a foe marked (Technique Key 1), the mark trades places with whatever you look at instead. From 6th it costs nothing; from 11th your next blow after a swap strikes true."],["Best Friend","best-friend","For 30 s, once every 3 s, a blow from a creature or player about to land on you finds the foe nearest your crosshair instead: you've already clapped. It comes back 20 s after it ends."],["Woogie","woogie","Technique Key 1 marks the foe you look at, and only you see the mark; the next clap swaps it with another. Press it on the marked foe to clear the mark."],["Clapping With Soul","clapping-with-soul","18 blocks of reach, and clapping costs nothing."],["Round of Applause","round-of-applause","24 blocks of reach; after a swap, your next melee blow within 2 s lands half again as hard."],["Standing Ovation","standing-ovation","A rhythm with no downbeat, so there's no pulse: inside, you can clap as often as you like, and it costs nothing."],["Boogie Down","boogie-down","Once every 3 s, a blow about to land on you is clapped away: you swap places with a foe and it misses you (1 CE)."],["Beguiling Tactics","beguiling-tactics","A foe you swap is stunned for a second, the first time; once it's seen the trick, only half the time."]]},{"id":"e164","n":"Braxton Veil","s":"Flood the battlefield with a nauseating, electrically wrong atmosphere whose modes reshape sight, weight, sensing and stamina.","c":"Cryptids","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Atmospheric Pulse","atmospheric-pulse","The Veil exhales: everything in it (or within 3 blocks of you without it) takes 14 damage, gains Exposure and is poisoned (a strong foe may resist)."],["Unnatural Atmosphere","unnatural-atmosphere","For a minute the Veil hangs round you (18 blocks; with Variant it hangs still where you look, 18 blocks off). Every 3 s foes in it gain Exposure (up to 5): 1 slowed, 2 weakened, 3 sick and reeling, 4 poisoned and rotting (7 damage an Exposure each 3 s)."],["Modes (Technique Key 1)","modes-technique-key-1","Sulfur: exposed foes heal at half. Crimson: you're hard to see. Gravitic: foes inside are dragged slow. Static: exposed foes lose their aim and hit softer."],["Floating Apparition","floating-apparition","You hover (fly) while the Veil is up."],["The Hill Beneath the Red Star","the-hill-beneath-the-red-star","The whole barrier becomes the Veil, every Mode at once: every chosen foe gains Exposure and is poisoned."],["Eddy Reading","eddy-reading","While your Veil is up, you see a mote on every creature near you."],["Red Star Descent","red-star-descent","Pulse while diving and you drive the Veil down with you: only foes within 2 blocks are struck, but for 27 damage more."]]},{"id":"e041","n":"Bungee Gum & Texture Surprise","s":"Aura with the properties of rubber and gum: it sticks to anything, stretches impossibly far, and snaps back exactly when you tell it to. Only you can see it.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Bungee Gum","bungee-gum","A strand to whatever you look at (up to 20 blocks): it sticks to a foe or a surface. You can hold 6; the oldest lets go. Only you can see them. Your newest strand on a surface is a tether: in the air you swing from it, and sneaking reels you in."],["Detach","detach","Let go of every strand."],["Texture Surprise","texture-surprise","Your skin becomes wallpaper: creatures lose track of you until you attack or are touched. Cast again to drop it."],["Contract","contract","Snap the newest stuck strand back (every strand at once): you fly to a surface (up to 25 blocks) or slam into a heavy foe for 25 damage; a light foe is yanked to you and takes 18 damage."],["Maximum: Gum Storm","maximum-gum-storm","For a minute, gum erupts across 20 blocks around you: every 3 s the foes in it are stuck for 1.5 s and they're slowed throughout. Contract yanks the stuck foe you look at."],["Rubber and Gum","rubber-and-gum","Strands stretch 20 blocks, then pull back like rubber."],["Slingshot","slingshot","Contract flings you up to 25 blocks. A strand anchored above you means no fall damage."],["Web of Strings","web-of-strings","6 strands, and Contract snaps every one at once. You feel your web: a foe touching one of your strands, or within 2 blocks of where one is stuck, glows for 3 s."],["Prosthetic Gum","prosthetic-gum","Once every 3 s (3 CE): a killing blow leaves you at half a heart instead."],["Post-Mortem Heartbeat","post-mortem-heartbeat","Once a day: when you'd die, the gum squeezes your heart. You lie still for 3 s and stand back up at half health."],["Playground of Strings","playground-of-strings","Every 3 s, every foe it chose is stuck by a strand that can't be detached, and held for 1.5 s. Contract yanks the stuck foe you look at 7 blocks."],["Tripwire","tripwire","Your strands are tripwires: any foe within 10 blocks of where one is stuck glows for you."],["Bungee Parachute","bungee-parachute","The shimmer in the air is anchor enough: falls never hurt you, and sneaking as you fall drifts you down gently."],["Gum Gag","gum-gag","A strand across the mouth: a player you yank with Contract can't speak Cursed Speech's words or chant for 3 s."],["False Floor","false-floor","Texture Surprise in its other form, on a floor block within 6 blocks: the floor becomes gum over a pit, and gives way under the first foe to step on it. Up to 3 at once; the ground comes back after 30 s."],["Card Return","card-return","A strand can stick to a dropped item or a thrown trident, and Contract brings it back to your hand."]]},{"id":"e118","n":"Carnage","s":"A red arsenal of blades, shard volleys and tendrils driven by the Kill Chain, ending in the Carnage Storm.","c":"Marvel","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Red Weapon","red-weapon","Reaper Blade: a red scythe sweeps everything within 4.5 blocks in front of you, above and below too (9 damage, plus the Chain). Technique Key 1 switches the arsenal: Cleaving Axe (the foe in reach, 13 damage plus the Chain), Harpoon Spear (a foe at 6 blocks, or thrown 18, 11 damage plus the Chain), Maw Tendrils (a foe within 4.5 blocks is grabbed and held 3 s instead of hurt), Shard Volley (2 CE): three red shards fly 20 blocks where you look, 18 damage each. The chosen weapon and the shards strike together, for the shards' 2 CE."],["Autonomous Tendrils","autonomous-tendrils","A minute: once every 3 s, a tendril lashes the nearest foe within 5 blocks, from any side, and drags it a little closer, building Chain."],["Carnage Unleashed","carnage-unleashed","A minute: both configurations at once, tendrils every second out to 10 blocks, the Red Feast doubled, and going cold never drops the Chain."],["Red Rain","red-rain","Feat. Shards form in the air and rain down on up to two foes within 10 blocks: 9 damage each, building Chain."],["Maximum: Carnage Storm","maximum-carnage-storm","You blur through everything within 12 blocks: spikes erupt under each foe and throw it up, 133 damage each and held for 3 s (a strong one tears free and takes half). +2 Chain for each one held."],["Kill Chain","kill-chain","Each hit builds 1 Chain (2 on an unhurt foe), up to 12. 3 s without a hit drops it to 0. At Chain 3+ one weapon blow in ten is a critical; at Chain 6+ you're 15% faster."],["Free Tendrils","free-tendrils","At Chain 4+, once every 3 s a tendril strikes a foe within 5 blocks on its own."],["Red Feast","red-feast","Once every 3 s, a Red Weapon hit heals you 6% of your health. Fire or a sonic blast on you spoils it for 3 s."],["Red Finale","red-finale","At Chain 6+, your next Red Weapon hit spends the whole Chain: 11 damage more per link."],["Carnage Rules","carnage-rules","A kill keeps the Chain warm for another 3 s: it carries to the next one."],["Red Event","red-event","Once every 3 s, a Red Weapon hit splashes 44 damage onto every other foe within 3 blocks of its target."],["Red Rain","red-rain-2","The quick key rains symbiote shards on up to two foes within 10 blocks."],["Wall of Teeth","wall-of-teeth","Once every 3 s, a creature that hurts you within 6 blocks is snared in the symbiote's maw and held for 3 s (a strong one tears free)."],["Blood Trail","blood-trail","The last creature your Red Weapon wounded is tracked for an hour: its distance and direction show every 2 s, within 1600 blocks. Wounding another moves the trail."]]},{"id":"e558","n":"Cavitation","s":"The smallest warrior hits twice: a cavitation bubble follows every blow, snapped from the fingers or collapsed on a fist that boils the water around it.","c":"Original","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Carapace","carapace","A minute of hardened exoskeleton plates: 8 armor."],["Snap Shot","snap-shot","Snap a bubble along your look (18 blocks): 36 damage, the crack staggers the foe a moment, and glass where it pops shatters."],["Shellbreaker","shellbreaker","The foe in reach (3.5 blocks): 66 damage, and its armor is cracked in half for 3 s."],["Boiling Strike","boiling-strike","The foe in reach: 133 damage, and the boiling water burns everything within 3 blocks of it for 44 damage; the water around it boils away."],["Solar Snap","solar-snap","A 9-block cone of flash: 89 damage and blinded for 3 s (a hardy foe takes half and sees)."],["Jet Propulsion","jet-propulsion","A burst of water throws you 9 blocks along your aim (half again underwater)."],["Maximum: Supernova","maximum-supernova","A Boiling Strike on the foe in reach and a Solar Snap bursting 9 blocks around it at once."],["Cavitation Strike","cavitation-strike","Your weapon blows collapse a bubble (1 CE, once a second): 20 damage more, and the foe is shoved 3 blocks (a strong foe holds)."],["Mantis Eyes","mantis-eyes","Every creature within 16 blocks shows to you, you see in the dark, and darkness and blindness can't touch you."],["Sonic Boom","sonic-boom","Technique Key 1 (4 CE): both claws snap at once. Everything within 6 blocks takes 36 damage and is knocked flat for 3 s (a hardy foe halves it and keeps its feet), and the glass around you shatters."]]},{"id":"e256","n":"Centipede Shroud","s":"Cursed Centipede, Insect Storage, Earthquake and Vermin of Disaster: a living shikigami shroud that fights with you, stores for you and devours for you.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Earthquake","earthquake","The centipede bursts out of the ground where you look (18 blocks): 44 damage to every foe within 9 blocks, knocked down, and the soft ground there caves in. A foe off the ground is spared."],["Vermin of Disaster","vermin-of-disaster","Up to three giant centipedes launch at the foes nearest where you look (72 blocks): 89 damage each, dragged toward you (hurled away with Variant) and held 2.5 s (a strong foe may tear loose)."],["Cursed Centipede","cursed-centipede","The centipede wraps around you as a shroud (free the first time each long rest, then 3 CE): your weapon blows add 11 damage and you have 6 armor more, half of every blow on you lands on the centipede until it's killed (50% of your max health, half again with the second centipede), and it carries you up walls (sneak to hang). Press again to send it away."],["Insect Storage","insect-storage","Shrouded, Technique Key 1 opens the centipede's stomach: your ender chest, wherever you stand."],["Centipede Nest","centipede-nest","Centipedes coil around every chosen foe: held fast 1.5 s."],["Dowsing Vibrations","dowsing-vibrations","Shrouded, with your feet on the ground, you sense every creature touching the ground within 60 blocks, the unseen too: a mote shows over each."],["Wu Gong","wu-gong","Shrouded, once every 3 s a weapon blow envenoms the foe (1 CE): 41 poison damage more, poisoned, and it can't react for 3 s unless it resists."],["Living Gullet","living-gullet","Earthquake swallows the smallest foe it hits (not the great ones): it vanishes into the centipede, held 3 s."]]},{"id":"e191","n":"Chimeric Night Cry","s":"Wear one Aspect at a time, Monkey, Tiger, Serpent, Tanuki; at the peak, the bodies overlap.","c":"Mythology","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Night Cry","night-cry","The eerie cry down a 18-block cone: 18 damage, or 27 damage if you changed Aspect within the last 3 s. Those who don't steel themselves sicken, lose their bearings and flee for 3 s."],["Shift Aspect","shift-aspect","Become the next Aspect: Monkey (20% faster, a third of blows miss you), Tiger (your blows 30% harder), Serpent (your blows poison and reach 3 blocks farther), Tanuki (30% faster, creatures lose track of you). With Variant, 1 CE more: you keep the body you left as well for 3 s."],["Maximum: Chimera Beneath the Black Cloud","maximum-chimera-beneath-the-black-cloud","For a minute, under a black cloud, you wear your current Aspect and the next one at once. The Night Cry carries 36 blocks, and the weak it frightens are struck still 1.5 s."],["Crossbred Transition","crossbred-transition","Variant + Shift Aspect (1 CE more): the body you left stays with you for 3 s."],["Unclassifiable Beast","unclassifiable-beast","Once every 3 s, a foe's blow of a tenth of your health or more costs 1 CE: the body changes under it. It lands a fifth softer, and for 3 s you're the Monkey as well."],["Monkey's Cunning","monkeys-cunning","As the Monkey, quick fingers: you work blocks from 3 blocks farther and swing a fifth faster."],["Tiger's Pounce","tigers-pounce","As the Tiger, once every 3 s a blow landed at a full run bowls the foe over (a strong one may keep its feet)."],["Tanuki Mist","tanuki-mist","As the Tanuki, standing still makes you all but nowhere: you vanish from sight."],["Serpent's Patience","serpents-patience","As the Serpent, your blows on a poisoned foe add 7 damage."]]},{"id":"e103","n":"Chronological Reserve","s":"Time is a currency. Steal seconds from your enemies, store them as Time Units, and spend them to accelerate, freeze, rewind, or restore.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Stasis Sphere","stasis-sphere","3 TU: the foe you look at (36 blocks) is set aside, held where it hangs, in the air too, and weakened for a 3 s (a strong one shrugs it off). It can't counter, dodge or parry, and your own blow ends the stasis once it has landed. Precise Stasis (feat): with Variant, the ally you look at is set aside instead, held but untouchable."],["Accelerate","accelerate","5 TU, once every 3 s: every art of yours is ready again at once, and for 3 s you move and swing far faster."],["Age to Dust","age-to-dust","8 TU: 106 damage to the foe you look at, and its health never recovers half of it (a player's comes back after 5 minutes; a boss loses none). A golem or anything conjured takes 130 damage instead and keeps its health. Look at a block instead (2 TU): the hour is spent on it (crops ripen, copper weathers, stone cracks)."],["Chrono Anastasis","chrono-anastasis","Every TU (at least 15), once a long rest: the last 3 s is taken back within 18 blocks. You and your allies return to where you stood and the health you had; foes return to where they stood, keeping their wounds. Grand Clock (feat): with Variant, foes are left where they are."],["Archive: AGE / FREEZE / RETURN","archive-age-freeze-return","Choose what your Domain declares each pulse."],["Chrono Step","chrono-step","2 TU: you attend a different moment, slipping up to 5 blocks where you look, up or down too, untouchable for an instant."],["Maximum: The Future I Refuse","maximum-the-future-i-refuse","Automatic, once a long rest (12 CE + 12 TU): when you'd die, you're rewound 3 s instead. It refuses an ally's death within 36 blocks the same way."],["Time Theft","time-theft","Once every 3 s, a blow of yours that lands, by hand, shot or art, steals time (1 CE): the foe is slowed and you gain 4 TU. Up to 90 TU; a long rest starts you at your level."],["Stored Future","stored-future","Automatic, 4 CE + 4 TU, once every 3 s: a blow that would land never happened, and you're back where you stood 3 s ago."],["Time Emperor","time-emperor","Your TU cap doubles, a fight starts you at 10 TU or more, and theft steals 2 more."],["Archive of the Stolen Hour","archive-of-the-stolen-hour","Each pulse it declares what you chose: AGE (106 damage), FREEZE (held, weakened and unable to counter, dodge or parry for 1.5 s), or RETURN (dragged back to where it stood the pulse before)."],["Second Hand","second-hand","Once every 3 s, 1 CE + 2 TU, automatic: a hold or a fright that lands on an ally within 18 blocks is undone."],["Precise Stasis","precise-stasis","Variant + Stasis Sphere on an ally sets them aside for 3 s: held, but nothing can hurt them."],["Borrowed Second","borrowed-second","Technique Key 1 on the ally you look at within 18 blocks, 2 CE + 3 TU: 3 s of great speed and haste."],["Grand Clock","grand-clock","Variant + Chrono Anastasis rewinds only you and your allies; foes stay where they are."]]},{"id":"e289","n":"Clone","s":"Split yourself into an army: clones that fight, shield, and trade places with you, until Divide and Conquer.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["One Man Army","one-man-army","A clone of you for 10 minutes, 25 damage a blow. It takes blows for you until it has soaked all of your health, then breaks (up to 6 at once)."],["Body Swap","body-swap","You and your farthest clone trade places."],["Maximum: Four is a Party","maximum-four-is-a-party","Your whole roster splits off at once, fresh, and each clone sets on the nearest foe with a 36 damage opening strike."],["Twice the Fun","twice-the-fun","A blow on a foe with one of your clones beside it finds the opening more often (one in three is a critical)."],["Three is a Crowd","three-is-a-crowd","When a clone breaks, you regain 1 CE."],["Divide and Conquer","divide-and-conquer","A clone appears beside every chosen foe and strikes: 18 damage per clone you have (up to 6)."],["Long Leash","long-leash","Your clones step out where you look (within 9 blocks), not just at your side."],["Shell Game","shell-game","Technique Key 1 trades places with the clone nearest where you look (within 18 blocks)."],["Meant to be Expendable","meant-to-be-expendable","Once every 10 s, when a blow is about to land, a clone splits off mid-blow (4 CE): it shoves you aside and takes it."],["Shared Burden","shared-burden","Every few seconds while a clone stands, the poisons, withering, burns and slowing on you pass to it instead."],["Maximum: Conga Line","maximum-conga-line","Four is a Party moves as one: every clone also dashes to the foe nearest where you look and strikes it (25 damage each)."]]},{"id":"e140","n":"Compleation","s":"Glistening oil remakes your body piece by piece while infection spreads through everything you touch. All will be one.","c":"Magic: The Gathering","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Oil Lash","oil-lash","A whip of glistening oil at the foe you look at (9 blocks): 18 damage, and it's infected. With the Cannon limb, a 27 damage shot twice as far."],["Proliferate","proliferate","Every infection within 9 blocks spreads a step (the foe you look at is infected even if it wasn't), and +1 Oil."],["Corrupted Conversion","corrupted-conversion","The foe you look at turns on its own kind for 3 s: surely at 3 Infection, otherwise a strong will resists."],["Self-Modify","self-modify","You graft yourself a little further: +1 Oil. An iron ingot from your pack is grafted in too: +2 Oil instead (it's used up). From 13th, Variant + Self-Modify picks the Praetor Evolution instead."],["Maximum: March of the Machine","maximum-march-of-the-machine","At Oil 10: for a minute every blow infects for free, the infections near you spread each 3 s, your plating thickens, and you grow large."],["Oil","oil","Oil builds as you're hurt (once every 3 s). At 3 your plating hardens (4 armor); at 6 your blows bite 7 damage deeper."],["Infection","infection","Once every 3 s a blow infects its target (1 CE, up to 3 for a minute): it rots for 7 damage per Infection each 3 s and hits 8% softer per Infection. A carrier that dies bursts, infecting the foes within 3 blocks."],["Adapt","adapt","At Oil 3, Technique Key 1 picks an adaptation: Plating (2 more armor), Climber (you climb walls), Sensors (night vision, and foes within 12 blocks shown to you), Edge (7 damage on a blow once a 3 s), or Resistance (one kind of harm lands at 80% until your next long rest)."],["Compleat Limb","compleat-limb","At Oil 5, Variant + Technique Key 1 picks a limb: Blade (9 damage on your blows), Cannon (Oil Lash becomes a shot), Shield (once a 3 s a blow lands at 80%), or Injector (your blows slow a foe a moment)."],["Perfected Form","perfected-form","Resistance is always worn beside your adaptation."],["Praetor Evolution","praetor-evolution","At Oil 7, Variant + Self-Modify picks an evolution: Wings (flight), Regeneration, Reach (+1 block), Ward (technique blows on you land at 85%), or Two Limbs."],["All Will Be One","all-will-be-one","Three adaptations and the evolution at once. Once a long rest, a killing blow (1 CE) makes you a cocoon instead: 1 health and held for 3 s, then you reform at half health."],["New Phyrexia","new-phyrexia","The clinic opens: each pulse every infection in it spreads a step for free, then every chosen foe takes 55 damage per Infection (111 damage at most; a hardy one halves it)."],["Gitaxian Probe","gitaxian-probe","Variant + Oil Lash probes instead (1 CE): how hurt the foe is, its armor, what it shrugs off; Resistance may then answer its kind of harm."],["Steel Thane","steel-thane","At 3 Oil or more, once every 3 s a creature's blow locks your plating rigid: it lands at half, but you're nearly rooted for a moment."],["Toxic","toxic","Past Oil 5 you exude a miasma: each 3 s, foes right beside you gain an Infection (a hardy one resists)."],["Viral Drake","viral-drake","Proliferate leaps: each infected foe passes the oil to one uninfected foe within 3 blocks (a hardy one resists)."]]},{"id":"e548","n":"Compound","s":"Every round you survive accrues interest; every strike is a withdrawal. Patience billed by the hour, then liquidated all at once.","c":"Original","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Principal","principal","A strike on the foe in reach (3.5 blocks): 18 damage plus your accrual, then the accrual is cashed out (but kept)."],["Maturity","maturity","Once every 5 minutes: for a minute, every 3 s counts twice for your accrual."],["Draw It Out","draw-it-out","You stop fighting and start billing hours: for 3 s, half the blows on you miss."],["Maximum: Total Liquidation","maximum-total-liquidation","A Principal strike that cashes out three times your accrual at once."],["Accrual","accrual","Each 3 s with a foe within 18 blocks adds +2 to your accrual (up to 40). 10 s with no foe around resets it."],["The Ledger Never Forgets","the-ledger-never-forgets","Your accrual survives a Principal strike."],["Living Off the Interest","living-off-the-interest","Once every 3 s, a blow on you is paid down by your accrual (2 CE): it lands that much softer."],["Compound Fracture","compound-fracture","At +5 accrual or more, a Principal strike leaves its foe slowed for 3 s."]]},{"id":"e114","n":"Conduit Mimic","s":"Touch a power and it's yours (smoke, neon, video, concrete), each with its own shot, movement and finisher, until they erupt together.","c":"Video Games","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Mode Shot","mode-shot","Your Mode's shot (36 blocks, Neon 54). Smoke: 18 damage and it burns. Neon (6th): 27 damage, often a critical. Video (9th): 36 damage and it loses track of you. Concrete (11th): 44 damage and a shove."],["Karmic Finisher","karmic-finisher","Once per Mode per long rest, where you look. Smoke, Orbital Drop: you rocket up and slam down, 89 damage and knocked down. Neon, Overcharge: 89 damage and blinded. Video, Angelic Storm: 89 damage and confused. Concrete, Fortress: 89 damage and walled in with conjured concrete."],["Mode Movement","mode-movement","Smoke: dash 12 blocks through foes as smoke. Neon: run as light for 3 s. Video: fly on wings for 3 s. Concrete: harden, so blows land far softer for 3 s."],["Maximum: Conduit Symphony","maximum-conduit-symphony","All four erupt together: everything within 8 blocks takes 107 damage and is blinded or bound (a nimble foe halves it and keeps its feet)."],["Sources","sources","Technique Key 1 switches to the next Mode whose source is within 6 blocks. Smoke: fire, lava, a lit furnace or campfire. Neon: glowstone, sea lanterns, lanterns, or bright light. Video: the open night sky. Concrete: standing on concrete or stone."],["Source Cache","source-cache","Each Mode stores one charge: switch to it anywhere once, refilled when you touch its source."],["Smoke & Mirrors","smoke-mirrors","Smoke Dash leaves a thick cloud where you stood: foes within 2 blocks are blinded for 3 s."],["Neon Runner","neon-runner","Running as neon, you pass through foes as light: each one you run through takes 18 damage, once per run."],["Digital Angel","digital-angel","Taking Video flight with 2 CE to spare hard-lights the wings into blades: everything within 3 blocks takes 27 damage."],["Concrete Skin","concrete-skin","Once every 3 s, a blow that lands is petrified shut (1 CE): it lands softer by 11 damage plus your level."]]},{"id":"e006","n":"Construction","s":"Real matter from cursed energy: a blade in your hand, blocks where you need them, cursed blessings, insectoid armor, and a perfect sphere nothing can break.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Construct","construct","Hold to pour 1 to 6 CE into something real (Technique Key 1 chooses). A weapon: a real blade in your hand for 30 s, a diamond sword's blow and 10% harder per CE. It's yours alone: it can't be dropped, and it's gone when its time is up, if you die, or when you build another. Matter: a column of solid stone where you look (within 12 blocks), a block per CE, that crumbles after 10 minutes."],["Cursed Creation","cursed-creation","A cursed item, made for the moment: a random blessing (toughness, mending, speed, strength, a shield, quick hands, life force or a spring in your step) for 10 minutes."],["Liquid Metal","liquid-metal","Your constructed weapon flows: each use (up to 4) adds half a block of reach and 5% more force, for 30 s."],["Insectoid Armor","insectoid-armor","A minute in insectoid armor: much tougher (+8 armor, +4 toughness), 20% stronger and 30% faster, and blows land 30% lighter."],["Maximum: Perfect Sphere","maximum-perfect-sphere","A perfect sphere nothing can break, moved by a thought for 30 s: it hangs where you look (scroll to set how far, up to 12 blocks) and crushes every foe it touches, 44 damage every 1.5 s."],["Threefold Affliction","threefold-affliction","A law, not an event: there is no pulse. Inside it every construction costs 2 CE less."],["Subtle Constructs","subtle-constructs","A weapon built so quietly no one saw it made: the first blow after you Construct a weapon lands half again as hard."]]},{"id":"e105","n":"Contact Decay","s":"Whatever the hand touches should not exist: Decay Marks that pile up and crumble, blocks that tremble and fall to dust, and ruin that spreads through the ground itself.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Five-Finger Decay","five-finger-decay","Touch the foe you look at (3 blocks): 13 damage and a Decay Mark (two at 20th); at 3 Marks it Crumbles. Touch a block instead and it trembles and falls to dust, and the decay runs through up to 60 blocks joined to it."],["Awakening","awakening","Hand to the ground: ruin runs 72 blocks through it (36 at 13th, 54 at 15th, 72 at 20th), and the nearest 20 blocks of its surface tremble and crumble. Everything standing on that ground, not in the air or in water, takes 66 damage and 2 Marks, and is knocked down for 2 s."],["Maximum: Deika Collapse","maximum-deika-collapse","48 blocks of ground unmade, two layers deep, and the ruin runs 90 blocks: everything standing on that ground takes 132 damage, 3 Marks, and is knocked down for 2 s. A closed Domain's barrier in the ruin takes its hardest blow. Recoil: you lose 53 damage (never below half a heart), and an arm breaks (Weakness for a minute)."],["Decay Marks","decay-marks","Up to 3 on a foe; they fade 30 s after the last if it survives."],["Touch Goes Both Ways","touch-goes-both-ways","Whatever hits you with its body has touched your hand: 13 damage and a Mark (1 CE, once every 3 s)."],["Crumbling Hold","crumbling-hold","A marked foe that's held, within 3 blocks of you, gains a Mark every 3 s."],["Crumble","crumble","A foe that reaches 3 Marks Crumbles: 2 CE (free from 15th) for 66 damage (more as you master it), and its Marks clear. Without the CE, it Crumbles at the next Mark."],["Four Fingers","four-fingers","Every 3 s, a marked foe touching another passes a Mark to it (1 CE)."],["Avalanche","avalanche","Awakening also knocks its victims down."],["Chain Reaction","chain-reaction","A foe your Decay reduces to nothing passes a Mark to everything touching it."],["Ruined City","ruined-city","You shape the ruin as you make it: Awakening also heaps a rubble rampart where you look (1 CE), 3 wide and 2 high, which decays in its turn after a minute. With Variant it opens a pit there instead."],["Dustproof","dustproof","Your Decay knows its maker: Deika's recoil no longer hurts you (the arm still breaks), and with Variant, Awakening or Deika carries you up to 6 blocks along your look, riding the crumble."],["Selective Hand","selective-hand","Variant + Five-Finger Decay stills the hand: Touch Goes Both Ways stops until you do it again."]]},{"id":"e157","n":"Corrosive Threshold","s":"Infect surfaces and prey with Corrosion, turn the stains into doors, and drag degraded targets into a private hunting space.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Corroding Touch","corroding-touch","The foe you touch (2.5 blocks): 16 damage of rot and a Corrosion Mark (up to 3, each slowing it, a minute after the last). Dragging Hand (6th): with Variant, on a foe with 2 or more Marks, for 3 CE more, it has to resist or you both sink below for 3 s, where nothing touches either of you; you rise at your stain nearest your look (within 36 blocks) with it beside you. Never a boss."],["Slough","slough","The foe you look at (18 blocks), with 2 or more Corrosion Marks, rots open: 7 damage a Mark, and its Marks are spent. If it resists it takes half and keeps them (resisting is harder at 3)."],["Rotting World","rotting-world","The foe you reach for (6 blocks), with 3 Corrosion Marks, is dragged down into your pocket dimension for 3 s. It rots there and comes back up broken: 66 damage. 3 CE inside your Domain."],["Threshold Walk","threshold-walk","Sink into the ground and rise from your stain nearest where you look (within 72 blocks), or else from the ground where you look (18 blocks). A stain lit bright, or rising while blind, can push you out beside it, and then you can't Walk for 3 s. Rising from a stain under water costs 2 CE more. Free once every 3 s. Inside your Domain every wall is a mouth: you rise from any surface you look at, and with Variant you carry an ally within 2 blocks (1 CE)."],["Stains","stains","Technique Key 1 stains the surface where you look (12 blocks), up to 8 stains, each for 10 minutes: doors for Threshold Walk."],["Predatory Emergence","predatory-emergence","Your first melee blow within 3 s of a Walk deals 18 damage more."],["House Beneath Every Surface","house-beneath-every-surface","Predigestion Tide: every chosen foe gains a Corrosion Mark and is pulled toward the floor; one already at three sinks and is held 1.5 s. Every wall is a mouth: Threshold Walk needs no stain here."],["Black Mucus","black-mucus","Your stains are sticky ground: foes standing near one are slowed (not a strong one)."],["Liquefying Grip","liquefying-grip","The third Corrosion Mark seizes its foe: it's held fast and can't react for 3 s (a strong one may tear free of the hold)."],["Predator Beneath","predator-beneath","Within 3 s of a Walk, Variant + Walk keeps you half sunk until 3 s has passed: shots on you land at half, and you can't move."],["Recall Protocol","recall-protocol","Once every 5 minutes, a blow that drops you below a quarter of your health pulls you (2 CE) through your farthest stain within 72 blocks."]]},{"id":"e514","n":"Crazy Slots","s":"A clown, a lottery, nine weapons: spin and fight with whatever the clown deals. A drawn weapon can't be dismissed until it's used. And there's a number you've never rolled.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Use Weapon","use-weapon","Attack with the weapon the clown dealt: the Daggers (2 seeking throws), the Scythe (3 sweeps), the Bow (3 arrows), the Hammer (2 blows that crack the ground), the Gun (3 shots), the Shield (blocks one blow), the Whip (one grab) or the Mace (2 blows that knock the foe away)."],["Second Spin","second-spin","Once a long rest: spin twice, and you must take the second."],["Double Feature","double-feature","Once a long rest: deal two weapons at once."],["The Clown's Contract","the-clowns-contract","Pay some of your health: spin twice and keep the one that fits the fight (a close weapon if a foe is near). With Variant you name it defensive: the Shield, if either roll gives it."],["Spin the Clown","spin-the-clown","Spin the clown's reel (it never lands on 9) and draw that weapon."],["Full House","full-house","A minute: all nine at once, no conditions. Use Weapon swings a random one. When it ends the clown collects: slowed and weakened for 30 s."],["Encore","encore","Once a long rest, when a weapon is used up, the clown spins again at once (2 CE)."],["The Number You Never Rolled","the-number-you-never-rolled","Once a long rest, at 0 health: 3 CE, back to half health, holding the Survivor, which deals double to whatever brought you down."],["The House Always Deals","the-house-always-deals","Everyone plays: each chosen foe juggles the clown's prop and hits 30% softer until the next pulse."],["The Clown Knows","the-clown-knows","When you spin, the clown whispers where the foe you look at is soft: its armor is halved for a minute."],["Rigged Applause","rigged-applause","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): flourish the weapon in your hand; foes within 9 blocks that fall for it stop to watch for 3 s."],["Curtain Call","curtain-call","Once a long rest, within a minute of a weapon being used up, Variant + Use Weapon hurls its echo: one more attack with it (1 CE)."],["Prop Master","prop-master","Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE): your last used-up weapon is left where you look as an innocent prop for an hour; the next foe to touch it takes one blow of it. One at a time."]]},{"id":"e107","n":"Crimson Legion","s":"A walking graveyard. Consumed souls are extra lives, summonable familiars, and the fuel for your most horrifying release.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Blood Drinker","blood-drinker","Drink the soul of a fresh body within 6 blocks (bodies you walk over are drunk on their own)."],["Black Hound","black-hound","A minute: a black hound pours out of your shadow and hunts beside you (26 damage a bite). While it's out, once every 3 s your blow lands 26 damage harder. Baskerville (feat): with Variant, a foe one of your hounds holds within 12 blocks is dragged to your feet (a soul)."],["Named Familiar","named-familiar","A minute: raise your finest stored soul as the creature it was, fighting for you, with 120 health or its own if that's more. A shooter keeps its weapon and its shot. Named Dead (feat): with Variant you commune with it instead, and every creature of its kind within 48 blocks glows for a minute."],["Vampiric Mist","vampiric-mist","Until the next 3 s: you're mist. Nothing touches you, you're hard to see, and you can't strike."],["Restriction Level One","restriction-level-one","A minute: release up to 6 familiars at once, your named souls first, then hounds. While it lasts, Extra Life costs 2 souls."],["Restriction Level Zero","restriction-level-zero","Ten minutes: the court deployed. 10 swarms of bats and hounds (a soul each) and every named familiar. No Extra Life while they're out."],["Feed","feed","Spend a soul: heal 20% of your health (about)."],["Maximum: Sea of the Dead","maximum-sea-of-the-dead","30 souls released as a tide out of the ground within 36 blocks: 132 damage to every foe, held by the dead for 3 s."],["Soul Stock","soul-stock","Up to 80 souls; a long rest starts you with at least 20. Up to 6 elite souls (a creature with 40+ health) are kept by kind."],["Extra Life","extra-life","Automatic, 3 CE + 3 souls, once every 3 s: at 0 health you stand at 1 and heal 20%. Not while Level Zero is out."],["Vampiric Body","vampiric-body","Blows land 15% softer, and you climb any wall you walk into."],["True Vampire","true-vampire","Once every 3 s, a kill feeds you its soul as it falls (1 CE)."],["Baskerville","baskerville","Your hounds hunt with a body now: their bites seize what they hit, holding it a moment."],["Casull & Jackal","casull-jackal","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): both cursed pistols fire where you look, 18 damage each."],["Named Dead","named-dead","Variant + Named Familiar communes with your finest stored soul instead of raising it: every creature of its kind within 48 blocks glows for a minute."],["No Life King","no-life-king","When Extra Life saves you, one more soul lets the moment land: foes within 6 blocks that see it freeze in dread for 3 s."]]},{"id":"e007","n":"Cursed Cannon","s":"A one-man battery: beams that blow holes in the world, a shot that splits, a shell that hunts, and a held nuclear charge.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Granite Blast","granite-blast","A beam of cursed energy along your look (90 blocks), through every foe on it: 133 damage. It blows a hole where it lands and kicks you back. Once every 2 s. Hold Variant as you fire: Grape Shot (1 CE more), split among up to 6 foes in front of you, the nearest your aim first. Hold the key a second, then release: Guided Shell (1 CE more), a shell that hunts the foe you looked at."],["Maximum: Nuclear Shell","maximum-nuclear-shell","Hold the key 4.5 s to build a loud, obvious charge, then release: a 90-block cone of Granite Blast with 55 damage more. Let go early and it fizzles, free."],["One-Man Battery","one-man-battery","Granite Blast has its own 2 s reload. Nothing about it is subtle."],["Il Gran Dolce","il-gran-dolce","The sweet course, served on schedule: up to three chosen foes take a full Granite Blast, from above."],["Detonate","detonate","Fired at a foe within 3 blocks, Granite Blast goes off in its face: a quarter more, and it's thrown back."],["Croquembouche","croquembouche","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow also fires a point-blank Granite Blast into the same foe (1 CE)."],["Canshot","canshot","When a Granite Blast hits, 3 CE shrapnels the impact: every other foe within 3 blocks of the target takes half."],["Maximum: Antimatter Bomb","maximum-antimatter-bomb","Hold Variant as you release Nuclear Shell: all of it strikes every foe within 60 blocks around you instead, and the ground within 6 blocks of you is reduced to dust."]]},{"id":"e258","n":"Cursed Circuitry","s":"Cursed Circuitry, Advanced Circuits, Linked Circuits and Circuit Mastery: lay invisible patterns and detonate them as traps.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Lay Circuit","lay-circuit","Lay the chosen pattern (Technique Key 1) on the floor, wall or ceiling where you look (9 blocks); it waits, unseen by foes, until one comes on it, and remembers the way you looked. Combustion: 20 fire damage in 6 blocks · Lightning Surge: 18 damage in a 9-block cone the way you looked, stunned 2 s · Stasis Hold: held 3 s in 6 blocks · Burst Leap: everything on it thrown the way you looked when you laid it (you, the way you look now) · Shockwave Blast: 14 damage down a 12-block line the way you looked, thrown back · for 2 CE more: Binding Chains (held 3 s in 9 blocks), Energy Discharge (27 damage in 12), Energy Drain (14 damage in 12, CE back, and a sorcerer loses up to 10 CE to you unless they resist), Cursed Detonation (66 damage in 18 and a crater, once a long rest). Up to 8 at a time."],["Activate","activate","Set off the pattern nearest where you look (within 9 blocks of you; any of yours from 11th). In Living Circuitry, with none in reach, it's a Burst Leap of your own the way you look, once every 3 s."],["Maximum: Living Circuitry","maximum-living-circuitry","With the feat: for a minute the circuit is drawn into your own body. Your weapon blows add 14 damage lightning (once a second), and once every 3 s one stuns the foe a moment."],["Linked Circuits","linked-circuits","A pattern going off sets off every other pattern within 36 blocks of it, one after another."],["Circuit Mastery","circuit-mastery","Patterns deal 14 damage more, and Activate reaches any of them. Variant + Technique Key 1, Cursed Overclock: spend up to 5 CE; for a minute your patterns deal 7 damage more per CE."],["Deus ex Machina","deus-ex-machina","The whole Domain is your circuit: every chosen foe's energy is drained through it, 66 damage, and 1 CE back to you for each (up to 5). A sorcerer among them also loses up to 5 CE to you."],["Closed Circuit","closed-circuit","You leave no trace of your energy: creatures more than 8 blocks off lose track of you."],["Dead-Man's Circuit","dead-mans-circuit","When a blow drops you below a quarter of your health (once a minute), or kills you, every pattern you've laid goes off at once."],["Circuit Chain Reaction","circuit-chain-reaction","Before Linked Circuits: for 2 CE, the nearest pattern within 6 blocks of one going off goes off too."],["Maximum: Living Circuitry","maximum-living-circuitry-2","Gain the Maximum: become the circuit, lightning on every blow for a minute."]]},{"id":"e249","n":"Cursed Corpse Creation","s":"Cores, bodies, mutations, the Prized Creation and Perfect Creations: Yaga's cursed-corpse construction and command.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Cursed Corpse","cursed-corpse","Sew a core into a body of the chosen size (Variant + Technique Key 1): Small (1 CE, 9 damage a blow) · Medium (2 CE, 18 damage) · Large (4 CE, 27 damage) · Huge (6 CE, 36 damage) · Gargantuan (10 CE, 53 damage). It fights for 10 minutes (an hour from 18th), up to 6 corpses. A block of wool in your pack is sewn in: a quarter more health."],["Maximum: Prized Creation","maximum-prized-creation","Your favorite, one at a time, for an hour: the largest body you can make with half again the health, 66 damage a blow, and three mutations: Quick, Hardened and Tough."],["Corpse Tactics","corpse-tactics","Technique Key 1: Cooperative (one blow in four lands a quarter harder) · Offensive (9 damage more a blow) · Defensive (blows land 15% lighter on you while a corpse stands) · Guerilla (each blow knocks its foe back) · Mobility (your corpses move half again as fast)."],["Cursed Corpse Mutation","cursed-corpse-mutation","One corpse in twenty comes out mutated: half again as big, twice as mean, and with one more quirk: Quick (faster), Hardened (armored), Tough (2 health a level more) or Fierce (a die more)."],["Perfect Creations","perfect-creations","Your corpses outlast the fight: they stay an hour."],["Expert Maker","expert-maker","Every corpse costs a third less CE."],["Patchwork Salvage","patchwork-salvage","When a corpse falls, a third of its strength is grafted onto another of yours."],["Mutate Specialist","mutate-specialist","The first corpse you sew after each long rest always comes out mutated."]]},{"id":"e483","n":"Cursed Lotus","s":"A reactive ward: a blue lotus waits on your body, and the next wound detonates it into a shower of cutting petals.","c":"Creeps and Curses","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["Lotus Petal","lotus-petal","A single cutting petal along your look (18 blocks): 9 damage."],["Cursed Lotus","cursed-lotus","A blue lotus waits on your body: the next blow on you detonates it, 37 damage to everything within 3 blocks."],["Double Bloom","double-bloom","You can keep two lotuses waiting at once; only one bursts each 3 s."]]},{"id":"e008","n":"Cursed Speech","s":"Ten commanding words that bend whoever hears them, paid for in Cursed Energy and the speaker's own throat. The stronger you are than the listener, the harder the word lands.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Speak","speak","Speak the chosen word (Technique Key 1 picks it) at the foe you look at, within 24 blocks, paying its CE: Sleep (2), Return (1), Run Away (1), Blast Away (2), Plummet (2), Don't Move (2); from 3rd Get Twisted (3); from 6th Get Crushed (4); from 11th Explode (5); from 18th Die (10). Hold to pour up to 4 more CE: 11 damage more each."],["Resounding Voice","resounding-voice","Toggle. Your words cost 5 CE more and fall on every foe in a 21-block cone (with Megaphone, hold Variant for a 42-block line)."],["Interjection","interjection","Your bound word (Variant + Technique Key 1 binds the chosen one), spoken instantly at the foe you look at: once every 3 s."],["Maximum: The Last Word","maximum-the-last-word","The chosen word, spoken to every foe within 24 blocks at once, at no strain."],["Vocal Cords","vocal-cords","Every CE a word costs is taken from your throat too (60 at your level). It heals a point a second; when it can't pay, you can't speak. A honey bottle soothes it: a third of it back."],["Weight of the Word","weight-of-the-word","A word lands by how much stronger you are than who hears it (players: their level; creatures: their toughness). Each level they have over you strains your throat 20% more and shortens what the word holds; they recoil it on you, and at 5 levels over you the word chokes. Each level you have over them holds it longer."],["Interjection","interjection-2","The quick key speaks your bound word instantly, once every 3 s."],["Die","die","On a foe 10 levels under you, Die is death. 5 to 9 under, it kills a foe already low (half its health at 5, more as the gap grows) and otherwise hits for 166 damage. Closer than that, it's that hit and a heavy strain. Bosses never just die."],["The Last Word","the-last-word","Every 3 s you speak the chosen word, and every foe it chose falls under it, at no cost and no strain."],["Fighting Words","fighting-words","A foe that hears your word loses its nerve too: weakened for a minute."],["Hushed Word","hushed-word","Your Interjection is whispered into one ear: it strains your throat only half as much."],["Quick Tongue","quick-tongue","Your Interjection can be spoken twice every 3 s."],["Megaphone","megaphone","Hold Variant as you speak a Resounding word to focus it into a 42-block line instead of the cone."]]},{"id":"e009","n":"Cursed Spirit Manipulation","s":"An unlimited stored collection of the creatures you've beaten, a bounded active roster, sacrificial defense, Uzumaki and Womb Profusion.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Release Spirit","release-spirit","Call a stored spirit of the chosen kind, the very creature you beat, to fight beside you for ten minutes (CE by its grade; up to 5 at once; a boss answers only alone). It fights the way it always did. Technique Key 1 chooses the kind, strongest first (Variant goes back); the summons answer faster. Variant calls every spirit out back into your collection, free and unspent."],["Absorb","absorb","Swallow the hostile creature you look at (16 blocks) without killing it, if its grade is below 6: it resists with its will, and if it fails it becomes a black orb in your collection. A boss, whatever its grade, once it's beaten down to a tenth of its health. Never a player, a pet or a conjured creature. Variant turns absorbing on or off: on, whatever you kill becomes an orb you swallow (a boss's is hard to keep down: you're weakened a while); off, kills stay dead."],["Extracted Action","extracted-action","Use what Uzumaki pulled out of a spirit it spent, the chosen kind if it was among them, else the strongest. You hold one at a time, and it's gone once used. A shot or a fist, 40 damage; a blast, fire or venom, 26 damage with what it brings."],["Maximum: Uzumaki","maximum-uzumaki","Every active spirit spirals into one blast: a 15-block cone, 26 damage, plus 13 damage and 2.5 blocks for every spirit beyond the second. The spirits are spent, and one of their actions stays in your hand. With Variant, up to 10 stored spirits of the chosen kind are poured in as well, and they don't come back."],["Curse-Infused Spirits","curse-infused-spirits","Your energy runs through what you call: a spirit gets 50% more health, 5 more melee damage and 10% more speed."],["Sacrificial Defense","sacrificial-defense","Once every 3 s, a heavy blow on you is thrown onto your nearest spirit (CE by its grade): it lands softer by d20s by its grade (as % of your health), and the spirit is destroyed."],["Perfect Control","perfect-control","Your spirits keep closer, and switch to the foe you strike at once."],["Womb Profusion","womb-profusion","A Domain with no barrier, as its first user opened it: nothing is held in and there's nothing to break. A procession of curses engulfs every foe it chose that's still inside: 89 damage every 3 s, and a weak undead creature is swallowed into your collection outright. Inside, releasing spirits costs nothing."],["Defensive Summoning","defensive-summoning","With no spirit out, Sacrificial Defense calls one from your collection to take the blow (5 CE plus its grade; it's spent)."],["Minimum: Uzumaki","minimum-uzumaki","With fewer than two spirits out, the Maximum without Variant spends two stored spirits of the chosen kind instead: a small, seeking Uzumaki at the foe you look at, 13 damage per point of their grade (twice it, up to 20)."],["Uzumaki Versatility","uzumaki-versatility","A Minimum: Uzumaki with no foe in sight waits in your hand for up to a minute and fires itself at the first foe within 30 blocks."]]},{"id":"e259","n":"Cursed Transmutation","s":"Cursed Transmutation, Elemental Manipulation, Alchemy of the Soul and Cursed Energy Transmutation: reshape matter, elements and flesh itself.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Transmute","transmute","Reshape a 12-block cube of matter where you look (36 blocks) into the chosen form (Technique Key 1): a weapon, your weapon blows add 9 damage for a minute · fire, 20 damage to everything in it and the ground alight · water, everything in it swept back and slowed, and fire put out · stone, a wall that stands a minute; with Variant a bridge two wide from your feet the way you look, and looking straight down a pillar that lifts you."],["Alchemy of the Soul","alchemy-of-the-soul","Hold to pour CE into flesh, the ally's you look at within 4 blocks or your own: 7% of max health mended per 2 CE."],["Philosopher's Stone","philosophers-stone","With the feat. Panacea, once a long rest: a fragment ends poison, wither, weakness, slowness, blindness, hunger and bad omens on the ally you look at within 4 blocks, or on you. With Variant, Chrysopoeia, once a long rest: up to 8 iron or copper ingots in your hand become gold."],["Toxic Alchemy","toxic-alchemy","The foe you look at (18 blocks): 27 poison damage, and poisoned for a minute (a hardy foe may halve it and shrug off the poison)."],["Cursed Energy Transmutation","cursed-energy-transmutation","Hold to pour CE: a 36-block line of raw force along your look, 9 damage per 2 CE."],["Maximum: Transmutation Sphere","maximum-transmutation-sphere","A 12-block sphere where you look is unmade and remade: 53 force damage to everything in it, stunned 2 s."],["Mandala of Dependent Origination","mandala-of-dependent-origination","The whole Domain is transmuted at once in the chosen form, on every chosen foe: fire (41 damage), water (swept and slowed) or stone (27 damage and held 1.5 s)."],["Philosopher's Stone","philosophers-stone-2","Gain the Philosopher's Stone art: Panacea and Chrysopoeia, each once a long rest."],["Soul Alchemy","soul-alchemy","Alchemy of the Soul also mends the most hurt teammate within 9 blocks for half as much, and bonds your soul to whoever it mended for 10 minutes: once every 3 s, within 36 blocks, half of a heavy blow on them lands on you instead."]]},{"id":"e260","n":"Dark Claw","s":"Dark Claw, Adaptation, Eight-Handled Sword, Divine Adaptation and Zenith: Mahoraga's claw, Mahoraga's adaptation, Mahoraga's zenith.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Eight-Handled Sword","eight-handled-sword","Mahoraga's sword for a minute: Sword Arc sweeps it."],["Sword Arc","sword-arc","With the Eight-Handled Sword: a sweeping arc 6.0 blocks before you, 33 damage to every foe in it, half again to the undead (the Sword of Extermination), cutting leaves, plants and glass."],["Dark Claw","dark-claw","A great black claw for a minute: your weapon blows add 16 damage, and you have 4 armor more."],["Maximum: Zenith","maximum-zenith","A minute at the wheel's zenith: every blow you land is a critical, and you're adapted to everything at once."],["Adaptation","adaptation","The first blow of a kind of harm (a kind of creature, of shot, or of hazard) costs 1 CE to adapt to. Then that kind hurts you a quarter as much for a minute. Each player is a kind of their own."],["Divine Adaptation","divine-adaptation","Poison, wither, blindness, darkness, weakness or slowness that has been on you for 3 s is adapted to (3 CE): it ends, and can't take hold again for a minute. And once every 3 s a claw blow on a kind of foe you're adapted to adds 18 damage: the wheel has turned on it."],["Hall of the Five-Clawed Dragon","hall-of-the-five-clawed-dragon","Your claws stab through space at the healthiest chosen foe: a critical blow, 85 damage, distance ignored."],["Close Combat Specialist","close-combat-specialist","Once every 3 s, a claw blow at arm's length grips the foe: held 2.3 s, and torn again a second later (16 damage)."],["Wheel of Adaptation","wheel-of-adaptation","Each time you adapt, the teammate nearest you within 18 blocks takes 20% less from blows for a minute (2 CE)."],["Mahoraga's Fury","mahoragas-fury","At half health or less, once every 3 s a blow on you slams the claw into the ground (2 CE): claws erupt within 9.0 blocks, 27 damage."],["Perfect Adaptation","perfect-adaptation","Technique Key 1 (3 CE) discharges your newest adaptation: a 18-block cone of what you learned along your look, 9 damage for each adaptation you hold (5 at most)."]]},{"id":"e102","n":"Dark Dimension","s":"A swordsman's darkness: read every intent in the room, swallow what you read, and cut where the reading ends, until space itself stops being an obstacle.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Dark Cloaked Slash","dark-cloaked-slash","Toggle. Your weapon blows carry the darkness: +13 damage (1 CE, at most once a second)."],["Avidya Wild Slash","avidya-wild-slash","A sword stroke through everything within 4 blocks, above and below you too: your weapon's blow and 26 damage to each, and you end beside the last one cut (a step of up to 6 blocks). In Mana Zone it can be centred on the foe you look at."],["Mana Zone","mana-zone","A minute: a 36-block zone around you. You sense everything that moves in it (they're outlined, walls or not), your Dimension Slash reaches half the zone farther, and Avidya Wild Slash can strike around a foe you look at inside it."],["Dimension Slash","dimension-slash","A 72-block cut through space along your look, through walls: 93 damage to everything on it. A closed Domain's barrier it crosses takes its hardest blow, and conjured blocks on it are unmade."],["Black Moon","black-moon","With Mana Zone up: for 3 s, every hostile arrow, trident or fireball within 9 blocks is erased."],["Ki Read","ki-read","A minute: you read the room. Every foe within 24 blocks is outlined, walls or not, and 1 blow in 20 lands as a critical. Ki Savant (feat): with Variant, the foe you look at is read (what it's casting or holding, its cursed energy), and your next Black Hole on its shot within 3 s is free."],["Maximum: Dark Cloaked Dimension Sever","maximum-dark-cloaked-dimension-sever","A 180-block cut through space, 159 damage to everything on it. It splits the ground and walls it crosses. The Equinox also cuts open any Curtain or Barrier it crosses."],["Black Hole","black-hole","Once every 3 s (2 CE), the darkness swallows a hostile arrow, trident or fireball about to reach you (within 6 blocks)."],["Iai: Death Draw","iai-death-draw","In Mana Zone, once every 3 s (4 CE): whoever strikes you, or steps into your reach, is cut first: your weapon's blow and 53 damage."],["Captain's Black Moon","captains-black-moon","Mana Zone reaches 36 blocks, one Black Hole or Iai each 3 s is free, and a Dimension Slash on a foe inside the zone lands half again as hard 1 time in 10."],["The Dark Blade","the-dark-blade","With an empty hand the darkness is your sword: bare-handed blows hit like an iron sword."],["Ki Savant","ki-savant","Variant + Ki Read reads the foe you look at: what it's casting or holding and its cursed energy. Your next Black Hole on its shot within 3 s costs nothing."],["Dark Cloaked Blade","dark-cloaked-blade","Your weapon is cursed steel: its blows bite through armor, a quarter harder on an armored foe."],["Black Hole Mastery","black-hole-mastery","You catch rather than erase: what your Black Hole swallows is thrown back where you look, twice as fast, as your own shot (2 CE more)."],["Surpass Your Limits","surpass-your-limits","At 0 health, before you fall, everything left (5 CE or more) goes into one last Dimension Slash."]]},{"id":"e048","n":"Dark Moon Covenant","s":"Shards of cold moonlight, moon-brands that unravel a foe, a familiar that devours them, and an age of stars.","c":"Video Games","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Lunar Bolt","lunar-bolt","A shard of cold moonlight along your look (60 blocks): 36 damage and a Lunar Sigil on what it hits. Each sigil (up to 6) makes that foe's blows on you 5% softer and your bolts on it land harder."],["Ashen Familiar","ashen-familiar","A spectral wolf at your side for an hour (two from 11th): it fights what you fight, 18 damage a bite."],["Freezing Mist","freezing-mist","For a minute, a 4-block cloud of freezing mist where you look: every foe that lingers in it is branded and chilled each 3 s, and the water under it freezes."],["Dark Moon","dark-moon","A great dark moon along your look (18 blocks): 36 damage and a sigil on each foe it crosses. What it touches comes undone: a held ally is freed, someone else's conjured creature is unmade, and shots in its way stop, a Maximum's too, and a Domain barrier it meets is struck."],["Black Moon Transit","black-moon-transit","You and up to 6 teammates within 6 blocks step through the dark moon to where you look (up to 90 blocks)."],["Causal Severance","causal-severance","Cut one outside binding on the creature you look at (18 blocks): someone else's conjured creature is unmade; failing that, a held teammate is freed; failing that, a foe loses every boon it carries."],["Devour Memory","devour-memory","Your familiar savages the most-branded foe near it (2 blocks): 7 damage, and more for every sigil it eats."],["Snow Witch's Step","snow-witchs-step","The cold is yours: you never freeze."],["Moon Shards","moon-shards","Each blow Cold Moon Guard turns aside leaves a shard, up to 6: the next art of this technique costs 1 CE less and spends it. They keep."],["Moonlit Guidance","moonlit-guidance","Variant + Lunar Bolt casts it from your familiar instead, for 1 CE more."],["False Body","false-body","Once every 3 s, a heavy blow (4 CE) strikes a frost-doll instead: 24% of your health less of it lands, and you're 9 blocks away."],["Lunar Rupture","lunar-rupture","A sigiled foe that fails against your Freezing Mist is frozen in place for 3 s, spending the sigil."],["Moon of Weakness","moon-of-weakness","A foe bearing 2 sigils can't shrug off your mist."],["Spirit Court","spirit-court","You keep two familiars."],["Cold Cosmos","cold-cosmos","Your own cold, and any other, never hurts you."],["Cold Moon Guard","cold-moon-guard","Once every 3 s, a blow on you is turned aside by moonlight (2 CE): 12% of your health less of it lands."],["Age of Stars","age-of-stars","Dark Moon Passage: the moon crosses every chosen foe, a crushing cold blow (137 damage), two Lunar Sigils, and its strength stripped away (3 s)."],["Sigil Shatter","sigil-shatter","Technique Key 1 breaks every Lunar Sigil on the foe you look at: a burst of cold per sigil, and the cold sinks into its limbs (slowed and weakened)."],["Occult Moon","occult-moon","When Cold Moon Guard turns a blow aside, a Lunar Bolt answers the nearest foe (1 CE)."]]},{"id":"e174","n":"Death Makes Two","s":"Severe injury grows more spectral heads unless the wound is cauterized: more heads, more bites, more venom, more body to punish.","c":"Cryptids","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Hydra Strike","hydra-strike","Every head lunges at the foe you look at (4 blocks, 9 in the Lernaean Body): 13 damage a head, and venom. Hydra Venom: a foe already poisoned takes a die more."],["Maximum: Ninefold Lernaean Body","maximum-ninefold-lernaean-body","For a minute: nine heads, 13 damage a bite with a reach of 9 blocks, and you tower. A head regrown heals two dice (one if fire reached you). When it ends, the heads past your cap vanish."],["Two Grow Back","two-grow-back","You begin with two heads (up to 9). Once every 3 s, a heavy blow (a tenth of your health) that leaves you standing opens a Neck Wound (1 CE): at the next 3 s it grows a head and mends you a die plus your Constitution, unless fire reached you first. Each head bites the nearest foe within 3 blocks every 3 s and gives you 2 armor."],["Shed the Neck","shed-the-neck","Once every 3 s, a blow that would leave you under half health is taken by a head instead (1 CE): no harm, one head less, and its stump is a Neck Wound. From 11th, two Head Dice and 1 CE shed a second neck in the same 3 s."],["Two From One","two-from-one","A wound that regrows takes 2 CE more, if you have it, and grows two heads."],["Unkillable Neck","unkillable-neck","With four heads or more, a regrowth heals a die more, free."],["Swamp-Born","swamp-born","You swim swiftly and breathe water, and a wound opened in water can't be cauterized until it has rooted."],["Venom Reservoir","venom-reservoir","Your heads' venom is a leash: what they bite is slowed (not a strong foe), and they reach 3 blocks farther for the poisoned."],["Heracles Problem","heracles-problem","Each Neck Wound cauterized by fire mends you 10% of your health."],["Guarding Heads","guarding-heads","Once every 3 s, a head intercepts a blow on an ally within 2.5 blocks (1 CE, a Head Die): it lands a die plus your Constitution softer."]]},{"id":"e059","n":"Deep Purple","s":"An army, exhaled: smoke soldiers that fight, screen and grapple while the general hides somewhere in the fog.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Smoke, Obey","smoke-obey","Exhale 6 smoke soldiers where you look (12 blocks). Each strikes for 14 damage a second; one hit dissipates it, and it disperses after a minute."],["Dismiss the Ranks","dismiss-the-ranks","Let every soldier drift away."],["The Fog Itself","the-fog-itself","Once a long rest, for a minute: you are smoke. Nothing can touch you, and you fight only through your soldiers."],["The General Vanishes","the-general-vanishes","Dissolve and re-form beside the soldier nearest where you look (24 blocks)."],["Maximum: The Smoking Parade","maximum-the-smoking-parade","For a minute the whole army is out: 60 soldiers, and every 3 s each foe hemmed in by three of them takes 53 damage. You're exhausted after."],["Soldiers","soldiers","Up to 30 soldiers stand at once (five a level from 6th, at most 30)."],["Screen","screen","Once every 3 s, 1 CE: a soldier beside you steps in and takes the blow."],["Hands of Smoke","hands-of-smoke","Your soldiers grapple: their blows hold foes 1.5 s (a strong foe less), and once every 3 s a foe held by two or more is dragged 6 blocks toward you (never a boss)."],["The Barracks of Fog","the-barracks-of-fog","Nowhere to Stand: soldiers condense out of the fog round every chosen foe for 36 damage, and a soldier forms beside it. Every foe inside can't see while it stays inside, and your ranks may swell to 60 while the Barracks stands."],["Secondhand Lungs","secondhand-lungs","A soldier fitted as a breathing mask: while any soldier stands, you never run out of air, and poison doesn't take."],["False General","false-general","One soldier wears your face and gear, in plain sight: while any stand, creatures more than 6 blocks away lose track of you and go for it instead."],["Dead Drop","dead-drop","Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE): a soldier takes the stack in your hand to the player you look at (within 64 blocks), drifting there as smoke, and puts it in their pack (at their feet if it's full)."],["Fog of War","fog-of-war","Technique Key 1 (2 CE): your soldiers breathe out a 6-block cloud of heavy smoke where you look (12 blocks) for a minute; every foe inside is blinded."],["The Last Soldier","the-last-soldier","Once a long rest, when you'd fall, you dissolve instead and re-form beside your farthest soldier (within 60 blocks) at 1 health."]]},{"id":"e047","n":"Destined Death","s":"The rune of death: every clean blow brands a Fate Scar, and the scarred take more from you until they can't heal at all.","c":"Video Games","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Black Blade Wave","black-blade-wave","A black crescent flies along your look (8 blocks), through everything in its way: 18 damage and a Fate Scar on each."],["Bestial Sling","bestial-sling","A 6-block cone of flung stone: everything in it is scarred and knocked down for 2 s (a nimble foe dodges it)."],["Black Blade Spiral","black-blade-spiral","You whirl 6 blocks along your look: up to 6 foes you pass take 27 damage and a Fate Scar each."],["Stone of Gurranq","stone-of-gurranq","One foe you look at (27 blocks) is scarred and knocked down for 1 s (a strong will keeps its feet)."],["Final Black Blade","final-black-blade","Once a long rest, on a foe within 12 blocks bearing 5 scars: a foe 10 levels under you, or 5 to 9 under and already low (half its health at 5, more as the gap grows), player or creature but never a boss, it dies. Anything else, or a strong will, is stunned for 3 s."],["Black Blade Eclipse","black-blade-eclipse","For a minute every weapon blow brands a Fate Scar for nothing, but the healing you receive is halved."],["Maximum: Thousand Black Blades","maximum-thousand-black-blades","Every foe within 6 blocks is scarred twice and knocked down (a nimble foe takes one scar and keeps its feet)."],["Deathbrand","deathbrand","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow brands its foe with a Fate Scar (1 CE). Scars last a minute, and up to 5 stack. Each takes 10.0% of the foe's max health away while it lasts (never below 10% of it), and cuts its healing by a tenth, half at most. The bar comes back as the scars go; the health doesn't. You strike no harder."],["Beast Step","beast-step","A weapon blow on a scarred foe springs you 3 blocks back from it."],["Mortal Wound","mortal-wound","A foe with 3 scars or more can't heal past them: whatever would heal it clears a scar instead, Reverse Cursed Technique included."],["Death Denies Death","death-denies-death","A scarred foe saved from death (a totem, an art that cheats death) keeps a scar, and the minute starts over."],["True Destined Death","true-destined-death","Five scars, a tenth of the bar each, down to a tenth of it, and the Final Black Blade."],["Death in Motion","death-in-motion","You jump higher."],["Night of Destined Death","night-of-destined-death","Mortality Remembered: every chosen foe gains a Fate Scar and is slowed (3 s)."],["Beast's Agility","beasts-agility","The beast's stride ignores the floor: you run up walls."],["Rune-Eater","rune-eater","The dooms you brand linger: Fate Scars last two minutes instead of one."],["The Beast Collects","the-beast-collects","When you'd fall, 3 CE harvests every Fate Scar on the most-scarred foe within 12 blocks: you stand back up with 10% of your health per scar."]]},{"id":"e038","n":"Directive Arrows","s":"Write glowing arrows into the air, ride their instructions at impossible speed, and turn a carefully drawn route into one decisive strike.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Directive Inscription","directive-inscription","1 CE inks 6 arrows. Each cast hangs one where you look (24 blocks), and the one before it turns to point at it; hold Variant to point it along your look. Up to 18 hang at once, for a minute."],["Acceleration Sphere","acceleration-sphere","6 CE: you ride 6 legs around the foe you look at (12 blocks), striking it on each for 22 damage plus Vector Edge."],["Imposed Directive","imposed-directive","Toggle. Once every 3 s, a weapon blow spends 2 CE to drive the foe 8 blocks away from you; a wall in the way turns it into a collision (41 damage, stopped 1.5 s)."],["Acceleraise Boost","acceleraise-boost","The ally you look at (24 blocks) is faster for 3 s, and once in it, after riding at least one of your arrows, their weapon blow adds 11 damage per arrow ridden (up to 3)."],["Erase Route","erase-route","Clear your arrows and start a new chart. Inside your own Domain: ride a virtual arrow along your look instead."],["Maximum: Dominion of Borrowed Speed","maximum-dominion-of-borrowed-speed","For a minute, an 8-block field moves with you: foes in it are slowed and you gain their speed, and every 3 s 6 free arrows bloom around you."],["Arrowpath","arrowpath","Touching an arrow carries you 8 blocks along it, in any direction; passing through another chains into its heading. 6 rides for 3 s."],["Vector Edge","vector-edge","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow adds 11 damage for every arrow ridden in the last few seconds, up to 6."],["Quick Inscription","quick-inscription","A weapon blow drops a free arrow at your feet, pointing along your look (6 a 3 s)."],["Projectile Redirection","projectile-redirection","A hostile shot passing within 2 blocks of an arrow is bent along it and becomes yours (1 CE, spends the arrow)."],["Persistent Line","persistent-line","Once every 3 s, an arrow you ride stays."],["Routebreaker","routebreaker","After a chain of 3 or more arrows, a free strike on the foe nearest the end: 66 damage."],["Shared Route","shared-route","Your allies ride your arrows too, 6 a round each, with no Vector Edge of their own."],["Palace of the Predestined Road","palace-of-the-predestined-road","Every point is an arrow: your arrows never fade, rides are unlimited and the quick key rides along your look. Every chosen foe is driven down the road you drew, and breaks on what it hits (66 damage, held 1.5 s)."],["Rescue Vector","rescue-vector","Once every 3 s, 2 CE and the arrow: an ally struck within 3 blocks of one of your arrows is carried along it, and a melee blow on them misses."],["Double Bank","double-bank","A shot you've redirected bends a second time at another arrow in its line, for 1 CE more."],["Shared Vector Edge","shared-vector-edge","Once every 3 s, 1 CE: an ally's weapon blow after they ride your arrows adds 11 damage per arrow ridden (up to 6)."],["Snare Glyph","snare-glyph","Your first 6 arrows are snares too: a foe that steps into one is held 1.5 s (a strong one tears free)."]]},{"id":"e011","n":"Disaster Flames","s":"Reliable fire waves, planted volcanoes, explosive ember insects, and a conspicuous Maximum Meteor.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Flames of Disaster","flames-of-disaster","A 3-block cone of flame where you look: 13 damage (hotter at 11th and 17th), and it sets foes burning. Hold to keep the stream going, 1 CE a gout."],["Erupting Volcanoes","erupting-volcanoes","Plant a volcano on the ground where you look (up to 24 blocks) for a minute. Hold to plant more side by side, 2 CE each, up to 5; the oldest gives way to the newest."],["Ember Insects","ember-insects","A swarm of four ember insects for 15 s: they fly at your foes on their own, and each one bursts on what it reaches, 14 damage within 2.5 blocks, setting it alight (one swarm at a time)."],["Erupt","erupt","Every volcano erupts at once, each a 6-block line of magma toward where you look: 33 damage, and stuck in the magma for 1.5 s. The magma slows whoever stands in it until its volcano ends. Hold Variant as you call it: the nearest volcano within 6 blocks erupts under you instead and throws you high into the air (+2 CE)."],["Meteor","meteor","You're lifted 12 blocks while a meteor gathers over you; then you ride it down to where you look (within 24 blocks of where you rose): 113 damage to everything within 10 blocks of the impact. If you're paralyzed before it falls, it scatters."],["Pyrokinesis","pyrokinesis","Your own fire doesn't take: nothing sets you burning, and flames don't hurt you (lava still does)."],["Coffin of the Iron Mountain","coffin-of-the-iron-mountain","Black iron seals around each foe it chose as magma erupts within: 111 damage every 3 s, and it's entombed and blind for 1.5 s."],["Ashfall","ashfall","Flames of Disaster leaves choking ash where it burned: foes caught in the cone are blinded for 3 s."],["Pyrokinesis Refined","pyrokinesis-refined","Training finds more in the old flame: Flames of Disaster reaches half again as far, and your fire arts hit about a tenth harder."],["Hellscape","hellscape","Where Meteor lands, the ground within 20 blocks runs with fire for a minute: foes standing in it take 27 damage every second."]]},{"id":"e251","n":"Disaster Storms","s":"Storms of Disaster, Lightning, Storm Creation, Divine Storm Sovereign, and the Heavenly Throne: wind and lightning made into a calamity.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Lightning","lightning","A bolt at the foe you look at (36 blocks): 54 damage, and half that to another foe within 6 blocks of it. Inside one of your storms it strikes harder, and inside the Sovereign's storm it needs no sight of its foe: the one nearest where you look is struck."],["Storm Creation","storm-creation","A 6-block storm around you for a minute (hold to pour CE, 3 blocks more each, up to 5): foes in it wade, each 3 s they may be knocked down, and shots that fly into it lose half their speed."],["Storms of Disaster","storms-of-disaster","A 9-block cone of cutting wind: 45 damage (a nimble foe may halve it). Loose things in it are blown away."],["Maximum: Divine Storm Sovereign","maximum-divine-storm-sovereign","A 30-block storm where you look (up to 90 blocks) for a minute: foes in it can't see, wade, may be knocked down, and are cut by the wind each 3 s."],["Heavenly Throne","heavenly-throne","Every 3 s, lightning falls from the throne on every foe it chose: 79 damage."],["Aerokinesis","aerokinesis","Foes inside your storms are starved of air and fight weaker, and while a storm stands you feel every body that moves the air (hostiles nearby glow)."],["Flying Nimbus","flying-nimbus","Your Storm Creation carries you: while it's up you fly."],["Squall","squall","With you and the spot you look at both inside your storms, Storms of Disaster steps you there and bursts all around you."]]},{"id":"e012","n":"Disaster Tides","s":"Hydrokinesis with a 3rd-level Domain, a roster of sea shikigami, a defensive water ring, flooding, and a Maximum tsunami.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Tides of Disaster","tides-of-disaster","Tap: water thrown where you look (36 blocks): 36 damage. Hold a second, then release: a high-pressure lance 18 blocks long instead (+1 CE), 22 damage to everything on it, and a foe that can't take it (60%) is knocked down and takes it again."],["Death Swarm: Sperm Whale","death-swarm-sperm-whale","The largest of the drowned rushes the foe you look at, or the nearest: one strike, 100 damage, and it's gone (inside your Domain; anywhere from 11th). The others answer to Technique Key 1."],["Water Defensive Ring","water-defensive-ring","A ring of water around you for 2 minutes: shields 60% of your max health, taking blows first; while it holds, cold can't touch you and you take 15% less from everything. It rises by itself when a heavy blow comes in (8 CE, once every 30 s)."],["Flash Flood","flash-flood","The foe nearest where you look (within 18 blocks): 89 cold damage and swept about 24 blocks away. Hold Variant as you cast for the whole flood instead (+2 CE): 106 damage to everything within 6 blocks of a point 18 blocks away."],["Maximum: Tsunami","maximum-tsunami","The sea itself: a wall of water rises behind you and rolls the way you look for 4 s, 66 damage a second to everything it carries."],["Tide-born","tide-born","You breathe water and swim like you were born in it."],["Death Swarm","death-swarm","Technique Key 1 calls a sea shikigami (Variant + Key 1 picks which): Eel (2 CE, 20 damage), Piranhas (3 CE, 33 damage), River Serpent (4 CE, 41 damage), Killer Whale (6 CE, 62 damage). Each rushes the foe you look at or the nearest, strikes once and is gone. Up to 3 on their way at once; inside your Domain only, until 11th level."],["Horizon of Captivating Skandha","horizon-of-captivating-skandha","The spectral school engulfs every foe it chose: 89 damage every 3 s, held by the feeding current for 1.5 s. Two free openings a long rest, then 20 CE."],["Shoal","shoal","The school hunts in open water now: Death Swarm answers outside your Domain, before 11th level."],["Typhoon","typhoon","While your Water Defensive Ring holds, a storm churns 12 blocks around you: 7 damage to every foe in it every 2 s, and it's thrown back."]]},{"id":"e013","n":"Disaster Verdure","s":"A garden that keeps what it catches: binding plants, tearing roots, wooden balls, a flower field that lulls, buds that drink, and a wall of roots that rises by itself.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Binding Plants","binding-plants","Plants seize the foe you look at (within 6 blocks): held in place for 3 s (a creature for 6 s)."],["Piercing Roots","piercing-roots","Roots tear up along a 10-block line where you look: 26 damage to everything on it (more at 11th)."],["Root Bundle","root-bundle","Two wooden balls float at your shoulders for 10 minutes. Technique Key 1 launches them at the foe you look at (22 damage each); Variant + Technique Key 1 steps onto one: you fly slowly while you ride it."],["Flower Field","flower-field","A 6-block circle of flowers on a point within 24 blocks: everything in it loses the will to fight. A creature stands still and does nothing for a minute until something hits it; a player is held for 3 s. The petals keep lulling whatever wanders in for 6 s."],["Bouquet","bouquet","One bloom, hand-delivered: the foe you look at (within 12 blocks) is lulled as by Flower Field."],["Cursed Buds","cursed-buds","Buds (5) fly at foes within 6 blocks: each takes root and drinks 7 damage and 1 CE from a sorcerer every 2 s for a minute. Hold Variant as you cast to plant the bud tree instead (+2 CE): for a minute it fires a bud (14 damage) at every foe within 6 blocks of it every 2 s."],["Stranglehold","stranglehold","Every foe carrying your buds within 12 blocks is constricted: held for a second."],["Wall of Roots","wall-of-roots","Toggle. While on, when a blow is about to land, a wall of roots rises between you and it (1 CE, every 3 s): the blow is stopped."],["Forests of Disaster","forests-of-disaster","The plants answer you: standing on grass or leaves, you mend faster."],["Ceremonial Sea of Light","ceremonial-sea-of-light","Every 3 s every chosen foe takes 9 damage and falls under Flower Field; you drink half of what it took as CE."],["Sapping Roots","sapping-roots","Striking a foe that carries your buds draws 1 CE back to you (once a second)."]]},{"id":"e252","n":"Disaster Vermin","s":"Vermin of Disaster, Earthen Insect Trance, Almighty Swarm, Parthenogenesis and the Brood Cathedral: a living swarm of horrors.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Vermin of Disaster","vermin-of-disaster","An insect swarm boils out beside you and hunts for 10 minutes: 14 damage a bite each 3 s (one swarm at a time; 6 from 3rd). Kill its insects and it's gone."],["Earthen Insect Trance","earthen-insect-trance","A pouch shikigami crawls out for 10 minutes (up to 2): a heavy beetle, 27 damage a bite each 3 s."],["Parthenogenesis","parthenogenesis","8 CE, 1 less for every creature your vermin have devoured in the last 480 s: an egg where you look (18 blocks) hatches a swarm every 3 s for a minute, and waits 600 s in all. Die while it waits, once a long rest, and it births you again where it stands, at half your health."],["Maximum: Almighty Swarm","maximum-almighty-swarm","Every swarm you can hold boils out at once, and the whole cloud falls on the foe you look at: 53 damage from each swarm."],["Brood Cathedral","brood-cathedral","The walls hatch: every chosen foe is swarmed (53 damage) and poisoned. Whatever you kill while it stands is devoured and rises as a swarm past your limit."],["Reinforced Vermin","reinforced-vermin","When you can spare 2 CE, your swarms come out hardened: larger insects, 27 damage a bite."],["Vermin Bulwark","vermin-bulwark","Once every 3 s, a swarm within 3 blocks of you or an ally throws itself in front of a blow: it's spent, and the blow never lands."],["Festering Life Sword","festering-life-sword","While a swarm hunts for you, your weapon festers: its hits poison, and once every 3 s add 9 damage."],["Vermin Techniques","vermin-techniques","With a swarm at your side, blows land 10% lighter on you, and the Almighty Swarm drags its prey toward you and holds it 3 s. Variant + Vermin of Disaster (4 CE more) carries you to the swarm nearest your look instead."]]},{"id":"e014","n":"Divergent Fist","s":"Delayed impact and a disciplined martial package that eventually guarantees Black Flash under strict conditions.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Manji Kick","manji-kick","Martial Prowess: a rising kick at the foe you look at (4 blocks): 18 damage plus half your weapon. A foe that can't take it takes double and is stunned for 1.5 s."],["One-Two","one-two","Martial Prowess: two punches at the foe you look at: a jab (7 damage), then a cross with triple weight (20 damage plus your weapon)."],["Stance of the Sparks","stance-of-the-sparks","Toggle a stance: you swing far slower, but every weapon blow is a critical, and may become a Black Flash."],["Divergent Flow","divergent-flow","Toggle. While on, a weapon blow pays 1 CE and lands again a second later as cursed force: the same damage, through armor (once a second per foe; two foes a second)."],["Maximum: Soul Punch","maximum-soul-punch","For 6 s, your weapon blows strike the soul: through all armor, and each one saps the foe's strength for a minute (down to half)."],["Divergent Flow","divergent-flow-2","Every blow lands twice: once by the body, once by the energy arriving late."],["Weave","weave","Tap sneak just as a blow comes in: you read it in the shoulder and are gone (a dodge, every 4 s). One Martial Prowess move every 3 s."],["Controlled Divergent Flow","controlled-divergent-flow","The echo can follow two different foes a second. A foe the echo lands on is open for 2 s: your blows on it are critical 15% more often."],["Chosen by the Sparks","chosen-by-the-sparks","Every critical weapon blow is a Black Flash."],["Black Belt","black-belt","Your Martial Prowess moves come twice as often, and the Manji Kick becomes a flying drop kick that throws its foe 6 blocks."]]},{"id":"e261","n":"Dragon Vein","s":"Your technique forms an unbreakable connection between you and the earth while your feet touch the ground.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Ley Line Command","ley-line-command","On the ground: draw on the earth for a minute. Every blow you take is 8 damage lighter, and a heavy one is braced against (1 CE: half of it). You can't be held, slowed or frozen. It lapses while your feet are off the ground."],["Ground Control","ground-control","Stomp, and the ground within 18 blocks answers in the way Technique Key 1 picks. Heave: every foe on it is thrown off its feet (held 1 s). Mire: every foe on it is slowed for 6 s. Rampart: a real wall of earth, 7 wide and 2 high, stands up before you for 10 s. Wave: the foe you look at on the ground is carried about 12 blocks the way you look unless it resists, or an ally you look at is, willingly."],["Maximum: Dragon Pulse","maximum-dragon-pulse","Stomp the world: every foe within 36 blocks on the ground, or hanging high above it, takes 111 damage, knocked down and blinded 2 s (some keep their feet: half, no stun). The earth guards you for each one that falls."],["Flow of the Dragon","flow-of-the-dragon","Feet on the ground: your melee blows add 4 damage (up to three times a second) and nothing knocks you back."],["Earth Dragon Soul","earth-dragon-soul","While the Ley Line holds, a melee blow draws 27 damage more from the earth once a second. Stand still for a second first and it can do so twice, but the earth then holds you in place for a second."],["World Anchor","world-anchor","On the ground, every few seconds the earth guards you against the next 15 damage of harm (replaced, not stacked). Below half health with the Ley Line up: 3 CE for half damage from everything for 6 s."],["Of Primordial World","of-primordial-world","The ground is the only law: anything inside that flies more than 3 blocks above the ground is crushed down into it for 55 damage (once a second). You are always under the Ley Line here."],["Ley Line Extension","ley-line-extension","While your Ley Line holds, up to 5 teammates within 18 blocks share it: 20% less from blows while their feet touch the ground."]]},{"id":"e054","n":"Dragonheart Incarnation","s":"Eat the heart, inherit the dragon: claws, scales and lineage breath in installments, until the debt comes due and the human outline goes.","c":"Video Games","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Dragonclaw","dragonclaw","A dragon's claw rakes the foe you look at (3 blocks; 5 as a dragon): 16 damage (25 damage as a dragon)."],["Dragon Breath","dragon-breath","Your lineage's breath down a 18-block cone: 45 damage (a nimble or strong foe takes half), and the world takes it too. Greater Breath: with Variant, a 27-block line instead. As a dragon: 71 damage, free every 6 s, and each 3 s it may come back sooner. Primeval Breath: as a dragon with your breath come back, Variant spends 5 CE more on a 36-block cone of 107 damage, and it costs you 18 damage."],["Dragon Roar","dragon-roar","A dragon's roar: foes within 4.5 blocks are frightened for 3 s. One that shrugs it off is safe from it for a day."],["Dragon Wings","dragon-wings","For a minute charcoal wings spread from your back and you fly."],["Dragonstorm","dragonstorm","A storm of your lineage on everything within 9 blocks of you: 62 damage and its affliction."],["Communion Bite","communion-bite","A dragon's maw closes on the foe you look at (3 blocks): 45 damage, and it's knocked down 2 s (a strong foe keeps its feet)."],["Heartfire Surge","heartfire-surge","For 3 s your blows burn with your lineage, 9 damage more and its affliction, and you move faster."],["Maximum: True Dragon","maximum-true-dragon","For up to ten minutes you become a dragon: your body swells, you fly, your scales thicken, your claws rake twice as hard, nothing knocks you back, and Heartfire Surge and Dragon Breath come free. Cast again to take back your human shape."],["Gravel Scales","gravel-scales","Dragon scales harden your skin: 6 more armor."],["Draconic Senses","draconic-senses","You see in the dark."],["Draconic Lineage","draconic-lineage","Technique Key 1 picks your lineage: Flame, Ancient Lightning, Glintstone Frost, Magma or Scarlet."],["Dragon Hearts","dragon-hearts","Each kind of dragon you slay brings your lineage's steps (Greater Breath, Lineage Ascension) one level sooner, up to 5. Hearts taken: 0."],["Tail or Horn","tail-or-horn","Variant + Technique Key 1 chooses, once after each long rest. Tail: a foe that strikes you is swept back. Horn: a Dragonclaw after a 6-block straight run knocks the foe down and throws it 3 blocks. Now: Tail."],["Greater Scales","greater-scales","Your scales thicken further, and weapon blows on you land a tenth lighter."],["Lineage Ascension","lineage-ascension","Your breath also carries the affliction of the lineage you held before this one."],["Dragon Fear","dragon-fear","As a True Dragon, a foe that first comes within 9 blocks of you is frightened (a strong will shrugs it off)."],["Beyond Time","beyond-time","Once a transformation, Variant + Dragonclaw vanishes into a rift and comes out beside the foe you look at, up to 90 blocks away, with a claw that can't miss."],["Elder Heart","elder-heart","As a True Dragon, your own lineage's harm can't touch you."],["Winged Predator","winged-predator","A weapon blow landed while diving down knocks the foe flat (a strong one keeps its feet) and you rebound safely (once a 3 s)."],["Dragon Communion Savant","dragon-communion-savant","For 1 CE more, your breath also carries the lineage you held before those two."],["Scale Shelter","scale-shelter","Your scales spread over an ally within 1.5 blocks: they take less harm."],["Dragonlord's Echo","dragonlords-echo","Dragonstorm breaks where you look, up to 27 blocks away."]]},{"id":"e130","n":"Dreadhorde","s":"Keep the dead as an account: raise zombies from the graveyard, sell the fallen twice, and spend everything on a single Dreadhorde army.","c":"Magic: The Gathering","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Raise Dead","raise-dead","A zombie rises from the ground you stand on (a drowned from water, a husk from sand). From a Corpse card it lasts 10 minutes and strikes for 25 damage; with no cards, a feeble one for a minute. Up to 12 at once."],["Mass Reanimation","mass-reanimation","Up to 6 zombies at once (Corpse cards make them stronger)."],["Raise Wight","raise-wight","1 Corpse card: an elite Wight rises, twice a zombie's health, striking for 34 damage. It lasts 10 minutes. Wights take no place under your cap."],["Dark Bargain","dark-bargain","Sacrifice your nearest undead: 1 CE back, or below half health, some life instead. Its corpse bursts for 18 damage on foes beside it."],["Maximum: Rise of the Dreadhorde","maximum-rise-of-the-dreadhorde","Every Corpse card becomes one great Army for a minute: its blow is 33 damage for every 3 cards spent (up to 4 times; at least once)."],["Graveyard","graveyard","Every foe you kill adds a Corpse card (up to 32)."],["Death's Majesty","deaths-majesty","Your undead hit harder."],["Diabolic Tutor","diabolic-tutor","Technique Key 1: 2 Corpse cards for 4 CE, once every 5 minutes."],["Contract of Four Demons","contract-of-four-demons","Variant + Technique Key 1 chooses a pact until your next long rest (a few seconds to settle on it): the Legion's, 2 more undead; the Wound's, your dead hit a foe under half health a fifth harder; the Feast's, the Bargain heals 4d8; the Iron's, your dead's blows pierce armor."],["Death Cannot Hold Me","death-cannot-hold-me","Once a long rest, 4 Corpse cards keep you at 1 health when you'd die."],["The Chain Veil","the-chain-veil","Each pulse, every chosen foe within 2 blocks of one of your undead takes 66 damage, and the grave recruits at the scene: a 1-health zombie of yours rises beside each one struck, until the next pulse."],["Gravecrawler","gravecrawler","The first undead you raise after taking this is your Gravecrawler: the first time it falls (not sacrificed), it drags itself up where it fell with 1 health."],["Liliana's Triumph","lilianas-triumph","When one of your undead falls (not sacrificed), its final moment adds a Corpse card."]]},{"id":"e262","n":"Earth Manipulation","s":"The ground answers: cubes that block and throw, a wall to shove into foes, a blast that knocks everything down, and the giant's stone arms.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Excavation","excavation","Hold to pour: a row of stone cubes (one per CE, up to 7) rises where you look, within 18 blocks. They stop shots, foes can't pass, anything standing there is thrown up, and they crumble after 30 s."],["Rock Blast","rock-blast","A rock torn from the ground and thrown at the foe you look at (18 blocks): 20 damage."],["Earthen Armor","earthen-armor","Hold to pour up to 6 CE: earth worn for a minute, 2 armor for each."],["Tremor","tremor","The ground bursts around you: everything within 9 blocks takes 55 damage (more at 6th, 11th and 18th) and is knocked down."],["Wall of Stone","wall-of-stone","A wall 6 wide and 4 high stands where you look, within 36 blocks, for a minute. Technique Key 1 (1 CE) shoves it 10 blocks the way you face, ramming foes for 22 damage."],["Rock Burst","rock-burst","(Feat: Rock Burst) The stone nearest you explodes: 22 damage to everything within 3 blocks of it."],["Shove Wall","shove-wall","Your newest wall is shoved 10 blocks the way you face, ramming every foe in its path for 22 damage and carrying it along."],["Maximum: Stone Arms","maximum-stone-arms","The giant's arms rise and close on the foe you look at (24 blocks): 66 damage, and it's held. Every 3 s after, 1 CE crushes it for 26 damage; it lets go when you can't pay, after 12 s, or when you cast it again."],["Trichiliocosm","trichiliocosm","A world of stone: every foe it chose takes 79 damage every 3 s, and is held in stone for 1.5 s."],["Density Manipulation","density-manipulation","Your stone is denser: it lasts twice as long, and a foe it throws is held a moment as it lands."],["Rock Burst","rock-burst-2","The quick key detonates the stone nearest you (see Rock Burst)."],["Arms of the Giant","arms-of-the-giant","While the giant's arms hold a foe, blows land on you 20% softer."]]},{"id":"e190","n":"Earth-Spider Loom","s":"String cursed Anchor Threads between surfaces: movement through the network is taxed and can trigger pulls, restraints and geometric traps.","c":"Mythology","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Anchor Thread","anchor-thread","A thread from you to the surface you look at (18 blocks) for a minute (up to 6): foes that cross it are cut (9 damage), slowed, and caught fast 1.5 s unless they slip it."],["Loom Trap","loom-trap","With three threads strung: their far anchors close into a triangle for a minute. Each foe that sets foot in it is bound 3 s unless it slips the silk, once each."],["Draw Taut","draw-taut","Every thread snaps taut: each foe touching one is yanked to its middle, cut for 18 damage and caught 2.5 s. With Variant, no snap: you ride the thread you touch to its far end."],["Ceiling Hunter","ceiling-hunter","You climb walls (sneak to cling) and hang from a ceiling while sneaking. Variant + Draw Taut rides the thread you're touching to its far end."],["Buried Spider","buried-spider","Once every 3 s, your weapon blow on a held foe spends your oldest thread: 18 damage more, and it's dragged 6 blocks to you."],["Castle Under Eightfold Silk","castle-under-eightfold-silk","Silk fills the castle: every chosen foe is wrapped fast (held 1.5 s, 27 damage)."],["Silk Architect","silk-architect","Variant + Anchor Thread ties the thread to the ally you look at (18 blocks): it moves with them, and you're told how far and which way they are."],["Tremor Reader","tremor-reader","Within a block of one of your threads, you hear through the web: a mote shows over every creature near you."],["Spider Drop","spider-drop","Once every 3 s, a blow landed while dropping onto a foe pins it 3 s (a strong one may tear free)."],["Eightfold Knot","eightfold-knot","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): collapse your newest thread and re-string it centred where you look (6 blocks)."]]},{"id":"e263","n":"Eight Heads","s":"Eight lives, serpent-fang shikigami, and a sacrificial barrier that feeds the slain back into your life bank.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Fangs of Orochi","fangs-of-orochi","Hold to pour up to 8 CE: one serpent fang per CE rises beside you and strikes for 10 minutes, 14 damage each 3 s."],["Maximum: Sacrifice","maximum-sacrifice","With 3 or more fangs out: they coil around the foe you look at (24 blocks) and bury themselves, and are spent. A trigram cylinder of real bone, three high, stands round it for two rounds and one more for each fang past three (five at most); it's held and its shots and arts shut off for 3 s, and while it stays inside the ring it takes 46 damage every 3 s. If it dies in there, one spent life comes back to you (once a long rest)."],["Eight Lives","eight-lives","When you'd die, 1 CE brings you back at half your health, cleansed (8 times a long rest)."],["Yamata no Orochi","yamata-no-orochi","The eight-headed serpent forms from the earth and bites: every chosen foe takes 89 damage."],["Snake Scales","snake-scales","Once every 3 s, a blow that lands while you're poisoned, slowed, held, withered or frozen sloughs your outer scales (2 CE) and every such ailment with them."],["Fang Versatility","fang-versatility","Technique Key 1 flings one of your fangs at the foe nearest where you look: 20 damage and poison, and it's spent."],["Blessing of the Hydra","blessing-of-the-hydra","When Eight Lives brings you back, whatever felled you hurts you 30% less for 10 minutes."]]},{"id":"e244","n":"Elder Futhark","s":"Carve the old alphabet in cursed energy: thorn, ice, torch, journey, ward, birch, and at the end, the Norns' own hand.","c":"Original","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Carve a Rune","carve-a-rune","Carve the chosen rune (Technique Key 1 picks), on the foe you look at (18.0 blocks), on you, or on the block you look at: Kenaz, fire: 26 damage and burning, or a block kindled (1 CE) · Thurisaz, thorns: 40 damage and bleeding for 3 rounds (2) · Isa, ice: 26 damage, frozen and pinned 3 s, or water frozen (2) · Raidho, a swift journey for a minute (1) · Algiz, a ward on you of 79 damage (2) · Berkano, birch-healing, or plants grown (2) · Hagalaz, hail 9 blocks around where you look: 53 damage, and glass and ice crack (4) · Sowilo, a sun-ray: 53 damage to everything along it, blinded unless it resists (4) · Tiwaz, Tyr's spear: 79 damage and its armor opened for 2 rounds (6) · Wyrd, any rune at all (3). The rest of the alphabet, on you or on the ally you look at: Fehu, up to 6 of your CE given to an ally (2) · Uruz, a minute of strength: a melee blow once every 3 s adds 13 damage (2) · Ansuz, a word of prohibition on a foe: it can't answer blows or strike true for 3 s, and a sorcerer can't cast (6) · Gebo, a gift of temporary health (1) · Wunjo, fear lifted (1) · Nauthiz, need: a foe is starved and slowed, and a sorcerer loses 6 CE (4) · Jera, harvest: strike within 3 s and be healed (2) · Eihwaz, a minute of yew: once every 3 s the kind of harm that strikes you is learned and halved (4) · Perthro, a minute of lots: once every 3 s a heavy blow on you is cast again, and half the time misses (6) · Ehwaz, a horse's bound forward (1) · Mannaz, a bond with an ally: each knows where the other is for 10 minutes (1) · Laguz, a current where you look: foes within 6 blocks are swept the way you face (2) · Ingwaz, a seed: part of the next blow on you is kept and rides your next melee blow (4) · Dagaz, daybreak: blindness, poison, weakness, slowness and holds ended, and healing (6) · Othala, a homeland 9 blocks round where you stand for a minute: you and allies in it take a fifth less, foes are slowed (6). Kenaz carved on nothing is a torch: every creature within 18 blocks is shown. Variant + Technique Key 1 steps a whole aett.."],["Bindrune","bindrune","Carve the chosen rune and the next one as a single sign: both their costs, plus 1."],["Wyrd Written Before Birth","wyrd-written-before-birth","Every rune you carve costs 2 CE less inside, never under 1. The Norns carve a rune on every chosen foe, whatever was always written: thorn (40 damage and bleeding), ice (26 damage and pinned 1.5 s) or hail (53 damage)."],["Aett-Binder","aett-binder","A Bindrune of two runes from the same aett costs no extra CE."]]},{"id":"e126","n":"Emerald Will","s":"Constructs of will, flight and shield, complex constructs, willpower, the Mecha Construct, the Emerald Colossus and Sector 2814.","c":"DC","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Emerald Construct","emerald-construct","1 CE and 1 Charge: a construct of will flies where you look, 30 blocks, 18 damage."],["Flight","flight","1 CE and 1 Charge: ten minutes of flight."],["Complex Construct","complex-construct","1 CE and 2 Charge, where you look (30 blocks), chosen with Technique Key 1: a giant hand (36 damage, and held for 3 s) · a cage (held for 9 s) · a wall of will (stops foes and shots for a minute)."],["Ring Scan","ring-scan","The living things within 48 blocks, counted, and the nearest named with their health. With Variant (2 Charge), each player also shows their technique and CE."],["Mecha Construct","mecha-construct","5 Charge, a minute: construct armor. +10 armor, flight, and your constructs hit 22 damage harder."],["Maximum: Emerald Colossus","maximum-emerald-colossus","10 Charge, 9 s: a towering construct fights beside you. Every second it slams the foe nearest where you look, 66 damage within 6 blocks."],["Power Ring","power-ring","Ring charge (20) comes back 1 every 10 s, and in full on a long rest."],["Shield of Will","shield-of-will","Once every 3 s (1 CE and 1 Charge), a blow is caught on a construct shield: it lands softer by 22% of your health, and you gain 1 Will (up to 10)."],["Willpower","willpower","With Will, each construct spends 1 for 11 damage more."],["No Evil Shall Escape","no-evil-shall-escape","While holding 3+ Will, the first construct each 3 s costs 1 less Charge."],["Sector 2814","sector-2814","Every 3 s a construct acts on its own, in turn: a blast on every foe it chose (89 damage), or a giant hand that holds them until the next."],["Ring Slinging","ring-slinging","Emerald Construct launches from a point near where you look (within 15 blocks), not from you."],["Emergency Protocol","emergency-protocol","Once a long rest, a blow that would kill you makes the ring flare on instinct (2 CE): you stand at half a heart and mend 6% of your health, plus 1% per Will."]]},{"id":"e540","n":"Empathic Sorcery","s":"Empathic sense, the raven soul-self, empathic bolts, shared pain, Azarath ascendant and the Daughter of Trigon.","c":"DC","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Empathic Bolt","empathic-bolt","A bolt of someone's pain, 22 damage (44 damage as the Daughter of Trigon). Hold it a second to pour 2 CE more for 9 damage more."],["Soul-Self","soul-self","For 10 minutes your soul-self, a raven of shadow, flies beside you (36 blocks). It strikes a foe near you once a 3 s for 22 damage."],["Maximum: Daughter of Trigon","maximum-daughter-of-trigon","Stop filtering, for a minute: you fly, blows on you land at half, your bolts hit harder, your bare fists hit 44 damage, and foes within 18 blocks are afraid (they hit 25% softer). Taking the form, a weak will lets Trigon steer: you strike the nearest creature within 6 blocks, friend or foe. Once a 3 s, Technique Key 1 is a hellfire wave, 66 damage within 9 blocks, and the ground there catches fire."],["Empathic Sense","empathic-sense","You feel every creature within 16 blocks: a mote shows over each, to you alone."],["Shared Pain","shared-pain","Once every 3 s (2 CE), a creature that hurts you takes half of it back; or, when one hits an ally within 9 blocks, you take the blow in their place and the attacker takes half of it back."],["Azarath Ascendant","azarath-ascendant","Your arts cost 1 CE less, and your soul-self ranges 90 blocks. Outside the Daughter of Trigon, Technique Key 1 is White Raven (1 CE, a minute): your empathic arts deal 9 damage more, and nothing frightens you."],["Trigon's Bargain","trigons-bargain","Once every 3 s, one of your arts costing 2 CE or more takes its price in pain instead: 2 CE less, paid in health (never below a quarter)."],["Still Point","still-point","Variant + Technique Key 1 (2 CE): for a minute creatures past 6 blocks or out of sight lose you, and nothing sees you glow through walls."],["Grief Eater","grief-eater","Once every 3 s (2 CE), a blow that would kill an ally within 18 blocks leaves them at 1 health, and you take 22 damage that nothing reduces (never below 1)."],["Nevermore","nevermore","Projecting your soul-self unfurls the dread: foes within 9 blocks hit 20% softer for a minute (a strong will holds)."]]},{"id":"e510","n":"Emperor's Chains","s":"Five chains: a jailer, a judge, a dowser, a healer and the scarlet-eyed emperor. Chain Jail binds the sworn kind absolutely, and every 3 s of Emperor Time burns an hour of your life.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Swear the Vow","swear-the-vow","Name your sworn group, once per character, for good: the kind of creature you look at, or a player's team (that one player if they have none)."],["Chain Jail","chain-jail","The middle chain lashes your sworn foe where you look (36 blocks): held 3 s and its output sealed (its shots and arts shut off, and a sorcerer's CE can't refill) for 9 s. The vow narrows the chain: it never closes on anyone else."],["Dowsing Chain","dowsing-chain","Attune to the creature or player you look at: until a long rest you know how far it is and which way, within 1600 blocks (your sworn group at any distance in the same world)."],["Holy Chain","holy-chain","The thumb mends the ally you look at (4.5 blocks), or you: up to 5 CE, 10% of their health per CE (15% in Emperor Time)."],["Steal Chain","steal-chain","The syringe tip, 9 blocks. A sorcerer's CE is sealed for 3 s and one use of their technique's first art is yours: Variant + Technique Key 1 casts it once, at its own cost (while you hold it, Emperor Time can't be cooled). Anything else: its strength drains for 3 s, and the stolen aura comes back to you (3 CE, once every 3 s)."],["Judgment Chain","judgment-chain","Stake a foe within reach (4.5 blocks) with a rule: \"do not strike me\" (with Variant: \"use no technique\": a player spending CE or a creature loosing a shot breaks it). If the rule falls, so does the stake: a foe 10 levels under you, or 5 to 9 under and already low (half its health at 5, more as the gap grows), player or creature but never a boss, dies; anything else is torn for a tenth of its health."],["Emperor Time","emperor-time","Scarlet eyes: the chains at full power and your hands faster, but every 3 s burns an hour of your life. Press again to cool them."],["The Unappealable Sentence","the-unappealable-sentence","Burn 12 hours: your sworn foe where you look (36 blocks) is held and judged, its output sealed for a minute."],["Binding Vow of the Designated","binding-vow-of-the-designated","Chain Jail, its snares and the Sentence close only on your sworn group. The same stake rests in your heart."],["Lifespan Ledger","lifespan-ledger","Every 24 hours burned by Emperor Time lowers your max health for good."],["Twin Fetters","twin-fetters","Chain Jail reaches 36 blocks and also binds a second of your sworn kind near the first (2 CE)."],["Post-Mortem Protocol","post-mortem-protocol","Once a long rest, falling leaves you standing for a minute in free Emperor Time."],["The Scarlet Courtroom","the-scarlet-courtroom","The vow executed perfectly: at each pulse your sworn group is jailed in full and staked (\"do not strike me\") and takes 66 damage; anyone else the chains pass through like smoke, lashing for 44 damage."],["The Snare Left Behind","the-snare-left-behind","Technique Key 1 (2 CE) lays a loop of Chain Jail where you look: the first of your sworn group to step in is bound in full. Up to three."],["Borrowed Hours","borrowed-hours","In Emperor Time, once every 10 s an affliction on you is thrown off at once (2 CE and six more hours of life)."],["The Thumb's Diagnosis","the-thumbs-diagnosis","Variant + Holy Chain reads the creature you look at instead of mending: its health, what afflicts it, and its technique if it has one."]]},{"id":"e169","n":"Empty Herd","s":"Open feeding wounds and drain blood. Every feeding drives an automatic metamorphosis: gaunt predator, fed hunter, swollen apex.","c":"Cryptids","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Feed","feed","Drain the foe you touch (2.5 blocks), once every 3 s a creature: 18 damage, and you heal half of it; a wounded foe gives 27 damage and its wound closes. A sorcerer also loses 3 CE. Every feeding advances your body. Pounce: after running 12 blocks, a blow on a wounded foe makes your next Feed free."],["Goat-Sucker Leap","goat-sucker-leap","You pounce onto the foe you look at (6 blocks) and Feed."],["Maximum: Night of the Empty Pens","maximum-night-of-the-empty-pens","For a minute you sense every living thing within 36 blocks, run 30% faster and climb freely, and every blow opens a wound. Feed reaches 9 blocks on a spectral tether, the first each 3 s is free, and each feeding counts twice and heals 7 damage more. When the night ends you're Gaunt again."],["Feeding Wound","feeding-wound","Once every 3 s (1 CE), a weapon blow opens a wound (up to 11 at once): it bleeds 7 damage every 3 s for a minute."],["Metamorphosis","metamorphosis","Gaunt (0–1 feedings): blows on an unhurt foe add 7 damage. Fed (2–3): 20% faster, and Feed heals all of it. Swollen Apex (4+): every blow adds 7 damage, but you're 15% slower. Gaunt in the dark, creatures lose you past 8 blocks. A long rest with no feeding since the last resets it."],["Night Scent","night-scent","Every wounded creature within 180 blocks shows to you alone, through walls."],["Empty the Pen","empty-the-pen","Once every 3 s, a wounded sorcerer within 18 blocks who spends 3 CE or more at once is fed on where it stands. One fed on at 0 CE gets none back for a 3 s."],["Purging Molt","purging-molt","Technique Key 1: regress one stage to slough tainted flesh; poison, withering, nausea, weakness and slowness fall away."],["Spraying Wound","spraying-wound","Once every 3 s, a critical blow sprays: a second foe beside the target gains a Feeding Wound, free."],["Packless Hunter","packless-hunter","With no ally within 9 blocks, once every 3 s your blow on a wounded foe drives it from the herd: it reels away frightened and hits 30% softer 3 s (a strong will may hold)."],["Livestock Sense","livestock-sense","The creature you look at within 18 blocks: you smell whether it carries CE and whether it's below half health."]]},{"id":"e264","n":"Esoteric Art","s":"Cursed paintings that swallow creatures into painted subspaces stocked with ink shikigami, structures and traps.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Impasto Canvas","impasto-canvas","Place the chosen effect (Technique Key 1) where you look, inside your painting: Ink Wolves (up to 5, real wolves that fight for you, 9 damage a bite) · Difficult Ground (foes wade through 4.5 blocks of it) · a Structure (a real ink wall for 10 minutes; with Variant a bridge of ink two wide, 12 blocks from your feet the way you look) · a Pit Trap (held 3 s and 14 damage when stepped on, and the soft ground under it opens into a real pit; with Variant, 3 CE more, a Rolling Stone trap: a boulder of ink rolls 18 blocks the way you looked, 44 damage to each foe in its path, knocked down) · an Ink Crow (2 CE more, up to 2, 14 damage a peck) · the Ink Wave (1 CE more, a 18-block cone, 20 damage and shoved back)."],["Giant Ink Shikigami","giant-ink-shikigami","With Air Brush: a painting opens beside the foe you look at (18 blocks) and a great ink beast strikes out of it, 62 damage."],["Panoramic Composition","panoramic-composition","Foes within 6 blocks of where you look (up to 10, 2 CE each beyond the first) are sucked into the painting for 3 s: held, unseen, and blind (a nimble foe resists)."],["Paint","paint","The ground around where you look becomes your painting: 18 blocks around it, for 10 minutes."],["Magnum Opus","magnum-opus","The Domain is your painting: two Impasto effects simply happen to every chosen foe. Ink tears at it (27 damage) and a pit takes it (held 1.5 s)."],["Air Brush","air-brush","Inside your painting, once every 3 s a blow on you has a third of a chance to land on a painting formed in its path instead (1 CE)."],["Diptych","diptych","Standing outside your painting and looking into it, the quick key steps you through to where you look (2 CE more) instead of painting anew."],["Gradient","gradient","The 9 blocks around you always count as your painting."]]},{"id":"e535","n":"Explosion","s":"Palms that sweat nitroglycerin: blasts, piercing AP Shots, blinding Stun Grenades and the diving Howitzer Impact, and the longer the fight runs, the more sweat feeds them.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["Explosion","explosion","A blast where you look (up to 18 blocks): 20 damage, plus 7 damage per Sweat fed (hold to feed). It blows a pit in soft ground; the big ones leave craters."],["Explosion (Cone)","explosion-cone","A 9-block cone of fire from your palms, the same blast."],["AP Shot","ap-shot","A 36-block piercing line that punches through a block of cover: 27 damage, plus up to 2 Sweat."],["Stun Grenade","stun-grenade","A blinding flash where you look (12-block radius, up to 36 blocks off): blinded, reeling and weakened for 3 s."],["Howitzer Impact","howitzer-impact","Spin-dive up to 36 blocks where you look and detonate (12-block radius): 54 damage, plus 7 damage per 2 Sweat fed."],["Blast Dash","blast-dash","Ride the recoil a dozen blocks the way you look. Looking straight down, it's a Blast Jump: you're thrown up and whatever's under you takes 7 damage."],["Nitroglycerin Sweat","nitroglycerin-sweat","Sweat holds 7: +1 every 3 s (2 while sprinting), +1 when you're hurt (once every 3 s). Hold the cast key to feed it into a blast."],["Growing Arsenal","growing-arsenal","Explosion deals 20 damage before Sweat."],["Cluster","cluster","No more recoil. Once every 3 s, an explosion that connects pours the rest of your Sweat in: 7 damage each."],["Grenadier Gauntlets","grenadier-gauntlets","Your gauntlets keep what your palms make: Sweat holds 4 more, and every fight starts with at least 2."],["Point-Blank","point-blank","An explosion within 3 blocks of you adds 14 damage and throws the foe back."],["Final Howitzer","final-howitzer","Once a long rest, Howitzer Impact costs 2 CE less and deals 14 damage more. For one dive, the tornado is bigger and the argument is over."],["AP Shot: Auto-Cannon","ap-shot-auto-cannon","Technique Key 1 (1 CE and 1 Sweat): a quick AP Shot, 18 blocks, 14 damage."]]},{"id":"e265","n":"Explosive Flesh","s":"Turn your own body into the bomb: detachable explosive anatomy from tooth to leg, thrown or detonated on the spot.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Explosive Flesh","explosive-flesh","Tear off the chosen part (Technique Key 1) and throw it; it detonates where it lands: Tooth (1 CE, 14 damage, 4.5 blocks) Finger (2 CE, 20 damage, 6.0 blocks) Hand (3 CE, 34 damage, 7.5 blocks) Arm (5 CE, 54 damage, 10.5 blocks) Leg (6 CE, 68 damage, 13.5 blocks). Each costs some of your health (it grows back); hands and bigger blow a pit in soft ground. A nimble foe halves it. Bites the Dust: with Variant the part lies where it lands for up to a minute (3 at most), and Variant + Technique Key 1 sets them all off at once, half again as hard."],["Payload","payload","With Elemental Bomb: choose what your thrown parts carry, plain · fire (it burns and catches) · cold (it freezes and slows) · lightning (the wound jumps to a second foe), at twice the part's CE."],["Maximum: Full Body Detonation","maximum-full-body-detonation","Everything at once: you detonate where you stand, 108 damage to everything within 12 blocks and a pit in the ground, and a third of your health goes with it."],["Faster Throws","faster-throws","Tearing and throwing is quick."],["Guerilla Tactics","guerilla-tactics","Once every 3 s, when a melee blow lands on you or you land one, the chosen part goes off on your body (its CE and health): everything near you takes its blast."],["Stronger Explosions","stronger-explosions","Blasts are 1.5 blocks wider, their pits half a block wider, and what they catch is dazed and blinded a moment."],["Detonation Field","detonation-field","You choose a limb on every chosen foe, and detonate it: 54 damage. Inside it your own parts cost no CE, only the flesh."],["Reduced Harm","reduced-harm","Every part costs you less health, though never nothing."],["Elemental Bomb","elemental-bomb","Unlocks the quick key: fire, cold or lightning for your thrown parts, at twice the part's CE."]]},{"id":"e266","n":"Fa Jin","s":"You can store and release kinetic energy using your cursed technique.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Bank a Charge","bank-a-charge","Spend CE straight into the bank: 2 Jin charges."],["Fist of Explosive Power","fist-of-explosive-power","Spend up to 6 charges as compressed air shaped by your weapon: a sword, axe or trident fires a 18-block line (22 damage a charge); anything else a 9-block cone (14 damage a charge) that knocks foes down and blows loose things away. With 3 or more charges, 18 blocks farther."],["Store and Release","store-and-release","Hold to commit charges to your next melee blow (up to 6; CE pays when the bank is empty): 9 damage each if it lands. If the swing finds nothing, they're spent (you keep up to 5)."],["Maximum: Destructive Release","maximum-destructive-release","The vault emptied at once: Fist of Explosive Power at triple force a charge, and everything it catches is thrown back."],["Store and Release","store-and-release-2","A melee swing that misses with a foe within 4 blocks banks a Jin charge (up to 26). Charges are lost on a long rest."],["Kinetic Absorption","kinetic-absorption","A heavy blow (a tenth of your health or more) is partly banked: 1 CE takes 27 damage off it and gives you a charge (every 2 s)."],["Instantaneous Movement","instantaneous-movement","Stand your ground for 2 s in a fight: +1 charge. Technique Key 1: spend a charge to blink 6 blocks the way you look, up or down too; holding Variant, spend 3 to blink 18 and your next blow lands with thunder (a critical, and harder)."],["Hall of Divine Bagua","hall-of-divine-bagua","Inside, your bank never runs dry; every chosen foe takes on a negative charge each pulse, its blows 10% softer each time, until the Domain ends."],["Carried Momentum","carried-momentum","A blink carries the ally nearest you within 2.5 blocks along with you, for one more charge."]]},{"id":"e267","n":"Faceless God","s":"Infect minds with escalating Madness and Corruption; even the user is not exempt from the madness they spread.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Madness Inducement","madness-inducement","Every foe within 36 blocks that can see you takes 10 Madness (a strong will may resist, and is then safe from it for a day). At 10 a creature goes berserk: it turns on whatever is nearest it and wears itself down. Madness fades a minute after it was last fed."],["Maximum: Rumination","maximum-rumination","The foes within 9 blocks glimpse the Faceless God: 15 Corruption each. Every 3 s each one either resists or takes 11 damage per 10 Corruption and sinks deeper."],["Obsession and Insanity","obsession-and-insanity","Madness is contagious: each 3 s, a berserk foe gives 5 Madness to the foes within 9 blocks of it."],["Theia Mania","theia-mania","Every chosen foe takes 10 Madness. If more than half of them are berserk or corrupted, the whole Domain screams: 111 damage (221 damage to those who break)."],["Veil of the Faceless God","veil-of-the-faceless-god","While any foe carries your Madness, you sense every creature within 16 blocks: a mote shows over each."],["Hands of Madness","hands-of-madness","Once a second, a weapon blow gives 5 Madness, and a foe already maddened (5 or more) takes 7 damage more."],["True Mania","true-mania","You aim the storm: a berserk foe turns on the foe you look at (within 18 blocks of it) instead of its neighbour."]]},{"id":"e268","n":"Fate","s":"Red-thread Fates: shared wounds, tethers, destined death, and a Domain whose Destined Foe it never misses.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Fate Manipulation","fate-manipulation","Tie the foe you look at (18 blocks) to the foe nearest it (9 blocks) with the chosen Fate (Technique Key 1), for 5 minutes (1 CE more for each thread already holding; up to 6). Shared Wounds: what your blows do to one, the other takes half of · Tethered: they're dragged back together if they part · Doomed: both take a quarter more from you."],["Cursed Eyes of Fate","cursed-eyes-of-fate","Read the thread of the foe you look at: its health, armor and strength."],["Maximum: Shears of Three Fates","maximum-shears-of-three-fates","With the feat: snip a thread of the foe you look at (3 blocks). Every 3 s it must hold on, and three holds spare it. At three failures, a foe 10 levels under you, or 5 to 9 under and already low (half its health at 5, more as the gap grows), player or creature but never a boss, dies; anything else loses a tenth of its health each failure instead."],["Strong Destiny","strong-destiny","Threads last 5 minutes."],["Road of Karma","road-of-karma","The strongest chosen foe is named your Destined Foe: your weapon strikes it on its own, a blow that can't miss (your weapon's strength, or 25 damage)."],["Destined One","destined-one","Once every 3 s, striking a threaded foe drags its partner 3 blocks toward it and holds it a moment."],["Web of Fate","web-of-fate","A Fate ties the foe you look at to every other foe within 9 blocks of it (up to 6), and you can keep that many more threads."],["Maximum: Shears of Three Fates","maximum-shears-of-three-fates-2","Gain the Maximum: snip a foe's thread of fate and let the slow death follow."]]},{"id":"e557","n":"Fateweaver","s":"Webs restrain. The sense warns. The spider emerges. And beneath it all, threads: every creature connected to its own fate, and the weaver pulling them.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Webshot","webshot","A web along your look (36 blocks): what it hits is bound for 3 s (half that if it resists), and real cobwebs are left where it lands: one on a foe, a patch three across on a surface for 10 s. With Variant it's a web-line: you're carried to the surface you look at."],["Pull a Thread","pull-a-thread","The foe you look at (36 blocks) is dragged toward you along its fate-thread, or with Variant thrown the way you look, unless it resists. Either way its next blow within 3 s, on you or an ally, lands at half."],["Web Dominion","web-dominion","For a minute, a sphere of real webbing 9 blocks around where you look: every foe in it takes 55 damage each 3 s (half if it resists) and is slowed, and shows to you alone."],["Swarm Body","swarm-body","A feat. For a minute you're a swarm of spiders: unseen, small enough for a one-block gap, weapon blows and shots on you land at half, and foes within 1.5 blocks take 14 damage each 3 s. You can't strike or use other arts. Cast again to reform, or with Variant to reform where you look (36 blocks)."],["The Spider Emerges","the-spider-emerges","For a minute limbs burst from you: you strike twice as fast, reach a block farther, climb faster, your weapon blows bite 14 damage harder and your mandibles hold what they grip, but you can't slip blows, and the spider feeds on you each 3 s."],["Sever Thread","sever-thread","Only inside your own Web of Destiny, on the foe you look at: all your CE (10 at least) cuts its thread. A lesser foe dies; anything else takes 89 damage. The Domain ends, and you're spent for a minute."],["Spider Physique","spider-physique","Strength and Dexterity +2, and both caps with them. You jump three times as high and never take fall damage. Your empty hand is a stinger (+4 attack). Once every 3 s your weapon blow grips, slowing the foe; with Variant held it's the mandibles, and the foe is held 1 s unless it resists."],["Spider-Sense","spider-sense","A blow worth a tenth of your health may be slipped (50% of the time) for 3 CE, spent only when it works. You're warned of a creature hunting you from out of sight and of a shot flying at you."],["Wall-Crawling","wall-crawling","You climb walls (sneak to cling), and hang from a ceiling and cross it while sneaking."],["Thread Sense","thread-sense","Every creature within 36 blocks shows to you, through walls."],["Web of Destiny","web-of-destiny","Every chosen foe sees every path of its life at once: 89 damage, bound in webbing for 1.5 s and drawn toward the heart of the web. One that resists takes half and isn't held. The Maximum key cuts a thread."],["Venom","venom","Your webs and your stinger bite: Webshot, and once every 3 s an empty-handed blow, also deal 14 damage and poison the foe for 6 s unless it resists."],["Swarm Body","swarm-body-2","Unlocks the Swarm Body art."],["Fate Sever","fate-sever","Variant + Technique Key 1 (3 CE): cut the foe you look at from its fate for 3 s: it's weakened, can't answer blows, and resists nothing of yours."],["Fate's Glimpse","fates-glimpse","Technique Key 1 (3 CE): touch the thread of the foe you look at. For two 3 ss, every attack it makes on you fails."]]},{"id":"e147","n":"Faultline Ledger","s":"Mark faults in bodies, let ordinary movement and impacts pile up Strain, then cash it out in controlled ruptures.","c":"Applied Systems","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Rupture","rupture","The foe you look at (12 blocks) ruptures: 7 damage a Strain banked (at least one), and it staggers. 2 or more knocks it flat; 4 or more opens a fissure under it and holds it 3 s; 6 or more throws it back; 8 cracks its armor too."],["Survey","survey","The foe you look at (12 blocks) gains 1 Strain (and a Fault, if it had none)."],["Accumulate Strain","accumulate-strain","A foe you hurt gains a Fault for a minute. Once every 3 s each, it gains Strain when it moves 2 blocks, when it's knocked about, and when you strike it (up to 8)."],["Aftershock","aftershock","Rupturing 4 or more Strain passes 1 Strain to another Fault within 6 blocks."],["Deep Fault","deep-fault","Strain banks up to 8, and the Cataclysm opens."],["World Beneath the Cracks","world-beneath-the-cracks","Every chosen foe gains a Fault and 2 Strain, and the deepest ruptures as a Cataclysm for free."],["Hairline Crack","hairline-crack","When a fight begins, a hurt foe within 12 blocks already has a Fault on the books."],["Cascade Failure","cascade-failure","When a foe bearing your Fault dies, the nearest other Fault within 6 blocks gains 2 Strain."]]},{"id":"e546","n":"Fermentation","s":"Patience as a weapon: bottle cursed energy, carry it, and let time do the work. A fresh brew is lunch; an ancient one has a blast radius.","c":"Original","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["Throw Bottle","throw-bottle","Hurl the chosen bottle (18 blocks): 9 damage Fresh, 18 damage Young, 27 damage Aged with a 3-block splash, 36 damage Vintage with a 4.5-block splash and fumes, 53 damage Ancient with a 6-block blast and fumes."],["Flash-Age","flash-age","The chosen bottle ages a step at once."],["Brew","brew","A fresh bottle of cursed brew (you carry up to 12). It ages every two minutes you carry it. Technique Key 1 picks a bottle; Variant + Key 1 drinks it."],["Drink","drink","Variant + Technique Key 1 drinks the chosen bottle: it heals and cleanses you, more the older it is (Vintage and older also regenerate you for a minute)."],["The Palate","the-palate","An Aged or older bottle counts a step older."],["Ageless Cellar","ageless-cellar","You carry twice as many bottles."],["Mother Culture","mother-culture","Your living starter brews one bottle each long rest for free."]]},{"id":"e049","n":"Flame of Frenzy","s":"A self-burning meter of Madness feeds a yellow flame that frightens, kindles and spreads, until the boundary between you and everything melts.","c":"Video Games","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Frenzied Burst","frenzied-burst","+1 Madness. A gout of yellow flame along your look (24 blocks): 18 damage (more with Madness). A foe struck twice is frightened: it hits softer."],["Frenzy Gaze","frenzy-gaze","+1 Madness. A foe within 18 blocks that is looking you in the eye takes 27 damage and can't land a blow for 3 s."],["Flame Fan","flame-fan","+1 Madness. A 9-block cone of yellow fire: 36 damage to each foe in it, half to a strong will."],["Face of Chaos","face-of-chaos","+1 Madness. A held foe within reach (4 blocks) sees the face: 45 damage, and it's stunned a moment."],["Apparition of the Lord","apparition-of-the-lord","+2 Madness. For a minute a flaming head hangs over you: every 3 s it looses 6 bolts at foes within 27 blocks, 18 damage each."],["May Chaos Take the World","may-chaos-take-the-world","You become the Lord of Frenzied Flame, by choice."],["Unendurable Frenzy","unendurable-frenzy","+2 Madness. The Lord's apparition breathes: a 8-block cone of 53 damage, and everything in it is frightened."],["Howl of Frenzy","howl-of-frenzy","+1 Madness. For a minute your weapon blows burn: 9 damage more, and they set foes alight."],["Madness","madness","Frenzy arts add Madness (0-10); it ebbs a point every 20 s you go without. Each point makes your Frenzy 5% stronger. From 7, blows on you land 15% harder; at 10 the flame takes you: your mind reels for 5 s and Madness falls back to 7."],["Burn the Pain","burn-the-pain","Nausea and anything holding you burn away the moment they take you (1 CE, +1 Madness)."],["Contagious Despair","contagious-despair","A frightened foe your flame hurts makes the foes beside it weaker for 3 s."],["Madness Feeds Madness","madness-feeds-madness","A foe that fails against your Frenzy gives you 6 temporary health."],["The Lord of Frenzied Flame","the-lord-of-frenzied-flame","At 10 Madness the flame crowns you instead of taking you: for a minute your Frenzy Dice are d12s, you fly, and the flame's reeling can't take you. Every 3 s you must hold on, or the flame turns you on the nearest creature and you charge it. Lord's Emergence: once a long rest, falling at 8 Madness or more leaves you at 1 health, crowned. Melt Distinction: crowned, your flame burns what fire can't. Last Ember of Self: once a crowning, a hold you'd lose is kept for 53 damage to yourself, never more than half the health you have."],["Kindled Contagion","kindled-contagion","From 3 Madness, a foe your Frenzy frightens is Kindled: it burns, and when it dies the flame leaps to the foes beside it."],["One Great, No More Distinction","one-great-no-more-distinction","Melt the Boundary: every chosen foe takes 106 damage, and every blessing on it burns away. It opens only at 6 Madness or more."],["Feed the Flame","feed-the-flame","Technique Key 1: take a point of Madness on purpose. Your next Frenzy blow adds 9 damage."],["Shabriri's Cry","shabriris-cry","While Howl of Frenzy runs, once every 3 s the foe you look at (6 blocks) hears your cry: it freezes in fear for 1.5 s and is frightened."],["Yellow-Eyed Prophet","yellow-eyed-prophet","You see creatures around you through walls."],["Lord Candidate","lord-candidate","Once a long rest, when the flame would take you, it crowns you instead: you keep your mind and are mended."]]},{"id":"e484","n":"Flow Technique","s":"A counter-flow art: when a blow lands on you, blunt it and channel the residue into your next strike.","c":"Creeps and Curses","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["Flowing Palm","flowing-palm","A palm strike on the foe you look at (4.5 blocks): 9 damage, plus 9 damage for each charge the flow is holding."],["The River Answers","the-river-answers","Once every 3 s a blow on you is caught (1 CE): it lands a third softer, and the residue waits for your next blow."],["Catch and Release","catch-and-release","A blow the river catches is answered at once: the attacker (within 9 blocks) takes 17 damage."]]},{"id":"e560","n":"Full Counter","s":"Every attack you can see is a gift: catch it on the blade and return it stronger than it arrived. The Captain doesn't dodge. He answers.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Counter Vanish","counter-vanish","Every harmful effect on you, holds included, simply never arrived. Not a Domain's."],["Revenge Counter","revenge-counter","Everything you've endured since your last Revenge, on top of your weapon's blow, to the foe you look at in reach (4.5 blocks). Past 270 the excess costs you half of itself. A long rest empties the ledger."],["Full Counter","full-counter","A split-second guard. A technique, magic, fire, lightning or a blast that lands in it is caught: you take nothing, and it returns to its sender twice as hard. A physical blow (a weapon, a fist, an arrow) can only be parried: half lands, and all of it goes to Revenge. With Variant the guard is amplified: a caught blow also spends up to 6 more CE, 13 damage more each. The Captain's Counter: the guard also catches blows on an ally within 18 blocks."],["Maximum: Absolute Counter","maximum-absolute-counter","Once a long rest, for a minute: every blow that reaches you is countered on its own (1 CE each), returned two and a half times as hard, and Counter Vanish costs 1 CE. After it, the arm needs 3 s before it counters again."],["Read the Blow","read-the-blow","You can't be caught off guard: hidden attackers near you show themselves."],["Second Helping","second-helping","Once every 3 s, after a counter, your next counter within it costs nothing."],["Revenge","revenge","Every blow you take adds to your Revenge total."],["Cover the Sin","cover-the-sin","The Captain's Counter reaches 36 blocks, and an ally you cover gains 8 temporary health."],["Interest on Pain","interest-on-pain","The ledger holds half again as much before it costs you, Revenge Counter costs 1 CE less, and with 68 Revenge or more you move a third faster."],["Vanish Point","vanish-point","Once a long rest, Counter Vanish throws what it dissipates onto the foe you look at (18 blocks) instead."],["Bounce Counter","bounce-counter","Against another Bounce Counter user, a countered blow rallies: each of you returns it on your own (1 CE a bounce), up to four bounces, half again as hard each time."]]},{"id":"e269","n":"G Warstaff","s":"A conjured G-pen that marks futures seconds ahead: foresight that becomes guaranteed criticals and a Domain that reads every future at once.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Warstaff Strike","warstaff-strike","With the warstaff: a long jab along your look, 3 blocks, 11 damage, and one more second of the foe's future marked (up to 6)."],["Warstaff","warstaff","Conjure the G-pen warstaff; it stays until the fight's over."],["Maximum: Omniscient Reader's Viewpoint","maximum-omniscient-readers-viewpoint","With the feat: a minute editing the panels. A foe read six seconds can't land a blow on you, and every warstaff strike on it is a critical."],["Highlighted Panels","highlighted-panels","A foe marked 2 seconds or more: its blows on you land at half."],["Predictable Strikes","predictable-strikes","A foe marked 3 seconds or more: once every 3 s, your warstaff strike on it is a critical."],["Precognition","precognition","You strike true more often: 10% of your blows are critical."],["Storyboard Dominion","storyboard-dominion","Every chosen foe counts as six seconds read: you see every future at once."],["Greater Foresight","greater-foresight","While your staff is out and a foe near you is read, teammates within 9 blocks stand firmer (20% less from blows)."],["True Warstaff: Full Spread","true-warstaff-full-spread","Technique Key 1 (4 CE): drive the staff into the ground where you look (9 blocks): a 4.5-block standing panel for a minute that reads one more second of every foe inside it each second."],["GG True Warstaff","gg-true-warstaff","The weapon's true form: the jab reaches 4.5 blocks, hits 16 damage, and a critical reads two more seconds."],["Maximum: Omniscient Reader's Viewpoint","maximum-omniscient-readers-viewpoint-2","Gain the Maximum: what you've read can't touch you, and you can't miss it."]]},{"id":"e122","n":"Gamma Rage","s":"Hulk Out, Thunder Clap, Hulk Leap, regeneration, Gamma Quake, Worldbreaker and the Worldbreaker Smash.","c":"Marvel","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Smash","smash","A fist at the foe in front of you: 9 damage (hulked out 11 damage) plus your Rage. Worldbreaker Grip: hulked, with Variant you seize that foe and swing it into the nearest other foe within 5 blocks, 22 damage plus your Rage to both."],["Thunder Clap","thunder-clap","A 5-block cone of thunder: 33 damage, and everything in it is shoved back."],["Gamma Quake","gamma-quake","Everything within 10 blocks takes 77 damage and is knocked down; the ground caves in under you."],["Worldbreaker","worldbreaker","At Rage 10: a minute where you grow larger still, blows barely hurt you, every hit lands 22 damage harder, your Rage can't fall, and your stride knocks down foes within 3 blocks of your path."],["Hulk Out","hulk-out","A minute: you grow huge and green, your bare fists hit 11 damage plus your Rage, and nothing pushes you around."],["Maximum: Worldbreaker Smash","maximum-worldbreaker-smash","At Rage 10: a 20-block cone of shattered ground, 159 damage, everything hurled away and knocked down, and a trench torn through the ground. Rage falls to 5."],["Rage","rage","Every blow you take raises Rage by 1 (up to 12), and an ally going down in your sight (within 16 blocks) by 2. 3 s without being hurt cools it by 1."],["Hulk Leap","hulk-leap","Hulked out, you jump far higher and falls don't hurt you. Land from 10 blocks or more (2 CE) and the landing is a burst: 33 damage, denting the ground."],["Regeneration","regeneration","At Rage 5 or more you heal every 3 s, unless you're poisoned or withered."],["Rage 8","rage-8","At Rage 8: tougher against blows, and once every 3 s your smash adds 11 damage."],["Strongest One There Is","strongest-one-there-is","Rage up to 12. Once a long rest, a blow that would kill you puts you into Worldbreaker at half a heart instead."],["Green Scar","green-scar","Technique Key 1 (1 CE and 1 Rage, at Rage 5+): a roar. Foes within 5 blocks recoil and hit far softer for 3 s."],["Hulk Catch","hulk-catch","Hulked out, once every 3 s you may catch a shot that would hit you (2 CE): about half the time, it's yours, and you hurl it back at its shooter within 20 blocks for 33 damage."],["Collateral Bulwark","collateral-bulwark","Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE, Rage 5+): you tear up the ground into cover; for 3 s shots at you land at half."]]},{"id":"e200","n":"Gate of the Protective Colossus","s":"Designate thresholds: hostile crossings generate Vigilance that lets the guardian intercept and, at last, account for every crossing.","c":"Mythology","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Raise Threshold","raise-threshold","A gate stands where you look (18 blocks), facing the way you look, for 10 minutes (up to 6). A foe that walks through it takes 18 damage once every 3 s, is slowed for 3 s and shown for 3 s, and unless it resists is stopped for 1 s and takes 18 damage more. The first crossing every 3 s gives you a Vigilance (up to 6; it's lost when no gate of yours stands)."],["Five-Legged Step","five-legged-step","Standing within 3 blocks of one of your gates, you stand at another: the one nearest your look, within 72 blocks."],["Intercept","intercept","Spend all Vigilance: you're beside the foe you look at (18 blocks), guarded for 3 s (blows on you land at half), and you strike it for 9 damage per Vigilance spent (up to 6)."],["Maximum: Gate No Enemy Crosses Uncounted","maximum-gate-no-enemy-crosses-uncounted","Four great gates rise in a square around you for a minute: crossing one costs a foe 53 damage and holds it 2 s, and no foe's shot passes through them."],["Bull-Lion Intercession","bull-lion-intercession","Once every 3 s, for a Vigilance: when a foe's blow lands on an ally within 18 blocks, you and the ally change places and the blow lands on you. Within 6 blocks of one of your gates, it lands at half."],["Five-Legged Perspective","five-legged-perspective","Every creature within 6 blocks of one of your gates is shown to you alone."],["Name on the Gate","name-on-the-gate","Allies who walk through your gates are quickened for 3 s; a stranger who fails to resist a gate takes 18 damage more."],["Gate No Enemy Crosses Uncounted","gate-no-enemy-crosses-uncounted","Four great gates stand 12 blocks from its heart while it's open. Every chosen foe is counted: 36 damage, held 2 s, and a Vigilance for you. One that walked through any gate of yours since the last count takes 18 damage more."],["Palace Watch","palace-watch","Technique Key 1 (2 Vigilance): move your newest Threshold to where you look (36 blocks), facing the way you look."],["Inscribed Gate","inscribed-gate","Variant + Raise Threshold (1 Vigilance): the gate is drawn to you alone."],["Winged Guardian","winged-guardian","When you intercede for an ally standing within 3 blocks of one of your gates, with another gate within 18 blocks of it, the ally is set at that gate instead and you stay where you are. The blow still lands on you."],["No Unrecorded Passage","no-unrecorded-passage","A foe that walks through one of your gates loses its invisibility."]]},{"id":"e176","n":"Gleipnir Breaker","s":"Begin under self-imposed chains: keep them for stability, snap them when their trigger comes to release Ragnarök, and turn every restraint into fuel.","c":"Cryptids","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Fenris Bite","fenris-bite","The foe you look at (3 blocks): 22 damage, and 11 damage more for every Ragnarök token you spend (all of them)."],["Wolf's Lunge","wolfs-lunge","1 Ragnarök token: 9 blocks along your look, and slowness and holds fall off you. Ending a hold this way gives you temporary health."],["Maximum: Ragnarök Unbound","maximum-ragnar-k-unbound","With 3 or more Bonds broken, for a minute, spending every token: you're huge, 10% faster and 11 damage of temporary health a token, once every 3 s a blow gains 5 damage a token (32 damage at most), every third shakes the ground for 11 damage, and nothing frightens or holds you. When it ends every Bond is broken until a long rest, and you're spent."],["Bonds","bonds","5 Bonds, prepared out of a fight with none broken (Technique Key 1 picks one, Variant + Key 1 prepares or drops it): Tyr's Hand (no healing from others: regeneration can't take hold on you; snaps when you fall below half health); Silent Fang (a whisper: your chat reaches only 8 blocks, no chant, no spoken words; snaps when you're frightened or gagged, or an ally names you while you're hurt); Moon Chain (no art that costs more than 2 CE; snaps when a foe near you spends 5 CE at once or opens a Domain); Dromi (no reactions; snaps when an ally within 18 blocks is struck); Gleipnir (30% slower; snaps when a foe you're fighting stands 18 blocks off or more); Laeding (no weapons: weapon blows do nothing; snaps when a weapon wounds you). A Bond snaps only when its trigger comes: a shockwave (18 damage within 3 blocks), a Ragnarök token (up to your Bonds), and its restriction is gone. While Bonds hold, blows on you land 5% softer for each and nothing throws you. Broken Bonds reform after two minutes out of a fight; tokens keep until a long rest."],["The Chain Remembers","the-chain-remembers","Being slowed or held gives you a Chain token for two 3 ss (one at a time), spent like a Ragnarök token."],["Wolf at the Rope","wolf-at-the-rope","A Bond snapping frightens foes within 6 blocks (a strong will may hold). Variant on a blow: 2 tokens and 1 CE for 11 damage more, and the foe is knocked flat."],["Five Impossible Bindings","five-impossible-bindings","Holding 3 Bonds or more, one art a 3 s costs 1 CE less. The third Bond to snap in a fight frees you of holds and throws you 12 blocks along your look."],["Slipped Leash","slipped-leash","Once every 3 s, when something slows or holds you, you slip it at once, 6 blocks along your look."],["Moon-Eater","moon-eater","When Moon Chain snaps, the foe who snapped it takes 7 damage as the chain lashes back."],["Unbroken Oath","unbroken-oath","Finish a fight with no Bond broken: the next time your picked Bond's trigger comes, it holds (no token)."]]},{"id":"e144","n":"Golden Fault","s":"Damage creates Fractures. Mend your own breaks into stronger seams, or strike through the enemy's before they heal.","c":"Applied Systems","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Gilded Seam","gilded-seam","The foe you look at (6 blocks): 16 damage, and a Fracture opens in it."],["Mend the Break","mend-the-break","Regain 10% of your health (twice that if you spend a Lacquer). You harden for 3 s after: 6 more armor, and nothing knocks you back."],["Maximum: Golden Reassembly","maximum-golden-reassembly","You regain 25% of your health. Every foe within 6 blocks has its Fractures detonate: 22 damage, plus 7 damage a Fracture, and it's knocked flat (a hardy foe stays standing)."],["Fracture Sense","fracture-sense","Once every 3 s, a foe you hurt gains a Fracture (up to 5) for a minute, a gold seam on its body."],["Exploit the Break","exploit-the-break","A weapon blow on a fractured foe spends a Fracture and a Lacquer (1 CE): 7 damage more, up to three at once, and three cracks its armor."],["Lacquer Pot","lacquer-pot","You hold 11 Lacquer, refilled by a long rest."],["Beautiful Scar","beautiful-scar","Mending yourself leaves a golden scar: for 6 s, poison, withering, burning, nausea, slowing and weakness can't take hold."],["Shatterpoint","shatterpoint","When a foe reaches its most Fractures, you see the moment it will fall: your next weapon blow on it lands half again as hard."]]},{"id":"e270","n":"Golden Hour","s":"Stopped time in an instant, purchased extra moments, a six-second rewind, and a Domain that stops time on every pulse.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Majestic Pose","majestic-pose","A longer pause: time stops for 3 s, but afterwards you can't move for a moment."],["Golden Week","golden-week","A minute instead of stopping time: twice as fast, 6 armor more, and quicker blows."],["Samsara Rewind","samsara-rewind","Six seconds back: you're where you stood then, and as hurt as you were then if that was better."],["Hour Hand","hour-hand","With the Clock Hand: a reaching thrust (3 blocks), 18 damage, and 27 damage more against anything frozen in time."],["Golden Hour","golden-hour","Time stops for 2 s around you (18 blocks): foes freeze where they are, shots, dropped items and falling blocks hang in the air, and every blow you land on something frozen is a critical."],["Maximum: Clock Hand","maximum-clock-hand","The Clock Hand in your hands for 10 minutes: Hour Hand thrusts it."],["The World","the-world","Time stops at every pulse for every chosen foe: held 1.5 s, and your blows on them critical."],["Quick Pose","quick-pose","Once every 10 s, a blow about to land stops time first (5 CE): it misses, and everything around you freezes for 1 s."],["Prime Time","prime-time","When you stop time, teammates within 9 blocks step into it with you (2 CE): they hit harder while it lasts."]]},{"id":"e173","n":"Gorgon's Regard","s":"Force every opponent to choose between fighting blind and risking progressive petrification.","c":"Cryptids","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Stone Glare","stone-glare","The foe you look at (36 blocks) meets your eyes: 22 damage, and it calcifies a step at once."],["Serpent Lash","serpent-lash","The hair bites the foe you look at (6 blocks): 9 damage. Shell-Crack: one at 3 or more sheds a step and is knocked flat."],["Bronze Reflection","bronze-reflection","Make the polished thing you look at (18 blocks: glass, ice, polished stone, a metal block) a mirror for the gaze, while the Regard lasts (up to 6, within 36 blocks)."],["The Regard","the-regard","For a minute, each 3 s every foe within 36 blocks whose eyes are on you or a mirror may calcify a step (a resist holds it): slowed, then weakened (30% softer), then held, then stone 3 s (great foes only stiffen). A foe that can't see you for a 3 s sheds a step. A blind foe is safe."],["Stone-Blooded","stone-blooded","Poison does you half harm."],["House of Mirrors","house-of-mirrors","When a foe turns to stone, you gain temporary health."],["Garden of the Unblinking Queen","garden-of-the-unblinking-queen","There is nowhere not to look: every chosen foe calcifies a step, no resist, and the nearly stone take 66 damage as they crack."],["Snake Crown","snake-crown","The snakes lend their senses: you see in the dark, and a mote shows over every creature near you."],["Cracking Stone","cracking-stone","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): shatter the calcifying shell of the foe you look at, 22 damage, and 11 damage more for each step it carries (spent). Once every 3 s, an ally's blow on a foe at 3 or more cracks it too: a step shed, knocked flat."],["Do Not Look Away","do-not-look-away","Once every 3 s, a calcifying foe that turns away from you and runs: you're 6 blocks closer (1 CE)."],["Mirror-Bearer","mirror-bearer","Variant + Bronze Reflection on an ally: they carry a mirror for the gaze."]]},{"id":"e186","n":"Grave-Mound Tenacity","s":"Choose a Grave Anchor. Trespassers, and those who flee your reach, feed Restlessness that fuels resistance and retaliation.","c":"Mythology","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Barrow Strike","barrow-strike","The foe you look at (3 blocks): 18 cold damage, and 9 damage more for each Restlessness you spend (all of it)."],["Mound-Dweller","mound-dweller","For a minute a Grave Mound rises round your Anchor: the guarded ground is 9 blocks, and foes on it are mired."],["Corpse-Swell","corpse-swell","For a minute the corpse swells: half again your size, 3 blocks more reach, and a foe in your reach that is snatched or blinks away is dragged back unless it breaks your grip."],["Grave Anchor","grave-anchor","Your Anchor rises where you stand: 6 blocks of guarded ground. On it, blows land 20% softer."],["Restlessness","restlessness","Once every 3 s each: a foe stepping onto your guarded ground, a foe tramping 6 blocks about inside it, and each foe slipping out of your reach. Up to 6."],["Restless Corpse","restless-corpse","Once every 3 s, a foe's weapon blow or shot of a tenth of your health or more spends 1 Restlessness and lands at half. A weapon blow of yours with Variant held spends 1 for 9 cold damage more."],["Too Angry to Die","too-angry-to-die","Once a long rest, on your guarded ground: a blow that would kill you spends all your Restlessness (2 at least) and 4 CE instead. You stand at 1 health and strike the nearest foe in reach for 18 damage."],["Barrow That Refuses the Dawn","barrow-that-refuses-the-dawn","The barrow closes round your Anchor, and all of it is your guarded ground: every chosen foe is held by grave-hands (36 damage, 1.5 s), and one more than 9 blocks from the Anchor is dragged toward it and feeds Restlessness."],["Corpse Weight","corpse-weight","Swollen, or full of Restlessness, nothing can knock you back."],["Anchor's Pull","anchors-pull","A foe slipping out of your reach can be escorted back (1 Restlessness): it's hurled toward your Grave Anchor (a strong foe may hold)."],["Burial Goods","burial-goods","Variant + Grave Anchor buries a second Anchor where you stand. Technique Key 1 (1 CE) moves your guarded ground to the other one."],["Unquiet Dead","unquiet-dead","When you're Too Angry to Die, foes within 9 blocks are frightened for 3 s unless they steel themselves."]]},{"id":"e046","n":"Gravity Sovereignty","s":"Violet marks that make everything answer to your gravity (pull, push, orbit) until the stars themselves fall on command.","c":"Video Games","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Vector Command","vector-command","Every foe within 4 blocks of where you look is hurled: toward you (Pull), or along your aim in any direction (Push: look down to drive them into the ground, up to fling them skyward), and takes 18 damage (a strong foe may hold). Marked foes answer from anywhere in range, can't hold, and take 27 damage. Technique Key 1 switches Pull and Push."],["Cragblade","cragblade","For a minute, a weapon blow on a marked foe also pushes it 3 blocks along your look (Push) or pulls it 3 blocks to you (Pull)."],["Meteor Sling","meteor-sling","Up to 6 marked things in orbit fly at the foes where you look: 27 damage each."],["Weightless Step","weightless-step","A short, weightless leap along your look, and you drift down after it. Once every 3 s, free."],["Consort's Meteor Rain","consorts-meteor-rain","You vanish upward, and 3 s later you fall on the point you looked at (up to 90 blocks): every foe within 9 blocks takes 71 damage and is thrown. With Variant, Heaven-Shattering Reentry: 10 CE more, 18 blocks and 107 damage, and the landing costs you 36 damage."],["Starcaller Cry","starcaller-cry","A 4-block sphere where you look (12 blocks) collapses: every foe in it is dragged to its heart and takes 27 damage (a strong foe is dragged less)."],["Collapsing Stars","collapsing-stars","6 violet gravity orbs seek foes (18 blocks): 18 damage each, and each drags its target toward you."],["Gravity Mark","gravity-mark","The foe you look at (30 blocks) wears a violet mark for a minute (a strong foe may resist): it's slowed, and it answers your Vector Command from anywhere in range. Looking at no foe, it marks a loose item, a falling block or a shot in flight instead (up to 6). Greatsword Conductor: once every 3 s a weapon blow marks its target for 1 CE."],["Maximum: Festival of Falling Stars","maximum-festival-of-falling-stars","A minute: three meteors form in orbit over you every 3 s (up to nine). Variant + Technique Key 1 hurls them all where you look: 36 damage each in a 2-block burst (a nimble foe halves it), and each one craters the ground."],["Gravity Collision","gravity-collision","A foe you hurl that strikes a wall or another creature stops dead and is knocked down a moment."],["Conqueror's Orbit","conquerors-orbit","Marked things circle you. Once every 3 s (2 CE) one is thrown into the path of a shot coming at you, and stops it."],["Absolute Vector","absolute-vector","Vector Command throws farther."],["Orbital Arsenal","orbital-arsenal","Each weapon blow or arrow that lands also launches a thing from your orbit at its target: 18 damage."],["Perfect Gravity","perfect-gravity","You may fly: you stand and run on open air."],["General of the Stars","general-of-the-stars","Mass Bows to the General: one Vector Command each 3 s is free. Army of One: below half health, nothing resists your gravity. Heaven-Shattering Reentry: see Consort's Meteor Rain."],["Wailing Firmament","wailing-firmament","Heaven Falls: every 3 s each foe it chose takes 53 damage, is dragged toward the centre, and hangs in the air until the next."],["Redmane Greatbow","redmane-greatbow","You mark the ammunition as you fire it: once every 3 s, an arrow that hits a marked foe drags it toward you."],["Starcaller's Mark","starcallers-mark","What the cry cannot crush, it claims: a foe that holds against Starcaller Cry is marked for a minute."],["Lion's Gravity","lions-gravity","Anchored to your own law: nothing knocks you back, and once every 3 s the foe that struck you is pulled to you."],["Grand Conjunction","grand-conjunction","Variant + Technique Key 1 merges the meteors in orbit into one greater star: 36 damage per meteor in a 3-block burst, and a far greater crater."]]},{"id":"e271","n":"Hair Manipulation","s":"Stingers, explosive drills, and helicopter or jet hair-forms, crowned by a Domain that shreds everything that moves.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Hair Stingers","hair-stingers","Three needles of hardened hair along your look (18 blocks, 1.5 more): 18 damage for the first on each foe, 18 damage for each after."],["Explosive Drill","explosive-drill","A spiraling drill of hair that bores through soft blocks and bursts where it stops: 71 damage within 3.0 blocks (a nimble foe may halve it)."],["Aircraft Hair","aircraft-hair","A minute of flight: your hair becomes a Helicopter (hover) or a Jet (Technique Key 1: fly fast and ram what you pass for 18 damage)."],["Mega-Drill","mega-drill","With the feat: one drill made enormous, a 24-block line of piercing ruin along your look, through walls, 66 damage to everything on it; it bores a tunnel through the soft ground it crosses."],["Hair Spray","hair-spray","Your hair reaches farther and hits like a cursed tool."],["Silken Strand Execution Ground","silken-strand-execution-ground","A law, not an event: inside, every foe takes 22 damage for every 1.5 blocks it moves, as hairs too fine to see cut into it."],["Scorpion Tactics","scorpion-tactics","Once every 3 s, a foe that strikes you in melee is stung back by your hair (14 damage) and the barb is left in: poisoned."],["Mega-Drill","mega-drill-2","Unlocks the quick key: one enormous drill."],["Air Bomber","air-bomber","As a Helicopter, your blades tear everything within 4.5 blocks every 2 s (1 CE, 27 damage); as a Jet, your ram hits twice as hard."]]},{"id":"e058","n":"Hakoware: Bankruptcy, Chapter Seven","s":"Potclean latches on and lends your enemy cursed energy. Everything you do to it becomes debt, compounding every 3 s; let a sorcerer owe more CE than they have, or anything else more than half its life, and it's bankrupt.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["A.P.R. (Potclean)","a-p-r-potclean","Potclean flies at the foe you look at (12 blocks) and latches: every blow you land on it becomes debt, and the debt grows by 12% every 3 s. Two loans at a time; a new one replaces the oldest."],["Bailout","bailout","Once a long rest: forgive the largest loan and pocket CE from half the debt."],["Maximum: Reversal: Repossession","maximum-reversal-repossession","The largest debtor pays a tenth of its debt in health, and that much leaves the ledger; you regain CE from half of it (up to 10). The loan continues."],["The loan","the-loan","A debtor strikes you 10% harder (you armed it), and its blows on you pay its debt down. A sorcerer is lent 60 CE at once; past their own CE (the loan included) they're bankrupt and can't cast a technique for 180 s. Anything else is ruined past half its health, and for as long strikes at half strength."],["Audit","audit","Every 3 s you're told each debtor's balance, how close it is to ruin, and how far and which way it is."],["Branch Offices","branch-offices","Two loans at once."],["Garnish Wages","garnish-wages","Interest rises to 12% every 3 s, and the first CE a sorcerer debtor spends each 3 s is added to the debt."],["Chapter 7","chapter-7","A bankrupt sorcerer's CE doesn't refill until the ruin ends, and the principal is three times your level."],["Ledger of Ruin","ledger-of-ruin","The lending itself: every chosen foe is given a loan (past the usual limit), and interest ticks on all of them."],["Predatory Lending","predatory-lending","The vow is the rate: interest is 15% every 3 s from the start."],["Debt Transfer","debt-transfer","Technique Key 1 (1 CE) moves a loan to the foe you look at, within 12 blocks of the debtor; the whole balance follows."],["Collateral","collateral","When a debtor goes bankrupt you seize collateral: 3 CE back, a little health, and what it holds: a creature's held item comes to you, a player's is knocked to the ground at their feet."],["Credit Check","credit-check","Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE): read the books of the creature you look at (18 blocks): a sorcerer's CE and its maximum, or a creature's health."]]},{"id":"e195","n":"Headless Road","s":"Manifest a black steed and a detachable spectral Head; closing on your quarry builds Gallop for pursuit strikes and control.","c":"Mythology","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Spine Whip","spine-whip","A whip of spine lashes the foe you look at (9 blocks): 27 damage, and 9 damage more per Gallop spent (all of it). Unless it endures, it's slowed and can't react for 3 s; your Road's End is hauled to you instead."],["The Severed Head","the-severed-head","Your Head floats beside you for ten minutes, glaring at the nearest foe within 8 blocks: 9 damage every 3 s. With Variant you set it down where you look (18 blocks) to watch from there; a foe that reaches it knocks it back to you, and that hurts (9 damage)."],["Name on the Road","name-on-the-road","Name the foe you look at (36 blocks): unless its will holds, it's your Road's End for a minute. It glows, you're told where it is, your Gallop builds on it from any direction, and Last Name Spoken finds it wherever you look."],["Black Steed","black-steed","The headless horse rises under you for a minute and carries you, far faster than you run (it fades when you dismount). Gallop builds as you close on your quarry."],["Gallop","gallop","Riding, every 4 blocks you close on the foe nearest where you look gives a Gallop (up to 5). A weapon blow with Variant held spends one for 9 damage more."],["The Road With No Turning","the-road-with-no-turning","The road runs only toward you: every chosen foe is dragged toward you and takes 36 damage, and you gain Gallop."],["Unbroken Gallop","unbroken-gallop","Riding with any Gallop built, nothing can knock you off course."],["Lantern Eyes","lantern-eyes","While your Head floats beside you, its lantern lets you see in the dark, and a mote shows over every creature near you."],["Last Name Spoken","last-name-spoken","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): speak the name of the foe you look at (18 blocks): it's dragged down the road toward you and falters (hits 20% softer) for 3 s (a strong will may refuse)."]]},{"id":"e015","n":"Heart Catch","s":"Two great hands of love at your shoulders: they strike, seize, shield you and charm.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Heart Grasp","heart-grasp","A hand closes on the foe you look at within its reach: held for 3 s (a strong foe may slip free; the hand has the better grip)."],["Hands of Love","hands-of-love","Two hands for ten minutes, never more than 18 blocks from you: they strike what comes within 6 blocks of you (14 damage). Calling them again replaces the pair."],["Maximum: Love at First Sight","maximum-love-at-first-sight","A foe within a hand's reach is charmed at first sight, no blow needed (a strong will may resist): for a minute it forgets the fight."],["Handy","handy","The hands hit harder, guard 6 blocks round you and reach 18 blocks from you."],["Hand Shield","hand-shield","Once every 3 s, a hand throws itself between a blow and you, or an ally within the hands' reach: it lands at a quarter."],["Cutie Honey","cutie-honey","Technique Key 1 (5 CE): the next blow a hand lands charms its foe for a minute (a strong will may resist)."],["Lover's Grasp","lovers-grasp","Every chosen foe is held and charmed (1.5 s), with no damage."],["Thunderous Applause","thunderous-applause","Once every 3 s, when both hands can reach the same foe, they clap around it: 16 damage, it's dazed, and it's thrown back."],["Lover's Embrace","lovers-embrace","A foe held by Heart Grasp is squeezed while it's held: 14 damage every second."],["Handy Dandy","handy-dandy","Variant + Technique Key 1 (2 CE): one hand locks into a platform five blocks across where you look, within its reach, for ten minutes. It can't strike, seize or shield meanwhile. Again to release it."]]},{"id":"e547","n":"Hemline","s":"The threaded needle: stitch foes to the floor, pull them where you want them, and dress the whole battlefield to your measurements.","c":"Original","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Needlework","needlework","A cursed needle (36 blocks): 18 damage, and what it hits is Threaded for as long as it lives."],["Hemming","hemming","The foe you look at (18 blocks) has its shadow sewn to the floor: it can't move for 3 s, and it's Threaded."],["Stitch","stitch","The foe you look at is stitched in place for 1.5 s (a strong foe may hold); a threaded foe can't, and is held for 3 s."],["The Full Wardrobe","the-full-wardrobe","Once every 5 minutes: every foe within 18 blocks is yanked 9 blocks toward you and stitched for 3 s, no holding out."],["Pull","pull","The foe you look at is yanked 4.5 blocks toward you (a strong foe may hold); a threaded foe is caught from anywhere in reach, and can't. With no foe in view, the loose item, boat or cart you look at is reeled in."],["Master Tailor","master-tailor","Needlework is free, and threads hold until the foe dies."],["The Final Fitting","the-final-fitting","The garments dress themselves: every chosen foe is Threaded, taken in (slowed), and pricked for 18 damage."],["Quilted Armor","quilted-armor","Technique Key 1 (2 CE) quilts cursed energy into your clothes: 6 armor for a minute."]]},{"id":"e513","n":"Hide and Seek","s":"A fourth-dimensional mansion entered through doors only the keyholder can hang, and Scream, a window that closes on whatever it touches and files it away.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["The Mansion Door","the-mansion-door","Hang a real trapdoor where you look, flat on the ground or against a wall (9 blocks; 6 at a time). Each door opens into a room of its own in your mansion, and only for you and your allies. Variant, looking at one of your doors, leaves it open to anyone, or locks it again: an open door lying on the floor is a pitfall, and a foe that steps on it drops into its room. Anyone can break a door, and when your last door falls, everyone in your mansion is put out."],["Enter / Leave the Mansion","enter-leave-the-mansion","Step through your door (or right-click it), with any ally within 2.5 blocks, into that door's room: the mansion is a hall, a corridor and 20 rooms outside the world. A foe you look at within 3 blocks is dragged in with you unless it resists (2 CE): a player can leave by the trapdoor in that room, back out of the door it belongs to, and a creature goes back where it stood once nobody walks the mansion. Every room is shut by an iron door that only your hand or an ally's opens, so a foe stays in the room it came into. Nothing outside can reach you, and nothing can dowse you. Leave by a room's trapdoor, or with this art, out of the door nearest where you look. Variant at a door: straight through it and out of your next door."],["Scream","scream","A portal snaps shut on a foe within 9 blocks: it's filed into a sealed room of its own, a player for 3 s and a creature for a minute, then put back where it stood. Its output is sealed for a minute. You're told which room: you and your allies can walk in on it. The vast are only held where they stand, 3 s."],["Keyholder's Step","keyholders-step","Step out of the door nearest where you look (within 150 blocks), from wherever you are, with any ally at your hand (2.5 blocks). Variant: step into your hall from anywhere."],["Reversal: Seek and Find","reversal-seek-and-find","Tear the hiding off: the foe you look at within 18 blocks is dragged out beside you (not the vast ones), and for a minute it glows and can't turn invisible. Aimed at another keyholder's door, it drags out everyone hiding behind it. With nothing in your sights, it pulls your own filed foes out beside you."],["More Doors","more-doors","Three doors at a time, four from 11th and six from 18th, each with a room of its own."],["Paired Doors","paired-doors","In by one door and straight out of the next, without stopping inside."],["Exile","exile","Scream seals a foe's output for a full minute, and a creature stays filed that long."],["The Fourth-Dimensional Estate","the-fourth-dimensional-estate","Everywhere is inside: each pulse, every chosen foe is swallowed into a holding room for 1.5 s, then put back where it stood."],["Doormat","doormat","Technique Key 1 (2 CE) lays a door flat on the floor where you look: the next foe to step on it falls into the room of your newest door and stays there, as if dragged in (with no door hung, it's filed for 6 s). Nobody else sees it. Up to two."],["Catch, Don't Kill","catch-dont-kill","Once every 3 s, a shot about to hit you is swallowed by a portal snapping shut on it (3 CE)."],["Mail Slot","mail-slot","Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE): the stack in your hand drops out of your farthest door, a dead drop with no courier. From inside, out of the door you look at."]]},{"id":"e142","n":"Hive Evolution","s":"A brood of Slivers that share every trait the hive has learned, and a queen who is all of them at once.","c":"Magic: The Gathering","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Sliver Brood","sliver-brood","Five Slivers hatch beside you for a minute (up to 12 at once): 15 damage a bite, wearing every hive trait. With Variant, the brood comes back to you instead."],["Sliver Queen","sliver-queen","The Sliver Queen, as big as a cow, joins the brood for a minute: 33 damage a blow, and she wears every trait. The first each long rest is free."],["Component Mana","component-mana","Your nearest Sliver dissolves back into 1 CE, spraying 9 damage on the foes beside it."],["Maximum: Sliver Legion","maximum-sliver-legion","For 9 s every trait the hive knows is worn, and five more Slivers hatch. Afterwards the hive wears only two traits for 5 minutes."],["Hive Traits","hive-traits","The hive wears 6 traits at once (Technique Key 1 looks through them, Variant + Key 1 wears or takes off the one shown); every Sliver and the Queen share them all: Claw, +1d6 on a Sliver's first bite each round; Carapace, +2 armor; Swift, +20% speed; Sinew, +mastery on a Sliver's first bite each round; Flying, they leap at prey and take no fall damage; Venom, their bites poison; Reach, +1 block of bite reach; Regeneration, each heals 2 a round; Ward, holds, slows and weakness on them are halved; Double Strike, one extra bite a round for the hive; Leech, the hive's bites heal you once a round; Psionic, their bites pass armor; Diffusion, a Sliver's first area blow each round is lessened."],["The Hive Is Many","the-hive-is-many","While your brood is out, players on your team within 50 blocks of you or of a Sliver wear the hive's traits too: Carapace's armor, Swift's speed, Reach, Regeneration, Ward, Flying (no fall damage), Venom on their blows, Claw and Sinew (and Psionic) on their first blow each round, Double Strike's second blow, Leech and Diffusion. One hive at a time: the nearest caster's."],["Hive Mind","hive-mind","The brood shares one target: the foe you last struck, shot or were struck by."],["Adaptive Sliver","adaptive-sliver","When a Sliver or you take a kind of harm (2 CE, by itself, once every 3 s), the brood takes half from that kind for 3 s."],["Sliver Overlord","sliver-overlord","Six traits at once, Sliver Brood hatches five, and the first Sliver Queen each long rest is free."],["The First Hive","the-first-hive","Each pulse a Sliver forms beside each of up to 6 chosen foes and bites once for 27 damage with the hive's traits, then dissolves at the next pulse."],["Necrotic","necrotic","A Sliver that dies (not dissolved) ruptures: the nearest foe beside it takes 9 damage."],["Crystalline","crystalline","Once every 3 s, a blow on a Sliver moves to another Sliver within 1.5 blocks."],["Hibernation","hibernation","A Sliver caught in an explosion, lightning or a Domain's blow takes half and sleeps in the hive for 3 s, then returns where it was (a Sliver the halved blow kills stays dead)."]]},{"id":"e549","n":"Hourglass","s":"The Domain is the technique. Trap the battlefield inside an hourglass whose conditions judge everyone, then settle the Final Accounting.","c":"Original","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Sandfall","sandfall","A lash of sand at the foe you look at (18 blocks): 18 damage."],["Terms","terms","Name terms on the foe you look at (18 blocks): the first time in the next 3 s it charges about or strikes you, the sand judges it, 9 damage, no escape."],["Sandsense","sandsense","You feel time's grain: the sand left in your Hourglass shows as you fight."],["Turn Again","turn-again","When your Domain's sand runs out, if you have 10 CE the glass flips once: the Final Accounting falls twice."],["The Glass Remembers","the-glass-remembers","Your Domain costs 15 CE instead of 20."],["The Hourglass","the-hourglass","Five 3 ss of judgment. A chosen foe that keeps still earns a Grain; one that doesn't is judged for 18 damage. When the sand runs out, the Final Accounting: the foe with the fewest Grains takes 89 damage, and you regain 10 CE and health."],["Against the Grain","against-the-grain","Once a long rest, a blow that would kill you is unmade: the sand runs backward and you stand at 1 health."],["Pocket Glass","pocket-glass","Technique Key 1 (4 CE) traps the foe you look at in a personal hourglass for a minute: slowed, and the sand grinds it each 3 s for 9 damage (a strong will refuses)."]]},{"id":"e198","n":"House of Bats","s":"Every Echo is a placed sound on the map: a node you can swap to, hear through, and strike from.","c":"Mythology","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Shriek","shriek","A shriek where you look (18 blocks): 18 damage to every foe within 3 blocks of it, and an Echo stays there for a minute (up to 6). Each 3 s bats boil out of every Echo at up to 3 foes within 4.5 blocks: 9 damage each."],["Razor Swoop","razor-swoop","You fly up to 18 blocks down your look and cut the first foe in the way: 25 damage, and it can't react for 3 s. Begun within 3 blocks of an Echo, 9 damage more. A foe below a quarter of its health takes the blow twice over unless it endures."],["Ceiling of Wings","ceiling-of-wings","For a minute a swarm fills 12 blocks round where you stand: foes inside see only darkness, and a mote shows you every creature in it."],["Echo Swap","echo-swap","You're at the Echo nearest where you look, and your next weapon blow within 3 s comes from the sound: 9 damage more."],["House Where Dawn Was Tested","house-where-dawn-was-tested","The black cave answers every sound: every chosen foe is swarmed (36 damage) and blinded, and an Echo forms at one of them."],["Roost Walker","roost-walker","You climb walls like a roosting bat (sneak to cling still), and sneaking under a ceiling, you hang from it."],["Blood Echo","blood-echo","While any Echo stands, the House listens for you: a mote shows over every creature within 16 blocks."],["Silent Wing","silent-wing","A Razor Swoop that cuts nothing carries you on to an Echo within 18 blocks of where it ended; one that lands makes its prey lose you for a moment."],["Vanishing Wing","vanishing-wing","Once every 10 s, a blow that would land finds only an Echo (1 CE): you're at one within 9 blocks and it misses."]]},{"id":"e120","n":"Human Torch","s":"Flame On! A body of living fire: bolts, sculpted flame, plasma, flight, and the Supernova when the Heat runs full.","c":"Marvel","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Fire Bolt","fire-bolt","While aflame: a bolt of fire, 20 blocks, 18 damage (+1 Heat)."],["Fire Sculpting","fire-sculpting","A 5-block cone of flame, 36 damage (+1 Heat). Technique Key 1 (2 CE) shapes it into a 20-block line instead."],["Plasma Burst","plasma-burst","White flame where you look (30 blocks): everything within 6 blocks takes 66 damage (+2 Heat); sand there fuses to glass and ice melts."],["Flame On!","flame-on","A minute aflame: fire can't hurt you, foes that strike you burn (once every 3 s), and you fly. With Variant, vent 2 Heat instead (free)."],["Maximum: Supernova","maximum-supernova","At Heat 10 only: everything within 13 blocks takes 133 damage as you go nova, and the sand around you turns to glass. Heat drops to 0 and you're exhausted."],["Heat","heat","Every fire art raises Heat by 1 (Plasma Burst by 2), up to 10, and so does each 3 s aflame in fire or lava. Out of combat it cools by 1 every 3 s."],["Jet Flight","jet-flight","While aflame you fly, and sprinting leaves a burning trail."],["Superheated Body","superheated-body","At Heat 5+, your weapon blows add 9 fire damage and set the foe alight."],["Nova Instability","nova-instability","At Heat 10 your fire arts carry two more of their dice, but the heat burns you for 6% of your health every 3 s (Variant + Flame On vents 2 Heat)."],["Living Star","living-star","While aflame your Heat can't fall below 3, and you fly faster."],["Hotshot","hotshot","At Heat 5+, Fire Bolt flies as a focused lance: faster, 40 blocks, and through everything in its line."],["Skywriter","skywriter","Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE): a flame copy of you for 3 s; the first blow meant for you strikes it instead."],["Flame Cage","flame-cage","Variant + Fire Sculpting raises a ring of white-hot flame 3 blocks round you for a minute: a foe in its wall takes 27 fire damage once every 3 s."]]},{"id":"e189","n":"Hundred-Demon Revel","s":"Switch visible Oni Masks, red for force, blue for endurance, black for terror, and let the Revel of takedowns power physical dominance.","c":"Mythology","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Oni's Club","onis-club","The foe you look at (3 blocks): 22 damage, and 11 damage more for every Revel you spend (all of it)."],["Night Parade","night-parade","For a minute three oni silhouettes stand where you look (18 blocks). Once every 3 s the Oni's Club strikes a foe within 3 blocks of one, wherever you stand. A foe that walks into one scatters it; a kill, or a Mask swapped for a Revel, calls them all back."],["Dread Laugh","dread-laugh","With the feat, behind the Black Mask: the foe you look at (18 blocks) reels away from your laugh and stands cowed for 3 s (a strong will may hold)."],["Maximum: O-Oni","maximum-o-oni","For a minute you are the great oni: half again your size, 3 blocks more reach, a Revel every 3 s, and all three masks at once. The Mask you wore as you cast it rules the others, its gift doubled: Red blows 50% harder, Blue blows on you 40% softer, Black foes hitting 50% softer."],["Masks (Technique Key 1)","masks-technique-key-1","Red: your blows 25% harder. Blue: blows on you 25% softer, and you mend 6% of your health every 3 s. Black: foes within 4 blocks hit 25% softer. Swap once every 3 s, or anytime for 1 Revel."],["Revel","revel","Each kill gives a Revel (up to 6)."],["Kanabo Principle","kanabo-principle","Whatever you hold strikes like an iron club: your critical weapon blows hurl the foe 6 blocks."],["Red Horn","red-horn","Behind the Red Mask, once every 3 s a blow landed at a full run bowls the foe over (a strong one may keep its feet)."],["Dread Laugh","dread-laugh-2","The quick key laughs behind the Black Mask (1 CE)."],["Iron Skin","iron-skin","Behind the Blue Mask, once every 3 s: a foe's blow on an ally within 6 blocks lands on you instead, softened by the Mask."],["Parade Master","parade-master","Variant + Technique Key 1 steps into the nearest silhouette (it's spent): for 3 s you also wear the Mask you'd swap to next."]]},{"id":"e184","n":"Hundred-Handed Arsenal","s":"A pool of spectral hands, each committed to offense, defense or grappling, and none free for the others until you change your mind.","c":"Mythology","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Hundred Hands","hundred-hands","Offense: every free hand strikes the foe you look at (6 blocks), 7 damage each (up to 11). Grapple: the free hands pin it, half a second a hand up to 3 s (a strong foe less), from 12 blocks. Guard: the hands are busy guarding. Every hand used is gone for 3 s."],["Stone Barrage","stone-barrage","Up to 6 free hands throw a stone each at the foe you look at and those beside it (36 blocks), two at most at any one: 9 damage a stone, and 7 damage more on each foe struck."],["Briarean Barrage","briarean-barrage","With the feat: every free hand fuses into one massive fist on the foe you look at (18 blocks): 9 damage a hand (up to 98 damage), and it's knocked down unless it holds."],["Maximum: Three Hundred Stones","maximum-three-hundred-stones","Every hand hurls boulders at once: 18 stones rain down where you look (36 blocks), 18 damage each within 2 blocks, and the rubble slows whoever they strike. It needs a free hand and takes them all."],["The Hand Pool","the-hand-pool","11 hands. A hand given a job comes back after 3 s."],["Commitment (Technique Key 1)","commitment-technique-key-1","Offense: 3 blocks more reach while a hand is free, and a free hand adds 9 damage to each weapon blow. Guard: a free hand turns aside a fifth of a foe's blow, two hands two fifths of a heavy one. Grapple: the art pins."],["Fifty Heads, Hundred Tasks","fifty-heads-hundred-tasks","While a hand is free you work blocks from 6 blocks farther, and Grapple reaches 12 blocks."],["Titan-Burying Volley","titan-burying-volley","In Offense, once every 3 s, your weapon blow on a creature much larger than you spends 1 CE and 3 hands: stones bury it for 3 s unless it breaks out (the greatest are only slowed)."],["Catch the Sky","catch-the-sky","In Guard, once every 3 s a free hand may snatch a shot out of the air (about a third of the time)."],["Ambidexterity Is Meaningless","ambidexterity-is-meaningless","In Offense, a free hand guides each ally's first weapon blow every 3 s within 18 blocks of you: 9 damage more."],["Jailor of Titans","jailor-of-titans","Grapple pins two foes at once: the one you look at and the next nearest in reach."],["Briarean Barrage","briarean-barrage-2","The quick key fuses every free hand into one massive fist (3 CE)."]]},{"id":"e016","n":"Ice Formation","s":"Encasing cold that holds foes in visible ice, frozen ground, a rain of spikes, and a Maximum that shatters every shell at once.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Ice Creation","ice-creation","A 6-block cone of cold where you look: 66 damage, and the ice covers them, holding them for 1.5 s. With Variant it lays a path of ice instead, two blocks wide and 14 long the way you look, through the air if need be, for 20 s. Fire melts your ice: a burning foe is let go."],["Frost Calm","frost-calm","Freezing mist on a spot within 36 blocks: 62 damage to everything within 18 blocks, held by the ice for 1.5 s, and the ground stays frozen for 10 s: water skins over with ice, snow settles, and foes on it are slowed."],["Ice Fall","ice-fall","You drop to the ground for a second, and ice falls on every foe within 18 blocks: held by the ice, then the spikes, 118 damage."],["Shatter","shatter","Every foe your ice is holding (within 24 blocks) shatters with it: 111 damage through armor, and the ice is gone."],["Born of Winter","born-of-winter","Cold can't touch you: freezing (powder snow, frost) does you no harm, and the water you walk on freezes under you."],["Extreme Cold","extreme-cold","A foe held in your ice is worn down: its blows on you land 15% softer while it's held. Foes within 3 blocks of a shell of your ice are slowed."],["White Abyss","white-abyss","Winter declared as law: every foe it chose takes 89 cold damage every 3 s and is held by the ice for 1.5 s."],["Iceshape","iceshape","Ice Creation also forms a blade of ice in your hand: for 10 minutes your melee blows deal 7 damage more and slow the foe."],["Permafrost","permafrost","When your ice would let a foe go, its feet stay frozen: every hold lasts half a second longer."],["Frostbite","frostbite","The cold of your ice goes deeper: a held foe's blows land 30% softer instead of 15%, and it takes 7 damage every second it's held."]]},{"id":"e017","n":"Idle Transfiguration","s":"The soul has a shape, and he can touch it: reshaping touches, the creatures they leave behind turned to fight for you, a clone, fused souls, and a body of distorted killing.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Idle Transfiguration","idle-transfiguration","Lay a hand on the foe in reach (3 blocks): its soul is reshaped, 34 damage (more at 6th, 11th and 18th). A creature this kills goes into your stock (a player becomes a transfigured human)."],["Self-Alteration","self-alteration","Reshape your own body for a minute (up to 6 at once). Cast to grow the chosen part, cast again to drop it; Variant + cast chooses. Sword Arms (2 CE): bare hands deal 9 damage more. Spike Hands (2 CE): bare hands deal 8 damage more. Arm Shields (3 CE): 4 armor. Long Arms (3 CE): 3 blocks more reach. Horse Hooves (3 CE): 20% faster. Spiked Skin (4 CE): once every 3 s, a melee attacker takes 8 damage. Wings (4 CE): flight. Sword Arms and Spike Hands don't go together, and Wings don't go with either, Arm Shields or Long Arms."],["Body Clone","body-clone","A copy of you for a minute, wearing your face and your gear, fighting beside you (one at a time)."],["Soul Multiplicity","soul-multiplicity","Fuse two or more of your stock (up to 6; they're gone). Body Repel: a 24-block bolt, 45 damage and 9 damage more for each beyond two. Or (Technique Key 1) a Polymorphic Soul Isomer: a giant that fights for a minute, bigger and stronger for each soul in it."],["Release Transfigured","release-transfigured","A creature from your stock fights for you for 2 minutes (up to 3 at once, or a boss alone): the same creature, reshaped and loyal. It leaves nothing behind when it falls."],["Maximum: Spirit Body of Distorted Killing","maximum-spirit-body-of-distorted-killing","A minute as your own final work: blows land 40% lighter, and elbow blades add 20 damage to every melee blow."],["Idle Touch","idle-touch","Once every 3 s, your melee blow touches the soul: 7 damage more."],["Self-Embodiment of Perfection","self-embodiment-of-perfection","Every 3 s, every foe it chose has its soul touched twice over: 68 damage."],["Transfiguration Adept","transfiguration-adept","Release Transfigured calls two at a time, when your stock holds them."],["Remote Transfiguration","remote-transfiguration","A soul you've touched stays marked: with no foe in reach, Idle Transfiguration reshapes the marked foe nearest your sights from afar (within 24 blocks)."]]},{"id":"e515","n":"Illusive Mirage","s":"Curse creatures and make them see illusions: distorted faces, false bodies, false terrain, until the House of Mirrors makes the lie inescapable.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Cursed Illusion","cursed-illusion","The foe you look at (18 blocks) sees distorted faces: it reels and loses track of you, hits 40% softer for 6 s, and glows for a minute so it can't hide from you (a strong will may shake it off). From 6th, up to 5 foes near where you look at once (2 CE each beyond the first)."],["Phase Fist","phase-fist","Your next weapon blow strikes beside a false double: a sure critical."],["Illusive Terrain","illusive-terrain","For a minute, the ground 45 blocks around you lies: every foe in it is slowed to a crawl, and the creatures there lose track of you."],["Blurring","blurring","For 5 rounds your body smears on the eye: about a third of the blows aimed at you miss."],["Maximum: Absolute Perspective","maximum-absolute-perspective","With the feat: the foe you look at is fooled in every sense for a minute. Each 3 s it's blinded, reeling and weakened, and a harmful illusion bites it for 36 damage."],["House of Mirrors","house-of-mirrors","Every chosen creature falls under an illusion and turns on the nearest of its own for 3 s. Mirror's Spite: half the blows aimed at you find another foe instead."],["Funny Faces","funny-faces","A Cursed Illusion is so absurd that a strong will shakes it off far less often (2 CE more)."],["Maximum: Absolute Perspective","maximum-absolute-perspective-2","Gain the Maximum: one foe fooled in every sense for a minute."]]},{"id":"e272","n":"Inverse","s":"Damage above the threshold inverts down, damage below inverts up: a tank that punishes weak hits and shrugs off strong ones.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Inversion","inversion","A minute: every blow that reaches you is mirrored around your threshold. A blow bigger than it lands as far below it as it was above (never less than a quarter of itself); a smaller blow lands as far above it."],["Maximum: Antithesis","maximum-antithesis","A minute, while Inverse is on: every blow within your threshold sends half of itself back at whoever struck you (within 9 blocks), and a shot that does is turned around and flies home as yours."],["Extreme Opposites","extreme-opposites","While inverted, big blows land a quarter lighter still."],["Quick Inversion","quick-inversion","A blow above your threshold switches Inverse on by itself, before it lands (2 CE)."],["Inverted Senses","inverted-senses","Every chosen foe has a sense turned inside out: blinded, numbed (held 1.5 s), lost or sick, each fighting badly in its own way."],["Extreme Inverse","extreme-inverse","While inverted, a blow above your threshold lands lighter still by 27 damage, and a blow below it costs its striker 27 damage in return."],["Inverted Field","inverted-field","Technique Key 1 (6 CE): for a minute, teammates within 9 blocks take 20% less from blows."]]},{"id":"e119","n":"Invisible Force","s":"Invisibility, force screens, constructs, flight, the Absolute Sphere and the Event Horizon Shell.","c":"Marvel","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Force Shapes","force-shapes","A wall of force where you look (20 blocks) for a minute: it stops foes and their shots. With Variant, a 3x3 platform of hard light there instead. Either draws 10 Integrity. Technique Key 1 (2 CE) is a ram instead: 33 damage to the foe you look at, shoved back."],["Internal Bubble","internal-bubble","A field inside the chest of the foe you look at (18 blocks): 55 damage, and a sorcerer can't cast for 3 s."],["Flight","flight","Ten minutes: you fly on a bubble of force."],["Absolute Sphere","absolute-sphere","Seal the foe you look at (20 blocks) in a sphere of force: it can't move or act for 9 s (a nimble foe may slip it)."],["Invisibility","invisibility","Ten minutes: light bends around you and foes lose you. Attacking shows you until the next 3 s. Cast again to drop it. With Variant (3 CE) the ally you look at goes unseen instead, or every ally within 6 blocks."],["Maximum: Event Horizon Shell","maximum-event-horizon-shell","A 10-block sphere around you for a minute: shots from outside can't cross it, foes inside can't leave, and every 3 s it closes in, 55 damage to every foe at its edge."],["Force Screen","force-screen","An Integrity pool of 40 that refills slowly. Once every 3 s (1 CE), a blow that reaches you is caught on a panel: Integrity is spent to stop it. When the last of it goes, every wall and platform collapses and your technique burns out for 3 s."],["Unseen Architect","unseen-architect","Integrity doubles, and the first Force Screen each 3 s costs no CE."],["Hard-Light Step","hard-light-step","While you hold Integrity: no fall damage, no knockback, and sneaking as you fall lets you walk down the air (it drains Integrity)."],["Mother's Shield","mothers-shield","The Force Screen also catches a blow on an ally within 6 blocks (the same once every 3 s), and slides them 2 blocks clear of the attacker."],["Fine Control","fine-control","Variant + Technique Key 1 works the lever, button, door, trapdoor or gate you look at, up to 18 blocks away."]]},{"id":"e123","n":"Iron Sorcery","s":"Doom armor and gauntlet, arcane bolts, counterspells, Doombots, armor modules, the Time Platform and Castle Doom.","c":"Marvel","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Gauntlet","gauntlet","The armor's integrated gauntlet: a blast of force, 30 blocks, 18 damage."],["Arcane Bolt","arcane-bolt","A seeking bolt of sorcery at the foe you look at (30 blocks): 22 damage."],["Doombot","doombot","A Doombot decoy for a minute: it draws foes and fires its own gauntlet, 18 damage every 3 s (2 at a time)."],["Trap Scheme","trap-scheme","An arcane mine where you look (18 blocks): the first foe within 1.5 blocks of it takes 36 damage. It waits until a long rest; 6 at a time."],["Time Platform","time-platform","Once a long rest: you go back six seconds, to where you stood and the health you had (if it was more)."],["Maximum: Power Cosmic Theft","maximum-power-cosmic-theft","A minute: the next great blow against you (a tenth of your health or more) is caught and stolen. You take none of it, and it's fired back along a 30-block beam at twice the force."],["Doom Armor","doom-armor","Always worn: +6 armor and +2 toughness, and sealed: you never run out of air."],["Counterspell Scheme","counterspell-scheme","Once every 3 s (2 CE): a projectile that would hit you is unmade before it lands."],["Latverian Arsenal","latverian-arsenal","Two armor modules. Variant + Technique Key 1 swaps the older one for the next. Flight (you fly), Force Shield (once every 3 s a blow is cut by a third), Tractor Beam and Micro-Missiles (Technique Key 1, 2 CE: the foe you look at is pulled to you, or four seeking missiles, 9 damage each), Mystic Sensor (foes within 24 blocks glow, and you see in the dark)."],["Power Siphon","power-siphon","Each shot the Counterspell Scheme unmakes leaves a Siphon token (one at a time, for a minute): your next Gauntlet or Arcane Bolt adds 33 damage."],["Castle Doom","castle-doom","Every 3 s the castle runs one Scheme in turn: a gauntlet blast on every foe it chose (66 damage), binding them until the next pulse, or clearing every hostile shot from the air."],["Mystic Armor","mystic-armor","Below 11th, the Counterspell Scheme leaves a Siphon token too (1 CE more)."],["DOOM Does Not Beg","doom-does-not-beg","Once a minute, a blow from a player sorcerer is filed as intelligence: you learn their technique, and for a minute their blows land 15% softer on you."],["Hidden Doombot","hidden-doombot","Once a long rest, a blow that would kill you while a Doombot is out fells the Doombot instead: you were standing where it stood, at a third of your health."]]},{"id":"e055","n":"Jajanken","s":"An honest game: Rock charges a fist while you stand glowing, Paper throws it, Scissors cuts. You always say which one is coming. No Domain, only a vow that spends your future.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Rock","rock","Hold to charge (a charge every 0.75 s, 1 CE each, up to 6; you're glowing, half as fast and take 15% more), release: 26 damage per charge to the foe in front of you."],["Paper","paper","Conviction thrown 20 blocks: 27 damage."],["Scissors","scissors","An edge of aura (5 blocks): 27 damage to what's in front of you."],["Everything I Have","everything-i-have","Once a long rest, a minute: instant charges (still 1 CE each), free Paper and Scissors, and charging no longer slows or exposes you. Then your Cursed Energy empties and stays empty until a long rest."],["Forbidden Vow: The Future, Spent","forbidden-vow-the-future-spent","Cast twice to swear. A minute grown, as if at level 20: six instant charges, free arts, and 15% of Jajanken's blows land half again as hard. Then Jajanken leaves you for good."],["All-In Rock","all-in-rock","Six charges at once: 159 damage, the foe thrown 10 blocks and knocked down, and the ground cratered."],["Declared Aloud","declared-aloud","Every art announces itself, and Rock's chant comes a line a charge. While charging Rock you glow for all to see and take 15% more damage."],["Held Gambit","held-gambit","If a foe hits you or comes within 4 blocks while you're charging Rock, the punch releases into it at once."],["Crater","crater","Rock with 4+ charges also hits everything within 3 blocks of the target for half, knocks it down and craters the ground."],["Ground Slam","ground-slam","Rock with no foe in front of you slams the ground: everything within 5 blocks takes it and is knocked down."],["Aftershock","aftershock","A landed Rock drives on into the foe behind it for half (1 CE)."],["Signal Paper","signal-paper","Variant + Paper fires straight up: no damage, 1 CE less, a pillar of gold aura seen from far off for 5 s."],["Sunder","sunder","Scissors strips its foes' armor for 10 s, cuts the cobwebs in its arc and frees you and the allies in it from holds."],["Paper Mine","paper-mine","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): press a Paper charge into the ground where you look. The first foe to come near sets it off. Up to three."]]},{"id":"e109","n":"Judgement Cut","s":"An unbroken mind with a katana: Concentration builds with every clean cut, until space itself is severed.","c":"Video Games","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Judgement Cut","judgement-cut","Space is cut where you look (36 blocks): 44 damage within 6 blocks (a nimble foe may halve it), and 11 damage more on your marked foe. A rift opens there, a dark sphere full of cuts, and shatters like glass; leaves, plants and glass in it fall apart."],["Mirage Blades","mirage-blades","Summon 6 Mirage Blades, kept until a long rest. Each weapon blow spends one for 9 damage more; Technique Key 1 fires one, 16 damage, up to 36 blocks."],["Sin Devil Trigger","sin-devil-trigger","Once a long rest, for a minute: Devil Trigger's gifts and more. Blows land far softer on you, your blade bites 18 damage harder, a Trick each 3 s is free, and you gain Concentration each 3 s. At 10 Concentration it costs nothing."],["Doppelganger","doppelganger","For a minute a spectral double repeats your weapon blows and Judgement Cuts for half."],["Devil Trigger","devil-trigger","For a minute: flight, speed, blows land softer on you, you heal every 3 s, and your blade bites 9 damage harder."],["Judgement Cut End","judgement-cut-end","At 10 Concentration: everything within 24 blocks is cut, 111 damage (a nimble foe may halve it). Concentration falls to 5."],["Trick","trick","Vanish and reappear 12 blocks where you look (18 at 5+ Concentration), or beside your marked foe."],["Maximum: Dimensional Judgement","maximum-dimensional-judgement","A cut aimed at distance itself: a 108-block line where you look, 133 damage (a nimble foe may halve it)."],["Concentration","concentration","A weapon blow landed while unhurt for a second raises Concentration (up to 10); being hit drops it by 2. Each point makes your blows 2% harder. The last foe you struck is marked for 10 s."],["Focused Draw","focused-draw","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow draws 1 CE for 9 damage more."],["Motivated","motivated","Concentration holds 12; the first blow each 3 s doesn't shake it, and at 10 or more the first Judgement Cut each 3 s costs nothing."],["Rapid Slash","rapid-slash","Your first weapon blow within 2 s of a Trick also cleaves a second foe within 3 blocks for half."],["Perfect Sheathe","perfect-sheathe","A blow that drops a foe spends 2 Concentration on one perfect sheathe: foes within 3 blocks freeze for 3 s."],["Summoned Sword Master","summoned-sword-master","Variant + Technique Key 1 spends 2 Mirage Blades on a spinning guard: for 3 s shots land on you at half."],["Dark Slayer","dark-slayer","At full Concentration, once every 10 s a blow about to land meets only the air you left (1 CE): you Trick away."]]},{"id":"e040","n":"Kinetic Imbuement","s":"Convert the potential energy of inorganic matter into a deliberate kinetic release: loaded cards, a bound conduit, laced charges, and Fifty-Two Pickup.","c":"Marvel","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Loaded Toss","loaded-toss","Charge a piece of matter from your off-hand or hotbar: hold to load it (a Charge every 0.6 s, 1 CE each after the first, up to 5, and no more than its size holds: a token such as a button or nugget 1, small such as an ingot or gem 2, a block or ore 3, a storage block 4, obsidian or netherite 5). Thrown, it detonates on what it hits: 22 damage per Charge, a block and a half of blast per Charge."],["Cardsharp Barrage","cardsharp-barrage","A fan of 5 cards, one Charge each, thrown as one motion."],["Lace Charge","lace-charge","Plant a 2-Charge object where you look (36 blocks; up to 5 at once). Technique Key 1 detonates every laced Charge at once."],["Armed Ally","armed-ally","Needs the feat Armed Ally. Hand the teammate you look at (6 blocks) a charged piece of matter. It keeps its 2 Charges in their hands for a day, and goes off where they throw it: 44 damage."],["Bound Conduit","bound-conduit","Charge your weapon as a conduit: once every 3 s a weapon blow discharges, 22 damage in a small blast (1 CE). Press again to let it go."],["Maximum: Fifty-Two Pickup","maximum-fifty-two-pickup","The whole deck at once: charged cards rain across 10 blocks where you look, each a blast of 44 damage."],["Vector Discharge","vector-discharge","Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE): a small blast at your heels throws you the way you look."],["Kinetic Footwork","kinetic-footwork","Faster on your feet."],["Chain Reaction","chain-reaction","A blast sets off every charged thing lying in its reach, laced or not, each its own explosion (1 CE each)."],["Saboteur's Touch","saboteurs-touch","A weapon blow (1 CE) charges the foe's held weapon or worn armor, up to 6 foes for a minute. Technique Key 1 sets them off on their wearers: 44 damage each."],["Remote Charge","remote-charge","Lace Charge reaches 18 blocks, and 36 from 18th."],["Advanced Agility","advanced-agility","Faster still. A sprint carries you up the wall it runs into, and blasts hurt you half as much."],["House of the Loaded World","house-of-the-loaded-world","No blow when it lands: the debtors detonate themselves. Every 3 s, each foe it chose takes on a debt until the next. A foe holding something has a Loaded Hand: its next swing or shot blows up in its grip, 66 damage, and knocks what it held to the ground. Any other has a Loaded Floor: when it has moved 3 blocks the ground goes off under it, 66 damage, and it's thrown about 9 blocks and held a moment."],["Armed Ally","armed-ally-2","The art Armed Ally: a teammate carries one of your charges and throws it."],["Kinetic Catch","kinetic-catch","Once every 3 s, a shot about to hit you may be met by a flicked, charged card (2 CE): about half the time it's knocked out of the air."],["Royal Flush","royal-flush","Four cards of one Cardsharp Barrage on the same foe stun it for 3 s."]]},{"id":"e037","n":"Kinetic Transmission","s":"A ten-gear gearbox of stored momentum: gain Gears by moving and striking, then spend only what each Shift needs, braking, throwing, and finally redlining.","c":"Original","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Engage Transmission","engage-transmission","For a minute your body is a gearbox, starting at Gear 6: every 3 s, a Gear for moving 3 blocks (any way: falling and climbing count) and a Gear for landing a blow (three for both), up to 10."],["Suspended Interval","suspended-interval","Feat. Up to 6 shots within 6 blocks stop in the air; cast again to let them go along your look, as yours. With no shot near, the marked foe you look at is pinned 1.5 s."],["Archive: ZERO / TERMINAL GEAR","archive-zero-terminal-gear","Which Gear the Zugzwang Engine forces on its pulse."],["Impact Shift","impact-shift","Each tap sets one more Gear for your next blow (past what you hold, it resets). The blow spends those Gears and 1 CE: 13 damage per Gear, and the foe is pushed 3 blocks per Gear (a strong foe holds). Use it as often as you like. Variant + this key readies Burn Out (with Reverse Cursed Technique)."],["Maximum: Redline","maximum-redline","At Gear 10: your Gear is held at 10 for 6 rounds (18 s). Triple speed, you run up walls, nothing shoves you, you swing faster, and one Velocity Override every 3 s is free. When it ends you pay: 26 damage every 3 s for 3 rounds, through anything (never below half a heart), then Burnout. In the Zugzwang Engine it's free and costs nothing after."],["Acceleration Shift","acceleration-shift","Technique Key 1, engaged: two Gears for a burst of speed along your look, and falls don't hurt you for 3 s."],["Brake Shift","brake-shift","A blow that lands on you while engaged spends a Gear to brake it: 20 damage less, and nothing knocks you back while you hold Gears."],["Velocity Override","velocity-override","Your blows mark foes for a minute (up to 6). Variant + Technique Key 1 at a marked foe within 36 blocks spends 3 CE and the Gears you've set: it's thrown 6 blocks a Gear along your look, and a wall it hits deals 26 damage a Gear. Aim at its legs to Down-Shift instead: it's slowed for 3 s, and held there at 4 Gears or more. Once every 3 s."],["Perfect Transmission","perfect-transmission","Engaged, Strength and Dexterity +2 (and their caps +2), and once every 3 s an Impact Shift gives you a Gear back."],["Burn Out","burn-out","With Reverse Cursed Technique: Variant + the quick key (4 CE and every Gear) readies it for a minute. The next art a marked player casts within 36 blocks fails with its CE spent, their technique is out for 3 s, and they take 13 damage per Gear. A strong will holds: the art goes off and they take half. Readied at Gear 10, it stops a Domain as it opens (Dead Ignition), and they suffer its Burnout."],["Drive Die d12","drive-die-d12","Your Drive Die is a d12."],["Zugzwang Engine","zugzwang-engine","Open, centred where you open it. Inside, Redline is free and has no recoil, every foe counts as marked, and Velocity Override costs no CE. Each pulse forces a Gear: Zero Gear, 132 damage and held still 1.5 s (great foes only slowed); or Terminal Gear, 132 damage and thrown 36 blocks along your look, then 53 damage each time it swings or moves 3 blocks before the next pulse."],["Flywheel Counter","flywheel-counter","Engaged, once every 3 s a blow on you is spun into the flywheel (2 CE): it lands 86 damage softer and you gain 6 Gears."],["Vector Skip","vector-skip","Acceleration Shift skips instead (1 CE more): you blink 8 blocks along your look, and your next blow is an Impact Shift of every Gear set."],["Relativistic Break","relativistic-break","The Maximum again during Redline (10 CE): you cross 90 blocks along your look in an instant, and every foe on the line takes 55 damage. Then Redline ends, with its recoil."],["Suspended Interval","suspended-interval-2","Gives you the Suspended Interval art."]]},{"id":"e124","n":"Kryptonian","s":"Solar Body, heat vision, flight and super breath, Man of Steel, Solar Flare, Sun-Dipped and World of Cardboard.","c":"DC","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Super Strength","super-strength","A fist at the foe in front of you: 9 damage (11 damage in Solar Body; more with World of Cardboard and Sun-Dipped), knocking it far."],["Heat Vision","heat-vision","1 CE and 1 Charge: a 30-block line of heat from your eyes, 33 damage, and it burns: what it lands on catches fire, and ice and snow melt."],["Flight","flight","1 CE and 1 Charge: ten minutes of flight. While flying, Technique Key 1 is Super Breath (2 CE): a 10-block gust that blows foes away and puts out fires."],["Solar Flare","solar-flare","Spend all your Charge (at least 5): everything within 10 blocks takes 22 damage per Charge."],["World of Cardboard","world-of-cardboard","1 CE and 2 Charge, a minute: your fists hit 22 damage harder."],["Sun-Dipped","sun-dipped","+5 Charge, a minute: fast flight, blows barely touch you, your attacks deal 33 damage more, and you heal every 3 s."],["Solar Body","solar-body","1 CE and 1 Charge, a minute: blows land far softer on you, your bare fists hit 11 damage, and you jump much higher."],["Maximum: World of Cardboard","maximum-world-of-cardboard","The day he stops holding back: one blow where you look and a 10-block shockwave, 26 damage per Charge (all of it)."],["Solar Charge","solar-charge","Up to 15 Charge. You gain 1 every 10 s under the open daytime sky; each morning you start with at least 5."],["Man of Steel","man-of-steel","Once every 3 s (1 CE and 1 Charge), a heavy blow is halved."],["Last Son","last-son","Once a long rest, a blow that would kill you leaves you at half a heart instead (2 CE)."],["Super Senses","super-senses","You see in the dark, and every foe within 24 blocks shows through walls."],["Sun-Drinker","sun-drinker","Fire is income, not harm: burning can't take hold of you, lava scorches you less, and the first fire to touch you each 3 s banks 1 Charge."],["Faster Than a Bullet","faster-than-a-bullet","Once every 3 s (1 CE), a blow on an ally within 6 blocks: you're at their side and take it instead, halved while your Solar Body burns."],["Hope","hope","Variant + Solar Body (1 CE + 1 Charge): every ally within 9 blocks sheds blindness, darkness, nausea and weakness, and stands firm for 3 s."],["Freeze Breath","freeze-breath","Super Breath learns winter: foes in the heart of the gust are frozen in place for 3 s and take 27 damage, and water in its path freezes over."]]},{"id":"e556","n":"Last Rites","s":"Perform the funeral before the death: wash, dress, close the eyes, speak the words, and the body follows the ceremony.","c":"Original","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Next Rite","next-rite","The next rite on the foe you look at (any skipped rite is performed with it): the Dressing, its armor falls away; the Closing of the Eyes, it's blinded; the Words, 111 damage, but a foe 10 levels under you, or 5 to 9 under and already low (half its health at 5, more as the gap grows), player or creature but never a boss, dies (5 CE more for the Words)."],["The Pall","the-pall","A funeral pall 6 blocks around where you look, for a minute: foes inside are blinded."],["The Washing","the-washing","The foe you look at (18 blocks) is Prepared for a minute: every hit on it takes 5 damage more."],["The Wake","the-wake","Every chosen foe receives its next rite, and those who have had all three hear the Words."],["Eulogy","eulogy","Technique Key 1 (2 CE): the same hands, turned to keeping. The player you look at (9 blocks), or you, mends."]]},{"id":"e165","n":"Leeds Infernal","s":"Build Pursuit by running down fleeing prey, then spend it on dive-bombs, horn launches and impossible aerial strikes.","c":"Cryptids","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Dive Bomb","dive-bomb","You hurl yourself at the foe you look at (12 blocks): 18 damage, and 9 damage more for every Pursuit you spend (all of it)."],["Marked Quarry","marked-quarry","Mark the foe you look at (36 blocks) for a minute: each 3 s it pulls 6 blocks or more farther from you, you gain 2 Pursuit. Free on a foe you struck in the last 3 s."],["Devil's Cry","devils-cry","The shriek of the Pine Barrens: a 18-block cone where you look (36 as the Devil). What can't steel itself is frightened for 6 s."],["Horn Toss","horn-toss","1 Pursuit: your next blow launches its target into the air (a strong foe holds)."],["Maximum: The Leeds Devil Takes Flight","maximum-the-leeds-devil-takes-flight","For a minute you grow huge and winged: swift flight, Pursuit up to 12, and two more every 3 s."],["Pine Barrens Predator","pine-barrens-predator","You glide (falls are slow unless you sneak). Pursuit (up to 12) builds as you run, fall and strike on the move; standing still for 3 s lets it cool away."],["True Flight","true-flight","You fly. Dive Rake: a Dive Bomb knocks the foe flat and frightens it (a strong foe may hold)."],["Roofline Hunter","roofline-hunter","Walls become roads: you cling to and run up them."],["Hellish Whinny","hellish-whinny","A foe Devil's Cry frightens betrays itself: it glows for a minute, through walls."],["Broken-Bridle Pursuit","broken-bridle-pursuit","Held, slowed or snared, the hunger only sharpens: gain 2 Pursuit when it takes hold."]]},{"id":"e018","n":"Limitless","s":"Infinity, Blue, Red, Hollow Purple and Unlimited Void: the Gojo clan's spatial inheritance, famously half a technique without the Six Eyes to run it.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Lapse Blue","lapse-blue","Hold to pour 1–6 CE: a sphere of Blue rolls 30 blocks toward where you look, through walls, dragging in everything within 1 block per CE and crushing it for 71 damage (at full pour) every 1.5 s. Hold a second past full for Maximum Output: it stays a minute, following your aim (scroll to set how far out it hangs, 2 to 30 blocks), crushing for 13 damage every 1.5 s. The chant runs as you hold: Phase, daybreak, arms of compassion."],["Reversal Red","reversal-red","Hold to pour (2 CE a step, up to 6 steps): a red point flies 12 blocks; the first foe it meets takes 89 damage (at full pour) and is flung 4 blocks per step. If it hits a wall first, the distance it didn't get to travel hits it again. Hold a second past full for Maximum Output: flung twice as far. The chant runs as you hold: Phase, twilight, eyes of wisdom."],["Infinity","infinity","Raise Infinity (1 CE, then 3 CE a second to keep it, or 1 CE every 6 s with the Six Eyes). Each attack that reaches you has a 100% chance never to arrive (bosses' and sorcerers' 95%); projectiles slow to a stop at its edge. A harmful effect or a shove someone else lays on you gets the same chance, and nobody you could harm can come within 1 block of you. A Domain's sure-hit passes through. Press again to drop it (or, with the Six Eyes, to spend 6 CE on Automatic Infinity first: every attack stops, at 1 CE a second)."],["Hollow Purple","hollow-purple","Press once to draw Blue and Red apart (free; you're slowed), press again within 6 s to let them meet: a slow sphere of imaginary mass rolls 60 blocks over 8 s, erasing everything it passes, 265 damage every half second to all inside it, through armor. What it catches is dragged along. Or hold the key through the chant (2 s; let go early and it's only drawn): 200% Hollow Purple, half again as wide, rolling twice as far (120 blocks), 529 damage every half second."],["What Infinity can't stop","what-infinity-cant-stop","A Domain's sure-hit, poison already in you, falling, fire and lava, starving, being teleported, what you do to yourself, and anything that isn't an attack."],["Teleport","teleport","Technique Key 1: Blue's logic applied to yourself. Blink toward where you look, 2 blocks per CE (up to 6 CE)."],["Delayed Purple","delayed-purple","Fire Red into your own held Blue: it detonates at the Blue for Red's cost plus 10 CE, one blow to everything within 8 blocks: 972 damage, through armor."],["Automatic Infinity","automatic-infinity","With the Six Eyes, Infinity rises on its own the first time you're hit with it down (once every 3 s, 1 CE)."],["The Filter Completes","the-filter-completes","Infinity stops every attack except bosses' and other sorcerers'."],["Unlimited Void","unlimited-void","Everything at once, with no filter. Every 3 s, each foe it chose that isn't touching you takes 107 damage and stands paralyzed, unable to move or act, until the next one (a full minute from the first; bosses shake it off sooner)."],["Offensive Infinity","offensive-infinity","The wall that refuses becomes the wall that crushes: while Infinity is up, a foe pressed against it takes 41 damage, is thrown back, and if a wall is behind it, it's pinned there for a second (once every 3 s per foe). Walls and ceilings the field presses on crack and break as they would under an iron pickaxe; sneak to spare them."],["Spatial Skirmishing","spatial-skirmishing","Once every 3 s, a melee blow carries Blue (1 CE): it lands as a critical and the foe is pulled in and held for half a second. Every other one carries Red instead: the foe is thrown back."]]},{"id":"e051","n":"Living Circuit","s":"Run your body as a circuit of lightning: Godspeed's Whirlwind sidesteps blows, Speed of Lightning outruns them, and every flash stuns.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Lightning Step","lightning-step","With Godspeed on: flash 5 blocks along your look (9 in Speed of Lightning, cutting through foes for 18 damage at most once a second). It stops at walls."],["Speed of Lightning","speed-of-lightning","With Godspeed on: switch between Whirlwind and Speed of Lightning."],["Thunderbolt","thunderbolt","A bolt falls where you look (18 blocks): 45 damage within 2 blocks. With the feat Thunderclap, Variant makes it a flash instead: no harm, but every foe within 9 blocks is blinded for 3 s."],["The Storm, Perfected","the-storm-perfected","Once a long rest, for a minute: no upkeep, Whirlwind and Speed of Lightning at once, and more speed still. You're exhausted after."],["Godspeed","godspeed","Throw the circuit on (Whirlwind): 1 CE every 6 s keeps it running, and nothing while you stand within 5 blocks of a source of current (powered redstone, a redstone block, a lightning rod or a lit lamp). Lightning lands at half on you while it runs. Cast again to drop it."],["Maximum: Storm's Verdict","maximum-storms-verdict","Become the bolt: dash 6 blocks along your look through everything in the way: 71 damage and stunned 2 s (a strong foe keeps its feet)."],["Whirlwind","whirlwind","While Godspeed runs: 60% faster at running, swinging and mining, and one attack in three misses as you sidestep it."],["Speed of Lightning","speed-of-lightning-2","130% faster (200% Perfected); your weapon blows crackle for 18 damage more (three times a second at most), and once every 3 s one stuns its foe 3 s."],["Counter-Program","counter-program","When Whirlwind makes a blow miss, you flash to the attacker and strike back for 18 damage (once every 3 s)."],["Arc Discharge","arc-discharge","Your lightning arcs to a second foe within 4 blocks for half."],["Thunderhead","thunderhead","Storm's Judgment: a free Thunderbolt falls on every chosen foe, and inside it your lightning can't be shrugged off: your stuns hold even a strong foe."],["Static Sense","static-sense","While Godspeed runs you read the room by its charge: you see a spark on every living creature within 16 blocks."],["Programmed Fall","programmed-fall","Whirlwind's orders include the ground: while Godspeed runs, falling never hurts you."],["Ground Wire","ground-wire","Godspeed on or off, the current is yours: lightning about to strike you or an ally within 4.5 blocks grounds through you harmlessly, and whatever sent it glows for you 5 s."],["Thunderclap","thunderclap","Thunderbolt can be called as a flash (Variant): no harm, but every foe within 9 blocks is blinded for 3 s."],["Dead-Man's Program","dead-mans-program","When a blow drops you below a fifth of your health in Godspeed, you flash 6 blocks away from the nearest foe (once a minute)."]]},{"id":"e538","n":"Living Lightning","s":"The Word, the wisdom of Solomon, the strength of Hercules, the power of Zeus, the speed of Mercury and the courage of Achilles.","c":"DC","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Champion's Fist","champions-fist","Champion only: a lightning fist at the foe in front of you, 25 damage (44 damage as the Living Lightning)."],["Power of Zeus","power-of-zeus","Champion only, once a transformation: lightning down a 30-block line, 66 damage. As the Living Lightning, Variant + this, once in the minute, is the discharge: 89 damage to every foe within 18 blocks."],["The Word","the-word","\"SHAZAM!\" Lightning strikes you and you're the Champion for ten minutes: far stronger, lightning can't hurt you, and your fists crackle. Speak it again (free) to turn back."],["Maximum: The Living Lightning","maximum-the-living-lightning","A minute: you are the bolt, not the boy. Technique Key 1 crosses up to 100 blocks where you look in a flash; your fists hit 44 damage; and once every 3 s, Variant + Technique Key 1 to call lightning where you look, 66 damage within 6 blocks."],["Wisdom of Solomon","wisdom-of-solomon","Once a long rest, nausea or darkness on you breaks at once."],["Strength of Hercules, Stamina of Atlas","strength-of-hercules-stamina-of-atlas","Champion only: your fists hit harder, and becoming the Champion gives you temporary health (your level and proficiency)."],["Speed of Mercury","speed-of-mercury","Champion only: you fly, and you're much faster."],["Courage of Achilles","courage-of-achilles","Champion only: you can't be frightened, and transforming frees allies within 9 blocks of fear. Once a long rest, a blow that would kill you leaves you at half a heart, still the Champion."],["Lightning Rod","lightning-rod","As the Champion, once every 3 s you may catch a shot that would hit you (1 CE, about a third of the time) and hurl it back as lightning: 22 damage to the nearest foe within 40 blocks."],["Seven Thrones","seven-thrones","Technique Key 1 calls one patron for 3 s (1 CE); Variant + Technique Key 1 picks which. Solomon clears nausea, blindness, darkness, slowness and weakness; Hercules adds a die to your fists; Atlas halves weapon and shot blows; Zeus adds a die to your next bolt; Achilles gives temporary health; Mercury doubles your speed."],["Wisdom's Price","wisdoms-price","As the Champion, a hold on you breaks at once, but the Word spends itself and you turn back."],["The Family Shares","the-family-shares","Variant + Champion's Fist on an ally within 4 blocks (3 CE, Champion or not): for a minute their bare fists hit 16 damage and lightning can't hurt them."]]},{"id":"e167","n":"Long Step Procession","s":"Turn distance into a resource: uncanny strides make Steps that dodge blows, bridge gaps, and leave glowing processions behind.","c":"Cryptids","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Stilt Kick","stilt-kick","A kick from far too high (3 blocks, 6 holding a Step): 18 damage and a shove. Spend a Step to knock the foe down 2 s too (a strong foe keeps its feet). Once every 3 s, a bare-handed blow holding a Step does it for 1 CE: a shove of 6 blocks and, unless it holds, the foe is knocked flat."],["Procession Path","procession-path","2 Steps, after walking 12 blocks this 3 s: the ground you crossed glows for 10 s. Allies on it are quick; foes on it are slowed, take 14 damage the first time they cross, and are knocked flat unless they hold."],["Echo Swap","echo-swap","2 Steps: trade places with the Echo nearest your look, up to 36 blocks away."],["Long Stride","long-stride","1 Step: one impossible stride, 6 blocks along your look, through creatures and over a low wall."],["Impossible Stride","impossible-stride","Every 6 blocks walked earn a Step (up to 6, two every 3 s); two rounds standing still and they fade. Holding a Step, you step over full blocks and your reach is 6 blocks."],["Between the Frames","between-the-frames","Once every 3 s, a blow on you can be stepped out of (2 Steps, 1 CE): you're 6 blocks to the side, and the blow lands on a frame you've left."],["Processional Echoes","processional-echoes","Walk 18 blocks in a 3 s and up to 6 Echoes stand where you were, for a 3 s. While one stands, a blow from more than 6 blocks away misses 1 time in 4, and once every 3 s a miss swaps you with an Echo for free."],["Footage That Should Not Exist","footage-that-should-not-exist","Every chosen foe leaves a frame where it stood, and at each pulse is snapped back to its last frame, unable to react for 1.5 s. Only where it stands rewinds: never its health."],["Tall Enough","tall-enough","Your jumps go twice as high."],["Walk Behind the Camera","walk-behind-the-camera","Holding 2 or more Steps in dim light, the procession vanishes: you're unseen, and creatures lose interest."],["Friendly Procession","friendly-procession","Variant + Long Stride, with an ally on your Path within 9 blocks: you fall in step just behind them, no Step spent."],["Dropped Frame","dropped-frame","A blow that misses you through an Echo gives you a Step."]]},{"id":"e019","n":"Love Rendezvous","s":"The Southern Cross: stars that draw their bearers together, and an order nobody can skip to reach you.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Southern Cross","southern-cross","Set the chosen star (Technique Key 1 picks it) on the foe you look at (20 blocks), up to 10 a star, or, holding Variant, on the spot you look at. You always bear Acrux."],["Maximum: Rendezvous","maximum-rendezvous","Every star's bearers are hurled into each other at once, from anywhere within 20 blocks."],["The Southern Cross","the-southern-cross","The stars by distance: Imai, Acrux, Mimosa, Ginan, Gacrux. Bearers of the same star within 8 blocks are drawn together (the one with more cursed energy pulls) and collide, each hurt by the other's size. A bearer can only approach the next star in the order; any other star within 3 blocks pushes it away. You bear Acrux: only an Imai bearer can reach you."],["Effective Marking","effective-marking","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow sets the chosen star on its target for free."],["Gravity","gravity","Collisions ignore armor."],["Universal Force","universal-force","Collisions become pure force: half again as hard."],["Star Crossed Lovers","star-crossed-lovers","Every chosen foe is given your chosen star, whatever a star can usually hold, and its bearers are hurled into each other. One alone is slammed down for 22 damage."],["Lodestar","lodestar","You become the brightest star: after every collision, its bearers are dragged toward you."],["Comet Reactions","comet-reactions","Once every 10 s, a blow from a marked foe is slipped (1 CE)."],["Repelling Forces","repelling-forces","When stars collide, every other marked foe within 6 blocks of the impact is hurled away."],["Collapsing Stars","collapsing-stars","A foe that has borne all four of the other stars collapses at its next collision: 115 damage, and its marks are spent."]]},{"id":"e291","n":"Magnetic Manipulation","s":"Polarize, Attraction and Repulsion, magnetic flight, induction bolts, field deflection, the railgun and Iron Requiem.","c":"Marvel","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Attraction / Repulsion","attraction-repulsion","Every foe within 6 blocks of where you look is pulled to that point. Hold Variant for Repulsion: every foe within 6 blocks of you is thrown away. Polarized foes answer from anywhere within 20 blocks, and opposite charges that meet slam together for 22 damage each."],["Induction Bolt","induction-bolt","A bolt of current, 20 blocks: 22 damage (11 damage more on a polarized foe)."],["Polarity Field","polarity-field","For a minute, a 5-block field around you: hostile shots that enter it are torn apart, every foe in it is polarized, and loose metal drifts to your hand."],["Railgun","railgun","A slug driven down a 40-block line by the field: 66 damage to everything on it. Carry an iron nugget or ingot and it's the slug: 22 damage more (33 damage for an ingot), and it's spent."],["Field Compression","field-compression","The polarized foe you look at (20 blocks) is squeezed: 18 damage, held 3 s. A foe wearing metal can't resist; any other may."],["Polarize","polarize","Mark the foe you look at (20 blocks) with a polarity for a minute, + and − in turn (up to 7 marks). Marks are magnets: within 5 blocks of each other, opposites are hauled together and slam for 22 damage each, and like charges are flung apart."],["Maximum: Iron Requiem","maximum-iron-requiem","Every foe within 40 blocks takes the mark at once, and is drawn together where you look and crushed, 89 damage each."],["Signature","signature","Variant + Polarize tells you where every mark is: how far and which way."],["Magnetic Flight","magnetic-flight","You fly on the planet's field."],["Electromagnetic Perception","electromagnetic-perception","Every foe within 18 blocks glows: you see their current through walls and smoke."],["Field Deflection","field-deflection","Once every 3 s (1 CE): a shot that would hit you is turned aside, and, for 1 CE more, sent back."],["The Master's Field","the-masters-field","Every chosen foe takes the mark, and each pulse 66 damage: it's drawn toward the Domain's heart and held until the next pulse."],["Polar Cage","polar-cage","Field Compression holds 3 s instead (1 CE more)."],["Blood Iron","blood-iron","Field Compression also blinds a living foe for 3 s (1 CE more)."],["Debris Throne","debris-throne","While you're airborne, orbiting scrap shields you: 4 more armor, and shots land a quarter softer."]]},{"id":"e202","n":"Man-Eater's Ballistics","s":"A finite tail magazine: fire specialised quills at range, then close with the lion's maw to reload. Volley, feed, disengage.","c":"Mythology","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Quill Volley","quill-volley","Three spines (or what you have) fly where you look (48 blocks): 14 damage each, and poison. A quill stays in the foe for 10 s (up to three), each one slowing it, and carries the tail's payload (Technique Key 1): Barbed (slowed more) or Heavy (thrown back); or, for 2 Spines a quill, Venom (a deep poison), Screamer (it can't answer blows for 3 s) or Tether (it can't go more than 9 blocks from where it was struck for 6 s). A quill that strikes a wall glances off it once."],["Rattle the Barbs","rattle-the-barbs","Every foe with a quill of yours in it, within 48 blocks, is held for 1.5 s unless it resists."],["Lion's Maw","lions-maw","A bite on the foe you look at (3.5 blocks): 22 damage, you heal a little, and 2 Spines regrow. With Variant you worry it instead: no Spines, and a foe with a quill in it flees for 3 s unless it resists."],["Maximum: The Sky Black With Quills","maximum-the-sky-black-with-quills","Every spine at once (six at least) rains out of the sky where you look, on every foe within 18 blocks: 61 damage, three quills and no answering blows for 3 s, or 20 damage and one quill if it resists. 6 quills stand in the ground for a minute and stick the first foe to step on them."],["Tail Magazine","tail-magazine","Your tail holds 10 Spines. One regrows every 4 s; the lion's maw reloads faster."],["Quill Catcher","quill-catcher","Once every 3 s, a shot that would hit you may be snatched out of the air (about a third of the time), loaded as a Spine, and a quill flies back at whoever shot it for 14 damage."],["Scorpion Tail","scorpion-tail","Lion's Maw spends a Spine to bite with venom: 7 damage more, and the foe is envenomed."],["Hunter's Mouth","hunters-mouth","Lion's Maw on a foe at death's door (under a quarter of its health) or one that is held regrows a third Spine."],["Compound Payload","compound-payload","Variant + Quill Volley, 2 Spines a quill: each quill carries your payload and the next one after it."]]},{"id":"e127","n":"Martian","s":"Shapeshifting, Solid and Light density, phasing, telepathy, the True Martian form and Psychic Communion.","c":"DC","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Martian Strike","martian-strike","A blow at the foe in front of you: in Solid form 20 damage (and once every 3 s, 9 damage more); in Light form 11 damage."],["Phase","phase","For 3 s nothing solid can touch you (only shots can), you can't be seen and creatures lose track of you, and you can't strike. Every ally within 2 blocks phases with you."],["Mind Link","mind-link","A minute: you read the surface thoughts of the foe you look at (30 blocks; a resolve check). It's weakened, and its blows land a quarter softer on you."],["Deep Telepathy","deep-telepathy","Psychic intrusion: the foe you look at is stunned for 3 s (a resolve check)."],["True Martian","true-martian","A minute in your true shape, a head taller: you fly fast, your strikes deal 22 damage more, and density changes cost nothing."],["Maximum: Psychic Communion","maximum-psychic-communion","Every foe within 30 blocks is linked to your mind: 111 damage (a resolve check halves it), and for 3 s you know everything each one intends: they're weakened and their blows land softer."],["Shapeshift","shapeshift","Solid form: heavy fists, and you can't be knocked back."],["Light Density","light-density","Technique Key 1: Light form. You fly, fall gently and move a quarter faster, but hit lighter."],["Selective Phasing","selective-phasing","Once every 3 s (2 CE): a blow that would land passes through you."],["Ghost","ghost","While Phased, one hand can solidify for a single Martian Strike without ending the Phase."],["Detective Mind","detective-mind","While you hold a foe's thoughts through Mind Link, you read its intent: once every 3 s, its blow on you is sidestepped."]]},{"id":"e129","n":"Mind Sculptor","s":"Read surface thoughts, fill the field with illusory doubles, send summons home, and mill an enemy's mind until it breaks.","c":"Magic: The Gathering","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Psychic Spike","psychic-spike","The foe you look at (20 blocks): 18 damage, and its mind is read. Its blows on you land softer for 3 s (a sharp mind isn't read). +1 Thought when it is."],["Unsummon","unsummon","A lesser foe you look at (not a great one, not a player) is sent away: it lands 25 to 40 blocks off, dazed (a strong will resists)."],["Memory Mill","memory-mill","1 Thought: the foe you look at forgets how to shoot for a minute. Its arrows, fireballs and spit dissolve as they leave it (a sharp mind resists)."],["Thoughtseize","thoughtseize","The foe you look at loses its best ideas: it hits far softer for a minute. +1 Thought. A sorcerer's arts are named to you, and for 6 s every art they cast costs 2 CE more."],["Perfect Illusion","perfect-illusion","A room that isn't there, 4.5 blocks around where you look, for 10 minutes: foes in it hesitate at every step (slowed). One at a time."],["Illusory Doubles","illusory-doubles","A minute: 6 illusory doubles. Once every 3 s, a blow on you may strike a double instead (it shatters)."],["Maximum: Mindbreak","maximum-mindbreak","6 Thought: the foe you look at takes 111 damage and is stunned for 3 s (a sharp mind halves it and keeps its wits)."],["Thought","thought","You hold up to 12 Thought, gained whenever a foe's mind fails against you."],["Mind Palace","mind-palace","Your focus is hard to break: nausea, blindness and darkness can't take hold of you."],["Living Guildpact","living-guildpact","Thought holds 12, and the first Thought you spend each 3 s is free."],["Infinite Library","infinite-library","Each pulse the library reads one chosen foe: if its mind gives way you gain a Thought and a Page on it, and its next blow before the next pulse is foreseen, landing at half on you or an ally."],["Mental Fortress","mental-fortress","Once every 3 s, a foe whose mind you've read that hurts you gives you 1 Thought."],["Unraveler","unraveler","Unsummon with no creature where you look unmakes the conjured blocks within 3 blocks of that spot."],["False Memory","false-memory","A mind you've read within the minute resists you only half as well."]]},{"id":"e275","n":"Missile Fist","s":"Giant cursed-energy fists, grappling barrages and a crushing Maximum: ranged martial volume turned into calamity artillery.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Missile Impact","missile-impact","Two giant fists of cursed energy hurled at the foe you look at (27 blocks): 42 damage for the first on each foe, 42 damage for each after. Hold to pour CE in: a fist more per CE (up to 5), the Devastating Barrage."],["Unrelenting Fury","unrelenting-fury","A 9-block cone of fists: every foe in it takes 53 damage (a strong one may halve it) and is knocked down."],["Armored Missile Fist","armored-missile-fist","With the feat: a minute with the fists worn as gauntlets, 4 armor more, a longer reach, and 36 damage on your weapon blows (up to three times a second)."],["Maximum: Brutal Bombardment","maximum-brutal-bombardment","A wave of fists on one foe within 15 blocks, then the crush: 205 damage, knocked down, the ground under it caved in, and everything near it takes the wave too."],["Devastating Barrage","devastating-barrage","Technique Key 1: grappling fists. They deal no damage but seize the foe (1.5 s; a strong one may break free), and a seized foe struck again is pinned (3 s)."],["Unrelenting Ring of Spirit","unrelenting-ring-of-spirit","Giant fists fall on every chosen foe: 71 damage and knocked down. Inside, Missile Impact costs nothing."],["Exploding Fighting Spirit","exploding-fighting-spirit","A landed fist bursts against everything within 1.5 blocks of it (16 damage), up to 6 times every 3 s."],["Armored Missile Fist","armored-missile-fist-2","Unlocks the quick key: the fists worn as gauntlets."],["Titan's Grasp","titans-grasp","Once every 3 s, a heavy blow on you meets a fist thrown in its way (3 CE): it's reduced by 42 damage."]]},{"id":"e292","n":"Mister Fantastic","s":"A rubber body with long reach, wraps and holds, reshaped limbs, Colossus Coil and the Infinite Coil.","c":"Marvel","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Elastic Strike","elastic-strike","Your fist stretches 5 blocks at the foe you look at: 16 damage, plus 9 damage per Stretch (mallet fists hit 25 damage; whip-limbs reach 10 and the foe can't react for a moment)."],["Wrap & Hold","wrap-hold","Wrap a foe within reach: held fast for 3 s (a strong one may break free), and you gain 1 Stretch."],["Colossus Coil","colossus-coil","Coil around up to 6 foes within reach: held, and each takes 27 damage every 3 s for three."],["Maximum: Infinite Coil","maximum-infinite-coil","A minute: your body unfurls into a 20-block web of bands where you look. Foes in it are held each 3 s (a strong one may break free) and squeezed for 27 damage."],["Rubber Body","rubber-body","Blows from foes land softer, and your reach is longer."],["Stretch","stretch","Wraps and soaked blows wind it; 3 s with neither unwinds 1. At Stretch 5+ your holds can't be broken and you reach a block farther. At Stretch 10 every foe you hold is squeezed each 3 s, but blows on you land 20% harder. Variant + Elastic Strike releases 2 (free)."],["Contortionist","contortionist","A hold on you slips off within half a second."],["Living Shield","living-shield","Once every 3 s (2 CE), a blow on an ally within 4.5 blocks lands at half as you wrap them."],["Apex Plasticity","apex-plasticity","Stretch never falls below 3."],["Kinetic Soak","kinetic-soak","A blow that lands on you is reduced by 7 damage more, and feeds 1 Stretch (once every 3 s)."],["Malleable Arsenal","malleable-arsenal","Technique Key 1 (1 CE, a minute): mallet fists, whip-limbs or a parachute (no fall damage, a slow glide), in turn."],["Soak & Rebound","soak-rebound","The damage a blow did to you is added to your next Elastic Strike (up to your level)."],["Snapback","snapback","A foe that breaks your Wrap takes 18 damage as the limb snaps back, and you try the hold once more."],["Reed's Calculus","reeds-calculus","Variant + Technique Key 1 (6 times a long rest): the creature you look at is analyzed, its health and armor in chat, and your next blow on it within 3 s hits 25% harder."],["Elastic Rebound","elastic-rebound","Once every 3 s, a shot that hits you meets a catching membrane (2 CE): it lands much softer."]]},{"id":"e276","n":"Moon Dregs","s":"A lunar jellyfish shikigami carrying escalating poisons, battlefield cover, and a neurotoxin Maximum.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Lunar Jellyfish","lunar-jellyfish","Moon Dregs drifts beside you for 8 hours, stinging the foes near it each 3 s: 41 damage (free the first time each long rest, then 5 CE). It can be struck down."],["Poison Jar","poison-jar","With the feat: milk Moon Dregs' venom onto your weapon. Your next 3 weapon blows within a minute add 14 damage and envenom."],["Maximum: Neurotoxin","maximum-neurotoxin","Moon Dregs bursts a cloud of neurotoxin: everything within 9 blocks of it takes 41 damage poison and is paralyzed 3 s (a hardy foe may halve it and stay free)."],["Noxious Poison","noxious-poison","Its stings poison and weaken what they touch (they hit 15% softer for a minute)."],["Cleansing of Purity","cleansing-of-purity","Moon Dregs stings three times as hard."],["Lunar Tide","lunar-tide","The air is full of jellyfish: every chosen foe takes 54 poison damage, and tiny jellyfish (up to 5) join you until the Domain ends."],["Adorable Poison Jar","adorable-poison-jar","Unlocks the quick key: milk the jellyfish (2 CE) for 3 envenomed weapon blows."]]},{"id":"e551","n":"Moonphase","s":"Attuned to the lunar cycle: every blow carries the current moon's rider, silent at New, swift at Half, hungry at Gibbous, crushing at Full.","c":"Original","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Moonrest","moonrest","At night under the open sky, bathe in moonlight and heal."],["Tidecall","tidecall","Tidal force surges 9 blocks around where you look (18 blocks): foes are dragged down and slowed (a strong foe holds firm)."],["Phase Eclipse","phase-eclipse","Once a long rest: for a minute the moon counts one step fuller."],["Borrowed Light","borrowed-light","Once a long rest: for a minute your blows carry the phase Technique Key 1 picked (not Full) instead of the real one."],["Maximum: Totality","maximum-totality","For a minute your blows carry the Full Moon at 27 damage and the New Moon's silence at once. Cast it again inside it to call down the dark of the moon: 89 damage to every foe within 36 blocks (once)."],["Moon-Touched","moon-touched","Your weapon blows carry the current phase (1 CE, once a second): New, the foe loses you; Half, a burst of speed; Gibbous, 7 damage more and a little life; Full, 18 damage more."],["Lunar Constant","lunar-constant","The moon is never less than Half for you."],["The Dark Side","the-dark-side","Under a New Moon you are the side no one sees: you're unseen, and creatures lose interest."],["Lunacy","lunacy","Once every 3 s, a Full Moon blow (or one in Totality) makes foes within 9 blocks strange: they hit 25% softer for 3 s."]]},{"id":"e149","n":"Mycelial Testament","s":"Grow a network through the battlefield, mend from any Node, and let the fallen feed the living.","c":"Applied Systems","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Symbiotic Pulse","symbiotic-pulse","You regain 15% of your health, 10% more within 2 blocks of a Node, and as much again for every Nutrient you hold (they're spent)."],["Grasping Mycelium","grasping-mycelium","For a minute the ground within 2 blocks of the Node nearest where you look grasps: every 3 s foes there are slowed and may be held fast 1.5 s."],["Plant Node","plant-node","A Node in the ground where you look (6 blocks) for ten minutes, up to 6. Foes that die within 2 blocks of one feed you a Nutrient."],["Maximum: Worldroot Fruiting","maximum-worldroot-fruiting","For a minute the ground within 12 blocks of you is the network: you gain a Nutrient every 3 s, and foes there take 26 damage and are slowed."],["Distributed Organism","distributed-organism","Within 2 blocks of a Node, once every 3 s (2 CE), a blow on you misses: you sink into the mycelium and surface at another Node within 12 blocks."],["Medicinal Culture","medicinal-culture","Technique Key 1 (1 CE and a Nutrient): graft a healing strain on the ally you look at, or on yourself, near a Node: 25% of their health."]]},{"id":"e020","n":"Mythical Beast Amber","s":"Lightning on every blow, charges that discharge as real lightning, and a once-in-a-lifetime Release that grows past human limits and ends in collapse.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Lightning Discharge","lightning-discharge","Lightning falls on the foe you look at (within 64 blocks): 22 damage for every charge on it (at least one's worth), all discharged at once."],["Loud Blast","loud-blast","Released, from its second minute: a blast from your mouth at the foe you look at (within 18 blocks), 66 damage, and 41 damage and a daze to everything within 9 blocks of it."],["Electric Beam","electric-beam","Released, from its fifth minute: a huge beam of cursed electricity down a 6-block line, 111 damage, and everything it hits is blinded a moment."],["Maximum: Mythical Beast Amber Release","maximum-mythical-beast-amber-release","ONCE IN THIS CHARACTER'S LIFE: your body fills with electric cursed energy for up to five minutes, growing every minute: stronger, faster, quicker blows, and lightning can't hurt you. From the second minute, Loud Blast. From the third, armor of lightning: every blow lands 5 softer. From the fourth, you see every foe within 72 blocks through walls. From the fifth, Electric Beam. Cast it again to end it early. When it ends, the body collapses (weakened for up to half an hour, longer the longer you burned), and it can never be used again."],["Electric Energy","electric-energy","A melee blow that lands spends 1 CE for lightning: 33 damage (more at 6th and 11th), once every 3 s."],["Lightning Body","lightning-body","Electric Energy twice every 3 s."],["Lightning Discharge","lightning-discharge-2","Electric Energy leaves a charge on its foe (up to 10, for a minute)."],["Lightning God's Realm","lightning-gods-realm","Every 3 s, every chosen foe takes three of your charges, with no cap; only you can discharge them."],["Defensive Surge","defensive-surge","The storm bites back: a foe that strikes you in melee is paralyzed for a moment (once every 3 s)."],["Imbued Weapon","imbued-weapon","Electric Energy also charges your weapon (up to 10). Lightning Discharge spends those too, as a line of lightning from you to the target: 13 damage per charge to everything along it."],["Final Discharge","final-discharge","When the Release ends, the body vents what's left: 26 damage per full minute endured (up to four) to every foe within 6 blocks."]]},{"id":"e021","n":"New Shadow Style","s":"A practiced art: a Simple Domain circle where the sword answers on its own, an instant Batto draw, and the Evening Moon that cuts whatever steps in.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["Batto Sword Draw","batto-sword-draw","One draw: you cross up to 9 blocks where you look in an instant, and your edge tastes every foe along the way (up to 5): twice your weapon's blow and 9 damage more, often a critical. With Variant you stay where you are and the cut flies 36 blocks the way you look."],["Evening Moon: Cut / Guard","evening-moon-cut-guard","Toggle what the Evening Moon does when a foe steps into your circle (once a second, sword in hand): Cut, 1 CE, a hard blow on the newcomer; Guard, no CE, the newcomer is thrown back out."],["Moonlight Veil","moonlight-veil","A minute with your energy along the blade: melee blows add 7 damage, and one in five lands half again as hard. With an empty hand the veil is the blade: +5 attack."],["Simple Domain","simple-domain","Draw a 4.5-block circle where you stand for 30 s (free 6 times a long rest, then 2 CE): shots that cross its line are cut down (one every half second), you take 15% less inside, its strength takes 80 of the blows on you before it breaks, and a hostile Domain's sure-hit can't find you there. While a free use is left, it draws itself when a hostile Domain starts forming around you or its sure-hit is about to land. Stepping out ends it (not any more: Perfect Shadow Style)."],["True New Shadow Style","true-new-shadow-style","The circle is drawn before thought can intervene: it's instant, and free a few times a rest."],["Perfect Shadow Style","perfect-shadow-style","The circle costs nothing, has no limit, and walks with you."],["Instantaneous Attack","instantaneous-attack","Each circle you draw holds one prepared draw: the first foe to step inside meets a Batto-strength cut."],["First Strike","first-strike","Even without the circle, the Evening Moon waits: after 5 s with no foe near, the first one to come within 4 blocks is cut."]]},{"id":"e137","n":"Nightmare Weaver","s":"Plant fear, harvest it, and sculpt it into nightmares shaped like what your enemies dread most.","c":"Magic: The Gathering","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Nightmare Touch","nightmare-touch","The foe you look at (18 blocks): 18 damage, and if its nerve breaks, a Fear Mark (up to 3): each makes it hit 10% softer for a minute. A player bearing all three is haunted: the phantoms of the sleepless night come for them until they sleep."],["Nightmare Shikigami","nightmare-shikigami","A full nightmare for a minute: 27 damage a bite (two at a time)."],["Exile Thought","exile-thought","The creature you look at (18 blocks) is shelved for 3 s: a conjured one is held and unseen; a player can't cast."],["Dream Token","dream-token","A small nightmare springs up beside the foe you look at and hunts for 6 s (9 damage a bite). If the foe bears a Fear Mark it feeds on one and lasts 20 s."],["Maximum: Nightmare Incarnate","maximum-nightmare-incarnate","Your fears fuse into one Huge nightmare for a minute: 55 damage a bite, and a die more for each stored Dream token it spends (up to 3)."],["Fear Marks","fear-marks","A marked foe hits 10% softer per Mark, and your nightmares bite it harder. Nightmare Touch with Variant consumes its Marks instead, 9 damage more each."],["Blueprint","blueprint","Technique Key 1 picks the shape your Nightmare Shikigami wakes in. Hunter: a die harder on a marked foe. Cage: its first bite on a foe each 3 s holds it 1.5 s. Abyss: foes within 4.5 blocks of it are in darkness and shaken."],["Fear Made Flesh","fear-made-flesh","Your Nightmare Shikigami bites a die harder."],["Nightmare Harvest","nightmare-harvest","A marked foe that dies leaves its Marks as stored Dream tokens (up to 6)."],["Fear Has No Face","fear-has-no-face","Two Nightmare Shikigami. Once a long rest, Variant + Nightmare Shikigami costs 1 CE and a stored Dream token."],["The Unwritten Nightmare","the-unwritten-nightmare","The gallery opens: each pulse every chosen foe meets its fear. Reveal: 66 damage, and its fear is named to you. Run: thrown 9 blocks toward you and marked."],["Mill the Mind","mill-the-mind","Once every 3 s, a foe reaching its third Fear Mark has its mind milled: 27 damage, and it's held for 3 s."],["Dream Eater","dream-eater","A nightmare biting a foe with 3 Fear Marks devours them all: that bite deals 36 damage more."]]},{"id":"e146","n":"Nine Knots","s":"Bind motion and distance with cursed cord: simple to learn, frighteningly flexible once several knots overlap.","c":"Applied Systems","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Tie a Knot","tie-a-knot","The foe you look at (6 blocks): 11 damage, slowed, and hitched to a stake where it stands: it can't pull more than 6 blocks from it. Up to 5 knots stack on one foe, for a minute."],["Gordian Binding","gordian-binding","Complete the knot: the foe you look at is bound 1.5 s, 0.3 s more for every knot on it (at most 3 s; a strong foe is only slowed)."],["Snare","snare","The foe you look at is held fast 3 s (a strong foe slips free, unless two knots hold it)."],["Temple of the Nine Ties","temple-of-the-nine-ties","Every chosen foe is knotted, hitched and snared 1.5 s, with no slipping free."],["Executioner's Knot","executioners-knot","Technique Key 1 (3 CE): a hangman's noose on the foe you look at, 22 damage, and it's held 1.5 s (a hardy foe may slip it). On a foe with 3 or more knots there's no slipping it, and it holds 3 s."]]},{"id":"e111","n":"One-Winged Calamity","s":"A long blade, a single black wing, and despair as a resource, until a star is brought down on the field.","c":"Video Games","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Shadow Flare","shadow-flare","Five dark orbs gather around you and spiral in on the foe you look at (36 blocks): 27 damage in all, and a foe that can't shrug it off gains Despair."],["Heartless Angel","heartless-angel","A shaft of pale light falls on the foe you look at (36 blocks): 66 damage. Unless it's very tough, it can't heal for 3 s, the dark closes in on it, and it despairs."],["Octaslash","octaslash","Eight cuts in a breath on the foe you look at (4.5 blocks): 40 damage in all."],["Hell's Gate","hells-gate","In the air, 6 blocks or more up: plunge straight down, the blade first. Everything within 9 blocks of where you land takes 66 damage, and one that can't brace is knocked flat."],["Pale Horse","pale-horse","The foe you look at (54 blocks) is ridden down by a pale shadow: 89 damage and poisoned for 3 s; one it overwhelms gains Despair."],["One Wing","one-wing","For a minute a black wing unfolds from your right shoulder: you fly, faster, your blade bites 9 damage harder, and blindness and the dark can't touch you."],["Maximum: Supernova","maximum-supernova","Mark the ground you look at (30 blocks): a star falls on it from high overhead for 3 s, then detonates for 6 blocks around: 155 damage, fire and 2 Despair (a tough foe halves it, no Despair), and it craters the ground. Heavy blows on you before it lands may scatter it."],["Masamune","masamune","Your reach is a block and a half longer. Once every 3 s a melee blow draws 1 CE for 9 damage more and drags the foe toward you."],["Despair","despair","Foes your magic overwhelms gain Despair (up to 3, for a minute): each point weakens their blows, and you hit them 5% harder."],["Safer Sephiroth","safer-sephiroth","Once a long rest a killing blow leaves you at 1 health with One Wing unfolding. Your blows on a foe at 3 Despair are critical one time in ten (half again as hard)."],["Nibelheim's Burning Memory","nibelheims-burning-memory","The village burns again. Each pulse every chosen foe faces you or flees: one that faces you takes 71 damage unless it can bear it (it can't at 3 Despair); one that turns away is driven toward the edge and despairs."],["Long Blade","long-blade","Once every 3 s, a melee blow carries on in a wide arc into a second foe within 4.5 blocks of the first, for half."],["Chosen by Jenova","chosen-by-jenova","Jenova's cells devour what would change you: poison, hunger and nausea don't take."],["Peerless SOLDIER","peerless-soldier","Octaslash's cuts may each find a different foe within 6 blocks."],["Black Materia","black-materia","The ritual, insured: no blow can scatter a falling Supernova."]]},{"id":"e152","n":"Osmothèque","s":"Distill emotions and memories into supernatural perfumes: courage to wear, grief to throw, and a hunter's nose that forgets nothing.","c":"Applied Systems","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Formula","formula","Use the chosen Formula (1 Note). Courage Accord: a veil that soaks 17% of your health and, when it breaks, bursts on the foes round you so they hit softer. Funeral Myrrh: the foe you look at (6 blocks) hits a quarter softer for 3 s. Hunter's Trace: you see every creature near you for an hour. Synesthetic Poison (2 Notes and 3 CE): 26 damage and its senses scramble."],["Perfumer's Case","perfumers-case","With the feat: throw the chosen Formula as a vial; Myrrh or Poison splashes every foe within 2 blocks of where it lands."],["Maximum: Perfect Accord","maximum-perfect-accord","3 Notes: for a minute you wear a 6-block aura. Your veil refreshes every 3 s, and foes inside hit softer."],["Scent Notes","scent-notes","11 Notes, refilled by a long rest; out of a fight you distill one a minute. Technique Key 1 picks the Formula."],["Perfumer's Case","perfumers-case-2","The quick key throws your chosen Formula as a vial (2 CE): Myrrh or Poison splashes every foe within 2 blocks of where it lands."]]},{"id":"e106","n":"Overhaul","s":"Touch gives complete authority over matter's arrangement, not its soul: execution, healing, terrain, and horrifying fusion. He doesn't heal or harm. He revises.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Disassemble","disassemble","Touch (4 blocks): 26 damage to the foe you look at (a golem or anything conjured takes 32 damage), or the block you look at comes apart (it drops, like a mined block)."],["Reconstruction","reconstruction","1 AP: heal 20% of your health (about). With Variant, the ally you look at within 4 blocks instead."],["Ground Spikes","ground-spikes","The floor is a draft: a 9-block line of stone spikes along your look, 40 damage to each and knocked down. Living Architecture (feat): with Variant, 1 CE more, the last spike stays a minute and slams the nearest foe within 6 blocks every 3 s for 26 damage."],["Biological Repair","biological-repair","2 AP: heal 44% of your health (about), and take poison, wither, blindness and nausea apart. With Variant, the ally you look at within 4 blocks instead."],["Fusion","fusion","4 AP: fuse with a held foe in reach, if it's a foe 10 levels under you, or 5 to 9 under and already low (half its health at 5, more as the gap grows), player or creature but never a boss, It's absorbed, and half its health becomes yours as absorption for 10 minutes."],["Terrain Dominion","terrain-dominion","Restructure the ground where you look (20 blocks): stone erupts across 9 blocks, 79 damage and thrown up."],["Theater: Disassemble / Reassemble","theater-disassemble-reassemble","Choose what your Domain declares each pulse."],["Maximum: City Block Reconstruction","maximum-city-block-reconstruction","5 AP: reshape everything within 20 blocks. 132 damage to every foe, walled in by conjured stone and held for 3 s. The walls come down after 10 s."],["Assembly Points","assembly-points","14 AP. They return after a long rest or two minutes out of a fight."],["Instant Reassembly","instant-reassembly","Automatic, 2 AP + 3 CE, once every 3 s: after a heavy hit (a fifth of your health), your body is put back together (poison, wither and blindness undone) and your worn armor is mended a tenth. It answers for an ally within 3 blocks too."],["Complete Rebuild","complete-rebuild","Once a long rest, 4 AP + 6 CE: rebuilt from 0 health to 1. You, or an ally within 4 blocks who would die."],["Operating Theater of Perfect Matter","operating-theater-of-perfect-matter","Each pulse it declares what you chose: DISASSEMBLE (106 damage to every chosen foe, and a player's held item is worn a tenth) or REASSEMBLE (you and your allies inside heal 49% and are cleansed)."],["Surgeon's Hand","surgeons-hand","Every Overhaul heal also takes poison, wither, blindness and nausea apart."],["Plague Mask","plague-mask","Technique Key 1 (1 AP + 1 CE): for a minute the air around you is overhauled. Poison, wither, weakness, nausea and hunger can't take hold, on you or on allies within 4.5 blocks."],["Living Architecture","living-architecture","Variant + Ground Spikes, 1 CE more: the last spike stays for a minute and slams the nearest foe within 6 blocks every 3 s for 26 damage."],["Clean Fusion","clean-fusion","Once every 3 s, 1 AP, automatic: a blow on an ally within 3 blocks is shared, half of it landing on you instead."]]},{"id":"e022","n":"Pachinko Fever","s":"Idle Death Gamble as a playable loop: balls that feed the expectation meter, a bet, three jackpot reels, and a Jackpot that won't let you die.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Green Ball","green-ball","A ball at the foe you look at (6 blocks): 11 damage. In your Domain, a hit raises expectation 10%."],["Red Rod","red-rod","A rod at arm's length (3 blocks): 16 damage. In your Domain, a hit raises expectation 25%."],["Gold Doors","gold-doors","Train doors of gold slam on the foe you look at (6 blocks): 20 damage, and it's held. In your Domain, a hit raises expectation 50%."],["Great Luck / Fever","great-luck-fever","Great Luck, once a long rest: your next melee blow lands half again as hard. During a Jackpot (from 11th): spend a Fever point instead, a hard blow and every art ready at once, once every 3 s."],["Maximum: Love Train","maximum-love-train","All three at once on the foe you look at: they raise expectation even outside your Domain, and since all three strike the same foe, the bet is placed on the spot."],["The machine","the-machine","Technique Key 1, in your Domain: bet all your expectation (up to 190%). A number from 1 to 20 (plus 1 per 10%) picks the event: the better it is, the fewer faces on the reels, 12, 10, 8 or 6. It runs for 2–8 s, then a second number sets your rerolls: 1–12 three, 13–15 four, 16–17 five, 18–19 ten, 20 a Rainbow (an automatic win). Three reels spin and reroll toward a match; three of a kind pays. A miss wipes the expectation."],["Jackpot","jackpot","The Domain ends and for 12 s: your CE refills every 3 s, you heal fast, and nothing can take you below half a heart. Your free Domain comes back."],["On a Roll","on-a-roll","After a Jackpot, every number the machine draws is drawn twice, keeping the better, until you log off."],["The Fever","the-fever","During a Jackpot, every death it refuses earns a Fever point (up to 6), spent on the quick key."],["Luckiest Sorcerer Alive","luckiest-sorcerer-alive","The number that sets your rerolls is drawn three times, keeping the best. The Jackpot lasts twice as long, and it heals twice as fast."],["Idle Death Gamble","idle-death-gamble","The floor plays itself: every 3 s a green ball lands on each chosen foe, raising expectation. It deals no damage: this Domain is all rules. Free once a long rest (and again after a Jackpot), then 25 CE."],["Contagious Luck","contagious-luck","Great Luck can be dealt to a teammate: use it while looking at them (within 12 blocks) and their next blow lands hard instead of yours."]]},{"id":"e277","n":"Pain Killer","s":"You cannot heal, but you can stop injuries from getting worse: wards that soak blows, ailments shaken off, and a clinic that never closes.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Pain Killer","pain-killer","For an hour, 34 damage of borrowed health takes blows before you do, and every poison, wither and burn on you stops (one other affliction lifts too)."],["Pain Breaker","pain-breaker","Pain Killer also lifts one affliction: nausea, slowness, blindness, darkness, weakness or fatigue."],["Panacea","panacea","When a blow would drop you, 4 CE keeps you standing with a little health, numbed."],["Medical Clinic","medical-clinic","The clinic never closes: at every pulse you're numbed again, free."],["Dull Pain","dull-pain","While numbed, you can't be made nauseous."],["Field Poultice","field-poultice","Technique Key 1 (2 CE) presses a poultice on the most hurt teammate within 9 blocks: for a minute poisons, withering and burns can't take hold of them, and blows land 20% lighter."]]},{"id":"e512","n":"Pain Packer","s":"Heat-proof armor drinks every wound and banks it as heat, then gives it all back as a rising sun. The more it hurts, the bigger the dawn.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Vent","vent","The bank bursts 4.5 blocks around you: 9 damage per 10 Pain (at least that much), and the ice and snow there melt. The bank empties."],["Slow Burn","slow-burn","A minute: each 3 s, foes within 3 blocks take 7 damage per 20 Pain, and the bank drains 20."],["Heat Sense","heat-sense","Pain radiates: every creature within 9 blocks, and how much it's hurt."],["Pain Packer","pain-packer","Conjure (or dismiss) the heat-proof armor: you can't be set burning, and every wound is banked as Pain (up to 200)."],["Rising Sun","rising-sun","The bank becomes a sun over you: 11 damage per 10 Pain (at least 33 damage) within 18 blocks, then 22 damage each 3 s for a minute; what's under it melts."],["The bank","the-bank","Pain banked is the damage you take while armored (as a share of your health), up to 200. Hurt with the bank already full, it Overflows: a free Vent, on its own."],["Backdraft","backdraft","Once every 3 s (1 CE), a melee attacker eats up to 30 Pain back, 7 damage per 10."],["Deep Bank","deep-bank","The bank holds twice as much, and the sealed armor can't be blinded."],["Solar Core","solar-core","The first wound each 3 s banks double."],["High Noon","high-noon","The sun doesn't miss: every chosen foe takes 9 damage per 10 Pain each pulse, and the bank doesn't empty."],["Banked Light","banked-light","Technique Key 1 (1 CE) vents 10 Pain as pure light: every foe within 9 blocks is blinded for 3 s."],["Cauterize","cauterize","Once a minute, armored with 10 Pain banked, a blow that would drop you leaves you at 1 health instead (it costs the 10 Pain)."],["Heat Haze","heat-haze","With 20 or more Pain banked, blows sometimes pass through where you seemed to be."],["Pain Ledger","pain-ledger","Heat Sense also tells what last hurt each one: blade, fire, fall, teeth, shot, blast or magic."],["Solar Forge","solar-forge","Variant + Technique Key 1 while the Rising Sun lingers: the block you look at (6 blocks, nothing harder than iron) melts away; with no block in view, your held weapon's next hit within a minute adds 14 fire damage."]]},{"id":"e150","n":"Palimpsest","s":"Record an earlier layer of a place or a person, then selectively restore it: red ink on the present.","c":"Applied Systems","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Margin","margin","First press: record where you stand. Next press: return there and regain 15% of your health (a Revision Die is spent; with none left you only return). You have 11 Revision Dice a long rest."],["Redaction","redaction","Every hostile shot within 6 blocks of where you look (12 blocks) is struck from the page, and foes there lose their footing."],["Position Note","position-note","The foe you look at (12 blocks) is noted: 3 s later it's pulled back to where it stood and takes 13 damage (a nimble or strong foe is only stopped, for half)."],["Maximum: First Draft","maximum-first-draft","Everything within 6 blocks returns to where it stood five seconds ago: you regain 39% of your health, and foes are pulled back and take 53 damage (a nimble foe takes half and stays)."],["Errata","errata","A foe that resists its Position Note still carries the correction: it's slowed 3 s."],["Margin Walker","margin-walker","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): step into the margin for 3 s: unseen, untouchable and unable to strike, then return to where you stood."]]},{"id":"e278","n":"Paralyzing Gaze","s":"Your technique allows you to paralyze others with a mere gaze.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Immobilizing Eyes","immobilizing-eyes","Look at the foe nearest where you look within 18 blocks: while you keep it in sight it moves at half speed, hits softer and its guard drops; 1 CE every 3 s per foe to keep it. Hold the cast first to sweep up to 5 foes, 1 CE each beyond the first. A foe that resists wounds your eyes."],["Maximum: Paralyzing Gaze","maximum-paralyzing-gaze","One foe you can see within 36 blocks is paralyzed, frozen even in mid-air, for 3 s, and stays under your gaze after. Straining against you, it may wound your eyes twice over."],["Your eyes","your-eyes","Your eyes have their own life (half of yours). Each foe that resists the gaze wounds them; they recover slowly. At zero you're blind, and they won't recover until a long rest."],["Reactive Eye Movement","reactive-eye-movement","A foe within 18 blocks that strikes at you meets your eyes (2 CE, every 3 s): a gazed foe always misses; another misses unless it resists. Technique Key 1: Eye Drops, 1 CE, close your eyes a moment and they recover."],["Chamber of Fractured Reflections","chamber-of-fractured-reflections","Mirrors on every side: your gaze can't be broken inside, and three chosen foes are held by it at every sure-hit, at no cost to your eyes."],["Immobilized Limbs","immobilized-limbs","A foe under your eyes has its guard drop entirely, not just by half."]]},{"id":"e156","n":"Pestilence Doctrine","s":"Diagnose a target, gather its Symptoms, cash them into a brutal Cure, then turn the dead into crude Patients.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Clinical Examination","clinical-examination","The foe you look at within 18 blocks: whether it's above or below half its health, whether it's poisoned or withered, and a sorcerer's Cursed Energy, above or below half. Inside your Domain it reaches anywhere, and once every 3 s its other form plants a Symptom on a foe you can see (1 CE)."],["Palliative Harvest","palliative-harvest","Every Symptom on the foe you look at (18 blocks) is consumed: 13 damage each. A foe with none can't be harvested."],["The Cure","the-cure","A touch (2.5 blocks) that consumes every Symptom: 33 damage, plus 13 damage a Symptom. Three or more consumed: it can't heal for 3 s. All it could hold, with the foe at a quarter of its health or less: it has to resist or drop dead (a player or a great foe takes 53 damage more instead). A foe it kills rises as your Patient (4 CE). Its other form is Crude Surgery: a creature you killed in the last 10 s rises as a Patient (5 CE)."],["Diagnosis","diagnosis","Once every 3 s, 1 CE: a weapon blow infects its foe with a Symptom (up to 8). Symptoms fade a minute after the last one lands. From 18th it infects twice a round, on two different foes."],["Symptomatic Decline","symptomatic-decline","Every two Symptoms, a foe heals a quarter less and resists this technique 10% worse."],["Systemic Pestilence","systemic-pestilence","Foes hold 8 Symptoms, and the Cure raises Patients: up to 6, each with 105 health, ten minutes. Among them all they strike once every 3 s: 33 damage."],["Ward of the Final Physician","ward-of-the-final-physician","Perfect Diagnosis: every chosen foe gains two Symptoms. Operating Staff: your Patients move faster inside. Sterile Field: Clinical Examination reaches anywhere inside."],["House Call","house-call","A spectral gloved hand: the Cure reaches 9 blocks."],["Field Surgeon","field-surgeon","Before 11th, a foe the Cure kills may still rise as your Patient (4 CE)."],["Second Opinion","second-opinion","Clinical Examination also tells the foe's exact health and its armor."],["Humoral Imbalance","humoral-imbalance","A foe with 4 or more Symptoms is slowed (not a strong one), and one that fails to resist this technique can't react for 3 s."]]},{"id":"e023","n":"Prayer Song","s":"A ten-beat dance that lifts you and takes the floor out from under one foe, more with every beat.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Prayer","prayer","For a minute, dance against the foe you look at (12 blocks). Every 3 s is a beat, and they add up: 1 you're harder to hit (6 armor) · 2 its guard drops · 3 your blows on it add 5 · 4 you're a third faster · 5 it fights weaker · 6 harder still to hit · 7 your blows strike true more often · 8 your blows on it add 9 damage · 9 they strike true more often still · 10 it can barely act. The song stops if your partner is out of sight or past 36 blocks when a beat falls."],["Maximum: Fortissimo","maximum-fortissimo","The dance leaps to its height: Prayer begins (or jumps) straight to its last beat."],["Marcado","marcado","Once every 3 s, a blow that lands takes 2 CE for 9 damage more."],["Caesura","caesura","Once every 3 s (2 CE), a blow about to land on you is played over: half the time it misses."],["Dance Dance Revolution","dance-dance-revolution","A law, not an event: inside, a dance you've begun is always on its last beat."],["Soloist","soloist","From the 4th beat, the ally nearest you within 12 blocks dances too: tougher and faster."],["Cadence","cadence","The conductor's veto: once every 10 s, a blow your partner lands on you is turned into a miss for 4 CE."],["Grand Chorus","grand-chorus","The duet becomes a chorus: your partner's penalties fall on every foe within 12 blocks."]]},{"id":"e113","n":"Prime Conduit","s":"A living battery: drink the world's current, throw it back as bolts, shockwaves and storms, and never be fully empty while the redstone still hums.","c":"Video Games","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Alpha Bolt","alpha-bolt","1 Charge: a bolt of lightning where you look (36 blocks): 27 damage. A bolt that strikes copper scours it back to bright."],["Shockwave","shockwave","1 Charge: a 18-block cone of force where you look: 27 damage, and everything in it, creatures, dropped items, carts and boats, is thrown (a great foe holds)."],["Shock Grenade","shock-grenade","1 Charge: a lobbed ball of current that bursts where it lands, 27 damage within 6 blocks."],["Lightning Tether","lightning-tether","An arc of lightning up to 36 blocks: the foe you look at is pulled to you (1 Charge more pulls even a great one), or you are pulled to the block."],["Ionic Power","ionic-power","3 Charge. Ionic Freeze: a 18-block cone of frost where you look, 53 damage and held for 1.5 s. With Variant, Ionic Drain: everything within 12 blocks takes 45 damage, and you heal half of it."],["Lightning Storm","lightning-storm","4 Charge: for three rounds a storm follows your aim, and each 3 s the sky strikes the foe nearest your look within 36 blocks: 55 damage."],["Discharge","discharge","At 6+ Charge: everything within 4 blocks takes 9 damage per 2 Charge (a tough foe halves it). You're left empty."],["Ionic Storm","ionic-storm","6 Charge: the sky strikes the foe you look at (36 blocks): 133 damage (a nimble foe halves it), and 44 damage to those beside it."],["Drain","drain","Near powered redstone or a lightning rod (5 blocks), or out in the rain, you refill all your Charge. Otherwise you leech the foe you look at (6 blocks): 9 damage and 2 Charge."],["Maximum: Empire Thunderhead","maximum-empire-thunderhead","8 Charge: a storm cloud gathers over you (12 blocks) and for two seconds the sky strikes up to 6 foes in turn: 89 damage in a 2.5-block burst each (a nimble foe halves it)."],["Charge","charge","You hold up to 50 Charge. Every bolt, wave and storm spends it. A thunderstorm feeds you 1 every 3 s, and so does standing near a source."],["Thunder Drop","thunder-drop","With Charge in you, falls don't hurt you. Sneak in the air to dive; a landing from 4 blocks or more spends 1 Charge and shocks everything within 3 blocks (18 damage)."],["Induction Grind","induction-grind","On rails or redstone wire you ride the current: twice as fast."],["Healing Pulse","healing-pulse","Variant + Drain lays a hand on the ally you look at (2 Charge): they heal 27 damage."],["Conductive Arc","conductive-arc","Aim at the metal, not the man: Alpha Bolt on a wet or heavily armored foe arcs on to every foe within 3 blocks of it, for half."],["Polarity Shift","polarity-shift","Once every 3 s, a projectile about to hit you is bent back (1 CE + 1 Charge): it strikes the nearest foe within 12 blocks instead."],["Karmic Overload","karmic-overload","Technique Key 1 (2 CE, at 6+ Charge): everything at once. Foes within 4 blocks take 9 damage per Charge and are paralyzed for 3 s (a tough foe halves it and keeps moving). You're left empty."]]},{"id":"e024","n":"Projection Sorcery","s":"A declared 24-frame route converts strict movement into accelerating speed, impact force, and frame-stun vulnerability.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Projection","projection","Start the reel (1 CE, then 1 CE every 6 s): faster, and your swings come quicker. Every second of movement is committed once you set off: turn back inside it or stop dead against something and Projection tears. Cast again to stop."],["24 Frame Rule","24-frame-rule","Your next melee blow deals no damage: instead the foe is stuck in one frame, frozen for 3 s, and the first blow to reach it lands half again as hard. Then the frame breaks."],["Air Shatter","air-shatter","After a straight run of 8 blocks or more: the air you displaced shatters along the 12 blocks behind you, 55 damage (more with your speed)."],["Sakuga","sakuga","Twelve frames drawn at once: you cross up to 24 blocks toward where you look at blinding speed, untouchable, striking everything on the route for 133 damage. Every foe you pass is left stuck in a frame for 3 s."],["Acceleration","acceleration","Every full second you move on-route while projecting: +25% speed, up to 12 stacks (never past +300% in all), and your melee blows, Air Shatter and Sakuga hit harder with it (twice as hard at +300%). Once every 3 s, a melee blow after a straight run of 2 blocks or more adds 7 damage per 2 blocks of the run. Losing Projection loses both."],["White Space","white-space","While projecting, once every 3 s (2 CE): a blow that would land finds you between frames instead. You slip 3 blocks away and it misses."],["Fastest Sorcerer Alive","fastest-sorcerer-alive","Projection starts with 3 stacks of Acceleration, each paid 6 s adds 2 more, and the cap doubles."],["Lunar Palace: Womb of Time","lunar-palace-womb-of-time","A jade palace under a moon too close: every foe it chose that has moved since the last pulse takes 89 damage every 3 s, as its cells rebel against the 24-frame rule."]]},{"id":"e131","n":"Pyromantic Soul","s":"Ember rises only from self-harm and reckless acts, and the hotter the forge, the more it burns everything, you included.","c":"Magic: The Gathering","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Pyrobolt","pyrobolt","A bolt of fire (18 blocks): 18 damage, 27 damage at 3 Ember, 36 damage at 6."],["Ignition","ignition","You explode: 45 damage to everything within 6 blocks, the ground catches, and you take some too (+2 Ember)."],["Spontaneous Combustion","spontaneous-combustion","The foe you look at (18 blocks) bursts into flame: 45 damage, then 9 damage more a 3 s later as it burns."],["Elemental Incarnation","elemental-incarnation","For a minute you become living flame: you fly, fire and lava can't hurt you, your blows carry 11 damage more, and everything within 4.5 blocks burns each 3 s."],["Inferno","inferno","An inferno 9 blocks across where you look (27 blocks): 89 damage (a nimble foe halves it), and the ground burns. Stand in it yourself for +3 Ember."],["Flame Dash","flame-dash","Dash 9 blocks along your aim, leaving a burning path: 18 damage to everything you pass, and real fire behind you."],["Maximum: Incandescent Cataclysm","maximum-incandescent-cataclysm","At Ember 10: the forge empties down an 18-block cone, 159 damage (a nimble foe halves it), burning the ground. Ember is a gate, not a cost: it stays, and the heat is quiet for 3 s after."],["Ember","ember","Rises only from reckless acts: taking hits, casting below half health, and standing in fire or burning. Cools a point every 5 s you play it safe."],["Regulator Off","regulator-off","Taking a hit head-on gives 2 Ember instead of 1."],["Emblem of Flame","emblem-of-flame","The first fire art you cast each 3 s rolls one more die."],["Torch of Defiance","torch-of-defiance","Ember never falls below 3. Once a long rest, the Inferno costs 3 CE less and every die lands at its top."],["Young Pyromancer","young-pyromancer","The first fire art of 3 CE or more you cast in a minute sheds a spark: for a minute it strikes the nearest foe within 9 blocks each 3 s for 7 damage and sets it alight, and it winks out when it finds no one."],["Shared Flame","shared-flame","Technique Key 1 lends your flame to the ally you look at (9 blocks): their next weapon blow within two rounds carries 9 damage more fire."],["Reckless Spark","reckless-spark","Cast a fire art with Variant: it burns you a little (nothing reduces it, never below 1) for an Ember, and its dice hit a quarter harder."],["Can't Be Extinguished","cant-be-extinguished","Once a minute, struck while Ember runs at 5 or more, you erupt: the attacker takes 41 damage and burns, and you gain 1 Ember."]]},{"id":"e026","n":"Ratio Technique","s":"Every body has a weak point at seven to three: criticals that come more often and cut through armor, a ground-splitting Collapse, and Overtime.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Ratio","ratio","Arm the 7:3: your next melee blow within 3 s gets two tries (hold to pour 1 CE more per extra try, up to 5); each has a 1 in 5 chance of a critical that lands half again as hard, cuts through armor and carries 9 damage more. (Golden Ratio: every blow already is.)"],["Collapse","collapse","Strike the ground where you look (within 12 blocks): it caves in 6 blocks around, its surface cracking, shaking and then falling away (nothing harder than ore, and nothing that holds anything). Everything there takes 25 damage and wades through rubble for 30 s."],["Maximum: Overtime","maximum-overtime","A minute past the end of the workday: your blows land half again as hard, and Ratio costs nothing."],["Critical Focus","critical-focus","One blow in ten finds a weak point on its own: half again as hard, and 9 damage more."],["Golden Ratio","golden-ratio","Every melee blow is a 7:3 critical, without rolling or spending."],["Measured Guard","measured-guard","You read incoming blows too: once every 3 s, a blow on you tries the 7:3 for 1 CE: 1 time in 5, it's halved."],["Fatal Ratio","fatal-ratio","A 7:3 critical takes 2 CE more and cuts at a limb: the foe is slowed and weakened for 5 s."]]},{"id":"e194","n":"Red Lioness Fever","s":"Consecutive slaughter builds Heat: speed and damage that, at its height, burns the lioness too. Escalate, or cool.","c":"Mythology","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Lioness Pounce","lioness-pounce","You pounce onto the foe you look at (6 blocks): 18 damage, and 9 damage more per Heat."],["Breath of Pestilence","breath-of-pestilence","A 9-block cone of plague wind: 18 fire damage, or half to one that endures it. Those who don't lose half of any healing for 3 s."],["Blood-Red Draught","blood-red-draught","Once every five minutes: Heat falls by 3, you mend 16 health, and fear leaves you."],["Vent","vent","The fever breaks outward: 14 damage of fire per Heat to everything within 3 blocks, and Heat falls to 0."],["Maximum: Lady of Slaughter, Lady of Healing","maximum-lady-of-slaughter-lady-of-healing","The Lady of Slaughter: for a minute Heat is locked at 5 and its gifts are doubled, but it burns you only half as much. With Variant, the Lady of Healing: for three 3 s periods Heat is locked at 0, and every 3 s you and allies within 9 blocks mend 33 health and are cleansed of poison and fear."],["Heat","heat","Each 3 s you deal damage, Heat +1 (up to 5); 3 s without, -1. Per Heat: 4% faster and 6% harder blows. At 4 or more, you burn every 3 s."],["Eye of Ra","eye-of-ra","At Heat 5, whenever the fever burns you it burns every foe within 6 blocks too: 9 fire damage unless it gets clear."],["Lion's Pursuit","lions-pursuit","At Heat 3 or more, sprinting leaves a trail of fire behind you: foes crossing it burn (7 damage)."],["Fever Claw","fever-claw","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow delivers the plague (1 CE): the foe is poisoned, set alight, hits 15% softer and loses half of any healing for 3 s."],["Red Beer Ritual","red-beer-ritual","Variant + Blood-Red Draught hands it to the ally you look at within 4 blocks: they get the mending and lose their fear; your Heat still falls."],["Two Faces of the Sun","two-faces-of-the-sun","Once in each Maximum, Technique Key 1 turns the sun's other face: Slaughter becomes Healing, or Healing Slaughter, for three 3 s periods."]]},{"id":"e170","n":"Red Sand Below","s":"Build a hidden network of Tremor Paths beneath the fight, then erupt with acid, lightning, dragging strikes and collapsing ground.","c":"Cryptids","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Erupt","erupt","The ground bursts under the foe you look at (12 blocks): 26 damage of acid and lightning, and the soft ground cracks. On a Tremor Path, 53 damage and it's dragged down 2.5 s (a strong foe holds). Drag Under: a foe within 3 blocks of a Path is pulled onto it and held a 3 s for 2 CE more (a strong foe holds). As the great worm, a 9-block burst that knocks foes down."],["Live Wire","live-wire","Charge the Path segment nearest your look (36 blocks): everything on it takes 26 damage of lightning, half if it resists."],["Network Predator","network-predator","Burrowed on a Path: come up from the segment nearest your look, up to 72 blocks away."],["Burrow","burrow","For a minute you sink into loose ground (earth, sand, snow, gravel; never worked stone): unseen, 30% faster and taking half damage, leaving a Tremor Path every 6 blocks (up to 18). Striking or leaving loose ground surfaces you. Caustic Tunnel: holding Variant, the segments you lay are acid, 1 CE each (up to 6)."],["Maximum: Olgoi-Khorkhoi","maximum-olgoi-khorkhoi","For a minute you're the great worm, huge: weapon blows and shots on you land at half and all else a quarter softer, you burrow through any ground, every Erupt is a 9-block burst that knocks foes down, and every foe on a Path burns for 26 damage a second and a half."],["Tremor Paths","tremor-paths","Segments last ten minutes (up to 18); you see a mote over every creature standing on one within 72 blocks."],["Caustic Tunnel","caustic-tunnel","The first foe on an acid segment each 3 s takes 26 damage of acid and is slowed (half and no slow if it resists)."],["Network Predator","network-predator-2","Once every 3 s, a foe tripping an acid segment also gets a Live Wire there, for 1 CE."],["Venom Static","venom-static","Erupt's acid and lightning short-circuit the nerves: its foe can't react for a 3 s."],["False Tremor","false-tremor","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): lay a false Tremor Path on the ground where you look (36 blocks)."],["Sand Listener","sand-listener","Variant + Technique Key 1: read the memory of the segment you stand on or look at: how many crossed it in the last ten minutes, and what."],["Buried Ambush","buried-ambush","An Erupt from underground before you've fought for 10 s is free."]]},{"id":"e163","n":"Red-Eyed Omen","s":"See disasters before they fully exist, stockpile Omens, and spend those warnings to step out of harm or make a foretold opening unavoidable.","c":"Cryptids","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Red-Eyed Glare","red-eyed-glare","The red eyes fix the foe you look at (12 blocks): 18 damage, and its Disaster Clock ticks."],["Winged Intercession","winged-intercession","Black moth wings for ten minutes: you fly, and when you warn an ally within 12 blocks you fly to them and take the blow yourself."],["Omen Sight","omen-sight","Watch the foe you look at (36 blocks) for a minute: its blows on you yield Omens, and its Disaster Clock fills each 3 s."],["Eyes Before the Storm","eyes-before-the-storm","A blow about to land on you is foreseen (an Omen and 1 CE): you're already 2 blocks to the side. Up to 11 Omens; a heavy blow, or any from the foe you watch, gives one."],["Warning","warning","Once every 3 s, a blow about to land on an ally within 36 blocks is foreseen too (an Omen and 1 CE): they're already 3 blocks aside, and it misses."],["Disaster Clock","disaster-clock","The watched foe's Clock fills each 3 s (to 3). At 3, your next blow on it lands half again as hard and the Clock resets."],["Point Pleasant","point-pleasant","Red-eyed afterimages of near futures on every surface: every chosen foe's Disaster Clock ticks, and you gain an Omen."],["Scarlet Afterimage","scarlet-afterimage","A foreseen blow leaves your red ghost behind: the next blow within 3 s strikes it instead."],["Prophet of Impact","prophet-of-impact","When a Clock reaches 3 you spend 2 Omens and 1 CE to mark where it lands: the foe is knocked flat 3 s (a nimble foe keeps its feet)."]]},{"id":"e161","n":"Refining Clockworks","s":"Feed things into a portable cursed clockwork and choose how aggressively it interprets 'refinement', then decide if one more Very Fine cycle is worth the risk.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Portable Clockworks","portable-clockworks","Two frames stand where you look, an Intake and an Output, for ten minutes: throw a plain item into the Intake and it comes out of the Output refined by the dial (Technique Key 1: Rough, Coarse, 1:1, Fine, Very Fine). It takes whole stacks, twice as fast. The frames fall if you go more than 36 blocks from them. Items with enchantments, names or other data are refused."],["Rough","rough","The clockwork grinds the foe you look at (2.5 blocks; 6 with Decoupled Line): 18 damage, and 1 Scrap (2 if it's ground to nothing). With no foe there, the block you look at is ground one step rougher."],["Very Fine","very-fine","2 Scrap: the item in your hand is read far too well. Roll a d12 less your Risk (on your status line), then Risk rises by 1: 1 or less, Misread: ruined (30% softer) for a minute, and you take 10% of your health plus 5% per Risk, Risk +2 more; 2, Inverse: one Fine, and its swings are 20% slower; 3-4, Oblique: one Fine and a strange property (it glows, or knocks back hard); 5-7, Superior: two Fines for ten minutes; 8-9, Anomalous: two Fines and lifesteal 10% or a burning edge; 10 or more, Impossible: blows half again as hard for a minute. A roll of 5 or more also leaves a random enchantment the item can take (not a curse), kept for good, in place of any enchantments it had. With Risk and 2 Scrap to spare, 2 of it takes 1 Risk off first. A long rest sets Risk to 0. Master Dial: once a long rest, Variant sets the roll to 10 (then Risk becomes 5)."],["Fine","fine","1 Scrap: the item in your hand is refined for 600 s, one Fine per item, chosen by what it is: Keen on a weapon or tool (10% harder-hitting), Reinforced on armor or a shield (+2 armor while you hold or wear it), Efficient on anything else (while you carry it, your first Clockworks art once every 3 s costs 1 CE less)."],["Maximum: The Interpretation Engine","maximum-the-interpretation-engine","3 Scrap: the item in your hand is Impossible for ten minutes, ignoring Risk (blows half again as hard). Afterwards Risk is 5, and you're in Burnout for 3 s."],["Scrap","scrap","Rough yields Scrap, up to 11. A long rest empties the hopper."],["Thrift","thrift","With 2 Scrap to spare beyond what an art needs, the machine spends it to take 1 CE off a Clockworks art (never below 1; not Rough or Very Fine)."],["The dial (Technique Key 1)","the-dial-technique-key-1","Technique Key 1 turns the dial. Rough grinds an item into Scrap by its size: 1 for most, 2 for tools and blocks, 3 for armor and workstations, 4 for anvils and furnaces. Coarse (1 CE) takes an item apart into its crafting ingredients, minus one of the most numerous; it needs the recipe's full output count, and an item made from one ingredient gives Scrap instead. 1:1 (1 CE) makes it its equivalent, one for one: the next wood, the next colour, the next stone. Fine and Very Fine refine it as the arts do, at their price. Variant + Technique Key 1 is 1:1 on the item in your hand."],["Compound Cycle","compound-cycle","The machine takes whole stacks and works twice as fast."],["Master Dial","master-dial","Very Fine rolls a d12, and once a long rest Variant + Very Fine sets the roll to 10 (then Risk becomes 5)."],["Salvage Intake","salvage-intake","A foe you kill within 6 blocks yields 1 Scrap about half the time, and a block broken within 18 blocks of your Intake yields 1 Scrap (once a second)."],["Decoupled Line","decoupled-line","Intake here, Output there: Variant + Portable Clockworks moves the Output to where you look, up to 18 blocks from the Intake. Rough reaches 6 blocks."],["Restorative Refinement","restorative-refinement","With the dial on Very Fine, a worn plain tool in the Intake comes out fully repaired, no roll and no Risk, for 5 CE and 3 Scrap."],["Hot-Swap Tuning","hot-swap-tuning","Variant + Fine moves the Fine on the item in your main hand to the item in your off hand."]]},{"id":"e279","n":"Regalia","s":"Your soul sealed as a weapon: a scaling cursed tool, a damage-eating pool of life, and an armory for a Domain.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Soul Bound Treasure","soul-bound-treasure","Your Regalia leaves your hand and fights on its own for a minute: 27 damage a blow."],["Regalia","regalia","Your soul takes the shape of the weapon in your hand for 5 hours: every blow with that kind of weapon lands 5 damage harder, and once every 3 s it can take 1 CE for 9 damage more. With the feat, pressing it again while the Regalia stands readies a Technique Release."],["Divine Protection","divine-protection","The Regalia has a life of its own (135 damage): a blow on you is thrown onto it (1 CE) until that's spent. It mends on a long rest."],["Cursed Soul Armory","cursed-soul-armory","Lesser regalia hang in the air of the armory and strike every chosen foe: 89 damage."],["Regalia Versatility","regalia-versatility","Technique Key 1 turns the Regalia between weapon and shield: as a shield it lends 10 armor instead of its blows, and Divine Protection takes blows for free."],["Celestial Raiment","celestial-raiment","Manifesting also drapes a heavenly scarf around you while it lasts (3 CE more): 5 armor and 10% less from blows."],["Technique Release","technique-release","Pressing the quick key while the Regalia stands (2 CE) readies a release: your next blow within 10 s is a critical that knocks the foe down, and the Regalia breaks with it."]]},{"id":"e542","n":"Resonance","s":"Every structure has a resonant frequency: flesh, stone, cursed energy. Tune your foes blow by blow, then break them all at once.","c":"Original","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Tuning Pulse","tuning-pulse","A ringing pulse along your look, 18 blocks: 9 damage, and everything it touches is tuned once more. Glass and ice in its path shatter."],["Breaking Point","breaking-point","The foe you look at (18 blocks) shatters: 18 damage, 36 damage at 3–4 attunement, 53 damage at 5 or more (a tough foe halves it); its attunement is spent. Aimed at a block no harder than stone, it sings the block apart, as if mined."],["Listen","listen","For a minute you hear every frequency: foes within 16 blocks and ore within 10 show to you alone, and your blows on a foe tuned 2 or more find its thin spots (more often critical)."],["Maximum: Perfect Pitch","maximum-perfect-pitch","Every tuned foe within 36 blocks takes 22 damage per attunement; every untuned one 44 damage (a tough foe halves it). All attunement is spent, and every pane of glass around you bursts."],["Attunement","attunement","Each blow you land tunes the foe (up to 8). At 3 or more its flow jams: it hits 15% softer."],["Sympathetic Ear","sympathetic-ear","You hear cursed energy flow like footsteps: every creature within 16 blocks shows to you."],["Dissonance","dissonance","Once every 3 s, a creature that hurts you meets a counter-frequency (2 CE): 18 damage, and it hits 30% softer for 3 s."]]},{"id":"e280","n":"Retrograde","s":"Reroll fate a few seconds at a time: time-reversal defense, regression movement and an inverted-causality Maximum.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Regression","regression","You're back where you stood about six seconds ago; only your place changes."],["Maximum: Inverted Causality","maximum-inverted-causality","A minute of effect before cause: every blow that lands on you lands on whoever threw it too, and you take only half of it."],["Reversion","reversion","Once every 3 s (1 CE), a blow about to land is played over: about half the time it misses."],["Enhanced Reversion","enhanced-reversion","Reversion 6 times every 3 s. Technique Key 1: pay 3 CE more each time for three-in-four odds."],["Maximum: Sword of Retrograde","maximum-sword-of-retrograde","Inverted Causality also strikes the foe you look at (18 blocks) along its reversed timeline: 53 damage, stunned 2 s (a strong foe is only held a moment)."]]},{"id":"e056","n":"Ripper Cyclotron","s":"Wind the arm, and every rotation compounds the punch. Everyone can see it coming; that's the point.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Release","release","The wound punch at what's in front of you (3.5 blocks): 13 damage a wind. From 5 winds its blast craters the soft ground."],["Shockwave Release","shockwave-release","The punch as a 9-block line of wind along your look: 13 damage a wind to everything in it."],["Split Winding","split-winding","Split your winds between the two nearest foes."],["The Arm Never Stops","the-arm-never-stops","Once a long rest, for a minute: a free wind every 3 s, no maximum and no winding down. You're exhausted after."],["Wind","wind","Tap to wind the arm once, or hold to keep winding, a turn every 0.5 s (1 CE each; up to 15)."],["Maximum: Full Rotation","maximum-full-rotation","The arm winds to its maximum (15, or what you've built if that's more) and releases: 13 damage a wind, and the foe is thrown four blocks and knocked down 2 s."],["A threat made in public","a-threat-made-in-public","While you hold winds you take 15% more. Winds fade after a minute without winding or releasing."],["Bleed-Off","bleed-off","Once every 3 s, 1 CE: a heavy blow vents winds, each lessening it by 7% of your health."],["Ground Zero","ground-zero","Releasing 10 or more winds also strikes everything within 4.5 blocks of the impact for half, and knocks it down."],["Centrifuge","centrifuge","The room winds up: winding is free inside it, +2 winds a pulse, every chosen foe is dragged 4.5 blocks in a spiral toward you, and loose things orbit you."],["Pre-Wound","pre-wound","After 10 s with no foe near, your arm winds itself to 3 and holds them while you wait."],["Gyroscope","gyroscope","While the arm holds winds, nothing knocks you back."],["Wind Reading","wind-reading","While the arm holds winds, you see a spark on every creature within 16 blocks."],["Bank Shot","bank-shot","Shockwave Release glances off the first wall it meets and carries on, mirrored, for the rest of its reach."],["Backblast","backblast","Winds vented by Bleed-Off burst out within 2 blocks: 7 damage each."],["Unbound Arm","unbound-arm","The arm has no ceiling: wind as often as your CE allows. Full Rotation still winds to the normal maximum, or keeps what you've built."]]},{"id":"e281","n":"Rockstar","s":"You can amplify sound and launch it as a blast of energy.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Sound Blast","sound-blast","A blast of sound along your look (18 blocks): 66 damage, shoving the foe back, and glass and ice shatter where it strikes. Hold for a longer volley: up to 3 blasts, 1 CE each beyond the first."],["Sound Wave","sound-wave","A wall of sound, a 9.0-block cone: 133 damage, shoved far and deafened (reeling a moment, and hitting softer). Hold a second first, the Musical Climax: throw it as an 18-block line from where you look instead."],["Maximum: Epic Solo","maximum-epic-solo","A minute on stage: your blows add 22 damage (hold to pour up to 3 CE more, 22 damage each), and every foe within 4.5 blocks of you takes 15 damage every 2 s."],["Emotional Melodies","emotional-melodies","Technique Key 1 changes the vibe (5 CE, a minute). Your Sound Blasts carry it: Happy charms (it stops fighting you), Sad pins it down, Angry turns it against its own side. Strong foes shrug most of it off."],["Hall of Fame","hall-of-fame","The encore nobody asked for: every chosen foe takes your Sound Blast (66 damage) and is deafened for a minute (it hits softer)."],["Rock Squad","rock-squad","During your Epic Solo, teammates within 9 blocks carry the rhythm: faster and harder to hurt."]]},{"id":"e248","n":"Rot","s":"Rotten Blood, Rot Techniques, Decay, Scarlet Rot, Wing King, and the Mind Palace of Corrupted Ego: the Death Paintings' acid-and-decay striker.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Blood Spit","blood-spit","Rotten blood in the face of the foe you look at (9 blocks): 14 acid damage, and blinded for 1.5 s unless it resists. A little life."],["Corrosive Wave","corrosive-wave","A 9-block cone of rotten blood: 45 acid damage, half if it resists. Some life."],["Crimson Rain","crimson-rain","Blood rains where you look (36 blocks), 9 blocks round: 33 acid damage, half if it resists. A little life."],["Blood Shield","blood-shield","A shell of clotted blood for a minute: it takes the next blows on you, a third of your max health in all, and a weapon blow it swallows whole burns its striker for 18 acid damage unless it resists. Some life."],["Blood Soak","blood-soak","Your limbs coated in your blood for a minute: quicker, and your empty-handed blows add 20 acid damage. A little life."],["Homing Blood Missile","homing-blood-missile","A seeking mass of blood at the foe you look at (36 blocks): 62 acid damage. Some life."],["Decay","decay","Everything your technique has hurt in the last minute rots for a minute: 36 damage every 3 s."],["Blood Line","blood-line","A line of rotten blood where you look (20 blocks): 18 acid damage, and it eats into the first soft blocks in its path. It costs a little of your life. Three at once as the Wing King, free."],["Maximum: Wing King","maximum-wing-king","A minute: far faster, you fly, and every Blood Line is three, free."],["Rotten Blood","rotten-blood","Poison barely touches you. Hurt, your weapon blows add 36 acid damage once every 3 s."],["Scarlet Rot","scarlet-rot","Whatever your rot touches is poisoned; poison can't touch you at all."],["Mind Palace of Corrupted Ego","mind-palace-of-corrupted-ego","Every 3 s, every foe it chose decays, and the rot bites deeper: 71 damage. Inside it your Rot Techniques cost you no life."],["Blood Production","blood-production","Cursed energy spun into blood: Blood Line takes 1 more CE instead of your life when you have it."],["Condensed Decay","condensed-decay","Your blood clots around their limbs: once every 3 s, a rot hit costs a little life and slows the foe hard for 2 s."],["Blackened Blood","blackened-blood","While any foe carries your rot, you sense every hostile around you."],["Wingbeat","wingbeat","As the Wing King, your wings beat on their own every 3 s while foes are within 9 blocks: they're thrown back and knocked down."]]},{"id":"e057","n":"Royal Marionette","s":"A surgical theater of three dolls: Doctor Blythe repairs bodies, the Puppeteer turns corpses into soldiers, and Terpsichora makes your own body dance past its limits.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Doctor Blythe","doctor-blythe","The surgical doll stands beside you for ten minutes. Surgery and Emergency Stitch need her."],["Surgery","surgery","With Blythe on stage: spend up to 5 CE, each healing 8% of your health."],["Predatory En","predatory-en","Toggle: you sense every living presence within 64 blocks, even through walls (1 CE a minute). It grows with you."],["Puppeteer","puppeteer","String up the freshest corpse of something you killed within 6 blocks (in the last 30 s): the same creature rises and fights for you for 180 s, striking for 7 damage a second (or half its own blow, if harder). Up to 20 puppets. Technique Key 1 sets their order: follow, guard where they stand, or attack the foe you look at. Puppet Memory: one that shot in life (a skeleton, a pillager, a blaze) keeps its shot, and its hits land as yours."],["Snap the Strings","snap-the-strings","Destroy the puppet nearest where you look: foes within 2 blocks of it are snared 3 s (a strong foe less). Variant: the Suture Surge instead, its stitches mending you and your allies within 3 blocks of it by a tenth of their health."],["Terpsichora","terpsichora","For a minute the ballerina strings your body: 40% faster, higher jumps and quicker swings. Variant while she dances (2 CE): Dance Past the Limits, +4 armor for 3 s, then the strings cost you 5% of your health."],["Maximum: Puppet Master's Serenity","maximum-puppet-masters-serenity","For a minute Terpsichora dances without end and one blow in five misses you. You're exhausted after."],["One doll at a time","one-doll-at-a-time","Royal Theater: all three dolls are on stage at once."],["Emergency Stitch","emergency-stitch","While Blythe is on stage, once every 3 s, 2 CE: a heavy blow is lessened by 24% of your health."],["Fifty Strings","fifty-strings","Up to 20 puppets at once."],["Last Dance","last-dance","If you'd die while Terpsichora dances, the doll keeps your body moving for one more 3 s."],["Field Surgeon","field-surgeon","While Blythe stands, every 5 s she mends the most hurt ally within 6 blocks for 16% of their health (2 CE)."],["Invisible Strings","invisible-strings","Your puppets wait in the wings, unseen: invisible until they strike, and again after 3 s without striking."],["Feral En","feral-en","Your En also finds danger and treasure: creatures hunting you glow red to you, and chests and ores within 8 blocks sparkle."],["Dance Beyond Death","dance-beyond-death","The strings hold even when the dancer cannot: Last Dance works from 11th."]]},{"id":"e052","n":"Scarlet Bloom","s":"An undefeated blade that drinks from every clean cut, and a scarlet rot that blooms in whatever it touches.","c":"Video Games","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Waterfowl Dance","waterfowl-dance","You leap, hang in the air, then dash at the foe you look at (12 blocks) three times, cutting everything near you: three flurries of 22 damage, each drinking life and perhaps planting rot. Each dash takes its line as it starts, so a foe can get clear of it."],["Scarlet Aeonia","scarlet-aeonia","You leap high and come down where you look (12 blocks), and a scarlet flower blooms: 53 damage within 4 blocks, and two Rot Marks on everything in it. For 3 s the flower stays, and a foe who comes into it takes a Rot Mark. The plants around it wither."],["Scarlet Wings","scarlet-wings","For a minute you fly on scarlet wings, and your weapon blows bite 11 damage harder."],["Scarlet Thrust","scarlet-thrust","Your next weapon blow thrusts deep: 11 damage more, and a Rot Mark."],["Aeonian Phantom","aeonian-phantom","For 3 s, the first blow about to land on you misses half the time, and when it does you step 3 blocks aside."],["Scarlet Phantoms","scarlet-phantoms","Up to 6 phantoms of your blade cut the foes within 27 blocks, shared among them: 22 damage and a Rot Mark each. They drink no life."],["Kick of the Severed","kick-of-the-severed","Right after a weapon blow: the foe is kicked two blocks back (a strong foe holds). With 1 CE to spare, it's knocked down 1.5 s as well."],["Blade Lifesteal","blade-lifesteal","Each weapon blow heals you 8% of your health, up to 6 times every 3 s. It drinks even through a shield."],["Rotting Edge","rotting-edge","Once every 3 s a weapon blow plants a Rot Mark, and a critical blow always plants one more (up to 5; they last a minute). Every 3 s, each mark rots its foe for 7 damage."],["Flowing Sword","flowing-sword","While you fight in melee you move faster."],["Unalloyed Pride","unalloyed-pride","Your own rot never touches you, and fear or charm slides off you half the time."],["Goddess Form","goddess-form","Once a long rest, a blow that would fell you blooms instead: you rise at half your health, your Scarlet Wings spread for nothing, and a Scarlet Aeonia opens where you stand."],["True Goddess","true-goddess","After you've bloomed three times (0 so far), poison and withering can't take hold of you."],["Aeonia Without Collapse","aeonia-without-collapse","With Variant, Scarlet Aeonia lands you at the flower's edge, not its heart."],["Rot Is Rebirth","rot-is-rebirth","Once every 3 s, when your rot hurts a foe you gain 6 temporary health."],["Haligtree of the Third Bloom","haligtree-of-the-third-bloom","Aeonian Bloom: a scarlet flower opens under every chosen foe for 106 damage and two Rot Marks, and you drink life from each."],["Flowing Blade Disciple","flowing-blade-disciple","Moving fast through a foe's reach leaves an afterimage: once every 10 s, a blow meant for you strikes that instead."],["Waterfowl Savant","waterfowl-savant","Waterfowl Dance ends in a defensive spiral: for 2 s, half the melee blows on you miss."],["Rot-Petal Squall","rot-petal-squall","Technique Key 1 (1 CE, with Scarlet Wings spread): a rot-laden gust gives foes within 3 blocks a Rot Mark (a tough one may resist)."],["Cleanrot Resolve","cleanrot-resolve","Variant + Technique Key 1 (2 CE): touch a creature within 3 blocks to clear your Rot Marks and the rot from it."]]},{"id":"e282","n":"Schrift X","s":"A cursed-seal marksmanship package: phasing shots that pierce cover, guaranteed hits on the still, and marks that turn the next strike critical.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Piercing Schrift","piercing-schrift","A seal-shot along your look that passes through walls and every foe in its line (27 blocks): 25 damage, a sure critical on a foe standing still. In Multi-Shot (Technique Key 1), one seal at each of up to 5 foes near where you look."],["Intangibility","intangibility","A minute with your body phased: blows pass mostly through you (three-quarters less)."],["Critical Mark","critical-mark","The foe you look at (9 blocks): your next hit on it is a sure critical."],["Maximum: Sacrosanct","maximum-sacrosanct","The phased body at its height: a minute of Intangibility, and through it every shot of yours is a sure critical."],["Cursed Seal Expert","cursed-seal-expert","Your Critical Mark also blinds and cripples the foe for 10 s (it hits 25% softer; a hardy foe may resist)."]]},{"id":"e247","n":"Séance","s":"Physical and Soul Information, the Ritual of Resurrection, and the Séance Parlor: necromancy that channels the dead through your body.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Séance","s-ance","Channel the freshest body you've killed within 18 blocks (30 s): Physical, more life, armor and strength, the bigger it was; or with Technique Key 1, Both (2 CE more): its soul too, one of its traits (flight, fireproof, immovable, aquatic or swift). 1 CE every 6 s to keep. With Variant the ally you look at (9 blocks) is the vessel instead, and must stay within 48 blocks of you. A soul whose body was stronger than its vessel may take the reins for 3 s each time you pay: the vessel can't cast, and strikes harder."],["End Séance","end-s-ance","Let the dead go."],["Maximum: Black Séance","maximum-black-s-ance","The body called whole, into you: up to your own max health again in life, every trait it had, and more of its armor and strength. The soul always fights for the reins."],["Blessing of the Grateful Dead","blessing-of-the-grateful-dead","When the dead arrive, they mend you a little."],["Séance Parlor","s-ance-parlor","A parlor, not an event: there is no sure-hit. Inside, the séance costs nothing to keep, the dead never take the reins, and any body you've killed in the last minute answers."],["Bestial Seance","bestial-seance","Body and soul, whole: a Both séance gives you every trait the body had, not just one."],["Cling to Life","cling-to-life","Out of CE, you hold the spirit in by force: the séance keeps going, and each payment takes 5% of your max health instead (it comes back after a long rest)."]]},{"id":"e193","n":"Serpent Against the Dawn","s":"Track Night Depth: put out light, blind, and press the dark to deepen it, while the sun, if it overcomes you, drives it back.","c":"Mythology","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Devouring Dark","devouring-dark","The dark swallows the foe you look at (12 blocks): 18 damage, 9 damage more per Night Depth, and it's blinded (a strong foe may see through it). Lit campfires and candles near it go dark."],["Swallow the Light","swallow-the-light","Where you look (36 blocks), 9 blocks of unnatural dark for two 3 s periods: fires, lit campfires and candles in it go out, and foes inside see only darkness. At Night Depth 2 or more they're blinded unless they see through it."],["Solar Struggle","solar-struggle","At Night Depth 3, the Eclipse Pulse: foes within 18 blocks take 36 damage and can't be healed for 3 s unless they endure it (then half, and they heal). Your Night Depth falls to 1."],["Coil of Night","coil-of-night","A coil of shadow wraps the foe you look at (12 blocks): 25 damage, held and blinded for 3 s (the greatest aren't held)."],["Night Depth","night-depth","0–3. Deepens once every 3 s for each of: a light put out, a foe blinded, a foe wounded by the dark. It pales every 5 s under the open daytime sky or in bright light, and when fire burns you. Each step: your blows 10% harder, blows on you 8% softer."],["Uncreated Darkness","uncreated-darkness","At Night Depth 3 fire burns you half as much, though it still drives the night back; and when it does, you move like a struck snake for 2 s."],["Twelve Gates Before Sunrise","twelve-gates-before-sunrise","The night has twelve gates and no dawn: every chosen foe is blinded and takes 36 damage, and Night deepens. At every third gate they can't be healed for 3 s either."],["Light-Eater","light-eater","When Swallow the Light puts out a light, the eaten light is thrown in the eyes of the nearest foe within 18 blocks of it: blinded for 3 s unless it looks away."],["Enemy of Sunrise","enemy-of-sunrise","When a foe's fire drives your night back, the dark lashes it: 18 damage unless it endures."],["Endless Coil","endless-coil","At Night Depth 3, Coil of Night strikes from any darkness: it reaches 36 blocks."],["Chaos Before Creation","chaos-before-creation","Once a long rest, when your Night Depth would fade to nothing, its dregs erupt: foes within 6 blocks take 36 damage and are blinded 3 s."]]},{"id":"e179","n":"Seven Sacred Coils","s":"Wrap friends and foes in living cursed coils: friendly coils ward, heal and shed ailments; hostile coils constrict, poison and drag.","c":"Cryptids","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Hostile Coil","hostile-coil","A coil wraps the foe you look at (36 blocks) for a minute, unless it tears free (up to 3 on one foe): every 3 s it's squeezed (26 damage a coil), poisoned, and dragged toward you."],["Tighten","tighten","Spend a coil on the foe you look at (36 blocks): 13 damage, and it's held a 3 s unless it tears free. River Venom: 1 CE more poisons it."],["Friendly Coil","friendly-coil","A coil wraps the ally you look at (36 blocks), or you, for a minute: blows land a quarter softer (a third from 11th), the bearer mends 6% of their health every 3 s, and ailments slough off."],["Seven Coils","seven-coils","You hold 7 coils in all (or your mastery plus CE power, if more); those on foes come free when they die."],["Interpose","interpose","Once every 3 s, a blow on an ally wearing your coil is taken by the coil whole: it's spent, and the striker is caught 1 s unless it tears free."],["River Venom","river-venom","While a coil is out you swim swiftly and breathe water."],["Palace Beneath the Sacred River","palace-beneath-the-sacred-river","The river's coils rise: every chosen foe is wrapped by a coil, past your cap, and squeezed (53 damage, poisoned, held 2 s); you and your allies inside are wrapped by friendly coils, and you mend."],["Jeweled Hood","jeweled-hood","While any of your coils is wrapped, a mote shows over every creature within 6 blocks of each bearer, and over those near you."],["Constriction Expert","constriction-expert","Your hostile coils anchor as they squeeze: the wrapped foe is slowed (not a strong one)."],["Rain-Bringer","rain-bringer","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): a light rain for ten minutes within 18 blocks: fires there go out, and nothing burns."]]},{"id":"e550","n":"Seven Seals","s":"Your bound power is a sealed scroll. Hold the seals and be warded; break them one by one and unleash judgment, irreversibly, until the dawn.","c":"Original","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Break a Seal","break-a-seal","Break the next seal, irreversibly until a long rest: 1 White Horse, a third of your blows land critically for a minute; 2 Red Horse, war bursts around you, 27 damage within 6 blocks, and the ground there burns; 3 Black Horse, famine: foes within 9 blocks hit 40% softer for a minute, and the crops wither; 4 Pale Horse, 53 damage to the foe you look at; 5 The Martyrs, healing for each seal broken; 6 The Great Earthquake, 71 damage within 9 blocks, foes thrown and the soft ground caved in."],["Maximum: The Seventh Trumpet","maximum-the-seventh-trumpet","Once a long rest: every foe within 36 blocks takes 22 damage plus as much again per seal broken (a tough foe halves it)."],["The Sealed Scroll","the-sealed-scroll","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow spends 1 CE for a sealed strike: 9 damage more, and as much again per seal broken. While every seal holds, blows land on you softer."],["The Sealed Scroll","the-sealed-scroll-2","Once a long rest, a blow that would kill you shatters the next seal instead: you stand at 1 health and its judgment falls."],["Sound It Again","sound-it-again","Technique Key 1 (once every 2 minutes) sounds your last broken seal's judgment a second time."]]},{"id":"e201","n":"Seven Terrors of the Cedar Forest","s":"Manifest one of seven Terror Faces at a time; cedar groves extend your aura, so the forest itself carries the fear you choose.","c":"Mythology","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Cedar Grove","cedar-grove","Three cursed cedars grow where you look (36 blocks) for a minute (up to 6 groves): the grove carries your Terror Face 9 blocks around it."],["Sevenfold Guardian","sevenfold-guardian","For 2 rounds you wear your Terror Face and the next one together: every pulse carries both fears."],["Maximum: The Cedar Forest Before the Axe","maximum-the-cedar-forest-before-the-axe","For a minute you wear all seven faces at once, in your aura and every grove."],["Terror Faces (Technique Key 1)","terror-faces-technique-key-1","Each 3 s your aura (9 blocks) and every grove within 36 blocks of you strike foes for 9 damage and carry your Face's fear, unless they resist it: Glare (thrown back and stopped 1.5 s) · Roar (they hit 25% softer) · Scent (nothing stays unseen: no resisting it) · Blaze (burning, and they flee) · Maze (slowed, no sprinting) · Majesty (your allies' fear is lifted) · Doom (a foe below half health flees and withers)."],["Cedar Forest Before the Axe","cedar-forest-before-the-axe","The whole forest wears your faces: every chosen foe takes 36 damage and suffers your Face and one other, with no resisting them."],["Cedar Warden","cedar-warden","The forest carries your face farther: each Cedar Grove's fear reaches 12 blocks, from groves within 72 blocks of you."],["Terrible Countenance","terrible-countenance","When a grove's cedars are cut down, your Face turns to the next and lands at once, with no resisting it, on every foe within 9 blocks of the stumps."],["Sevenfold Guardian","sevenfold-guardian-2","Unlocks the quick key: split the visage and wear two Faces at once."]]},{"id":"e534","n":"Shadow Eminence","s":"By day, an unremarkable face in the crowd. By night, a slime-clad god of theatrics who announces his apocalypses before he performs them.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Slime Sword","slime-sword","With the suit on: the slime as a blade, 18 damage to the foe you look at within 3.5 blocks."],["Overcharged Strike","overcharged-strike","A toggle: slime blows spend 1 CE and 1 Atomic for 9 damage more."],["Atomic Discharge","atomic-discharge","2 Atomic or more: a small apocalypse where you look (36 blocks), 6 blocks around, 22 damage per Atomic, and the soft ground craters."],["Slime Threads","slime-threads","Threads fine as lies: the foe you look at within 18 blocks is held for 3 s (a strong one may tear free)."],["Slime Wings","slime-wings","Fly for a minute."],["True Eminence","true-eminence","Once a long rest: open I am Atomic at once, past Burnout, its opening detonation at its peak."],["Slime Bodysuit","slime-bodysuit","Put the slime suit on, or take it off: 4 armor, and whatever you swing is slime too, so weapon blows build Atomic."],["Mob Camouflage","mob-camouflage","Creatures more than 8 blocks off overlook you unless you've struck them, and your first blow in each fight is a critical."],["Atomic","atomic","Up to 8: +2 per slime blow, once every 3 s."],["I am Atomic","i-am-atomic","5 CE cheaper, 108 blocks of field. Open, with no barrier. Opening: 177 damage to every foe in range, and the ground at the heart craters. Then atomic fire, 22 damage each pulse."],["Theatrical Naming","theatrical-naming","Give your attack a name aloud: a line of a few words in chat is 1 Atomic, once every 3 s, on top of what your blows build. The Atomic does not care about your dignity."],["Slime Arsenal","slime-arsenal","With the suit on, once every 3 s a slime buckler may catch a blow (1 CE, about a third of the time). Variant + Slime Sword: the suit as a bow, 16 damage to what its arrow strikes within 36 blocks, a slime blow like the sword's."],["Mob's Escape","mobs-escape","Drop a foe, or set off an Atomic Discharge, and you're just another face in the crowd: for 3 s you're unseen and creatures lose track of you, and a slime double of you stays where you stood for a minute: it can't act or move, and whatever was after you goes after it."],["Shadow Step","shadow-step","Technique Key 1 (1 CE and 2 Atomic): a dash of 9 blocks along your look so fast nothing touches you."]]},{"id":"e283","n":"Shadow Killer","s":"Kill without touching: strike through shadows, bind bodies to their own darkness, and darken the sky itself.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Shadow Strike","shadow-strike","The foe you look at (18 blocks) is struck through its own shadow: 25 damage, a sure critical on a foe that isn't hunting you, or under the dark sun, or that hasn't been hurt yet. It costs nothing."],["Shadow Bind","shadow-bind","The foe you look at is bound to its shadow for 3 s: in darkness there's no escape; in light it may tear free."],["Maximum: Heavenly Star of Darkness","maximum-heavenly-star-of-darkness","A dark sun hangs over where you look for a minute (9 blocks): every foe under it takes 27 damage each 3 s, can't see, and is always in shadow. The campfires and candles under it go out."],["Void Steps","void-steps","You see in the dark, and in darkness creatures more than a few blocks off lose you."],["Shadows of Mortality","shadows-of-mortality","Shadow Strike costs nothing, and is a sure critical on a foe that hasn't been hurt yet."],["Shadow User","shadow-user","Technique Key 1 (1 CE) sinks you into the darkness where you look (18 blocks) and you step out of it there."],["Lingering Bindings","lingering-bindings","Shadow Bind can't be torn free even in light (2 CE more)."]]},{"id":"e155","n":"Shamebound Pursuit","s":"Make seeing your face a terrible commitment: Witnesses become quarry, distance builds Fury, and every obstacle between you becomes part of the attack.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Pursuit","pursuit","The Witness you look at (18 blocks) becomes your Quarry: a red thread always leads you to it, and every 3 s you close on it builds Fury (up to 6), 20% faster a Fury. A melee hit on it spends all your Fury: 13 damage a Fury. Backing away from it for 3 s burns your Fury."],["Four Pixels","four-pixels","Your face on the block you look at (6 blocks), up to 6 at once, for 20 minutes: the first foe within 18 blocks that clearly sees it becomes a Witness."],["Witness","witness","You uncover your face: every foe within 18 blocks that can see you and faces you recoils (it hits a quarter softer for 10 s) and becomes a Witness until your next long rest. Looking away is the only defense."],["Nothing Stops the Pursuit","nothing-stops-the-pursuit","While you pursue, real blocks between you and your Quarry come apart as you charge into them (not the hardest), you climb the walls that don't, and nothing knocks you back."],["No Known Material","no-known-material","Moving toward your Quarry, holds and slows on you are halved. Once every 3 s, a heavy blow on you during Pursuit (a fifth of your health or more; 1 CE) spends up to 6 Fury to land 13 damage a Fury softer."],["Face in Every Frame","face-in-every-frame","Pursuit's speed doubles."],["Face in Every Frame","face-in-every-frame-2","Compulsory Recognition: each pulse every chosen foe becomes a Witness, looking or not. With no Quarry the nearest becomes one, and your Fury rises to at least 3. A Quarry that falls inside it is followed at once by the nearest chosen Witness, your Fury kept."],["Grief-Fueled Momentum","grief-fueled-momentum","Once every 3 s, when your Quarry hurts you, you gain 1 Fury."],["Unseen Photograph","unseen-photograph","Your Four Pixels carry no mark at all: nobody sees one coming."],["No Rest Until Silence","no-rest-until-silence","When your Quarry falls you keep half your Fury for 6 s: a Witness taken as Quarry before then inherits it."],["Inhuman Acceleration","inhuman-acceleration","Technique Key 1 (1 CE, once every 5 minutes): with your Quarry 18 or more blocks away, you close the gap at once."]]},{"id":"e509","n":"Shattered Mirror","s":"She doesn't dodge or endure: she angles the shards and lets the attacker meet itself. Every blow that gets through is kept, and paid back.","c":"Original","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Face the Shards","face-the-shards","Raise (or lower) the shards: a hostile shot reaching you is thrown back at its sender (1 CE; 4 every 3 s). Melee blows shatter the glass instead, and you flinch."],["Kept Wounds","kept-wounds","Open the ledger of hurts on the foe you look at (18 blocks): every wound you've kept, paid back at once."],["Look Away","look-away","Technique Key 1 switches the shards to Drink: the shot vanishes and you mend."],["Crueler Reflection","crueler-reflection","A reflection costs 1 CE more and hits twice as hard."],["Someone Worth Shielding","someone-worth-shielding","The shards also catch shots aimed at other players within 9 blocks."],["Kept Wounds","kept-wounds-2","Every wound you take is written in a ledger (up to a fair share of your health); it fades on a long rest."],["Hall of Broken Mirrors","hall-of-broken-mirrors","Every chosen foe meets its own reflection: it takes twice the blow it would deal (at least 44 damage)."],["Angle the Shard","angle-the-shard","A reflected shot flies at the foe nearest where you look instead of back at its sender."],["Nursed Grudges","nursed-grudges","Opening the ledger keeps half of it for the next reckoning."]]},{"id":"e027","n":"Shrine","s":"Invisible cuts at range, the adaptive Cleave, Divine Flame, a perfect form, and Malevolent Shrine: a Domain with no barrier at all.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Dismantle","dismantle","An invisible cut flies 30 blocks straight where you look, through walls, into the first thing it meets. Tap for 1 CE (9 damage); hold to pour up to 6 CE (53 damage at full). Hold Variant as you release: Spiderweb, the cut fans out across the 6 blocks in front of you, into everything there (+1 CE)."],["Dismantle on the Swing","dismantle-on-the-swing","Toggle. While it's on, each swing of your arm also sends a Dismantle where you look (1 CE, 9 damage), once a second, two at a time with Perfect Form."],["Cleave","cleave","The adaptive cut. Hold to pour 1–10 CE, then the foe nearest your crosshair within 30 blocks takes 77 damage to 177 damage. It reads the target's structure for a minute: the next Cleave on it cuts clean through armor."],["Divine Flame: Open","divine-flame-open","The one thing you can see coming. Hold to pour 1–12 CE, then release a fire arrow where you look (up to 60 blocks): it bursts 1 block wide per CE, burning everything in it for 159 damage at full pour, and sets it alight. The blast burns a crater into the world and leaves the ground on fire."],["World Cutter","world-cutter","Hold the key through the whole chant (1.5 s); let go early and it breaks, free. A cut through space itself, 40 blocks where you look, through walls: 177 damage to everything on the line, through armor. The world along it is cut too."],["Invisible","invisible","Only you can see a Dismantle in flight; it passes through anything between you and where you point."],["Perfect Form","perfect-form","+15% attack speed, +5% melee damage, +2 hearts. Pouring CE takes half as long, and your swings Dismantle twice."],["Malevolent Shrine","malevolent-shrine","A Domain with no barrier: nothing is held in and there's nothing to break, but it reaches 72 blocks. Every 3 s it cuts every foe it chose that's still inside: a full Dismantle (53 damage) and a full Cleave (177 damage, through armor on a foe already read)."],["Form of Battle","form-of-battle","Up close, the cut rides your grip: a Cleave on a foe within 2 blocks always cuts clean through, as if its structure were already read."]]},{"id":"e545","n":"Shutter","s":"Every attack, every position, every instant can be captured: bottled, labeled, shelved, and developed when it hurts them most.","c":"Original","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Develop","develop","Replay your oldest captured moment on the foe you look at (27 blocks): the captured blow lands again, on it. Two at once (Contact Sheet)."],["Exposure","exposure","For a minute your lens sees the truth: you see in the dark, and creatures within 16 blocks and ore within 10 show to you alone."],["Flash","flash","An overexposed moment: everything within 9 blocks is blinded for 3 s and loses you (a tough foe shrugs it off), and the light lingers a second."],["First Exposure","first-exposure","A blow that lands on you is captured as a moment (1 CE): its full force, stored to develop later. You hold 4."],["The Darkroom","the-darkroom","Every moment inside is on your contact sheet: each chosen foe is struck by a developed print (44 damage), and a moment is captured for you."],["Negative","negative","Technique Key 1 (2 CE) develops your newest moment as its negative: instead of the blow, you mend half of it."]]},{"id":"e135","n":"Silver Golem","s":"A silver body that needs no breath, an unmaking touch, and a workshop of artifacts that wake at your word.","c":"Magic: The Gathering","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Unmaking Touch","unmaking-touch","The foe in reach (3.5 blocks): 18 damage as you take it apart."],["Null Rod","null-rod","The foe you look at (18 blocks) has its ranged powers extinguished for a minute: its shots fizzle and it can't cast (a strong presence resists)."],["Liquimetal","liquimetal","Metal flows into cover where you look: a wall of iron bars, 5 wide and 2 high, for a minute."],["Legacy Weapon","legacy-weapon","Three of your constructs fuse into one great construct for a minute: 60 health, 55 damage a blow."],["Creator's Touch","creators-touch","You mend, and your constructs are renewed for another minute."],["Animate Artifact","animate-artifact","The metal block you look at wakes as a construct for a minute (27 damage a blow; the block returns when it ends). With none in view, a plain one (18 damage). Up to 10."],["Maximum: Great Creator","maximum-great-creator","Twice 6 constructs wake at once for three 3 ss, past your usual limit."],["Silver Body","silver-body","4 armor; poison can't touch you; you need no air."],["Father of Machines","father-of-machines","Ten constructs, and the first Animate Artifact each minute costs nothing."],["Argentum","argentum","The workshop's shift, set with Technique Key 1. Animate: the foundry strikes two chosen foes, 44 damage each. Silence: one chosen foe can't cast and its shots fizzle until the next pulse (a strong presence may hold)."],["Walking Ballista","walking-ballista","Animate while holding a bow or crossbow: the construct becomes a ballista, striking foes it can see within 18 blocks for 18 damage, never in melee, with 5 less health."],["Urza's Legacy","urzas-legacy","Creator's Touch also improves you: for 10 minutes, 6 armor more and blows land 5% softer."]]},{"id":"e036","n":"Siphon","s":"Every clean hit is a debt. Steal the cursed energy you run on, wager it in an arena where no one dies, and be the one the crowd pays.","c":"Original","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Siphon Tap","siphon-tap","Spend 10 stolen CE, or half of it if you hold less: for 3 s, every blow you land deals 7 damage more per 2 spent."],["Maximum: Grand Spoil","maximum-grand-spoil","Every foe within 6 blocks is siphoned at once, and takes 36 damage for the wound it leaves."],["Siphon","siphon","2 clean blows steal 6 CE. Changing targets keeps the chain, and it ends only after 30 s without a hit. Only a nearly full swing that truly lands counts, or a fully drawn shot. A sorcerer you steal from loses it."],["Stolen Reserve","stolen-reserve","Your own reserve is 5 CE: only that comes back by itself. You can hold 100 stolen CE above it, until you spend it or take a long rest."],["Marked Prey","marked-prey","The foe you siphon becomes your chosen opponent for 6 s: your chain on it needs one blow less, your blows on it land 7 damage harder, and it hits anyone else a quarter softer."],["Blood on the Sand","blood-on-the-sand","Technique Key 1 in your own arena turns stolen CE into Tribute: it feeds the Pool and tears Gladiator health from the foe, not your reserve."],["Colosseum Spoils","colosseum-spoils","Each victory wins a Spoil at random: a real weapon, a piece of arena armor, or an Arena Beast, for 60 s. Weapons can't be dropped or kept. A beast fights by itself and can be struck down. From 18th you win two at once."],["Roar of the Crowd","roar-of-the-crowd","A victory's Encore starts with 5 in the Pool, and Tribute adds your Favor to it."],["Emperor of the Living Dead","emperor-of-the-living-dead","Once every 3 s a siphon gives you a free blow. Inside your arena a siphon pays you and the Pool both, and an Encore starts with 10 plus your last Favor."],["Amphitheater of the Living Dead","amphitheater-of-the-living-dead","Needs 3 stolen CE, then costs 6. Everyone inside, you too, fights on 100 Gladiator health, which takes all damage instead of their real health. At nothing they're sent to the stands, alive and out of the fight. Every 3 s each competitor pays 3 CE into the Pool, and whoever can't pay loses Gladiator health. The Pool lifts your Favor, which hardens your weapon. Last one standing: you cash the Pool out, with no Burnout, and take a title, the crown and a Spoil. If anyone else is last, or time runs out, the Pool is lost."],["Early Trigger","early-trigger","Technique Key 1 cuts the chain short: with 2 blows on it (1 from 6th), you siphon the last foe you struck at once."],["Redistributed Drain","redistributed-drain","Variant + Technique Key 1 hands half your stolen CE to the ally you look at."],["Blood-Price Champion","blood-price-champion","Once a second, a blow that tears Gladiator health adds 1 to the Pool."]]},{"id":"e511","n":"Skill Hunter","s":"Bandit's Secret: witness a creature's attack, then press the bloody palm print to its flesh within the hour; the attack is yours, and it can't use it while your page holds it.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Read the Open Page","read-the-open-page","Fire the attack on the open page along your look: the real projectile, now yours, 33 damage more on a hit. A stolen art reads as that art, cast for its own cost on top and with its own cooldown. With Two Pages Open, the bookmarked page fires too (2 CE more)."],["Bandit's Secret: The Palm","bandits-secret-the-palm","Press the palm print to a creature within reach (3.0 blocks) that you watched attack within the hour: its attack becomes a page, and it can't use it again. On a sorcerer you watched cast one of their arts (never a Maximum), that art is the page, and they can't cast it while you hold it."],["Bookmark","bookmark","Mark the open page."],["Due Diligence","due-diligence","Study whoever you look at: a sorcerer's arts, named; a creature's attack, if you've seen it."],["Turn the Page","turn-the-page","Open the next page of the book. With Variant, the Catalogue: every page, and whether each stolen art's owner is about."],["Imprimatur","imprimatur","A minute: every attack you see a creature make is inscribed at once, no palm needed."],["Theft, not borrowing","theft-not-borrowing","A creature you stole from can't fire that attack while it lives and the page is yours."],["Two Pages Open","two-pages-open","Reading the open page also reads the bookmarked one (2 CE more)."],["The Black Chapter","the-black-chapter","Every page turns at once: each chosen foe you've seen attack is inscribed where it stands, and each chosen sorcerer's first art is torn free, seen or not."],["The Placed Ribbon","the-placed-ribbon","When a blow drops you below a quarter of your health, the bookmarked page reads itself along your look (once a minute)."],["Palimpsest","palimpsest","Variant + Bookmark erases the open page: a stolen art goes back to its owner, and the impression tells you their level and technique."],["Footnote","footnote","Reading a stolen art tells its owner it was just used, and how far away and which way."],["Sun and Moon","sun-and-moon","Technique Key 1 (2 CE) stamps a sun, then a moon, on the creature you look at (12 blocks); one of each at a time. When the two marked creatures touch, they detonate: 44 fire damage to every foe within 6 blocks."]]},{"id":"e197","n":"Skinless Blight","s":"Create Blight patches that wither and suppress healing, with fresh water a hard weakness that cuts safe lanes through your territory.","c":"Mythology","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Blight Patch","blight-patch","A 6-block patch of blight where you look (18 blocks) for a minute (up to 6; never on water): foes in it Wither each 3 s, 7 damage per Wither (up to 5), and most of what they heal is taken back. Plants in it rot away and grass dies to dirt."],["Horse-and-Rider Flesh","horse-and-rider-flesh","For a minute you're the plague on horseback: half again your size, 40% faster, striding over full blocks, and nothing knocks you back. Water ends it at once."],["Bloom of Rot","bloom-of-rot","The Blight patch nearest where you look (36 blocks) bursts and is spent: each foe in it Withers and is poisoned for 3 s unless it endures."],["Blight Breath","blight-breath","A 9-block cone of rotten breath: 20 damage and a Wither."],["Aversion to Fresh Water","aversion-to-fresh-water","The vow, sworn: a blow from a foe standing in your Blight lands 30% softer."],["Binding Weakness: Fresh Water","binding-weakness-fresh-water","While you stand in water your blight hits at half. A foe standing in water can't be withered by a patch, and the water washes a Wither off it each 3 s."],["Shore Where Nothing Grows","shore-where-nothing-grows","The whole shore is blight: every chosen foe Withers twice and takes 27 damage."],["Long Arms","long-arms","In the horse-and-rider shape your arms trail to the ground: 3 blocks more reach, and once every 3 s your weapon blow Withers."],["Salt-Air Rot","salt-air-rot","Variant + Technique Key 1 tastes the Wither on the foe you look at (18 blocks, 2 Wither or more): you learn how much health it has left."],["Murrain Wind","murrain-wind","Sprinting, you breathe blight behind you: foes crossing the trail begin to Wither."],["Black Tide","black-tide","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): move your newest Blight patch to where you look (18 blocks; never onto water)."]]},{"id":"e028","n":"Sky Manipulation","s":"Grab the sky as a sheet: roll foes along it, bend shots through it, wear it as armor and fly, shatter it like thin ice, and fling everything skyward.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Grip the Sky","grip-the-sky","Pinch the sky and pull it out of your hand: a sheet 6 blocks along your look for 3 s, following your hand. Foes it sweeps over are rolled along the pull (14 damage), and shots that fly into it bend through its fold and leave along your aim, yours now."],["Sky Armor","sky-armor","For a minute the sky hangs on you like a cloak: 17 more armor, and it carries you (you can fly)."],["Thin Ice Breaker","thin-ice-breaker","A 18-block line of sky shatters like thin ice where you look: 55 damage to everything on it, and fliers are knocked out of the air."],["Maximum: Hurricane","maximum-hurricane","The sky rolls up from your feet and exhales: every foe within 18 blocks that can't hold its ground is hurled high into the air, and comes down hard. Needs the feat Maximum: Hurricane."],["Sky Shape","sky-shape","Once every 3 s (1 CE), a blow about to land on you, or on an ally within 4.5 blocks, may glance off bent sky (about a third of the time). A weapon blow that glances off leaves the arm that swung it numb for 3 s."],["Sky Shape Improvement","sky-shape-improvement","Once every 3 s (6 CE), a shot that would hit you is bent back the way it came, at whoever fired it."],["Heaven's Gate","heavens-gate","Every chosen foe that can't fly is falling: the ground is very far down and coming up fast (41 damage)."],["Cloak of Invisibility","cloak-of-invisibility","Still water, unseen: under Sky Armor, after 2 s without attacking you turn invisible and creatures lose track of you, until you strike."],["Spatial Tear","spatial-tear","Thin Ice Breaker tears rather than breaks (2 CE more): the first foe on the line also takes 55 damage and is slammed down and held for 1.5 s."],["Maximum: Hurricane","maximum-hurricane-2","Gain the Maximum: every foe near you is launched high into the air."]]},{"id":"e029","n":"Solo Forbidden Area","s":"A ritual zone where everything goes your way: truer blows, lighter wounds, a biting edge, full output, and a hallowed pulse.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Forbidden Area","forbidden-area","For a minute, a 18-block zone where you stand: inside it you strike true more often (15%) and blows land 15% lighter on you, and your allies inside are stronger and tougher. The zone doesn't move."],["Bless","bless","For a minute the ally you look at (within 36 blocks), or else you, carries the Zone's favor anywhere (instead of a zone)."],["Maximum: Hallowed Pulse","maximum-hallowed-pulse","The sanctuary breathes out: you're mended 26% of your health, and every foe within 6 blocks takes 53 damage."],["Arena","arena","Inside the Zone your blows add 5; a foe trying to cross its edge, either way, may be turned back, once every 3 s."],["Maximize Output","maximize-output","One of you in the Zone lands the first technique blow every 3 s at half again its force: the ally you name by looking at them and pressing Technique Key 1, or else you."],["Hallowed Zone","hallowed-zone","A law, not an event: inside, your Zone is twice as wide."],["Blessing Relay","blessing-relay","The sanctuary is carried: allies within 6 blocks of you share it too, wherever you stand, while your Zone or Bless lasts."],["Blessing of Combat","blessing-of-combat","The threshold evicts: once every 3 s, your blow on a foe inside the Zone throws it toward the edge (across it, the Arena bites)."],["Shrine of the Gods","shrine-of-the-gods","The Zone walks: once raised, it moves with you."]]},{"id":"e284","n":"Star Dictator","s":"Command star shikigami whose orbits trace a pseudo-domain: from a lone orbiting light to an Army of the Dictator under a Divine Mandate.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Minor Star Shikigami","minor-star-shikigami","Hold to pour up to 6 CE: a minor star shikigami per CE for 10 minutes, 7 damage a strike (up to 18 at once)."],["Major Star Shikigami","major-star-shikigami","A major star shikigami for 10 minutes, 36 damage a blow (one at a time; two from 11th)."],["Pseudo-Domain Constitution","pseudo-domain-constitution","For a minute your stars orbit the point where you look (18 blocks): each 3 s every foe inside the orbit (6 blocks) is cut 11 damage per orbiting star (a nimble foe may halve it). Press again to release them."],["Maximum: Divine Mandate","maximum-divine-mandate","The Army of the Dictator: your star roster fills at once, and for a minute the orbit cuts twice as deep."],["Constellation Network","constellation-network","While any star is out, you sense every creature within 16 blocks: a mote shows over each."],["Keystone Star","keystone-star","Your Major Star holds the center: while it stands, the orbit follows it and doesn't break."],["Judicial Amputation","judicial-amputation","A foe that fails badly against your orbit loses a limb: slowed hard and hitting 30% softer for a minute."]]},{"id":"e030","n":"Star Rage","s":"Mass, purchased and carried into every blow: criticals that detonate, a stone-kicking Shooting Star, and a Black Hole that costs the star itself.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Shooting Star","shooting-star","While mass is up: kick the ground's loose stone down a 10-block line where you look, twice your mass's blow bonus, to everything on it."],["Virtual Mass Increase","virtual-mass-increase","Hold to pour mass in, a CE a point (up to 12): for 30 s your melee blows add 5 damage to 18 damage by your mass (a step up per 2 mass) and half the mass again, and hit far harder. It can't be ended or renewed early."],["Maximum: Black Hole","maximum-black-hole","Hold the key for 2 s to commit (let go early and nothing happens): you become the singularity. Within 20 blocks, a foe 10 levels under you, or 5 to 9 under and already low (half its health at 5, more as the gap grows), player or creature but never a boss, is destroyed outright, unless it holds its ground (3 in 10). The rest take 443 damage and a fifth of their health through all defense, and are dragged in. The ground around the singularity is swallowed as it grows, and loose things are drawn in. Two seconds later, you die."],["Mass Impact","mass-impact","A critical melee blow (a falling one) with mass up detonates: 1+ mass knocks the foe down, 2+ tears a cone of the same blow out behind it, 3+ slows it, 4+ holds it for 2 s. It's shoved 3 blocks too."],["Improved Duration","improved-duration","Virtual mass lasts twice as long."],["Event Horizon","event-horizon","Everything inside is crushed by mass: every step costs four. Every 3 s, each chosen foe is knocked flat and takes 71 damage."]]},{"id":"e285","n":"Starlight Symphony","s":"Mold shining cursed fog, raise fox shikigami, and become the mist itself: a control package crowned by the Fog of Exorcism.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Cursed Fog","cursed-fog","Hold to pour CE (up to 15): shining fog 3 blocks around you per CE, for a minute, following you; foes inside can't see."],["Kitsune Creation","kitsune-creation","A fox shikigami for a day, 14 damage a bite (up to 6)."],["Living Fog","living-fog","Up to an hour: you become a drifting cloud. You fly slowly, can't be seen, and blows pass mostly through you (three-quarters less), but you can't strike. Cast again to take shape."],["Inari","inari","The great fox Inari for a minute, 53 damage a blow."],["Fox Fire","fox-fire","With the feat: your fog erupts in a vapor explosion, 89 cold damage to every foe in it, chilled, and the fog is spent."],["Maximum: Fog of Exorcism","maximum-fog-of-exorcism","The fog detonates down a 18-block cone: 177 cold damage (a hardy foe may halve it)."],["Fox in the Mist","fox-in-the-mist","While the fog stands, you can keep one more Kitsune out."],["Fox Fire","fox-fire-2","Unlocks the quick key: detonate your fog."]]},{"id":"e181","n":"Starvation Colossus","s":"Violence feeds Hunger. Spend it to assemble giant skeletal arms, ribs, jaws, and finally a towering cursed exoskeleton.","c":"Cryptids","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Bone Arm","bone-arm","A giant skeletal hand slams down on the foe you look at (12 blocks): 22 damage, and 11 damage more for every 2 Hunger you spend (all of it). With Variant, 1 Hunger: the arm stays for a 3 s, 6 blocks more reach and 5 damage on your next blow."],["Bone Jaw","bone-jaw","2 Hunger: a skull's jaw bites the foe you look at (6 blocks): 12 damage, and it's held a 3 s unless it tears free."],["Gnashing Jaws","gnashing-jaws","A skull's jaws snap down a 4-block cone: 36 damage, and a Hunger for each foe caught."],["Rattle of the Giant","rattle-of-the-giant","The ringing of the bones: foes within 12 blocks are frightened a 3 s unless they steel themselves, and each that isn't feeds a Hunger (up to 6). Once every five minutes."],["Skeletal Armor","skeletal-armor","3 Hunger: for a minute the skeleton walks round you: +9 armor, larger, 3 blocks more reach, and the Arm's empowering costs no Hunger once a 3 s."],["Torso of a Nation","torso-of-a-nation","4 Hunger: a rib-and-spine tower twelve blocks tall rises round you for a minute (6 blocks across): shots from outside land a quarter softer on your allies inside, and a foe stepping in is shoved 6 blocks out unless it holds."],["Rib Cage","rib-cage","3 Hunger: ribs close round you for 3 s; blows land at half."],["Maximum: Gashadokuro","maximum-gashadokuro","With 6 or more Hunger, all of it: for a minute the starving skeleton rises round you. You tower, gain 14 damage of temporary health for each Hunger, your reach grows by nine blocks, your first blow each 3 s also bites and holds, a round with a heavy wound near you gives back a Hunger, and every 3 s the ground shakes for 44 damage within 4 blocks."],["Hunger","hunger","Once every 3 s each: blood spilled within 36 blocks, a foe falling below half health, a death (two). Up to 18. End a 3 s full without spending any and you starve: 7 damage."],["Bone Chime","bone-chime","You hear the half-dead rattle: a mote shows over every creature below half its health within 18 blocks."],["Jaw of Famine","jaw-of-famine","Gnashing Jaws feeds you: 5% of your health for each foe caught (up to three)."],["Starving Maw","starving-maw","When you'd starve, a foe in your Jaw takes it instead."]]},{"id":"e482","n":"Stone Cutting Style","s":"A martial technique that turns the body into a chisel: blows tear through stone, and two forms focus that breaking force.","c":"Creeps and Curses","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["Stone Cutting Strike","stone-cutting-strike","The foe you look at (3 blocks): 33 damage, and the stone around it cracks apart, mined loose."],["Swift Fury","swift-fury","Three chisel blows on the foe you look at (3 blocks): 9 damage each."],["The Body Is the Tool","the-body-is-the-tool","Your weapon blows bite 9 damage harder (once a second), and you break stone twice as fast."],["Keystone Break","keystone-break","When the Stone Cutting Strike cracks stone apart, the break keeps going (1 CE): foes within 3 blocks take 26 damage (a nimble one may halve it)."],["Living Quarry","living-quarry","Golems, shulkers, silverfish and other things of stone or metal are quarry to you: everything you deal them lands half again as hard."]]},{"id":"e183","n":"Stormfather Catastrophe","s":"Build Cataclysm by changing disasters, fire, lightning, thunder, venom, gale, layering ruin instead of repeating one best attack.","c":"Mythology","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Fire Breath","fire-breath","A 9-block cone of fire: 45 damage and burning; the ground in it catches."],["Lightning","lightning","A bolt from the sky onto the foe you look at (18 blocks): 45 damage, and it leaps to one more for 36 damage."],["Thunderclap","thunderclap","Thunder round you (6 blocks): 45 damage, and everything is thrown back."],["Venom","venom","A gout of venom where you look (18 blocks, 3-block splash): 45 damage and badly poisoned."],["Serpent Limbs","serpent-limbs","For a minute your legs are serpent coils: a third faster, and you climb walls (sneak to cling). While you hold half your Cataclysm or more, storm-wings: you fly. After 12 blocks of movement, a weapon blow with Variant held spends 1 Cataclysm: 18 damage more, and the coils seize the foe for 1.5 s unless it tears free."],["Gale","gale","A 18-block gale down your look: 45 damage, and it hurls creatures and loose items alike."],["Maximum: Siege of Heaven","maximum-siege-of-heaven","Once a long rest. For three 3 s periods you are the storm: you tower, fly and can't be thrown. At once and then every 3 s, a catastrophe the last was not falls where you look (36 blocks, 9 blocks round it): the eruption burns, the thunderhead leaves no one able to react, the hurricane hurls, the venom rain poisons. Each deals 36 damage."],["Cataclysm","cataclysm","The first time every 3 s you wound a foe with a phenomenon unlike the last you used, 1 Cataclysm (up to 6). Repeating yourself gains nothing."],["Discordant Layering","discordant-layering","Hold Variant as you loose a phenomenon: 1 Cataclysm wreathes it in the next disaster in turn (fire, lightning, thunder, venom) for 9 damage more."],["Many-Mouthed Tempest","many-mouthed-tempest","The wreathing takes up to 3 Cataclysm, a disaster each, and each also leaves its mark: fire sets alight, lightning leaves the foe unable to react for 3 s, thunder throws it, venom poisons."],["Mountain-Buried Monster","mountain-buried-monster","Once every 3 s, a foe's blow of a tenth of your health or more costs 3 CE and lands 33 damage softer, and rubble slows the foes within 3 blocks. Below half health your Cataclysm holds 2 more and you fly on storm-wings."],["Tireless Coils","tireless-coils","Technique Key 1 drives your serpent limbs into the ground for 3 s: you can't move or be moved, and blows land 30% softer."],["Volcanic Prison","volcanic-prison","Variant + Technique Key 1 on the foe your coils seized (within 3 s), 2 Cataclysm: cooling magma holds it 3 s unless it breaks out, and burns it for 9 fire damage as it closes and again as it cracks."],["Polyphonic Horror","polyphonic-horror","A foe struck by two different phenomena within 3 s may break (1 Cataclysm): it stands frozen in horror 3 s (a strong will may hold)."],["Last Challenge of Olympus","last-challenge-of-olympus","When you fall, the storm spends everything left: foes within 9 blocks take 18 damage per Cataclysm."]]},{"id":"e031","n":"Straw Doll Technique","s":"Nails, a hammer and a straw doll: nails that bind a foe to the doll, Resonance that strikes it from anywhere, and hairpins that wait to go off.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Nail Projectile","nail-projectile","Two nails hammered where you look (24 blocks), 14 damage for the first on each foe, 14 damage for each after. Hold for two more (3 CE more)."],["Resonance","resonance","Strike the straw doll and use up its piece: the foe bound to it takes it wherever it is. A minor piece: 41 damage, and it fights weaker for 3 s. A medium piece: 98 damage, and its technique is shut for 1.5 s. A major piece: 177 damage, and it's held for 3 s. Its max health falls by as much as the blow took, to half at most, for five minutes."],["Hairpin","hairpin","Plant up to 6 nails where you look (1 CE each beyond the first). Technique Key 1 detonates every planted hairpin: 14 damage per nail to every foe within 2 blocks of it."],["Improved Resonance","improved-resonance","The foe within arm's reach that's held, bound or stunned: knocked down, 53 damage, and its cursed energy suppressed for a minute: half a sorcerer's casts fizzle, their CE spent, and a creature fights weaker."],["Maximum: Last Nail in the Coffin","maximum-last-nail-in-the-coffin","(The Last Nail feat) While a foe is bound to the doll: every planted hairpin tears loose, streaks to it wherever it is and goes off as one, 14 damage per nail, and it's held for 3 s. The link ends."],["Nail Pouch","nail-pouch","20 nails; one comes back every 3 s."],["Resonance Link","resonance-link","A wound you deal with a blade, a nail or an arrow takes a piece of the foe for your doll (3 CE), if no other foe is bound: minor under a quarter of its max health, medium under half, major from half. A bigger wound on the same foe takes a bigger piece (3 CE more). The link lasts a minute, and a red thread shows it."],["Grand Effigy Rite","grand-effigy-rite","Every 3 s, every foe it chose is nailed: 89 damage, and bound to an effigy for 1.5 s."],["Nail Volley","nail-volley","Hold Nail Projectile past its second step and the nails scatter: up to 5 nails and CE in a cone (2 blocks long per nail), 5 damage per nail to everything in it."],["1000 Needles","1000-needles","Hairpins go in barbed (1 CE more per nail): a foe caught by their detonation is held a moment and takes 9 damage every second for 5 s."],["The Last Nail","the-last-nail","Gain the Maximum: Last Nail in the Coffin."]]},{"id":"e110","n":"Style Devil","s":"Indecision, weaponized: switch styles and weapons, vary your attacks, and ride the Style Rank from Dope to SSStylish.","c":"Video Games","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Stinger","stinger","You lunge 6 blocks along your look, through the air if you aim up: 18 damage to everything you pass."],["Rain Storm","rain-storm","You spring up and spin upside down, raining bullets: 27 damage to everything within 5 blocks."],["Million Stab","million-stab","A flurry at the foe you look at (3 blocks): five thrusts of 11 damage, and it's pinned while they land."],["Devil Sword Dante","devil-sword-dante","Four Mirage Swords: 9 damage each, split among the foes nearest your look within 18 blocks. With Variant they ride your next blow instead, 18 damage more. In Sin Devil Trigger, Rain Storm is Demolition: 66 damage in a 6-block burst where you look, up to 36 blocks."],["Devil Trigger","devil-trigger","For a minute: you fly, blows land a fifth softer, you heal 6% each 3 s, and every hit is a tenth harder. 1 CE less at S rank or above."],["Maximum: Sin Devil Trigger","maximum-sin-devil-trigger","For a minute your rank holds at SSS in Devil Trigger. When it ends, Judgement: space around you is cut to pieces, 133 damage to every foe within 18 blocks (a nimble foe halves it)."],["Style Rank","style-rank","Land a different attack from the last (a different weapon, a shot, an art) and your rank climbs, D to SSS. Repeat yourself and it may slip; stop hitting for 5 s and it falls; a hit on you knocks it down two. Each rank: +6% damage."],["Styles (Technique Key 1)","styles-technique-key-1","Swordmaster: melee blows 9 damage harder · Gunslinger: arrows and bolts 9 damage harder · Trickster: faster, and a third of blows miss as you air-trick a step aside · Royal Guard: blows land a third softer, and what you block is stored and released on your next blow."],["Legendary Dark Knight","legendary-dark-knight","Your rank never falls below B, and at SSS all four Styles work at once."],["Quadruple Style","quadruple-style","At SS and above you keep your previous Style's benefits as well."],["Enemy Step","enemy-step","The enemy is terrain: once every 3 s, a melee blow landed in the air springboards you up off it, and the push-off may knock it down."],["Royal Guard Savant","royal-guard-savant","In Royal Guard, once every 3 s a blow on an ally within 6 blocks lands on you instead, through your guard."],["Jackpot","jackpot","A critical arrow sprays: up to two other foes within 3 blocks take half of it."]]},{"id":"e192","n":"Sun-Eater Wings","s":"Earn Pinions through sustained flight and by breaking poison and bindings, then spend them on radiant stoops that devour serpents.","c":"Mythology","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Radiant Stoop","radiant-stoop","You dive on the foe you look at (12 blocks) from above: 18 damage of radiance, and 9 damage more per Pinion spent (all of them)."],["Wingbeat Deliverance","wingbeat-deliverance","1 Pinion: the ally you look at (36 blocks) is swept to your side, free of poison, slowing and holds. With Variant: the foe you look at is hurled 6 blocks away unless it holds its ground."],["Sun-Eater Wings","sun-eater-wings","For a minute great golden wings carry you: you fly, and every 3 s aloft earns a Pinion (up to 8)."],["Maximum: Wings That Eclipse the Serpent","maximum-wings-that-eclipse-the-serpent","For a minute your wings blot out the sun: poison and bindings can't take you, and every 3 s radiance falls on the foes beneath you (36 damage). The first Deliverance every 3 s costs no Pinion, and the Stoop deals 27 damage more to a foe beside a poisoned or held ally."],["Pinions","pinions","Earned by staying aloft and by breaking free of poison, slowing or being held (each is cleansed the moment it takes you). A weapon blow with Variant held spends one for 9 damage of radiance."],["Enemy of Venom","enemy-of-venom","Once every 3 s, 1 CE: an ally within 18 blocks who is poisoned, slowed or held is torn free, and you earn a Pinion."],["Sunward Ascent","sunward-ascent","Aloft under the open sky you earn Pinions twice as fast."],["Feather Shield","feather-shield","Once every 3 s, 1 Pinion: a foe's blow on an ally within 9 blocks lands a quarter softer behind your feathers."],["Venom Breaker","venom-breaker","You tear free of sickness too, and so do the allies you free: withering, weakness and hunger are cleansed for a Pinion each."],["Solar Plumage","solar-plumage","Under the open daytime sky, poison and slowing can't take hold of you at all."]]},{"id":"e039","n":"Sunshine: Pride Incarnate","s":"A furnace in the chest that grows with the sun. Cruel Sun, Pride Flare, Super Slash, and at true noon, The One. At 18th, a fatal vow refuses the end.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Cruel Sun","cruel-sun","Hold to pour 1 to all your CE: a miniature sun flies 120 blocks where you look and bursts on what it meets, 16 damage at night to 33 damage at noon for one CE, a Solar Die more for each CE poured. Hold a second past full for Maximum Output: the sun stays 10 s, following your aim (scroll to set how far out), and burns what it touches every 1.5 s. Pride Flare sets it off early."],["Crazy Prominence","crazy-prominence","Your Mastery in CE (6): 6 homing suns among the foes within 120 blocks, 14 damage at night to 40 damage at noon each."],["Super Slash","super-slash","Your Mastery in CE (6): surge forward 8 blocks, striking everything in your path 6 times with your weapon's force."],["Divine Sword","divine-sword","The One only: a 6-block cone of sunlight, 103 damage, through armor."],["Divine Spear","divine-spear","The One only: a 4-block thrust into the first foe, 93 damage, through armor, and it's stunned for a second."],["Solar Memory","solar-memory","The rite: stand still out of a fight for 10 s under a Low, High or Near-Noon sun to store it. Release (2 CE): for a minute you burn as if under the stored sun, if it's higher."],["Lion's Heat","lions-heat","Toggle. Once every 3 s, a melee blow spends 1 CE for 14 damage at night to 40 damage at noon more (as The One, 2 blows every 3 s)."],["Refuse the End","refuse-the-end","While The One: the fatal vow, The One Ultimate. It is noon for you whatever the hour, but your max health falls every 6 s, and when it ends, so do you. Press again to let the noon go."],["Final Prominence","final-prominence","The One Ultimate only: all your CE (15 at least) into a final sun that falls where you look, 30 blocks of burning noon, 463 damage and more for every CE beyond 15. Then the end."],["Pride Flare / Sun-Rider","pride-flare-sun-rider","Pride Flare while a Cruel Sun is in the air, held, or just landed (3 s): it detonates, 23 damage at night to 66 damage at noon in a burst that widens with the sun; a held sun goes up far bigger. Otherwise Sun-Rider: ride solar fire 6 blocks (more as the sun climbs) where you look, untouchable."],["Solar Station","solar-station","Your sun hits harder as the day climbs: Night (weakest), Low Sun, High Sun, Near-Noon (11:00 to 14:00), Zenith (12:00 to 13:00, strongest)."],["Pride Incarnate","pride-incarnate","Your melee hits harder and knocks back further as the sun climbs, and when a fight begins in daylight your pride shields you (absorption, more as the sun climbs)."],["The Body Rises with the Sun","the-body-rises-with-the-sun","Each step of the sun: a little faster on foot, higher jumps, and quicker mining."],["Sun-Wrought Stature","sun-wrought-stature","High Sun and up: heavier knockback. Near-Noon and up: you reach further with your blows."],["Solar Sovereignty","solar-sovereignty","By day nothing can set you burning, and flames don't hurt you."],["Prideful Endurance","prideful-endurance","On its own, once every 3 s (2 CE): a heavy blow is blunted by your Solar Dice."],["Solar Authority","solar-authority","Cruel Sun reaches 60 blocks and takes twice the CE; Prominence suns hit harder; your Sunshine cuts through armor."],["The One","the-one","At Zenith: half damage taken, immune to fire and knockback, faster, +50% attack speed, Lion's Heat on 2 blows every 3 s, and a great shield of pride."],["Unbounded Sunshine","unbounded-sunshine","Cruel Sun reaches 120 blocks with no limit on the CE poured; Prominence suns hit harder still."],["Throne Beneath a Merciless Noon","throne-beneath-a-merciless-noon","Inside it is always noon: Zenith, and The One. Every 3 s, Sovereign Pressure bears down on each foe it chose, 113 damage, crushing it to the ground and pinning it there."],["Night-Prowling Lion","night-prowling-lion","The sun's weakest hour is the lion's: at night creatures more than 8 blocks off never notice you, and your first blow every 3 s lands harder."],["Bestowed Memory","bestowed-memory","Solar Memory's other form gives the rite to the ally beside you (4 blocks), holding a weapon: the stored sun goes into the weapon, not you. They release it once, with Variant + use, for 2 CE: for a minute its blows burn with that sun (18 damage at High Sun, once every 3 s) and set the foe alight. You can't release it yourself."],["Corona of Command","corona-of-command","Technique Key 1 (3 CE, with the sun High or higher): a corona pulse; every foe within 3 blocks is blinded for 3 s."]]},{"id":"e039g","n":"Sunshine: Solar Grace","s":"The same furnace as Pride, circulated with angelic precision: flight in daylight, Solar Infusion on every blow, lines of sunlight, delayed judgments, suns from orbit, and the Greatest Sun.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Cruel Sun","cruel-sun","Hold to pour 1 to all your CE: a miniature sun flies 120 blocks where you look and bursts on what it meets, 16 damage at night to 33 damage at noon for one CE, a Solar Die more for each CE poured. It falls from orbit, 6 blocks above you."],["Crazy Prominence","crazy-prominence","Your Mastery in CE (6): 6 homing suns fall from orbit among the foes within 120 blocks, 14 damage at night to 40 damage at noon each."],["Sunspot","sunspot","The next foe your Sunshine burns carries a sunspot (6 at a time). It detonates when the foe moves 3 blocks, or after 3 s: 28 damage at night to 79 damage at noon, and it's blinded for a second."],["Solar Infusion","solar-infusion","Toggle. A melee blow or Cruel Sun that lands spends 1 CE for 14 damage at night to 40 damage at noon more, once every 3 s (twice, three times at noon)."],["Solar Memory","solar-memory","The rite: stand still out of a fight for 10 s under a Low, High or Near-Noon sun to store it inside you. Release (2 CE): for a minute you burn as if under the stored sun, if it's higher. Each true noon stores itself."],["Solar Fist","solar-fist","A 12-block line of concentrated sunlight where you look: 21 damage at night to 46 damage at noon to every foe on it."],["Maximum: Greatest Sun","maximum-greatest-sun","A miniature sun grows as it crosses the sky to where you look (up to 64 blocks) and bursts: 80 damage at night to 218 damage at noon to every foe within 6 blocks (12 if it lands more than 30 blocks away). Hold to pour more: a Solar Die per CE, and a block wider per 5."],["Solar Station","solar-station","Your sun hits harder as the day climbs: Night (weakest), Low Sun, High Sun, Near-Noon (11:00 to 14:00), Zenith (12:00 to 13:00, strongest)."],["Solar Grace","solar-grace","While the sun is up you fly, faster as it climbs. At night (or when the memory runs out) you fall."],["Fine Control","fine-control","Your Sunshine never touches what you don't mean it to: villagers, pets and grazing animals pass through it unharmed."],["Solar Sovereignty","solar-sovereignty","By day nothing can set you burning, and flames don't hurt you."],["Perfect Grace","perfect-grace","Flight half again as fast; every Solar Die burns a little hotter; Solar Infusion rides two blows every 3 s at noon; your Sunshine cuts through armor."],["Sun Without Horizon","sun-without-horizon","Your sun never sinks below High Sun, even at night, and each true noon stores itself in your Solar Memory."],["Absolute Circulation","absolute-circulation","Solar Infusion rides two blows every 3 s at any hour (three at noon); you keep 6 sunspots, and an armed Sunspot marks every foe a Crazy Prominence hits (2 CE each)."],["Empyrean of the Greatest Sun","empyrean-of-the-greatest-sun","A weightless golden firmament of orbiting suns, where it is always noon. Every 3 s, Celestial Procession: each foe it chose takes 99 damage and carries a Procession Sun; if it moves 3 blocks before the next, the sun detonates, 79 damage, and blinds it for a second."],["Corona of Command","corona-of-command","Technique Key 1 (3 CE, with the sun High or higher, once a minute): a corona pulse; every foe within 3 blocks is blinded for 3 s."],["Grace Bestowed","grace-bestowed","Your Solar Infusion can ride an ally's melee blow within 24 blocks of you, on the same budget."]]},{"id":"e543","n":"Superposition","s":"Split into instances no one can tell apart, collapse into whichever one survived, and at the peak choose what's real for everyone in the box.","c":"Original","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Collapse","collapse","You were the echo all along: you're where your newest echo stood, and it's gone."],["The Observer","the-observer","Once every 5 minutes: the foe you look at (18 blocks) collapses into the state you choose, held still for 3 s and left half-there (40% softer) for a minute."],["Superpose","superpose","An echo of you where you look (18 blocks; two at once) for as long as it lasts: a blow on you is as likely to have struck an echo. It collapses, and you take nothing."],["The Uncollapsed","the-uncollapsed","Superpose costs 1 CE less and lasts until it collapses."],["Schrödinger's Box","schr-dingers-box","Every chosen foe is both alive and dead until observed. You observe: half are found wounded (89 damage), half are found frozen (held 1.5 s)."],["Many Eyes","many-eyes","While superposed you see through every instance: every creature within 16 blocks shows to you."],["Uncertain Blade","uncertain-blade","While superposed, your first blow each 3 s is a sure critical: the foe can't tell which strike is real."]]},{"id":"e117","n":"Symbiote","s":"A living suit: tendrils and web-lines, ablative weave, predatory morphologies, camouflage, recovery and the King in Black's echo.","c":"Marvel","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Web & Tendril","web-tendril","A tendril lashes out 12 blocks where you look (twice as far at Bond 3): a light foe is dragged to you, a heavy one drags you to it, and at a wall, a ceiling or a branch it's a web-line that zips you there."],["Adaptive Camouflage","adaptive-camouflage","A minute: the suit takes the colour of everything behind it. While you hold still you can't be seen and creatures lose you; attacking shows you for a moment."],["Symbiotic Recovery","symbiotic-recovery","The suit knits you back together: you heal 38% of your health (about)."],["King in Black Echo","king-in-black-echo","A minute: wing-like tendrils (you fly), blows land softer on you, and fragments of the symbiote lunge as one swarm at the foe nearest you every 4.5 s, 44 damage."],["Living Suit","living-suit","The symbiote covers you (press again to pull it back): you grow to Venom's size (as far as the space around you allows; sneak to squeeze through), tougher, and once every 3 s a weapon blow can take 1 CE for 9 damage more. Ablative Weave: once every 3 s a blow on you lands softer."],["Maximum: We Are Venom","maximum-we-are-venom","9 s: every morphology at once, a tendril lashes the nearest foe every second (18 damage), and the Ablative Weave doubles. Afterwards you're exhausted."],["Bond","bond","The partnership's ledger, 0 to 6: +1 for feeding (a kill in the suit) and for protecting at cost (an interception, or the Weave catching a blow while you're low), each at most once a minute. Fire or a sonic blast tears the suit off you, -1. At Bond 3 the tendril reaches twice as far."],["Predatory Morphology","predatory-morphology","Technique Key 1 (suit on) cycles: Claws (weapon blows hit harder), Blade Tendrils (you reach farther), Rampart (much tougher, and once every 3 s for 1 CE a blow on an ally within 4.5 blocks lands on you instead), Bulk (you grow, hit heavier, and nothing knocks you back)."],["Host Override","host-override","In the suit, when you're held, the symbiote moves your body: the hold is shaken off (3 CE, once every 5 minutes)."],["Perfect Bond","perfect-bond","At Bond 6: in the suit you're faster and tougher still, the Ablative Weave is twice as thick, and Rampart reaches 9 blocks."],["Lethal Protector","lethal-protector","Bond never falls below 3. Once a long rest you survive a killing blow at 1 health and heal 41% of your health; once a long rest the suit takes a blow meant for an ally within 9 blocks by itself."],["Spider-Sense Echo","spider-sense-echo","In the suit, the symbiote watches your back: a third of the blows from behind you are slipped."],["Living Parachute","living-parachute","In the suit you never take fall damage, and sneaking while you fall snaps out web-wings to glide."],["Anti-Sonic Conditioning","anti-sonic-conditioning","Fire and sonics never tear the suit off you: a fragment swarm detaches instead and lashes the nearest foe every 4.5 s for a minute (22 damage)."]]},{"id":"e516","n":"Synovia Manipulation","s":"Liquefy the bones where they stand: soften the frame so every blow afterward lands deeper, and plant mites that eat the marrow.","c":"Creeps and Curses","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["Synovia Manipulation","synovia-manipulation","The foe you look at (9 blocks): 53 damage (twice on a creature of bone), and its frame softens: your blows on it land 25% harder for 3 s (a tough foe halves it and stays firm)."],["Bone Broth","bone-broth","Every foe within 9 blocks is liquefied at once."],["Devour the Marrow","devour-the-marrow","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow plants marrow mites (3 CE): the limb breaks, slowed and hitting 20% softer for a minute."],["Softened Frame","softened-frame","Softened foes take even more from every blow."],["Ossuary Sense","ossuary-sense","You feel the architecture of bodies through stone: a mote shows over every creature within 16 blocks."],["Joint Lock","joint-lock","Once every 3 s, a weapon blow on a softened foe seizes the hinge: it's held a moment (a strong one may tear free)."],["Broth of the Fallen","broth-of-the-fallen","Bone Broth feeds you: a little health for each foe it catches (up to five)."]]},{"id":"e032","n":"Technique Extermination","s":"Radiant extinguishment: a pillar of light that puts a foe's powers out, wings and a halo, and Jacob's Ladder.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Extinguishment","extinguishment","The foe you look at (12 blocks) is struck by light: 66 damage, and its powers go out for 3 s: it can't fire, a sorcerer can't cast, Infinity falls, and it fights weaker (a strong will may hold on; the undead can't). Once every 3 s."],["Angel's Blessing","angels-blessing","For a minute, wings of light and a halo: you fly."],["Maximum: Jacob's Ladder","maximum-jacobs-ladder","A pillar of light where you look (40 blocks), 12 blocks wide: everything inside takes 106 damage and is extinguished, and every hostile shot in it is unmade. Blocks a technique made come apart in it, and a closed barrier it touches takes the blow."],["Improved Extinguishment","improved-extinguishment","Extinguishment deals 66 damage."],["Choir of Extinction","choir-of-extinction","Every 3 s, every foe it chose is struck by the choir's light: 89 damage, and its powers stay out until the next: no shots, no casting, no Infinity."],["Blessed Blow","blessed-blow","The refusal, delivered by hand: once every 3 s, a weapon blow also puts the foe's powers out for 3 s (1 CE, a strong will may hold on)."],["Sword of Michael","sword-of-michael","The trumpet narrowed to a blade: cast Jacob's Ladder at a foe within 3 blocks for 5 CE more, and that foe alone takes 132 damage and is extinguished, no will holding."]]},{"id":"e288","n":"Teleportation","s":"Marks, blinks, and sending others where you please: a blink to where you look, marks to return to from any distance, a dodge, and a soul swap.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Teleport","teleport","You vanish and reappear where you look (up to 24 blocks, never inside a wall)."],["Mastered Teleport","mastered-teleport","To your chosen mark (Technique Key 1 picks it) at any distance in this world. Or, with a foe in your sights (within 6 blocks), it's sent there instead (a strong will may resist)."],["Teleport Mark","teleport-mark","A mark at your feet to return to (up to 15; the oldest fades when you place too many). It costs nothing."],["Maximum: Soul Swap","maximum-soul-swap","You and the foe in your sights (within 12 blocks) trade places, soul first: it reels, held for 3 s, and takes 89 damage through armor as its soul tears loose."],["Improved Teleport","improved-teleport","Once every 3 s, a blow that would land on you is dodged: you blink out of the way (1 CE)."],["Improved Marking","improved-marking","Marks cost nothing, and you can hold three for each point of CE power."],["Warded Marks","warded-marks","Your marks watch as well as carry: you're told when a foe comes within 2 blocks of one, and it glows."]]},{"id":"e133","n":"Temporal Archmage","s":"Phase out of blows, delay the enemy, retrace your steps, and finally unhappen the last few seconds.","c":"Magic: The Gathering","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Chronostrike","chronostrike","A mote of stopped time (18 blocks): 18 damage, and what it hits is slowed."],["Temporal Step","temporal-step","1 Time Counter: you're back where you stood 6 s ago."],["Time Raveler","time-raveler","1 Time Counter: the foe you look at (18 blocks) loses its readiness for 3 s: a player can't cast and their shield is knocked down; a creature is slowed hard."],["Stasis","stasis","The foe you look at (18 blocks) is held out of the moment for 3 s: unseen, held, and out of the fight with you both ways (a strong will may hold)."],["Temporal Reversal","temporal-reversal","2 Time Counters: your health returns to what it was 6 s ago."],["Delay","delay","The foe you look at (18 blocks) is held 2.5 s out of time (a strong will shrugs it off). +1 Time Counter."],["Maximum: Hero's Rewind","maximum-heros-rewind","5 Time Counters: the last few seconds unhappen. You return to where you stood with the health you had, and every foe within 18 blocks is pulled back to where it was."],["Phase","phase","Once every 3 s, a blow on you may find you a moment out of step (2 CE, one time in three): it misses, and you slip 3 blocks aside. +1 Time Counter."],["Hero of Dominaria","hero-of-dominaria","You can bank two more Time Counters, and an art of 3 CE or more readies Phase again."],["Master of Time","master-of-time","Time Counters hold 10. Once a long rest, Technique Key 1 (3 CE and 6 Time Counters) opens a Temporal Window: your cooldowns clear and you're quick for 3 s."],["The Slow Sunset","the-slow-sunset","Each pulse the evening lengthens: three markers fall. Your allies near you move quicker for 3 s, and the rest land on chosen foes, slowed hard for 3 s."],["Momentary Blink","momentary-blink","Variant + Technique Key 1 (1 CE): creatures within 9 blocks show to you alone through walls for 3 s."],["Untap","untap","When a Delay's hold ends, your allies within 9 blocks move quicker for a moment."],["No, Not Yet","no-not-yet","Once every 3 s (2 CE), a creature's blow on an ally within 18 blocks is postponed: it misses, and the striker is held as Delay holds (a strong will may hold)."]]},{"id":"e148","n":"Territorial Influence","s":"Turn the battlefield into a Go board: Stones project overlapping Influence, and foes who let themselves be surrounded lose their freedom.","c":"Applied Systems","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Take","take","The foe you look at (12 blocks): 11 damage, plus as much again for every Stone whose Influence reaches it. Looking at no foe, Connect your Stones instead (1 CE more): every pair within 8 blocks draws a cutting line, 22 damage to what stands across it."],["Place Stone","place-stone","A Stone on the ground where you look (6 blocks), its Influence reaching 3 blocks, for five minutes. 10 at once; the oldest is lifted."],["Atari and Capture","atari-and-capture","A foe inside two of your Influences is slowed; inside three, it's held fast 3 s (once a 3 s; a strong foe may break free)."],["Living Board","living-board","Once every 3 s, 1 CE: a blow lays a Stone beside the foe."],["Nineteen-by-Nineteen Funeral Board","nineteen-by-nineteen-funeral-board","Every chosen foe is Captured (held 1.5 s) and takes 33 damage."],["Reading Ahead","reading-ahead","When a fight begins, a Stone is laid at your feet for free."],["Sacrifice Play","sacrifice-play","Technique Key 1 (1 CE) detonates the Stone nearest where you look: 22 damage to foes beside it (a nimble foe takes half)."]]},{"id":"e524","n":"The Builder","s":"Animate a small construct that builds replicas of itself from nearby materials, and direct the swarm, carefully.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["Animate Builder","animate-builder","A tiny construct for an hour, 15 damage a slam. Each 3 s a Builder on the ground takes a soft block from beside it and builds a replica (up to 12)."],["Self-Sustaining","self-sustaining","Once a long rest, for an hour: your Builders forage within 36 blocks for their material, not only beside themselves."],["The Foreman","the-foreman","Four Builders merge into one large brute for the hour: 23 damage a slam."],["Union Rates","union-rates","Replicas add your mastery to their slams."],["Double Shift","double-shift","You can keep twice as many Builders."],["Skilled Labor","skilled-labor","Variant + Animate Builder: each Builder makes one plain tool or weapon from what you carry, at the vanilla recipe's own cost: the stone or iron tool in your hand again, or else an iron sword, or a stone one. Never from nothing. Up to 12 a long rest, one a Builder."],["Scrap Armor","scrap-armor","While a Builder is beside you, it interposes scrap: 4 armor more."],["Assembly Line","assembly-line","Builders replicate twice every 3 s."],["Literal Minds","literal-minds","Variant + The Foreman (Variant + Animate Builder below 11th) gives the standing order \"hold this spot\": your Builders stand where you look and slam any foe within 4 blocks of it, until you give the order again."],["Demolition Order","demolition-order","Technique Key 1: every Builder and brute detonates, 14 fire damage to everything within 6 blocks of each (a nimble foe may halve it), and the ground there caves."]]},{"id":"e531","n":"The Downward Stair","s":"Open a stairwell that descends impossibly far. Something knocks from below; use sparingly.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["Descend","descend","A stairwell opens at your feet for 10 minutes (two at a time). New Entrance: Variant + Descend (1 CE) moves the newest one's mouth to ground you see within 36 blocks."],["The Bottom","the-bottom","Once a long rest: a foe trapped in your stairwell falls through the bottom, 68 damage, and surfaces far away (a strong will clings on)."],["Go Down","go-down","Go down the stairwell you stand at, or come back up: below, nothing can see or harm you, but you can't act. Allies within 2 blocks come down and up with you. If the stairwell closes with you below, you're put out at its mouth, knocked down. Deeper: while anyone is below, something knocks. It's only a sound."],["The Trap","the-trap","A foe that steps onto an open mouth falls in: 41 damage, and it's stuck climbing out for 6 s."],["Down Only","down-only","Within 3 blocks of your stairwell, nothing can knock you back."],["Watch Your Step","watch-your-step","Near your stairwell you move silently: creatures more than 6 blocks off don't notice you."],["Emergency Exit","emergency-exit","You can keep one more stairwell open."],["It Follows","it-follows","Once a long rest, Variant + Go Down on a foe within 18 blocks: what's below follows it for 10 minutes. Knocking sounds near it, and it glows to you alone. Nothing ever appears."]]},{"id":"e541","n":"The Fifty-Two","s":"Fifty-two cursed cards, a five-card hand: Spades sharpen, Hearts mend, Clubs bludgeon, Diamonds ward, and the House always wins.","c":"Original","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Play a Card","play-a-card","Play the card Technique Key 1 picked: ♠ your next blow lands harder by its number · ♥ heal by it (8 or more also cures an ailment) · ♣ a card flies at the foe you look at (18 blocks), its number plus a little, and may bind it for 3 s · ♦ a ward that soaks its number. Court cards count 11 to 14."],["Marked Cards","marked-cards","With the feat, once every 2 minutes: the card you've picked becomes the Ace of its suit."],["Maximum: Royal Flush","maximum-royal-flush","Play your whole hand at once, every card doubled if all five share a suit, then draw five fresh."],["Draw Step","draw-step","Each 3 s, your hand refills to five."],["The Court","the-court","A Jack's Club binds surely; a Queen's Heart heals twice; a King's Diamond also steadies you against knockback; an Ace's Spade is a sure critical."],["The House Always Wins","the-house-always-wins","Every chosen foe gambles with the House: lose and take 66 damage and be held 1.5 s; win and the House rakes 3 CE off the pot for you."],["Card Counter","card-counter","You've memorized the deck: every card you draw is the better of two."],["Marked Cards","marked-cards-2","The quick key (1 CE, once every 2 minutes) turns the card you've picked into the Ace of its suit."]]},{"id":"e559","n":"The Immortal Game","s":"Chess with full-scale shikigami: pawns screen and promote, knights leap the line, rooks own the hallway, and a king who castles out of every blow.","c":"Original","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Set the Board","set-the-board","Set the piece Technique Key 1 picked where you look (9 blocks) for a minute: pawn 1 CE, knight 2, bishop 2, rook 3, queen 6 (her arrival lets every piece strike at once). You field up to 6. Pieces can be taken."],["The Move","the-move","The piece that can reach the foe you look at leaps onto it and strikes (pawn 7 damage, up to the queen's 27 damage). Once every 3 s; 2 CE buys another."],["Castling","castling","Once every 3 s, a blow meant for you is Castled away (2 CE): you and your nearest piece within 18 blocks swap places."],["Check and Promotion","check-and-promotion","Foes within 4.5 blocks of a piece are in check: they take a fifth more from you. A pawn that takes a foe is promoted to the best piece you can field."],["Checkmate","checkmate","The board captures every chosen foe: 62 damage, half again for a foe in check."],["Endgame Study","endgame-study","With two or fewer pieces on the board, every Move strikes harder."]]},{"id":"e160","n":"The Possessive Mask","s":"Wear one body until it rots, tempt another into accepting the mask, and move your will across hosts.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Temptation","temptation","The foe you look at (36 blocks) is tempted by the mask: one that gives in gains Temptation (up to 3). At 1 the Sweetened Offer can't be refused; at 2 it's slowed going away from you; at 3 it can be worn. It fades after a minute, and each 3 s a foe may shake one off. A player sorcerer at 3 shows you the last art they cast."],["Host Transfer","host-transfer","The mask settles on the creature you touch (2.5 blocks) with 3 Temptation: your host, turning on its own kind, for up to a minute (from the second 3 s it may throw you off). Its wounds land on you instead (Shared Vitality). Players and great foes can't be worn. Borrowed Bodies (6th): with Variant, something you killed in the last 10 s rises as your host, no resist, with 80 health, for 5 minutes. Inside your Domain, a foe at 3 Temptation within 36 blocks can be worn without a touch."],["Sweetened Offer","sweetened-offer","The foe you look at lowers its guard and goes docile for 3 s (any blow wakes it). A tempted foe can't refuse and stays docile twice as long (it spends a Temptation)."],["Corrosive Secretion","corrosive-secretion","Once every 3 s, 1 CE, a melee blow seeps: the foe has to resist or be held for 3 s. Technique Key 1 corrodes the soft block you look at within reach."],["Manifest Mask","manifest-mask","A porcelain mask: you see a mote over every mind within 72 blocks."],["Mind Under the Mask","mind-under-the-mask","When your host falls, the mask leaps (2 CE) to another foe within 18 blocks that could be worn."],["Theater of the Anguished Mask","theater-of-the-anguished-mask","Curtain Call: the whole house is tempted at once, every chosen foe gains a Temptation."],["Honeyed Words","honeyed-words","A Sweetened Offer on an untempted foe that accepts it also gives it a Temptation (1 CE)."],["Black Ichor","black-ichor","A block you corrode away leaves a black patch for 3 s that slows foes who walk into it."],["Borrowed Aptitude","borrowed-aptitude","While you wear a host, you keep the best of its training: your blows hit 10% harder and you have 4 more armor."],["Never Without a Face","never-without-a-face","Once a long rest, a blow that would kill you while you wear a host is paid by the host instead: it dies, and you stand at a quarter of your health."]]},{"id":"e293","n":"The Thing","s":"Bedrock body, ripped-up arsenal, bull rush, groundbreak stomp, Living Avalanche and Clobberin' Time.","c":"Marvel","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Stone Fist","stone-fist","A fist of living stone at the foe in front of you: 16 damage."],["Ripped-Up Arsenal","ripped-up-arsenal","Tear up the ground in front of you (it leaves a pit) and hurl it 20 blocks: 25 damage where it lands."],["Groundbreak Stomp","groundbreak-stomp","The ground within 6 blocks breaks into rubble: every foe in it is knocked down."],["Shake It Off","shake-it-off","Slough off holds, poisons and slows like loose sediment."],["Unbreakable Line","unbreakable-line","Plant the flag: every hostile creature within 9 blocks turns on you, and every ally within 9 gets a layer of absorption for a minute."],["Living Avalanche","living-avalanche","A minute: Bedrock doubles, and anything that strikes you takes 7 damage back."],["Bull Rush","bull-rush","Charge 6 blocks where you look, through foes: each takes 25 damage and is knocked down."],["Maximum: Clobberin' Time","maximum-clobberin-time","A minute: Bedrock doubles, foes within 10 blocks can't take their eyes off you, and every foe that strikes you is slammed back for 42 damage and knocked down."],["Bedrock Body","bedrock-body","Every blow that reaches you is reduced by 7 damage, and you can't be knocked back."],["Stonewall","stonewall","Once every 3 s (1 CE), a blow on an ally within 3 blocks lands on you instead, through your Bedrock, and you step to their side."],["Fastball Special","fastball-special","Variant + Ripped-Up Arsenal hurls the ally you look at (within 3 blocks) along your look instead: the throw never hurts them, and their first blow within 5 s hits 25% harder."],["Dead Stick Landing","dead-stick-landing","Falls never hurt you, and a hard landing discharges into everything within 3 blocks: 18 damage."],["Seismic Sense","seismic-sense","Standing on the ground, you feel every creature near you (they glow)."],["Yancy Street Rules","yancy-street-rules","Ripped-Up Arsenal knocks down what it hits."]]},{"id":"e528","n":"The Tickle Doctrine","s":"Weaponize joy itself: overcome enemies with euphoria until they cannot fight through the laughter.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["Tickle","tickle","The foe you look at (36 blocks) laughs helplessly for 3 s (held), then hits 25% softer for a minute. One that resists still giggles, 20% softer for 3 s."],["Total Euphoria","total-euphoria","Once a long rest: up to 6 foes within 18 blocks are overcome with laughter (held 3 s, then weakened)."],["Contagious","contagious","Foes within 6 blocks of your target catch the giggles: they hit 20% softer for a minute."],["Hideous Laughter","hideous-laughter","The laughter holds much longer."],["They Don't Get the Joke","they-dont-get-the-joke","Constructs and the undead resist your laughter more often."],["The Giggles Linger","the-giggles-linger","A foe still softened by your laughter can't hold its concentration: any blow breaks its Domain's hand signs, its chant or the art it's holding."],["Comfort","comfort","Variant + Tickle on an ally you look at (18 blocks, 2 CE): their fear, charm and Weakness end."],["Hysterics","hysterics","A foe that laughs helplessly may laugh far too hard: unless its will is strong, it takes 18 damage as well."]]},{"id":"e552","n":"The Tithe","s":"Sacrifice is currency: pay in your own blood to strike harder, and make your enemies pay into the plate so you can take the house cut.","c":"Original","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["The Collection Plate","the-collection-plate","The foe you look at (18 blocks) pays: 9 damage, 20% softer and slowed for 3 s (a strong will pays half). You take the house cut: some life, or 1 CE if you're whole."],["The Revival","the-revival","Once a minute: the plate passes to every foe within 18 blocks at once."],["The Offering","the-offering","Pay a little of your own life (no armor softens it), and your next blow lands 18 damage harder. Made at an altar (an enchanting table or a lectern within 4 blocks), the blessing is doubled."],["Maximum: The Grand Tithe","maximum-the-grand-tithe","Pay a great price in life, then regain all of it, shed every ailment and refill your CE. For every foe within 36 blocks, the congregation strikes one of them for 22 damage."]]},{"id":"e532","n":"The Unfinished Score","s":"Begin the melody for power, and try to stop yourself from finishing it. The composer always pays.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["The Final Note","the-final-note","Once a long rest, while performing: the score completes. Everything within 36 blocks takes 111 damage (a strong will halves it), and you pay a heavy blow that armor can't soften."],["The First Bars","the-first-bars","Perform for a minute: once a second a weapon blow or shot of yours rings for 20 damage more. Every note block within 8 blocks plays along. Press again to stop, unless the music has you."],["Compulsion","compulsion","Hurt while performing, the music may hold you: you can't stop until the minute ends."],["The Audience","the-audience","When you begin, foes within 18 blocks are frightened while you play: they hit 25% softer. One that resists can't be frightened by it again for a day."],["The Draw","the-draw","While you play, foes within 36 blocks are drawn toward the music."],["Perfect Pitch","perfect-pitch","The music takes hold of you half as often."],["Earworm","earworm","A sorcerer your ringing blow hits, or one beside a playing note block, hears the melody for an hour: any blow breaks their concentration (a Domain's cast, a chant, a held art). A strong will tunes it out."],["Ensemble","ensemble","When you begin, the nearest ally within 18 blocks harmonizes: once a second, their weapon blows ring too while you play."],["Unfinished Business","unfinished-business","After the music fails to hold you 3 times in one performance, the note blocks around you play a chord nobody wrote. Nothing more."]]},{"id":"e286","n":"Tool Manipulation","s":"Imbue cursed energy into tools, fly them as weapons, and turn the battlefield into the Tsukumogami Spirit World.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Floating Tool","floating-tool","A cursed copy of your held item flies out and fights on its own for 10 minutes, 33 damage a blow (2 at once, 1 CE)."],["Wind Scythe","wind-scythe","Your tool cuts a 18-block gale along your look: 33 damage, everything it catches thrown back and knocked down (a strong foe may halve it and stand), and the leaves and grass in its path are cut."],["Guided Control","guided-control","Hold to pour up to 5 CE into the item in your hand, an hour per CE: blows with it land 7 damage harder per CE, and one in ten is a critical."],["Tool Mastery","tool-mastery","Your floating tools strike harder, and you're 15% faster."],["Tsukumogami Spirit World","tsukumogami-spirit-world","Every tool in the world wakes and turns on the chosen: 53 damage each."],["Tools of the Craft","tools-of-the-craft","While your tool is imbued and in hand, you break blocks half again as fast and reach 3 blocks farther."],["Eyes in the Skies","eyes-in-the-skies","While a floating tool is out, you sense every creature within 16 blocks: a mote shows over each."]]},{"id":"e033","n":"Triple Core","s":"A body with two spare hearts: more health, two chosen combat forms, and a heart that stops instead of you.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Energy Blast","energy-blast","Energy Blast form: hold to pour 1 to 6 CE, a blast of force along your look (24 blocks): 7 damage per CE, bursting where it lands."],["Defensive Ward","defensive-ward","Defensive Form: hold to pour 1 to 6 CE, a ward of 5% of your health per CE that soaks blows. It stacks to half your health, and fades after 30 s out of a fight."],["Maximum: Core Release","maximum-core-release","Depends on the form that's awake. Unblockable: Crippling Strikes, 10 s of free, harder Unblockable Blows. Energy Blast: Blast Away, the recoil hurls you toward where you look and knocks down everything behind you. Defensive: Fortress, the ward bursts outward, what's left of it as a blow to everything within 2 blocks."],["First Core","first-core","Your body keeps a backup: 20% more health."],["Second Core","second-core","Variant + Technique Key 1 steps through the combat forms; Technique Key 1 claims the one shown as a core and wakes it. Unblockable Blows: after a blow lands, 1 CE (once a second) makes it ignore armor and land a quarter harder. While it's awake, your body grows a quarter bigger."],["Third Core","third-core","Claim a second form. One burns at a time; Technique Key 1 switches."],["Insurance","insurance","Struck down: a heart stops instead. That core seals for 7 days and you rise at half health. With both sealed, nothing catches you."],["Rule of Three","rule-of-three","A law, not an event: while it stands, all of your unsealed hearts burn at once."]]},{"id":"e053","n":"Twin Moon Armament","s":"One hand draws moonlight, the other living flame: alternate them in rhythm, hang glintblades in the air, and raise twin moons over the field.","c":"Video Games","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Carian Phalanx","carian-phalanx","Every stored glintblade looses along your look, seeking a foe: 22 damage each."],["Flame Spiral","flame-spiral","A spiral of flame around you (3 blocks): 44 damage (a nimble foe takes half), then you dart 3 blocks along your look."],["Carian Sovereignty","carian-sovereignty","A great cut at the foe you look at (5 blocks): 89 damage, then a 6-block cone of 44 damage."],["Moonlight Wave","moonlight-wave","A wave of cold moonlight from the Moon Blade, 18 blocks along your look: 33 cold damage to every foe it crosses, and they freeze. 1 CE less in the Sorcerous stance."],["Carian Stance","carian-stance","For 3 s, take a stance; casting again steps to the other. Sorcerous: the Moon Blade reaches 1.5 blocks farther and Moonlight Wave costs less. Infernal: Flame blows add 11 damage and carry you through the foe you hit."],["Twin Aspect Guard","twin-aspect-guard","For 3 s, the first blow on you is cut by 66 damage: the Moon turns a technique's blow, the Flame a weapon's."],["Manifest Twin Blades","manifest-twin-blades","For a minute your weapon blows alternate Moon (the foe freezes) and Flame (it burns), each 11 damage harder. A blow within a second of the last adds as much again and stores a Carian glintblade (up to 6)."],["Maximum: Twin Moons","maximum-twin-moons","You rise and raise two moons: three shockwaves run out along the ground (5 blocks): 44 damage, 44 damage, then 66 damage. Foes caught are knocked down, and those caught twice are hurled up. Third Moon: with Variant, 5 CE more brings a fourth shockwave (66 damage), and the four pass each other's guard."],["Knightly Footwork","knightly-footwork","While your blades are out, you have 4 more armor."],["Perfect Alternation","perfect-alternation","Once every 3 s (twice from 20th), a quick follow-up blow also looses one stored glintblade at its foe, for nothing."],["Dancing Knight","dancing-knight","Two quick follow-ups within 3 s quicken you, and the next hold on you slips half the time."],["Rellana's Flame","rellanas-flame","A Flame blow that ends a quick follow-up leaves a burst that goes off a moment later: 22 fire damage within 2 blocks of where it struck."],["Moonfire Sovereignty","moonfire-sovereignty","Your blades stay out until you sheathe them (cast again). With Variant, once every 3 s a blow carries both the Moon and the Flame, and both their dice (2 CE)."],["Moon and Fire, Always Together","moon-and-fire-always-together","A quick follow-up adds 22 damage more."],["Sovereign Knight","sovereign-knight","Once every 3 s, a blade blow strikes a second time, as hard, a moment later."],["Carian Dueling Form","carian-dueling-form","Technique Key 1 (1 CE) marks the foe you look at (8 blocks) as your duelist for 10 s: your blade blows on it add 11 damage."],["Phalanx Reserve","phalanx-reserve","Your glintblades screen you: once every 3 s, a shot about to hit you may be caught by one of them (half the time), spending it."],["Messmer Ember","messmer-ember","Flame Spiral's dart sets alight each foe you pass, for 11 fire damage."],["Moon Princess's Guard","moon-princesss-guard","Twin Aspect Guard also turns the first blow on an ally within 3 blocks of you."]]},{"id":"e112","n":"Umbral Witchcraft","s":"Dance with gunfire for punctuation, dodge into Witch Time, and pay your infernal creditors in other people's pain.","c":"Video Games","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Infernal Summon","infernal-summon","One demon attack at the foe you look at (18 blocks). Gomorrah's bite: 66 damage. Madama's fist: 55 damage and a launch skyward. Phantasmaraneae's web: 44 damage and bound. Technique Key 1 picks the demon."],["Beast Within","beast-within","Your body turns beast for 10 s: the panther, twice as fast on the ground; with Variant the crow, and you fly."],["Queen Sheba","queen-sheba","Once a long rest, with 3 Tempo or more (all of it is spent): the Queen's fist comes down where you look (36 blocks). Everything within 18 blocks takes 159 damage and is hurled away (a great foe holds)."],["Demon Masquerade","demon-masquerade","For a minute you wear your chosen demon: you fly, blows land a fifth softer on you, and your blows bite 11 damage harder."],["Umbran Climax","umbran-climax","Spend 3 Tempo: for 3 s every melee blow calls a Wicked Weave for free."],["Witch Time","witch-time","A split-second dodge: a blow that lands in the next moment misses, and time slows in a bubble 8 blocks around you for 2 s. Foes crawl, and arrows and fireballs hang in the air. You gain Tempo (once every 3 s)."],["Maximum: Infernal Finale","maximum-infernal-finale","Spend 5 Tempo: all three demons strike at once, each at a different foe near where you look."],["Bullet Arts","bullet-arts","Once every 3 s, after a melee blow, your guns fire a free shot at the foe (7 damage)."],["Wicked Weave","wicked-weave","Two melee blows within a second call a giant infernal fist out of a portal behind you (2 CE): 33 damage, and the foe is launched skyward (a great foe holds)."],["Tempo","tempo","Witch Time builds Tempo, up to 10."],["Witch Without Equal","witch-without-equal","Tempo holds 10."],["Umbran Sidestep","umbran-sidestep","Your dodge carries you: Witch Time also slips you 3 blocks along your look."],["Moon of Mahaa-Kalaa","moon-of-mahaa-kalaa","A blow that triggers Witch Time is parried into another foe within 2 blocks of the attacker (1 Tempo): it takes the full blow."],["Bat Within","bat-within","Once every 10 s, a blow that lands bursts you into bats (1 Tempo): it lands at half, and you reform 3 blocks away."],["Pure Platinum","pure-platinum","Once a minute, your Witch Time is flawless: the slowed time lasts twice as long."]]},{"id":"e108","n":"Undead","s":"The technique negates approaching death. You fight with your own body, fingers for bullets and blood for propulsion, and a Repair Reserve pays the invoice.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Parts Bullet","parts-bullet","Tear free a finger and fire it on a falling arc (36 blocks): 26 damage. Costs a little of your life."],["Dead Line","dead-line","Lose 5% of your life: a 36-block line of blood where you look, 53 damage to everything on it. The blocks it crosses are splashed red."],["Repair Boost","repair-boost","Toggle. Once every 3 s, a melee blow drives a shard of you in: lose 6% of your life and 1 CE, for 79 damage more."],["Division","division","Lose 10% of your life: 6 severed parts (twice as many under Victor) crawl after your foes for a minute, biting for 40 damage between them."],["Dead Road","dead-road","Lose 10% of your life: a 54-block road of you, 93 damage to everything on it."],["Victor","victor","Once a long rest, for a minute: Repair doubles, every Undead blow hits harder, and your own costs can't drop you below 1."],["Interpretation Shift","interpretation-shift","Death is a definition; choose which one you rule out. Age: wither can't take hold and stolen years come back. Stasis: you can't be bound or frozen. Dismemberment: a fall costs 5 Reserve, not 10. Unconsciousness: no blindness, darkness or nausea while the Reserve lasts. You hold two: Variant chooses the second."],["Blood Propulsion","blood-propulsion","Shed 6% of your life as a jet of blood: you're thrown along your full look, up a cliff or over a ravine, and land unhurt."],["Maximum: Dead Quartet","maximum-dead-quartet","Lose 25% of your life: skin, blood, bone and muscle lash up to four foes within 36 blocks for 40 damage each (159 damage on a lone foe). Then you reassemble, repairing up to 25% from the Reserve; with Variant, beside the first foe it struck."],["Negate Death","negate-death","While the Repair Reserve (200) lasts, death doesn't take: you keep going at 1 health, slowed and weakened, until you've repaired a tenth of yourself. Each fall costs 10 Reserve."],["Repair","repair","Each 3 s, heal up to 6% of your life from the Reserve. It refills on a long rest, and whenever you're out of danger."],["Interpretation Shift","interpretation-shift-2","One death you've ruled out of order, and a second (the art chooses; it starts as Stasis)."],["Undead Completion","undead-completion","The Reserve doubles, and once a long rest even an empty Reserve can't kill you."],["Crimson Bullet","crimson-bullet","Plant rather than fire: Technique Key 1 sets a finger in the block you look at (36 blocks, a little life). The first foe to come near it is hit for 40 damage. Up to three."],["Bloody Arts","bloody-arts","Your propulsion carries more than you: an ally within 2 blocks is thrown along with you, and lands unhurt."],["Never Stop","never-stop","Conditions are suggestions: once a minute, 10 Repair throws off slowness, nausea, blindness, mining fatigue and binding at once."]]},{"id":"e480","n":"Vairocana","s":"Harmony and chaos, the infinite universe that contains both: sense everything, then loose chaos bolts and wild cosmic effects.","c":"Creeps and Curses","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Harmony","harmony","For a minute you sense every creature within 32 blocks (a mote over each), and you mend 8 damage."],["Chaos","chaos","A Chaos Bolt at the foe you look at (27 blocks): 53 damage of a random element, and it may leap to another foe. Or, one time in three, the Chaos Table strikes around it: a fireburst, a displacement, a frozen moment, life blooming, bewilderment, or a storm of the void."],["Maximum: Cosmic Genesis","maximum-cosmic-genesis","A new law of physics 9 blocks around where you look, for 10 rounds: foes and loose things inside fall upward, slowed, and foes take 22 damage each 3 s."],["Balance","balance","The Chaos Table's backlash can't touch you."],["Mandala of Mutual Paradox","mandala-of-mutual-paradox","Every chosen foe suffers a Chaos Table effect, every pulse."],["Tides of Harmony","tides-of-harmony","Technique Key 1 (2 CE, once a minute): your next weapon blow is a sure critical."]]},{"id":"e099","n":"Vector Authority","s":"You don't create force: you rewrite direction and magnitude. Nothing touches you unanswered, once you've calculated it. Do not strike him; you're only lending him your weapon.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Vector Touch","vector-touch","Toggle. Your weapon blows add 13 damage and shove the foe away, or drag it to you with Variant held (1 CE, at most once a second)."],["Vector Rewrite","vector-rewrite","A minute: gravity is a suggestion. You're faster, you leap far higher, you walk up any wall you walk into, and falls don't hurt. Borrowed Vector (feat): with Variant, the ally you look at within 18 blocks walks on it instead."],["Atmospheric Weapon","atmospheric-weapon","A 36-block line of compressed air where you look: 53 damage, and everything on it is blown along. Bioelectric Rewrite (6th): with Variant, a foe within 3 blocks has to resist or takes 40 damage and can't counter, dodge or parry for 3 s."],["Vector Transformation: Repel","vector-transformation-repel","The point you look at (54 blocks) violently repels: 79 damage to everything within 12 blocks, flung away from it, up and down too. Items fly with them."],["Vector Transformation: Attract","vector-transformation-attract","The same, but the point violently attracts."],["Black Wings","black-wings","A minute (any number of times): you fly, one reflection each 3 s is free, and Vector Touch adds three dice instead of one. Platinum Wings (20th): with Variant, for 4 CE more, every Vector Die of yours deals 2 more while they last."],["Plasma Geometry","plasma-geometry","A sphere of plasma at the point you look at (72 blocks): 106 damage within 5 blocks, and blinded. It needs air: nothing forms under water."],["One-Way World: PUSH / PULL / REVERSE","one-way-world-push-pull-reverse","What your Domain declares each pulse."],["Vector Filter","vector-filter","Raise (or lower) the Filter. A shot you've calculated is turned around at the border of your body and flies home as yours (or where you look, with Variant held), and a blow is returned to the one who threw it (1 CE each, any number)."],["Maximum: Celestial Vector Collapse","maximum-celestial-vector-collapse","The point you look at (108 blocks): everything within 13 blocks is dragged to it, 159 damage, then blasted straight up. Hostile shots in it are torn apart, and the ground at its heart gives way."],["Calculation","calculation","Something you haven't seen needs calculating: about 85% of the time it's solved and known until a long rest; otherwise the Filter drops. A reflected blow is never reflected again, and a Domain's sure-hit passes."],["Advanced Filter","advanced-filter","A long rest keeps your 6 newest calculations, and once every 3 s a miscalculation doesn't drop the Filter."],["One-Way World","one-way-world","Each pulse the world declares what you chose: PUSH or PULL (106 damage, flung away from or toward the centre) or REVERSE (106 damage, slammed into the ground and held)."],["Passive Filter","passive-filter","While the Filter is up, allies within 9 blocks are sheltered: blows land softer on them, and once every 3 s the Filter turns a shot heading for one of them (it counts as one of your reflections)."],["Borrowed Vector","borrowed-vector","Variant + Vector Rewrite lends the Rewrite to the ally you look at within 18 blocks for the same minute: the speed, the leap, no fall damage, and walking up walls."],["Kihara Counterstudy","kihara-counterstudy","Returned blows come back at three times their force instead of twice."],["White Wings","white-wings","When Black Wings end, they shed in one vector discharge (4 CE): 53 damage to everything within 12 blocks, flung away."]]},{"id":"e034","n":"Vengeful Spirit Manipulation","s":"A spirit bound to your ring: her arm tears out of the air, her voice holds foes still, and in full she fights beside you.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Partial Manifestation","partial-manifestation","Her arm tears out of the air at the foe you look at (6 blocks): 66 damage."],["Borrowed Word","borrowed-word","She speaks a word she once learned, \"Don't move\": the foe you look at (12 blocks) is frozen for 3 s (a strong will may hold)."],["Maximum: Full Manifestation","maximum-full-manifestation","Rika in full, for five minutes: she fights beside you (66 damage a blow), and while she's here you're stronger and your cursed energy runs higher."],["The Ring","the-ring","Your weapon is enhanced by the spirit bound to you: weapon blows 5% harder."],["Involuntary Manifestation","involuntary-manifestation","A blow of more than a quarter of your health calls her out in full on her own, for a minute, to protect you (once a minute)."],["Mimicry","mimicry","When Rika in full strikes a sorcerer, she copies the first art of their technique (never a Maximum or a Domain), up to 5 arts. While she's out in full, Technique Key 1 casts the one you've picked, at its own cost; Variant + Technique Key 1 picks the next."],["Stronger Bond","stronger-bond","While she's manifested, your blows land 15% harder, you have 6 more armor, and your reserve holds 2 more CE: you gain 2 when she comes and lose 2 when she goes."],["True and Mutual Love","true-and-mutual-love","A field of swords, one for each copied technique: every 3 s, each chosen foe is struck by a copied art, free. With nothing copied, or an art that can't reach, the swords fall instead: 89 damage."],["Partial Manifestation Versatility","partial-manifestation-versatility","The arm seizes as well as wounds: a foe it strikes is held a moment and dragged toward you (a strong foe may pull free)."],["Technique Storage","technique-storage","Her library opens to you: while she's manifested in full, your arts cost 1 CE less, and Partial Manifestation tears from two arms, the second at the next foe nearest."],["Directed Frenzy","directed-frenzy","Her fury can be pointed: her blows on the foe you look at land a third harder."]]},{"id":"e172","n":"Visitors at the Window","s":"Call an almost indestructible nuisance swarm that steals, clings, rattles defenders, and keeps coming back.","c":"Cryptids","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["They Came Back","they-came-back","For a minute a swarm of 6 Visitors besets your foes: 7 damage a nip, and what they nip hits 15% softer for a few seconds. Any that vanish come back while the swarm lasts."],["Swarm Trick","swarm-trick","Technique Key 1 picks the trick, this plays it on the foe you look at with a Visitor within 6 blocks of it. Rattle: it can't react for a 3 s. Grab: its held item is pulled away and dropped (or handed to you). Cling: slowed for a 3 s. Hurl Clutter (18 blocks, any Visitor): its next blows land at half for a 3 s. Sabotage (3rd), on the block you look at: lights within 3 go out or fall, doors fly open, riders are thrown from carts and boats. Every Window: each play also Rattles. A foe that fails to shrug a trick off banks a Mischief (up to 12). Variant: Pile On, 1 CE, every 2 Mischief plays the trick on one more foe. The first extra trick each 3 s is free."],["Rattle the Doors","rattle-the-doors","Every Visitor rushes the foe you look at (18 blocks) at once, and it's rattled: 20% softer for 4 s."],["Maximum: Siege at Kelly-Hopkinsville","maximum-siege-at-kelly-hopkinsville","For a minute, an 18-block Visitor Perimeter where you look (36 blocks): every 3 s up to 6 foes inside are nipped (14 damage), rattled and can't react; the bank has no cap."],["Every Window","every-window","A shot from a foe beside a Visitor goes wide 1 time in 2."],["Shiny Eyes","shiny-eyes","While the swarm is out, its eyes glow and you see a mote over every creature near you; the invisible near a Visitor glow."],["Roof Scratcher","roof-scratcher","A foe with a Visitor right above it, once every 3 s, hits at half until the next."],["Tiny Thieves","tiny-thieves","Grab on a player takes a small thing instead: a potion, pearl, golden apple or firework from their hotbar, never armor."]]},{"id":"e287","n":"Voracity","s":"Devour the fallen to steal their abilities, regurgitate them on demand, and at the peak become the devoured thing itself.","c":"Jujutsu Kaisen","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Devour","devour","Your maw opens for 3 s: every creature you kill in it is devoured and its nature stored (up to 5 kinds; a new one digests the oldest)."],["Regurgitation","regurgitation","For an hour you wear the chosen devoured thing's nature (Technique Key 1 picks): a flyer's wings (flight), a heavy thing's hide (12 armor, no knockback), or anything else's fangs (your blows bite harder by its strength)."],["Maximum: Body of the Devourer","maximum-body-of-the-devourer","For a minute you become the chosen devoured thing: wings, hide and fangs all at once, and its bite on every blow twice over."],["Digestion","digestion","Devouring heals you a little and returns 1 CE."],["Gourmand","gourmand","Regurgitation calls up the devoured kind you wore before too: both natures at once for the hour."]]},{"id":"e044","n":"War God's Household","s":"Give a wandering soul a name and it joins the household as family: each Regalia a weapon, garment, guide, shield, scale or sacred beast.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Battle Muster","battle-muster","Call or dismiss the highlighted Regalia (dismissing is free), up to 8 active at once."],["Regalia Art","regalia-art","The highlighted Regalia's own move (it must be active): Pinpoint Order marks a foe so your next blow on it lands half again as hard; Rending Arc is a 3-block cone of 47 damage; Crossfire fires two shots of 14 damage; Capture drags a foe to you and holds it 3 s; Pounce leaps 6 blocks onto a foe for 47 damage. Another active Regalia answers it (1 CE; the first every 3 s is free from 6th)."],["Borderline","borderline","A line of light across the ground where you look (12 blocks long, a minute): the first foe to cross it takes 49 damage, is thrown back and stopped 3 s."],["Sevenfold Muster","sevenfold-muster","Up to 8 active Regalia each fly at a foe within 24 blocks: 9 damage each."],["Name the Next","name-the-next","Highlight the next Regalia in the household."],["Maximum: Heaven's Grand Muster","maximum-heavens-grand-muster","Every unbroken name answers once, active or not (up to 8): 18 damage each on foes within 24 blocks."],["Household","household","Eight Regalia, one of each form; 8 may be active at once (5 at 3rd, 7 at 6th, all at 11th)."],["Guide Charm · Battle Garb","guide-charm-battle-garb","Charm: you see a spark on every creature within 16 blocks. Garb: 3 more armor (6 Blessed), and once a 3 s, 1 CE, Take the Wound lessens a blow by 35% of your health."],["Greatblade · Twin Sidearms · Binding Lash","greatblade-twin-sidearms-binding-lash","Weapon blows add 9 damage once a second (twice that Blessed); shots add 7 damage once a second; the Lash adds a block of reach and drags what it strikes toward you."],["Sacred Bulwark · Sky Lion · Judgment Scales","sacred-bulwark-sky-lion-judgment-scales","Bulwark: 6 more armor, and Stand Between (2 CE) lessens a blow as the Garb does. Lion: faster, higher, no fall damage, and from 6th you fly. Scales: whoever hurts you is marked (2 CE, once every 3 s) and your next blow on it adds 41 damage."],["Coordination","coordination","The first Household Answer each 3 s is free."],["Hafuri Vessel","hafuri-vessel","When you'd fall, the highlighted active Regalia risks its name for you: it becomes Blessed and you stand at 1 health (two may be Blessed). After that, once a long rest, a Blessed Regalia breaks to keep you up."],["Golden Citadel of Ten Thousand Names","golden-citadel-of-ten-thousand-names","Every Regalia is active. Testimony of Every Name: every chosen foe takes 47 damage; the Accused (whoever hurt you in the citadel) take double, and are dragged inward and held 1.5 s."],["Line That Casts Out Evil","line-that-casts-out-evil","Your Borderline may run 24 blocks long."],["Many Names, One Banner","many-names-one-banner","Battle Muster in its other form calls the highlighted Garb, Bulwark, Lash or Sky Lion into the hands of the ally you look at, within 18 blocks. It still counts against your Active Limit, and it gives them its armor, reach, speed and the Lion's soft landing instead of you. Muster it again to call it home; it comes home by itself past 36 blocks."],["Cavalry of Heaven","cavalry-of-heaven","While you fly on the Sky Lion, up to 6 allies within 3 blocks who hold sneak ride with you, and land softly when they let go."]]},{"id":"e188","n":"White Silence","s":"Breath and lingering in your Snowfield add Frost: it slows, numbs, and finally Frostbinds.","c":"Mythology","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Snow Woman's Breath","snow-womans-breath","A 9-block cone of killing cold: 45 cold damage, and a Frost on everything in it that doesn't shrug it off."],["Woman in the Storm","woman-in-the-storm","Inside your Snowfield: the snow carries you up to 12 blocks along your look to another spot in it, and for 3 s the Frost of your Breath can't be shrugged off."],["Warmth Stolen Gently","warmth-stolen-gently","A Frostbound foe within 6 blocks: 36 cold damage unless it holds on, and half of what it lost warms the ally you look at, or you."],["Snowfield","snowfield","For a minute snow falls 12 blocks round where you stand and settles on the ground: every 3 s each foe in it takes 7 cold damage and gathers Frost unless it shrugs it off."],["Frost","frost","1: slowed and freezing. 2: numbed, hitting 20% softer and unable to react. 3: Frostbound in place 2 s, then back to 1."],["Village Lost Beneath Snow","village-lost-beneath-snow","The village is buried: every chosen foe takes 36 cold damage, and gains a Frost unless it stands by a fire or bright light, or huddles against another creature."],["Footprints Vanish","footprints-vanish","In a snowy place, or inside your Snowfield, the falling snow hides you: creatures more than 6 blocks away lose you, and when the snow carries you, those hunting you lose the trail."],["Snowblind","snowblind","A foe reaching 2 Frost is blinded by driven snow 3 s (a strong foe may blink it away)."],["First Flurry","first-flurry","When a fight begins, the nearest foe within 18 blocks already has winter in its lungs: 1 Frost."]]},{"id":"e138","n":"Wildspeaker","s":"Call the pack, mark the prey, grow primal yourself, and when the forest answers, it answers all at once.","c":"Magic: The Gathering","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Beast Call","beast-call","A beast of the land answers for a minute (a wolf in the biome's coat, or a polar bear on snow): 18 damage a bite (up to 3). It wears a trait from your trophies. The first call each minute is free."],["Primal Might","primal-might","For a minute you're a beast yourself: faster, a little larger, and your weapon blows bite 9 damage harder. Your beasts run faster too."],["Overrun","overrun","You and the whole pack charge: every beast strikes its nearest foe for 27 damage, and you dash 9 blocks."],["Hunter's Mark","hunters-mark","The foe you look at (27 blocks) is your quarry for a minute: it glows for you, and your beasts bite it 8 damage harder."],["Maximum: Caller of the Pack","maximum-caller-of-the-pack","Five spectral beasts join the hunt for three 3 ss, beyond your usual pack, and charge as one swarm: once a 3 s they strike your quarry (or the nearest foe) for 89 damage (a nimble foe halves it)."],["Trophies","trophies","Each kind of creature you kill leaves a trophy, and your beasts wear its trait: Flight (fliers), Venom (spiders, bees, witches), Armor (golems, shulkers, the plated), Charge (ravagers, hoglins, goats, horses), Amphibious (sea creatures), Reach (endermen, the tall) or Pack Tactics (wolves, raiders). From 6th, Technique Key 1 picks the trait."],["Apex Trophy","apex-trophy","A boss, or a creature of 100 health or more, earns an Apex for your lead beast, picked with Variant + Technique Key 1: Breath (a 66 damage cone once a minute), Regeneration, or Huge (larger, longer reach, 9 damage more a bite)."],["Apex Predator","apex-predator","Three beasts; the first Beast Call each minute is free, and your lead beast wears two trophy traits and the Apex."],["The Great Hunt","the-great-hunt","Each pulse a stampede of spectral beasts runs a 6-block line from you to the Prey (your quarry, or the nearest chosen foe): every foe in it takes 77 damage and is knocked down. Only the Prey can't halve it."],["Pack Bond","pack-bond","Two beasts on one foe combine their attack: each bite deals 7 damage more."],["Trample","trample","A beast wearing Charge that bites at the run throws its foe aside (a strong foe holds)."],["Primal Hunter","primal-hunter","Your quarry can't hide from your beasts: they find it through walls and invisibility, twice as far, and never lose it."],["Unnatural Predation","unnatural-predation","Once a minute, when a creature hurts an ally within 18 blocks of one of your beasts, that beast answers it at once: 18 damage."]]},{"id":"e199","n":"Wind Between Heaven and Earth","s":"Draw directional Wind Roads: you ride the flow, enemies fight against it.","c":"Mythology","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Wind Road","wind-road","A road of wind from you to where you look (18 blocks, any direction) for a minute (up to 6). On it you and your allies are carried swiftly along it and don't fall (sneak to step off), and so is everything loose on it. Foes on it are swept along it, slowed, and buffeted for 7 damage each 3 s."],["Serpent of the Updraft","serpent-of-the-updraft","For a minute you fly, as long as you keep within 6 blocks of one of your Wind Roads; a 3 s away from them and you sink gently down."],["Breath of Civilization","breath-of-civilization","The Wind Road nearest where you look breathes out: every foe on it is hurled 9 blocks along it unless it braces, and allies on it are quickened for 3 s."],["Gust","gust","Everything within 4.5 blocks is blown 6 blocks away (9 damage to foes), shots and loose things too, and fire there goes out."],["Plumes","plumes","Riding a Wind Road from one end to the other earns a Plume, once every 3 s (up to 6). Variant + Technique Key 1 spends one: for 3 s your roads carry their riders twice as fast."],["Morning-Star Crossing","morning-star-crossing","Where two of your roads cross is a Crossroad. Once every 3 s, you or an ally standing at one and looking toward another within 36 blocks is carried there."],["City Beneath the Feathered Sky","city-beneath-the-feathered-sky","Six Wind Roads open out from you, beyond your usual count, and every road runs through the city: every chosen foe is hurled by the wind (36 damage) and slowed for 3 s."],["Precious Plumes","precious-plumes","Variant + Wind Road pays with a Plume instead of cursed energy."],["Cloud Serpent","cloud-serpent","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): pave a 9-block Wind Road ahead along the way you're moving."],["Tailwind Archer","tailwind-archer","Standing on a Wind Road, your shots ride it: 7 damage more each."]]},{"id":"e158","n":"With Many Voices","s":"Archive perfect voices, breathe away short-term memory, and lure the confused toward false cries in the dark.","c":"SCP Anomalies","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Amnestic Breath","amnestic-breath","A 18-block cone of amnestic mist: foes in it lose a Moment (up to 3; a strong foe may resist). One lost: it can't react against you. Two: a creature loses track of you past 8 blocks. Three: once you've moved 6 blocks you're hidden from it until you strike it or it bumps into you. Each 3 s a foe may shake one off."],["AMN-C227 Saturation","amn-c227-saturation","For a minute, a 9-block aura of mist: foes that stay in it lose a Moment every 3 s."],["Thrown Voice","thrown-voice","A recorded voice cries out where you look (36 blocks) for a minute: foes that have lost a Moment go looking for it (1 CE every 3 s while it lures). Inside your Domain it comes from anywhere you look, free once every 3 s."],["Voiceprints","voiceprints","You record the voice of a creature you strike, or a player you hear speak within 36 blocks: up to 6 voices, the newest first. Thrown Voice speaks in the newest."],["Predatory Strike","predatory-strike","Once every 3 s, your blow on a foe with a Moment lost that's lost you or can't react: it has to resist or be frightened of your nearest voice (or you) for a minute, unable to get farther from it, and held 1.5 s."],["Troglobitic Senses","troglobitic-senses","You see in the dark, sense creatures within 18 blocks, and climb walls."],["Borrowed Distress","borrowed-distress","Your voices lure as they always have, for 1 CE every 3 s while a foe is drawn."],["Corridor Without Memory","corridor-without-memory","Memory Break: every chosen foe loses a Moment."],["Perfect Voiceprint","perfect-voiceprint","Technique Key 1 (1 CE) throws a second voice, your second-newest, where you look: lured foes follow whichever is nearer."],["Dark Hunter","dark-hunter","Variant + Thrown Voice (1 CE more): for 3 s, foes within 18 blocks of the voice show themselves to you."],["No New Memories","no-new-memories","A creature that fails to resist your Breath forgets you for a minute: it drops you as a target (not a strong one)."],["Pack Echo","pack-echo","Once every 3 s, an ally's blow on a foe with 2 or more Moments lost lands half again as hard (1 CE)."]]},{"id":"e177","n":"World Coil","s":"Lay spectral serpent coils across the field, close them into Rings, and decide whether each circle protects, poisons, or constricts.","c":"Cryptids","d":1,"m":0,"p":[["Close the Ring","close-the-ring","A serpent Ring closes on the ground where you look (12 blocks; 8 across) for a minute, up to 6. Ward: you take 30% less inside. Venom: foes inside take 14 damage every 3 s. Constrict: foes inside are slowed and take 18 damage every 3 s."],["Coil Segment","coil-segment","A spectral serpent 12 blocks long lies across the ground where you look (36 blocks) for ten minutes, up to 12. A foe crossing it stumbles. Three of them near where you Close the Ring are bound into it: the Ring is free and lasts ten minutes."],["World Fang","world-fang","The serpent strikes the foe you look at (6 blocks): 9 damage of poison; one on a Segment is poisoned (a resist holds it)."],["Tighten","tighten","Every Ring tightens at once: every foe in one takes 18 damage and is held 2 s. Nested World: the coils walk inward, dragging each foe 3 blocks toward the heart."],["Ring Mode (Technique Key 1)","ring-mode-technique-key-1","Picks what your next Ring does: Ward (you and your allies inside take 30% less), Venom (foes inside also can't heal for a 3 s; a resist halves it) or Constrict."],["World Venom","world-venom","Venom lingers three 3 ss. Once every 3 s, a foe crossing a Segment is bitten by World Fang from the coil (1 CE)."],["Midgard Encircled","midgard-encircled","The World Serpent closes round the Domain: every chosen foe is constricted (held 1.5 s, 36 damage) and poisoned."],["Ocean Coil","ocean-coil","The serpent's home water: you swim swiftly and breathe underwater."],["Closing Snap","closing-snap","A Ring that closes snaps shut on the foe nearest its heart: it's dragged toward the centre and held 1.5 s (a strong one may hold its ground)."],["Tail Around the Party","tail-around-the-party","Allies inside a Ward Ring can't be thrown."],["Venom of the World","venom-of-the-world","Venom Rings bite past resistance: 7 damage more every 3 s, and a stronger poison."]]},{"id":"e132","n":"Worldwaker","s":"Claim patches of the world as Lands, draw on them, wake them into elementals, and finally make every claim erupt at once.","c":"Magic: The Gathering","d":1,"m":1,"p":[["Vine Lash","vine-lash","The foe you look at (18 blocks): 18 damage; on one of your Lands, 27 damage and bound for 3 s (a strong foe may tear free)."],["Awaken Land","awaken-land","The nearest Land (or the ground where you look) rises as an elemental for 10 minutes: 22 damage a blow (two at a time)."],["Animist's Awakening","animists-awakening","Up to 6 of your Lands rise for a moment: each slams the nearest foe on it, 27 damage."],["World Shaper","world-shaper","A wall of the ground's own earth rises where you look for a minute."],["Claim Land","claim-land","The ground where you look (18 blocks) becomes your Land for 10 minutes, 6 blocks around, and what grows there grows (up to 10; the oldest returns to the wild)."],["Maximum: Worldwake","maximum-worldwake","Every Land erupts (or, with none, the ground where you look): 55 damage to everything within 4.5 blocks of each, thrown up (a nimble foe halves it)."],["Elemental Bond","elemental-bond","Two elementals at once, and when one lands a blow you move freely for a moment."],["Vastwood","vastwood","You and your allies standing on your Lands are quicker."],["Soul of the World","soul-of-the-world","Up to 10 Lands. Once a long rest, Variant + Technique Key 1: for a minute everything within 36 blocks of you is your Land."],["Leyline","leyline","Standing on one of your Lands, one cast every 3 s costs 1 CE less."],["Zendikar Risen","zendikar-risen","The world asserts itself in the mood Technique Key 1 sets. Quake: every chosen foe takes 66 damage and is knocked down. Growth: every chosen foe is held for 1.5 s (a strong one may tear free). Elemental: two land spirits rise until the next pulse."],["Lotus Cobra","lotus-cobra","Claiming a Land reads it: you learn what living things are on it and around it (16 blocks)."],["Living Terrain","living-terrain","Standing on one of your Lands, the ground shelters you: shots land 30% softer."]]},{"id":"e536","n":"Zero Gravity","s":"Five fingertips, and the world lets go. Make enemies, debris and yourself weightless, then decide exactly when gravity gets to remember.","c":"Anime & Manga","d":0,"m":0,"p":[["Zero Gravity","zero-gravity","Touch the foe you look at (3 blocks; any size): it goes weightless, drifting up 5 blocks and hanging there until you release it. With no leverage, its blows on you land at three quarters."],["Lighten Self","lighten-self","You go weightless: you drift down slowly and never take fall damage (it counts toward your limit). Cast again to land."],["Debris Lift","debris-lift","Lift 5 real blocks out of the ground around you to orbit you, weightless (each counts toward your limit). Release lets them fall where they are."],["Meteor Shower","meteor-shower","Drop every lifted chunk where you look (36 blocks), spread over 12 blocks around: 7 damage each, and the rubble lands as blocks."],["Weightless World","weightless-world","Every foe within 9 blocks goes weightless at once."],["Release","release","Fingertips together: gravity returns to everything at once, and the weightless are slammed down to fall the whole way."],["Target Limit","target-limit","7 weightless things at once. Over the limit your stomach rebels: each 3 s you may be sick (nausea and poison)."],["Gunhead Martial Arts","gunhead-martial-arts","Your blows on weightless foes deal 5 damage more and knock them twice as far."],["Weightless World (passive)","weightless-world-passive","Any size can be touched, and the limit doubles."],["Iron Stomach","iron-stomach","Her stomach still complains; she has stopped listening: 2 more weightless things, and the nausea grips you less often."],["Tether Pull","tether-pull","Technique Key 1 (1 CE): drag the weightless foe you look at (18 blocks) toward you."],["Precision Drop","precision-drop","Meteor Shower is aimed by hand: each strike falls on a foe in the radius in turn, and none on anyone else."],["Combat Float","combat-float","While you're weightless you fly, swimming through the air."]]},{"id":"e481","n":"████ and Light","s":"An innate technique that forges killing intent into bars of light: thrown, rained down, and finally ridden as the beam itself.","c":"Creeps and Curses","d":0,"m":1,"p":[["Light Construct","light-construct","A bar of light thrown along your look (18 blocks), through every foe in its path: 18 radiant damage. You flash after it on a hit, and holding pours up to 5 CE for 27 damage more each."],["Rain of Light","rain-of-light","Bars of light fall within 3 blocks of you: 111 radiant damage, and what they hit is pinned 3 s (a nimble foe slips free). They leave real light behind for half a minute. Hold to pour more."],["Maximum: Light Speed","maximum-light-speed","You become the beam: a 60-block line along your look, 199 radiant damage to everything on it, and you arrive at the end."],["Hyperspeed","hyperspeed","Light can't burn the hand that holds it: you can't be set burning."],["Dazzling Glare","dazzling-glare","Once every 3 s, a creature within 9 blocks striking you meets a flare of light (2 CE): about half the time its blow misses, and it's dazzled."],["Irradiated Light","irradiated-light","Once every 3 s, a construct or rain bar that hits leaves radiation (1 CE): 7 damage more, and the foe is poisoned."]]}];
